uri e React","Desempenho nativo","Interface do usuário moderna e intuitiva","Suporte a múltiplos repositórios"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных issues","Интеграция с Tauri и React","Родная производительность","Современный и интуитивный интерфейс пользователя","Поддержка нескольких репозиториев"],"ar":["إنشاء قضايا مخصصة","التكامل مع Tauri و React","الأداء الأصلي","واجهة مستخدم حديثة وسهلة الاستخدام","دعم عدة مستودعات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI智能工具创建Github问题","什么是创建Github问题的AI智能工具","Tauri和React技术","Github问题创建工具","开发效率提高","native性能","AI智能工具安装","AI智能工具设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェントを使用してGithubイシューを作成する方法","Githubイシューを作成するAIエージェントとは","TauriとReact技術","Githubイシュー作成ツール","開発効率を向上させる","nativeパフォーマンス","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트를 사용하여 깃허브 이슈를 생성하는 방법","깃허브 이슈를 생성하는 AI 에이전트란","Tauri와 React 기술","깃허브 이슈 생성 도구","개발 효율성을 높입니다","native 성능","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas AI para GitHub","crear issues de GitHub","Tauri y React","gestión de proyectos eficiente","herramientas de desarrollo","GUI de GitHub","alternativas a GitHub","instalación de Tauri","guía de configuración de React"],"fr":["outils IA pour GitHub","créer des problèmes GitHub","Tauri et React","gestion de projets efficace","outils de développement","GUI de GitHub","alternatives à GitHub","installation de Tauri","guide de configuration de React"],"de":["KI-Tools für GitHub","Erstellen von GitHub-Issues","Tauri und React","effiziente Projektverwaltung","Entwicklungstools","GUI von GitHub","Alternativen zu GitHub","Installation von Tauri","Konfigurationsanleitung für React"],"pt":["como criar issues no github","ferramentas de ias para github","tauri e react","criar issues personalizadas","alternativas para criar issues no github","guias de instalação de ferramentas de ias","configuração de ferramentas de ias"],"ru":["как создать issues на github","инструменты ии агентов для github","tauri и react","создание индивидуальных issues","альтернативы для создания issues на github","руководства по установке инструментов ии агентов","настройка инструментов ии агентов"],"ar":["كيفية إنشاء قضايا على جيت هاب","أدوات الإي الأجنت لجيت هاب","tauri و react","إنشاء قضايا مخصصة","بديلات لإنشاء قضايا على جيت هاب","دلائل تركيب أدوات الإي الأجنت","إعداد أدوات الإي الأجنت"]}},"owner":"StirlingMarketingGroup","repo":"marlin","repoPath":"StirlingMarketingGroup/marlin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.722Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"creating-github-issues","description":"Use when creating GitHub issues, making new issues, filing bugs, requesting features, or before running `gh issue create`. Triggers on new issue, create issue, file issue, gh issue, open issue. Ensures proper research, labels, and comprehensive issue documentation.","bodyPreview":"# Creating GitHub Issues\n\n## Overview\n\nEvery GitHub issue should be well-researched and clearly documented. This skill ensures issues contain enough context for anyone to understand and implement them.\n\n## Mandatory Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Research the Codebase\n\nBefore writing the issue, use the Explore agent or search tools to understand:\n\n- Where relevant code lives (file paths, functions, components)\n- How similar functionality is currently implemented\n- Database tables, API endpoints, or UI co","body":"# Creating GitHub Issues\n\n## Overview\n\nEvery GitHub issue should be well-researched and clearly documented. This skill ensures issues contain enough context for anyone to understand and implement them.\n\n## Mandatory Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Research the Codebase\n\nBefore writing the issue, use the Explore agent or search tools to understand:\n\n- Where relevant code lives (file paths, functions, components)\n- How similar functionality is currently implemented\n- Database tables, API endpoints, or UI components involved\n- Existing patterns that should be followed\n\n**Include in the issue:**\n- Specific file paths and line numbers\n- Code snippets showing current implementation\n- References to similar existing code as examples\n\n**Why:** Issues with research reduce back-and-forth questions and give implementers a head start.\n\n### Step 2: Create the Issue\n\nUse `gh issue create` with a well-structured body:\n\n```bash\ngh issue create --title \"Brief descriptive title\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n<1-3 sentences describing what needs to be done>\n\n## Current State\n<What exists now, with file paths and code references>\n\n## Proposed Changes\n<What should change, with specific details>\n\n## Technical Notes\n<File paths, database tables, API endpoints, code snippets>\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Specific testable requirement\n- [ ] Another requirement\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Add Labels\n\nDiscover current labels and apply appropriate ones:\n\n```bash\ngh label list --limit 50\n```\n\n**Common label categories:**\n\n1. **Type** (pick one):\n   - `enhancement` - New feature or improvement\n   - `bug` - Something isn''t working\n   - `documentation` - Documentation improvements\n   - `question` - Further information requested\n\n2. **Priority** (if applicable):\n   - `priority: critical` - Production broken, blocking issue\n   - `priority: high` - Important bug fix, urgent feature\n   - `priority: low` - Nice to have, can wait\n\n3. **Area** (if applicable):\n   - Labels indicating which part of the codebase is affected\n\n```bash\ngh issue edit <number> --add-label \"enhancement\"\n```\n\n### Step 4: Add to Project (if applicable)\n\nIf the repository uses GitHub Projects:\n\n```bash\ngh issue edit <number> --add-project \"Project Name\"\n```\n\n## Issue Template\n\n```markdown\n## Summary\n<1-3 sentences describing what needs to be done>\n\n## Current State\n<What exists now>\n- File: `path/to/file.ts:123`\n- Current behavior: <description>\n\n## Proposed Changes\n<What should change>\n1. Change X to do Y\n2. Add Z functionality\n\n## Technical Notes\n- Relevant files: `src/components/Feature.tsx`, `src/utils/helpers.ts`\n- Related functions: `handleSubmit()`, `validateInput()`\n- Consider: <architectural notes, edge cases>\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Specific testable requirement\n- [ ] Another requirement\n- [ ] Tests pass\n\n## Additional Context\n<Screenshots, error messages, related issues>\n```\n\n## Field Selection Guidelines\n\n### Priority\n- **Critical** - Production broken, blocking issue\n- **High** - Important bug fix, urgent feature (most bugs default here)\n- **Medium** - Standard feature work\n- **Low** - Nice to have, can wait\n\n**Default guidance:** Bugs default to High unless trivial. Enhancements default to Medium unless urgent.\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Create issue without researching code first | Use Explore agent to find relevant files |\n| Generic issue description | Include specific file paths, line numbers, code snippets |\n| Missing acceptance criteria | Always include testable requirements |\n| No labels | Always add at least a type label |\n| Vague title | Make titles specific and searchable |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:52:36.425Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured issue tracking and native performance with Tauri and React","zh":"非常适合需要结构化问题跟踪和与 Tauri 和 React 原生性能的开发代理","ja":"Tauri と React のネイティブ パフォーマンスを必要とする開発エージェントに構造化された問題追跡が必要な場合に最適","ko":"Tauri와 React의 네이티브 성능과 구조화된 문제 추적이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan un seguimiento de problemas estructurado y rendimiento nativo con Tauri y React","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''un suivi de problèmes structuré et de performances natives avec Tauri et React","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel benötigende Agenten, die ein strukturiertes Problemverfolgung und native Leistung mit Tauri und React benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de rastreamento de problemas estruturado e desempenho nativo com Tauri e React","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходим структурированный отслеживание проблем и родная производительность с Tauri и React","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النشطين الذين يحتاجون إلى تتبع مشاكل منظم وأداء أصلي مع Tauri و React"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create well-researched GitHub issues with clear documentation, utilizing Explore agents or search tools to understand codebase context, including file paths, functions, and database tables","zh":"赋予代理创建具有清晰文档的 GitHub 问题的能力，利用 Explore 代理或搜索工具来理解代码库的上下文，包括文件路径、函数和数据库表","ja":"エージェントは、Explore エージェントまたは検索ツールを使用してコードベースのコンテキストを理解し、ファイルパス、関数、データベーステーブルを含む、明確なドキュメントを備えた GitHub の問題を作成できる","ko":"Explore 에이전트 또는 검색 도구를 사용하여 코드베이스의 contexto를 이해하고 파일 경로, 함수 및 데이터베이스 테이블을 포함한明確한 문서와 함께 GitHub 문제를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트에게 권한을 부여","es":"Empodera a los agentes para crear problemas de GitHub bien investigados con documentación clara, utilizando agentes de exploración o herramientas de búsqueda para comprender el contexto de la base de código, incluyendo rutas de archivos, funciones y tablas de bases de datos","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des problèmes GitHub bien documentés avec une documentation claire, en utilisant des agents d''exploration ou des outils de recherche pour comprendre le contexte de la base de code, y compris les chemins de fichiers, les fonctions et les tables de base de données","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, um gut recherchierte GitHub-Probleme mit klarer Dokumentation zu erstellen, unter Verwendung von Explore-Agents oder Suchwerkzeugen, um den Kontext der Codebasis zu verstehen, einschließlich Dateipfade, Funktionen und Datenbanktabellen","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem problemas bem pesquisados no GitHub com documentação clara, utilizando agentes Explore ou ferramentas de pesquisa para entender o contexto do código, incluindo caminhos de arquivo, funções e tabelas de banco de dados","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать хорошо исследованные проблемы на GitHub с четкой документацией, используя агентов Explore или инструменты поиска для понимания контекста кода, включая пути файлов, функции и таблицы базы данных","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مشاكل محققة جيدًا على GitHub مع توثيق واضح، باستخدام وكلاء الاستكشاف أو أدوات البحث لفهم سياق قاعدة البيانات، بما في ذلك مسارات الملفات والوظائف وجداول قاعدة البيانات"},"useCases":{"en":["Researching codebases for issue creation","Documenting issues with relevant context for implementation","Utilizing Explore agents for efficient issue tracking"],"zh":["研究代码库以创建问题","使用相关上下文记录问题以进行实现","使用 Explore 代理进行高效的问题跟踪"],"ja":["問題作成のためのコードベースの調査","実装のための関連コンテキストで問題を文書化","効率的な問題追跡のための Explore エージェントの使用"],"ko":["문제 생성을 위한 코드베이스 연구","구현을 위한 관련 contexto로 문제를 문서화","효율적인 문제 추적을 위한 Explore 에이전트 사용"],"es":["Investigación de bases de código para la creación de problemas","Documentación de problemas con contexto relevante para la implementación","Utilización de agentes de exploración para un seguimiento eficiente de problemas"],"fr":["Recherche de bases de code pour la création de problèmes","Documentation de problèmes avec un contexte pertinent pour la mise en œuvre","Utilisation d''agents d''exploration pour un suivi efficace de problèmes"],"de":["Recherche von Codebasen für die Problemerstellung","Dokumentation von Problemen mit relevantem Kontext für die Implementierung","Verwendung von Explore-Agents für eine effiziente Problemmverfolgung"],"pt":["Pesquisar códigos para criação de problemas","Documentar problemas com contexto relevante para implementação","Utilizar agentes Explore para acompanhamento eficiente de problemas"],"ru":["Изучение кодов для создания проблем","Документирование проблем с соответствующим контекстом для реализации","Использование агентов Explore для эффективного отслеживания проблем"],"ar":["البحث في قواعد البيانات لإنشاء مشاكل","توثيق المشاكل مع السياق المناسب للتنفيذ","استخدام وكلاء الاستكشاف لتتبع فعال للمشاكل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub access","Dependent on Tauri and React for native performance","Needs Explore agent or search tools for codebase understanding"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 访问","依赖于 Tauri 和 React 的原生性能","需要 Explore 代理或搜索工具来理解代码库"],"ja":["GitHub にアクセスする必要がある","Tauri と React のネイティブ パフォーマンスに依存","コードベースを理解するために Explore エージェントまたは検索ツールが必要"],"ko":["GitHub 액세스가 필요","Tauri 및 React의 네이티브 성능에 의존","코드베이스를 이해하기 위해 Explore 에이전트 또는 검색 도구가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a GitHub","Dependiente de Tauri y React para un rendimiento nativo","Necesita agentes de exploración o herramientas de búsqueda para la comprensión de la base de código"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à GitHub","Dépendant de Tauri et React pour des performances natives","Nécessite des agents d''exploration ou des outils de recherche pour la compréhension de la base de code"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf GitHub","Abhängig von Tauri und React für native Leistung","Benötigt Explore-Agents oder Suchwerkzeuge für das Verständnis der Codebasis"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao GitHub","Depende de Tauri e React para desempenho nativo","Necessita de agente Explore ou ferramentas de pesquisa para compreensão da base de código"],"ru":["Требует доступа к GitHub","Зависит от Tauri и React для родной производительности","Требует агента Explore или инструментов поиска для понимания базы кода"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى GitHub","يعتمد على Tauri و React للأداء الأصلي","يحتاج إلى وكيل استكشاف أو أدوات البحث لفهم قاعدة البيانات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"71bfe54535fcda7b4c12a92cda350db624add64831e1af9e9de885f5371b995c","qualityScore":37}');
