,"Desenvolvimento de soluções de IA","Utilização de ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Интеграция с Discord","Общение с Claude","Мост кода Claude","Разработка решений ИИ","Использование инструментов разработки"],"ar":["تكامل مع ديسكورد","التواصل مع كلود","جسر كلود للكود","تطوير حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي","استخدام أدوات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 智能代理","Discord 代码桥","Claude 集成","自动化代码生成","如何使用 Discord 与 Claude 交互","AI 代理开发","Discord 代码桥教程","Claude API 文档"],"ja":["AI エージェント","Discord コードブリッジ","Claude 統合","コード自動生成","Discord を使用して Claude と対話する方法","AI エージェント開発","Discord コードブリッジのチュートリアル","Claude API ドキュメント"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","디스코드 코드 브릿지","클로드 통합","코드 자동 생성","디스코드를 사용하여 클로드와 상호 작용하는 방법","AI 에이전트 개발","디스코드 코드 브릿지 튜토리얼","클로드 API 문서"],"es":["cómo usar Discord con Claude","qué es un Agente de IA","alternativas a Claude"," Claude vs otros Agentes de IA","instalación de Claude","guía de configuración de Discord","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Discord y Claude"],"fr":["comment utiliser Discord avec Claude","qu''est-ce qu''un Outil d''IA","alternatives à Claude","Claude vs autres Outils d''IA","installation de Claude","guide de configuration de Discord","développement d''applications avec Discord et Claude"],"de":["wie man Discord mit Claude verwendet","was ist ein AI-Tool","Alternativen zu Claude","Claude vs andere AI-Tools","Installation von Claude","Konfigurationsanleitung für Discord","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit Discord und Claude"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","integração discord","como usar Claude","o que é Claude","alternativas ao Claude"," Claude vs outros","instalar Claude","guia de configuração do Claude"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","интеграция с Discord","как использовать Claude","что такое Claude","альтернативы Claude","Claude vs другие","установить Claude","руководство по настройке Claude"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تكامل ديسكورد","كيفية استخدام كلود","ما هو كلود","بديلات كلود","كلود مقابل الآخرين","تثبيت كلود","دليل إعداد كلود"]}},"owner":"alexknowshtml","repo":"cord","repoPath":"alexknowshtml/cord","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.761Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cord","description":"Send messages, embeds, files, and interactive buttons to Discord via the Cord CLI. Use for notifications, reports, interactive choices, and dynamic Discord interactions.","bodyPreview":"# Cord - Discord Bridge Skill\n\nInteract with Discord through Cord''s CLI commands. This skill teaches Claude Code how to send messages, embeds, files, and interactive buttons.\n\n**GitHub:** https://github.com/alexknowshtml/cord\n\n## Setup\n\nEnsure Cord is running:\n```bash\ncord start\n```\n\nVerify it''s connected:\n```bash\ncurl -s http://localhost:2643/health\n# {\"status\":\"ok\",\"connected\":true,\"user\":\"MyBot#1234\"}\n```\n\n---\n\n## CLI Commands\n\n### send\n\nSend a text message to a channel or thread.\n\n```bash\nco","body":"# Cord - Discord Bridge Skill\n\nInteract with Discord through Cord''s CLI commands. This skill teaches Claude Code how to send messages, embeds, files, and interactive buttons.\n\n**GitHub:** https://github.com/alexknowshtml/cord\n\n## Setup\n\nEnsure Cord is running:\n```bash\ncord start\n```\n\nVerify it''s connected:\n```bash\ncurl -s http://localhost:2643/health\n# {\"status\":\"ok\",\"connected\":true,\"user\":\"MyBot#1234\"}\n```\n\n---\n\n## CLI Commands\n\n### send\n\nSend a text message to a channel or thread.\n\n```bash\ncord send <channel> \"message\"\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\ncord send 123456789 \"Hello world!\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### embed\n\nSend a formatted embed card with optional styling.\n\n```bash\ncord embed <channel> \"description\" [options]\n```\n\n**Options:**\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `--title \"...\"` | Embed title |\n| `--url \"...\"` | Title link URL |\n| `--color <name\\|hex>` | red, green, blue, yellow, purple, orange, or 0xHEX |\n| `--author \"...\"` | Author name |\n| `--author-url \"...\"` | Author link |\n| `--author-icon \"...\"` | Author icon URL |\n| `--thumbnail \"...\"` | Small image (top right) |\n| `--image \"...\"` | Large image (bottom) |\n| `--footer \"...\"` | Footer text |\n| `--footer-icon \"...\"` | Footer icon URL |\n| `--timestamp` | Add current timestamp |\n| `--field \"Name:Value\"` | Add field (append `:inline` for inline) |\n\n**Examples:**\n\nSimple embed:\n```bash\ncord embed 123456789 \"Daily status update\" --title \"Status Report\" --color green\n```\n\nEmbed with fields:\n```bash\ncord embed 123456789 \"Build completed successfully\" \\\n  --title \"CI/CD Pipeline\" \\\n  --color green \\\n  --field \"Branch:main:inline\" \\\n  --field \"Duration:2m 34s:inline\" \\\n  --field \"Tests:142 passed\" \\\n  --footer \"Deployed by Cord\" \\\n  --timestamp\n```\n\n---\n\n### file\n\nSend a file attachment.\n\n```bash\ncord file <channel> <filepath> [\"message\"]\n```\n\n**Examples:**\n```bash\ncord file 123456789 ./report.md \"Here''s the weekly report\"\ncord file 123456789 ./logs.txt\n```\n\n---\n\n### buttons\n\nSend interactive buttons with optional handlers.\n\n```bash\ncord buttons <channel> \"prompt\" --button label=\"...\" id=\"...\" [options]\n```\n\n**Button options:**\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `label=\"...\"` | Button text (required) |\n| `id=\"...\"` | Custom ID for tracking (required) |\n| `style=\"...\"` | primary, secondary, success, danger |\n| `reply=\"...\"` | Ephemeral reply when clicked |\n| `webhook=\"...\"` | URL to POST click data to |\n\n**Examples:**\n\nSimple confirmation:\n```bash\ncord buttons 123456789 \"Deploy to production?\" \\\n  --button label=\"Deploy\" id=\"deploy-prod\" style=\"success\" \\\n  --button label=\"Cancel\" id=\"cancel-deploy\" style=\"secondary\"\n```\n\nWith inline responses:\n```bash\ncord buttons 123456789 \"Approve this PR?\" \\\n  --button label=\"Approve\" id=\"approve\" style=\"success\" reply=\"Approved! Merging now.\" \\\n  --button label=\"Reject\" id=\"reject\" style=\"danger\" reply=\"Rejected. Please revise.\"\n```\n\nWith webhook callback:\n```bash\ncord buttons 123456789 \"Start backup?\" \\\n  --button label=\"Start Backup\" id=\"backup-start\" style=\"primary\" webhook=\"http://localhost:8080/backup\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### typing\n\nShow typing indicator (useful before slow operations).\n\n```bash\ncord typing <channel>\n```\n\n---\n\n### edit\n\nEdit an existing message.\n\n```bash\ncord edit <channel> <messageId> \"new content\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### delete\n\nDelete a message.\n\n```bash\ncord delete <channel> <messageId>\n```\n\n---\n\n### rename\n\nRename a thread.\n\n```bash\ncord rename <threadId> \"new name\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### reply\n\nReply to a specific message (shows reply preview).\n\n```bash\ncord reply <channel> <messageId> \"message\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### thread\n\nCreate a thread from a message.\n\n```bash\ncord thread <channel> <messageId> \"thread name\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### react\n\nAdd a reaction to a message.\n\n```bash\ncord react <channel> <messageId> \"emoji\"\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\ncord react 123456789 987654321 \"👍\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### state\n\nUpdate a message with a status indicator. Use this to show work progress on a thread starter or status message.\n\n```bash\ncord state <channel> <messageId> <state>\n```\n\n**Preset states:**\n| State | Display |\n|-------|---------|\n| `processing` | 🤖 Processing... |\n| `thinking` | 🧠 Thinking... |\n| `searching` | 🔍 Searching... |\n| `writing` | ✍️ Writing... |\n| `done` | ✅ Done |\n| `error` | ❌ Something went wrong |\n| `waiting` | ⏳ Waiting for input... |\n\n**Examples:**\n\nUsing presets:\n```bash\ncord state 123456789 987654321 processing\ncord state 123456789 987654321 done\n```\n\nCustom status:\n```bash\ncord state 123456789 987654321 \"🔄 Syncing database...\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Choosing the Right Command\n\n| Use Case | Command |\n|----------|---------|\n| Simple notification | `cord send` |\n| Formatted status update | `cord embed` |\n| Long content (logs, reports) | `cord file` |\n| User needs to make a choice | `cord buttons` |\n| Indicate processing (typing bubble) | `cord typing` |\n| Update thread/message status | `cord state` |\n| Update previous message | `cord edit` |\n| Start a focused discussion | `cord thread` |\n| Quick acknowledgment | `cord react` |\n\n---\n\n## Assembly Patterns\n\n### Notification with follow-up options\n\n```bash\n# Send the notification\ncord embed 123456789 \"Build failed on main branch\" \\\n  --title \"CI Alert\" \\\n  --color red \\\n  --field \"Error:Test suite timeout\" \\\n  --field \"Commit:abc1234:inline\"\n\n# Offer actions\ncord buttons 123456789 \"What would you like to do?\" \\\n  --button label=\"View Logs\" id=\"view-logs\" style=\"primary\" reply=\"Fetching logs...\" \\\n  --button label=\"Retry Build\" id=\"retry\" style=\"success\" webhook=\"http://ci/retry\" \\\n  --button label=\"Ignore\" id=\"ignore\" style=\"secondary\" reply=\"Acknowledged\"\n```\n\n### Progress updates\n\n```bash\n# Start with typing indicator\ncord typing 123456789\n\n# Send initial status message\nMSGID=$(cord send 123456789 \"🤖 Processing...\" | grep -o ''[0-9]*$'')\n\n# Update state as work progresses\ncord state 123456789 $MSGID searching\ncord state 123456789 $MSGID writing\ncord state 123456789 $MSGID done\n```\n\nOr with custom progress:\n```bash\ncord state 123456789 $MSGID \"🔄 Step 1/3: Fetching data...\"\ncord state 123456789 $MSGID \"🔄 Step 2/3: Processing...\"\ncord state 123456789 $MSGID \"🔄 Step 3/3: Generating report...\"\ncord state 123456789 $MSGID done\n```\n\n### Report delivery\n\n```bash\n# Send summary embed\ncord embed 123456789 \"Weekly metrics compiled\" \\\n  --title \"Weekly Report Ready\" \\\n  --color blue \\\n  --field \"Period:Jan 15-21:inline\" \\\n  --field \"Pages:12:inline\"\n\n# Attach the full report\ncord file 123456789 ./weekly-report.pdf \"Full report attached\"\n```\n\n### Confirmation flow\n\n```bash\n# Ask for confirmation\ncord buttons 123456789 \"Delete all archived items older than 30 days?\" \\\n  --button label=\"Yes, Delete\" id=\"confirm-delete\" style=\"danger\" reply=\"Deleting...\" \\\n  --button label=\"Cancel\" id=\"cancel-delete\" style=\"secondary\" reply=\"Cancelled\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Auto-Complete Behavior\n\nWhen a user adds a ✅ reaction to the **last message** in a thread, Cord automatically:\n1. Detects the reaction\n2. Updates the thread starter message to \"✅ Done\"\n\nThis provides a quick way for users to signal \"conversation complete\" without explicit commands.\n\n---\n\n## HTTP API\n\nFor advanced use cases (webhooks, external scripts), see [HTTP-API.md](./HTTP-API.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:15:40.655Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Chatbot Agents needing seamless Discord integration through CLI commands.","zh":"适合需要通过CLI命令实现无缝Discord集成的Chatbot Agents。","ja":"CLIコマンドを介したDiscordとのシームレスな統合を必要とするChatbotエージェントに適しています。","ko":"CLI 명령을 통해 Discord와의無缝한 통합이 필요한 Chatbot 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Chatbot que necesitan una integración perfecta con Discord a través de comandos de CLI.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Chatbot ayant besoin d''une intégration transparente avec Discord via des commandes CLI.","de":"Ideal für Chatbot-Agents, die eine nahtlose Discord-Integration über CLI-Befehle benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Chatbot que necessitam de integração perfeita com o Discord por meio de comandos CLI.","ru":"Идеально для агентов-чатботов, требующих бесшовной интеграции с Discord через команды CLI.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الدردشة الذي يحتاج إلى إعداد الدردشة المتكامل بشكل متواصل من خلال أوامر CLI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with Discord using Cord''s CLI, enabling features like sending text messages, embeds, files, and interactive buttons over HTTP protocols.","zh":"赋予代理交互式地使用Cord的CLI与Discord交互，实现通过HTTP协议发送文本消息、嵌入、文件和交互式按钮等功能。","ja":"CordのCLIを使用してエージェントがDiscordと対話できるようにし、HTTPプロトコルを介したテキストメッセージ、埋め込み、ファイル、およびインタラクティブなボタンの送信などの機能を可能にします。","ko":"Cord의 CLI를 사용하여 에이전트가 Discord와 상호 작용할 수 있도록 하여 HTTP 프로토콜을 통해 텍스트 메시지, 임베드, 파일 및 상호 작용 버튼을 보낼 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar con Discord utilizando el CLI de Cord, lo que permite funciones como el envío de mensajes de texto, incrustaciones, archivos y botones interactivos a través de protocolos HTTP.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec Discord en utilisant le CLI de Cord, ce qui permet des fonctionnalités telles que l''envoi de messages texte, d''incrustations, de fichiers et de boutons interactifs via des protocoles HTTP.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, mit Discord über das CLI von Cord zu interagieren, ermöglicht Funktionen wie das Senden von Textnachrichten, Einbettungen, Dateien und interaktiven Buttons über HTTP-Protokolle.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a interagir com o Discord usando o CLI do Cord, permitindo recursos como enviar mensagens de texto, embeds, arquivos e botões interativos sobre protocolos HTTP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью взаимодействовать с Discord с помощью CLI Cord, позволяя использовать функции, такие как отправка текстовых сообщений, встроенных элементов, файлов и интерактивных кнопок по протоколам HTTP.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على التفاعل مع الدردشة باستخدام CLI من كورد، وتمكين الميزات مثل إرسال رسائل نصية ودمج الملفات والأزرار التفاعلية عبر بروتوكولات HTTP."},"useCases":{"en":["Sending notifications to Discord channels","Automating file sharing through Discord","Creating interactive Discord buttons for user input"],"zh":["向Discord频道发送通知","通过Discord实现文件共享的自动化","为用户输入创建交互式Discord按钮"],"ja":["Discordチャンネルに通知を送信する","Discordを介したファイルの共有の自動化","ユーザー入力用のインタラクティブなDiscordボタンを作成する"],"ko":["Discord 채널에 알림을 보내기","Discord를 통해 파일 공유 자동화하기","사용자 입력을 위한 상호 작용 Discord 버튼 만들기"],"es":["Enviar notificaciones a canales de Discord","Automatizar la compartición de archivos a través de Discord","Crear botones interactivos de Discord para la entrada de usuario"],"fr":["Envoyer des notifications aux canaux Discord","Automatiser le partage de fichiers via Discord","Créer des boutons interactifs Discord pour la saisie utilisateur"],"de":["Benachrichtigungen an Discord-Kanäle senden","Automatisieren des Dateiaustauschs über Discord","Erstellen interaktiver Discord-Buttons für die Benutzereingabe"],"pt":["Enviar notificações para canais do Discord","Automatizar a partilha de ficheiros através do Discord","Criar botões interativos do Discord para entrada de usuário"],"ru":["Отправка уведомлений в каналы Discord","Автоматизация обмена файлами через Discord","Создание интерактивных кнопок Discord для ввода пользователя"],"ar":["إرسال الإشعارات إلى قنوات الدردشة","توفير مشاركة الملفات من خلال الدردشة","إنشاء أزرار تفاعلية للدردشة لمدخلات المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Cord to be running and connected","Needs access to Discord through a bot account","Limited to Discord API capabilities"],"zh":["需要Cord正在运行并连接","需要通过机器人账户访问Discord","仅限于Discord API的功能"],"ja":["Cordが実行中で接続されている必要がある","ボットアカウントを介してDiscordにアクセスする必要がある","Discord APIの機能に限定される"],"ko":["Cord가 실행 중이고 연결되어야 함","봇 계정을 통해 Discord에 접근해야 함","Discord API의 기능으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere que Cord esté en ejecución y conectado","Necesita acceso a Discord a través de una cuenta de bot","Limitado a las capacidades de la API de Discord"],"fr":["Nécessite que Cord soit en cours d''exécution et connecté","A besoin d''un accès à Discord via un compte de bot","Limité aux capacités de l''API Discord"],"de":["Benötigt, dass Cord ausgeführt und verbunden ist","Benötigt Zugriff auf Discord über ein Bot-Konto","Begrenzt auf die Fähigkeiten der Discord-API"],"pt":["Requer que o Cord esteja em execução e conectado","Necessita de acesso ao Discord por meio de uma conta de bot","Limitado às capacidades da API do Discord"],"ru":["Требует, чтобы Cord был запущен и подключен","Требует доступа к Discord через учетную запись бота","Ограничен возможностями API Discord"],"ar":["يتطلب تشغيل كورد والاتصال به","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى الدر