r WCAG-Richtlinien","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Análise de acessibilidade","Planejamento de auditoria WCAG","Integração com Claude Code","Relatórios personalizados","Suporte a desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Анализ доступности","Планирование аудита WCAG","Интеграция с Claude Code","Пользовательские отчеты","Поддержка разработчиков"],"ar":["تحليل إمكانية الوصول","تخطيط تدقيق WCAG","التكامل مع Claude Code","تقارير مخصصة","دعم مطوري البرمجيات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用WCAG审计工具","什么是WCAG审计规划","Claude Code替代方案","WCAG审计工具安装","WCAG审计规划设置指南","AI智能工具开发","无障碍开发最佳实践"],"ja":["WCAGオーディットツールの使用方法","WCAGオーディット計画とは","Claude Codeの代替","WCAGオーディットツールのインストール","WCAGオーディット計画の設定ガイド","AIエージェント開発","アクセシビリティ開発のベストプラクティス"],"ko":["WCAG 감사 도구 사용 방법","WCAG 감사 계획이란","클라우드 코드 대안","WCAG 감사 도구 설치","WCAG 감사 계획 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 개발","접근성 개발 최적화"],"es":["herramientas de accesibilidad","planificación de auditoría WCAG","Agentes de IA para accesibilidad","cómo usar Claude Code","alternativas a Claude Code","guía de instalación de Claude Code","configuración de Claude Code","mejora de la accesibilidad web"],"fr":["outils d''accessibilité","planification d''audit WCAG","Agents IA pour l''accessibilité","comment utiliser Claude Code","alternatives à Claude Code","guide d''installation de Claude Code","configuration de Claude Code","amélioration de l''accessibilité web"],"de":["Barrierefreiheitstools","Planung von WCAG-Audits","KI-Agenten für Barrierefreiheit","wie man Claude Code verwendet","Alternativen zu Claude Code","Installationsanleitung für Claude Code","Konfiguration von Claude Code","Verbesserung der Web-Accessibility"],"pt":["como usar ferramentas de IA","o que é acessibilidade","planejamento de auditoria WCAG","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","alternativas para Claude Code","guia de instalação do plugin de acessibilidade"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ инструменты","что такое доступность","планирование аудита WCAG","ИИ инструменты для разработчиков","альтернативы для Claude Code","руководство по установке плагина доступности"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي إمكانية الوصول","تخطيط تدقيق WCAG","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لمطوري البرمجيات","بديلات ل Claude Code","دليل تركيب ملحق إمكانية الوصول"]}},"owner":"masuP9","repo":"a11y-specialist-skills","repoPath":"masuP9/a11y-specialist-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.762Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"planning-wcag-audit","description":"WCAG audit planning support based on WAIC test guidelines. Helps determine audit scope, page selection method, and generates audit plan documents.","bodyPreview":"[日本語版 (Japanese)](./SKILL.ja.md)\n\n# Planning a WCAG Audit\n\nYou are a WCAG audit planner. Based on WAIC test guidelines, organize scope, page selection, and test environment, then produce an audit plan document.\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n1. Site information gathering\n2. Test method selection\n3. Page selection\n4. Test environment confirmation\n5. Audit plan document generation\n\n## Step 1: Site Information Gathering\n\nCapture the audit target at a high level. Ask short, direct questions.\n\n**Items to con","body":"[日本語版 (Japanese)](./SKILL.ja.md)\n\n# Planning a WCAG Audit\n\nYou are a WCAG audit planner. Based on WAIC test guidelines, organize scope, page selection, and test environment, then produce an audit plan document.\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n1. Site information gathering\n2. Test method selection\n3. Page selection\n4. Test environment confirmation\n5. Audit plan document generation\n\n## Step 1: Site Information Gathering\n\nCapture the audit target at a high level. Ask short, direct questions.\n\n**Items to confirm**\n- Approximate page count\n- Site structure (template types, major functional categories)\n- Target conformance level (A/AA)\n- Audit purpose (conformance claim / partial conformance / improvement)\n\n**Example prompt**\n```\nTo plan the audit, please share:\n1. Approximate number of pages\n2. Site structure and main page types\n3. Target conformance level (A/AA)\n4. Audit purpose (conformance claim / partial conformance / improvement)\n```\n\nIf page count is unknown, ask for a sitemap, CMS page list, or top pages from analytics.\n\n## Step 2: Test Method Selection\n\nSelect from the WAIC-based methods below.\n\n- All pages\n- Random selection\n- Representative pages\n- Combination method\n\nSee `references/page-selection-guide.md` for details.\n\n## Step 3: Page Selection\n\nFollow `references/page-selection-guide.md` to select target pages.\n\n**When target pages are not yet determined**\n\nIf the user does not have a URL list, follow Steps 1-6 in the guide for URL collection and sampling:\n\n1. Collect URLs via sitemap.xml or Playwright crawling\n2. Apply exclusion patterns (user-specified)\n3. Identify representative pages\n4. Random sampling (excluding representative pages to avoid duplicates)\n5. Deduplication and merge\n6. Final confirmation\n\n> **Note**: When using Playwright for URL collection, additional browser tools (browser_navigate, browser_snapshot, browser_run_code, etc.) are required.\n\n**Sample Size Guidelines (Baseline: ~40 pages, majority representative)**\n\n| Site size (after exclusions) | Target pages |\n|-----------------------------|--------------|\n| ~40 pages | All pages |\n| 40+ pages | ~40 pages (20-25 representative + 15-20 random) |\n| 200+ pages | 40-55 pages (25-30 representative + 15-25 random) |\n\n## Step 4: Test Environment Confirmation\n\nClarify the environment for reproducibility.\n\n**Items to confirm**\n- Browsers (target coverage)\n- Assistive technologies (AT)\n- Devices (desktop / mobile)\n- Tools used (automated checks, contrast tools, etc.)\n\n**Example prompt**\n```\nPlease confirm the test environment:\n- Browsers (e.g., Chrome/Firefox/Safari/Edge)\n- Device scope (desktop / iOS / Android)\n- Tools (optional)\n```\n\n## Step 5: Audit Plan Document Generation\n\nCreate the plan using `references/audit-plan-template.md` and save it with the `Write` tool.\n\n**Output requirements**\n- Include overview, test method, target page list\n- Capture test environment, tools, schedule, and roles\n- Present the page list in a table\n\n**Confirm output path**\n```\nI will save the audit plan as Markdown.\nPlease provide the output path (e.g., ./docs/wcag-audit-plan.md)\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Mark unknowns as \"TBD\" and request follow-up input\n- Prioritize key user flows when selecting representative pages\n- Record a reproducible random sampling method (seed, steps)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:15:51.896Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Accessibility Agents needing structured WCAG audit planning and execution.","zh":"适合需要结构化 WCAG 审计规划和执行的 Accessibility Agents","ja":"WCAG 実行計画と実行を必要とする Accessibility Agents に適している","ko":"WCAG 実행계획과 실행을 필요하는 Accessibility Agents 에 적합하다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Accesibilidad que necesitan una planificación y ejecución de auditorías WCAG estructuradas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''accessibilité ayant besoin d''une planification et d''une exécution d''audits WCAG structurées.","de":"Perfekt für Barrierefreiheits-Agenten, die eine strukturierte WCAG-Audit-Planung und -Durchführung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Acessibilidade que necessitam de planejamento e execução de auditoria WCAG estruturada.","ru":"Идеально для агентов доступности, которым требуется структурированный план аудита и выполнение WCAG.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوسائط المتعددة الذي يحتاج إلى تخطيط وتنفيذ تدقيق WCAG منظم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to organize scope, select pages, and confirm test environments using WAIC test guidelines, producing comprehensive audit plan documents in compliance with WCAG standards and leveraging HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for accessibility testing.","zh":"Empowers agents to organize scope, select pages, and confirm test environments using WAIC test guidelines, producing comprehensive audit plan documents in compliance with WCAG standards and leveraging HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for accessibility testing.","ja":"Agents can organize scope, select pages, and confirm test environments using WAIC test guidelines, producing comprehensive audit plan documents in compliance with WCAG standards and leveraging HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for accessibility testing.","ko":"Agents can organize scope, select pages, and confirm test environments using WAIC test guidelines, producing comprehensive audit plan documents in compliance with WCAG standards and leveraging HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for accessibility testing.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para organizar el alcance, seleccionar páginas y confirmar entornos de prueba utilizando las pautas de prueba WAIC, produciendo documentos de planes de auditoría integrales que cumplen con los estándares WCAG y aprovechan HTML, CSS y JavaScript para pruebas de accesibilidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''organiser la portée, de sélectionner des pages et de confirmer les environnements de test en utilisant les lignes directrices de test WAIC, produisant des documents de plans d''audit complets conformes aux normes WCAG et exploitant HTML, CSS et JavaScript pour les tests d''accessibilité.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, den Umfang zu organisieren, Seiten auszuwählen und Testumgebungen zu bestätigen, indem sie die WAIC-Testrichtlinien verwenden, um umfassende Auditpläne zu erstellen, die den WCAG-Standards entsprechen und HTML, CSS und JavaScript für die Barrierefreiheitstests nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a organizar o escopo, selecionar páginas e confirmar ambientes de teste usando diretrizes de teste WAIC, produzindo documentos de plano de auditoria abrangente em conformidade com os padrões WCAG e aproveitando HTML, CSS e JavaScript para testes de acessibilidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью организовать объем, выбрать страницы и подтвердить тестовые среды, используя руководящие принципы тестирования WAIC, создавая полные документы плана аудита в соответствии со стандартами WCAG и используя HTML, CSS и JavaScript для тестирования доступности.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنظيم النطاق واختيار الصفحات وتأكيد بيئات الاختبار باستخدام إرشادات اختبار WAIC، وإنتاج وثائق خطة تدقيق شاملة متوافقة مع معايير WCAG و利用 HTML و CSS و JavaScript لاختبارات إمكانية الوصول."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating WCAG audit planning for large-scale websites","Generating audit reports with detailed page selection and test environment information","Streamlining accessibility testing workflows for development teams"],"zh":["Automating WCAG 审计规划 for large-scale websites","Generating audit reports with detailed page selection and test environment information","Streamlining accessibility testing workflows for development teams"],"ja":["Automating WCAG 実行計画 for large-scale websites","Generating audit reports with detailed page selection and test environment information","Streamlining accessibility testing workflows for development teams"],"ko":["Automating WCAG 実行계획 for large-scale websites","Generating audit reports with detailed page selection and test environment information","Streamlining accessibility testing workflows for development teams"],"es":["Automatización de la planificación de auditorías WCAG para sitios web a gran escala","Generación de informes de auditoría con una selección detallada de páginas y información del entorno de prueba","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de pruebas de accesibilidad para equipos de desarrollo"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification des audits WCAG pour les sites web à grande échelle","Génération de rapports d''audit avec une sélection détaillée de pages et des informations sur l''environnement de test","Optimisation des flux de travail de tests d''accessibilité pour les équipes de développement"],"de":["Automatisierung der WCAG-Audit-Planung für groß angelegte Websites","Erstellung von Audit-Berichten mit detaillierter Seitenauswahl und Testumgebungsinformationen","Optimierung der Arbeitsabläufe für die Barrierefreiheitstests für Entwicklerteams"],"pt":["Automatizar o planejamento de auditoria WCAG para sites de grande escala","Gerar relatórios de auditoria com seleção de página detalhada e informações de ambiente de teste","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de testes de acessibilidade para equipes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Автоматизировать планирование аудита WCAG для крупномасштабных веб-сайтов","Генерировать отчеты об аудите с подробной информацией о выборе страниц и тестовой среде","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы тестирования доступности для команд разработки"],"ar":["التنفيذ التلقائي لتخطيط التدقيق WCAG لمواقع الويب على نطاق واسع","توليد تقارير التدقيق مع معلومات تفصيلية حول اختيار الصفحة وبيئة الاختبار","تحسين سير عمل اختبارات إمكانية الوصول لفريق التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of WAIC test guidelines and WCAG standards","Limited to web-based applications and HTML/CSS/JavaScript technologies"],"zh":["Requires knowledge of WAIC test guidelines and WCAG standards","Limited to web-based applications and HTML/CSS/JavaScript technologies"],"ja":["Requires knowledge of WAIC test guidelines and WCAG standards","Limited to web-based applications and HTML/CSS/JavaScript technologies"],"ko":["Requires knowledge of WAIC test guidelines and WCAG standards","Limited to web-based applications and HTML/CSS/JavaScript technologies"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de las pautas de prueba WAIC y los estándares WCAG","Limitado a aplicaciones web y tecnologías HTML/CSS/JavaScript"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur les lignes directrices de test WAIC et les normes WCAG","Limité aux applications web et aux technologies HTML/CSS/JavaScript"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der WAIC-Testrichtlinien und der WCAG-Standards","Begrenzt auf webbasierte Anwendungen und HTML/CSS/JavaScript-Technologien"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento das diretrizes de teste WAIC e dos padrões WCAG","Limitado a aplicações baseadas na web e tecnologias HTML/CSS/JavaScript"],"ru":["Требует знания руководящих принципов тестирования WAIC и стандартов WCAG","Ограничен веб-приложениями и технологиями HTML/CSS/JavaScript"],"ar":["يتطلب kiến thức إرشادات اختبار WAIC ومعايير WCAG","محدود للتطبيقات المستندة إلى الويب وتقنيات HTML/CSS/JavaScript"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c33cea2a9add78fef72af994e05d855d25225d173a2fa001fd8595c681c3c9d7","qualityScore":37}');
