re logicielle pilotée par des spécifications","Conception et mise en œuvre guidées par des spécifications","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Prise en charge de plusieurs langages de programmation","Flexibilité et évolutivité dans la conception de logiciels"],"de":["Spezifikationsgetriebene Software-Architektur","Entwurf und Implementierung unter Anleitung von Spezifikationen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen","Flexibilität und Skalierbarkeit im Software-Design"],"pt":["Arquitetura de software baseada em especificações","Melhoria da qualidade e eficiência do código","Desenvolvimento de soluções mais robustas e escaláveis","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento existentes","Suporte a múltiplos linguagens de programação"],"ru":["Система архитектуры программного обеспечения на основе спецификаций","Улучшение качества и эффективности кода с ИИ Агентами","Разработка более прочных и масштабируемых решений","Интеграция с существующими инструментами разработки","Поддержка нескольких языков программирования"],"ar":["نظام هندسة برمجيات مدفوع بالمواصفات","تحسين جودة وكفاءة الكود للعملاء الإلكترونيين","تطوير حلول أكثر متانة وقابلية للتوسع","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير الحالية","دعم لغات برمجة متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Spec-driven软件架构系统","什么是Spec驱动的软件开发","Spec-driven软件架构系统替代品","Spec-driven vs 其他软件开发方法","Spec-driven软件架构系统安装","Spec-driven软件架构系统设置指南"],"ja":["Spec駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャシステムの使用方法","Spec駆動のソフトウェア開発とは","Spec駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャシステムの代替品","Spec駆動 vs その他のソフトウェア開発方法","Spec駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャシステムのインストール","Spec駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャシステムの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Spec 주도 소프트웨어 아키텍처 시스템 사용법","Spec 주도 소프트웨어 개발이란","Spec 주도 소프트웨어 아키텍처 시스템 대체품","Spec 주도 vs 다른 소프트웨어 개발 방법","Spec 주도 소프트웨어 아키텍처 시스템 설치","Spec 주도 소프트웨어 아키텍처 시스템 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar Specture","qué es la arquitectura de software","Specture alternativa","Specture vs otras herramientas","instalación de Specture","guía de configuración de Specture","desarrollo de software con Specture"],"fr":["comment utiliser Specture","quoi est l''architecture logicielle","alternative à Specture","Specture vs autres outils","installation de Specture","guide de configuration de Specture","développement de logiciels avec Specture"],"de":["wie man Specture verwendet","was ist Software-Architektur","Specture-Alternative","Specture vs andere Tools","Installation von Specture","Einrichtungsanleitung für Specture","Software-Entwicklung mit Specture"],"pt":["como usar Specture","o que é arquitetura de software baseada em especificações","Specture vs outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento","guia de instalação do Specture","configuração do Specture","desenvolvimento de software com Specture"],"ru":["как использовать Specture","что такое система архитектуры программного обеспечения на основе спецификаций ИИ Агенты","Specture против других инструментов разработки","руководство по установке Specture","настройка Specture","разработка программного обеспечения с помощью Specture и ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Specture","ما هي هندسة البرمجيات المرتكزة على المواصفات للعملاء الإلكترونيين","Specture مقابل أدوات التطوير الأخرى","دليل تثبيت Specture","إعداد Specture","تطوير البرمجيات باستخدام Specture والعملاء الإلكترونيين"]}},"owner":"specture-system","repo":"specture","repoPath":"specture-system/specture","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.810Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"specture","description":"Follow the Specture System for spec-driven development. Use when creating, implementing, or managing specs.","bodyPreview":"# Specture System\n\nSpecture is a spec-driven development system. Specs are design documents in the `specs/` directory that describe planned changes — features, refactors, redesigns, tooling improvements. Each spec contains the design rationale, decisions, and an implementation task list.\n\nSpec numbers are stored in the YAML frontmatter `number` field. New specs use slug-only filenames (e.g., `my-feature.md`). Older specs may retain `NNN-slug.md` filenames — both naming patterns are valid.\n\n## Im","body":"# Specture System\n\nSpecture is a spec-driven development system. Specs are design documents in the `specs/` directory that describe planned changes — features, refactors, redesigns, tooling improvements. Each spec contains the design rationale, decisions, and an implementation task list.\n\nSpec numbers are stored in the YAML frontmatter `number` field. New specs use slug-only filenames (e.g., `my-feature.md`). Older specs may retain `NNN-slug.md` filenames — both naming patterns are valid.\n\n## Implementation Workflow\n\nWhen implementing a spec, follow this loop:\n\n1. Run `specture status` to see the current spec and next task\n2. Complete one or more tasks from the task list\n3. Edit the spec file: change `- [ ]` to `- [x]` for every task completed in this commit\n4. Stage both the implementation files **and** the spec file update\n5. Commit together with a conventional commit message (e.g., `feat: implement feature X`)\n6. Push the changes\n7. Repeat from step 1\n\n**Critical rules:**\n\n- Every commit that completes a task MUST include the spec file checkbox update alongside the implementation changes. Never commit implementation without the corresponding `- [x]` update. This is the most important rule.\n- If a single commit completes multiple tasks, check off all of them in that same commit. Do NOT make separate empty commits just to check off tasks that were already implemented.\n- Do NOT edit spec design decisions or descriptions without explicit user permission. You may only mark tasks complete and add/remove tasks during implementation.\n- When editing a spec, keep the design decisions section and task list in sync. If a description is updated, update all corresponding task descriptions to match, and vice versa.\n- When all tasks are checked off, update the frontmatter `status` to `completed`.\n\n## CLI Commands\n\nAlways use non-interactive flags. Interactive mode will hang waiting for input.\n\n### specture list and specture status\n\nUse `list` to see all specs at a glance, then `status` to drill into a specific one.\n\n**`specture list`** — overview of all specs (number, status, progress, name).\n\n```bash\nspecture list                            # All specs\nspecture list --status in-progress       # Filter by status\nspecture list --status draft,approved    # Multiple statuses\nspecture list -f json                    # JSON output with full metadata\n```\n\nAliases: `list`, `ls`\n\n**`specture status`** — detailed view of one spec, including tasks and current task.\n\n```bash\nspecture status                          # Current in-progress spec\nspecture status --spec 3                 # Specific spec by number\nspecture status -f json                  # JSON output\n```\n\nTypical workflow: run `specture list` to find the spec you need, then `specture status --spec N` to see its tasks and progress.\n\n### specture new\n\nCreate a new spec file with automatic numbering and branch.\n\n```bash\n# Non-interactive: provide title via flag (required for agents)\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\"\n\n# Pipe full body content\ncat spec-body.md | specture new --title \"Feature name\"\n\n# Skip branch creation\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\" --no-branch\n\n# Skip opening editor\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\" --no-editor\n\n# Preview without creating anything\nspecture new --title \"Feature name\" --dry-run\n```\n\nAliases: `new`, `n`, `add`, `a`\n\n### specture validate\n\nValidate that specs follow the Specture System format.\n\n```bash\n# Validate all specs\nspecture validate\n\n# Validate a specific spec by number\nspecture validate --spec 3\nspecture validate -s 42\n```\n\nChecks: valid frontmatter (number and status), no duplicate numbers, description present, task list present. Warns on number/filename mismatch.\n\nAliases: `validate`, `v`\n\n### specture setup\n\nInitialize or update the Specture System in a repository.\n\n```bash\n# Non-interactive setup\nspecture setup --yes\n\n# Preview without changes\nspecture setup --dry-run\n\n# Force AGENTS.md update prompt\nspecture setup --update-agents --yes\n```\n\nAliases: `setup`, `update`, `u`\n\n### specture rename\n\nRename a spec file and update all markdown links in the specs directory.\n\n```bash\n# Rename spec 3 to status-command.md\nspecture rename --spec 3 status-command\n\n# Preview changes\nspecture rename --spec 3 status-command --dry-run\n```\n\n## Spec Status Workflow\n\nSpecs move through these statuses:\n\n1. **draft** — Being written and refined\n2. **approved** — Ready for implementation\n3. **in-progress** — Implementation underway (tasks being checked off)\n4. **completed** — All tasks done\n5. **rejected** — Reviewed and rejected\n\nIf a spec has no explicit `status` in frontmatter, it is inferred from tasks:\n- No task list or no complete tasks → `draft`\n- Mix of complete and incomplete → `in-progress`\n- All tasks complete → `completed`\n\n## Commit Messages\n\nUse conventional commits:\n\n- `feat:` — new features\n- `fix:` — bug fixes\n- `refactor:` — code restructuring\n- `docs:` — documentation\n- `test:` — test changes\n\n## Precedence\n\nHigher-numbered specs take precedence over lower-numbered ones when they conflict. Completed specs are historical records — do not retroactively update them (except to fix typos or factual errors).\n\n## Spec Format Reference\n\nFor detailed spec file format (frontmatter fields, sections, naming conventions), see [references/spec-format.md](references/spec-format.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:32:57.415Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring spec-driven software architecture systems and YAML frontmatter parsing capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要基于规格驱动的软件架构系统和YAML前置内容解析能力的代码审查代理。","ja":"規格駆動のソフトウェアアーキテクチャシステムとYAMLフロントマターの解析機能を必要とするコードレビュー代理に最適です。","ko":"코드 검토 에이전트가 규격 주도 소프트웨어 아키텍처 시스템 및 YAML 프론티어 내용 파싱 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisión de Código que requieren sistemas de arquitectura de software basados en especificaciones y capacidades de análisis de YAML frontmatter.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Revue de Code nécessitant des systèmes d''architecture logicielle basés sur des spécifications et des capacités d''analyse de YAML frontmatter.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die spezifikationsgetriebene Software-Architektursysteme und YAML-Frontmatter-Verarbeitungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem sistemas de arquitetura de software baseados em especificações e capacidades de parsing de frontmatter YAML.","ru":"Идеально для агентов проверки кода, требующих системы программной архитектуры, управляемые спецификациями, и возможности парсинга YAML-заголовков.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يتطلب أنظمة هندسة برمجية مدفوعة بالمواصفات وقدرات تحليل YAML frontmatter."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage spec documents in the `specs/` directory, leveraging YAML frontmatter `number` fields for efficient spec numbering and organization, while utilizing slug-only filenames for new specs and supporting legacy `NNN-slug.md` filenames.","zh":"赋予代理在`specs/`目录中管理规格文档的能力，利用YAML前置内容`number`字段进行高效的规格编号和组织，同时支持仅slug文件名的新规格和遗产`NNN-slug.md`文件名。","ja":"代理が`specs/`ディレクトリで仕様ドキュメントを管理できるようにし、YAMLフロントマターの`number`フィールドを使用して効率的な仕様番号付けと組織を行い、新しい仕様にはスラッグのみのファイル名を使用し、レガシーの`NNN-slug.md`ファイル名をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 `specs/` 디렉토리에서 규격 문서를 관리할 수 있도록 하며 YAML 프론티어 내용의 `number` 필드를 사용하여 효율적인 규격 번호 매기기 및 조직을 수행하며 새로운 규격에는 슬러그만 파일 이름을 사용하고 레거시 `NNN-slug.md` 파일 이름을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar documentos de especificaciones en el directorio `specs/`, aprovechando los campos `number` de YAML frontmatter para un numerado y organización de especificaciones eficientes, y utilizando nombres de archivo de solo slug para nuevas especificaciones y admitiendo nombres de archivo legados `NNN-slug.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les documents de spécifications dans le répertoire `specs/`, en exploitant les champs `number` de YAML frontmatter pour un numérotage et une organisation de spécifications efficaces, tout en utilisant des noms de fichiers slug-only pour les nouvelles spécifications et en prenant en charge les noms de fichiers hérités `NNN-slug.md`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Spezifikationsdokumente im Verzeichnis `specs/` zu verwalten, indem sie die YAML-Frontmatter-`number`-Felder für effizientes Spezifikationsnummern und -organisation nutzen und Dateinamen mit Slug-only für neue Spezifikationen verwenden und Dateinamen im legacy-Format `NNN-slug.md` unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar documentos de especificações no diretório `specs/`, aproveitando campos `number` de frontmatter YAML para numeração e organização eficientes de especificações, além de utilizar nomes de arquivos com slug apenas para novas especificações e suportar nomes de arquivos legados `NNN-slug.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять документами спецификаций в директории `specs/`, используя поля `number` заголовков YAML для эффективной нумерации и организации спецификаций, а также использует имена файлов только со slug для новых спецификаций и поддерживает устаревшие имена файлов `NNN-slug.md`.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة مستندات المواصفات في الدليل `specs/` ، واستخدام حقول `number` من YAML frontmatter للترقيم والتنظيم الفعال للمواصفات ، بالإضافة إلى استخدام أسماء الملفات التي تحتوي على slug فقط للمواصفات الجديدة ودعم أسماء الملفات Legacy `NNN-slug.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating spec document management","Generating implementation task lists from spec documents","Parsing YAML frontmatter for spec metadata"],"zh":["自动化规格文档管理","从规格文档生成实现任务列表","解析YAML前置内容以获取规格元数据"],"ja":["仕様ドキュメントの管理を自動化する","仕様ドキュメントから実装タスクリストを生成する","YAMLフロントマターを解析して仕様メタデータを取得する"],"ko":["규격 문서 관리 자동화","규격 문서에서 구현 작업 목록 생성","YAML 프론티어 내용을 파싱하여 규격 메타데이터를 얻는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la gestión de documentos de especificaciones","Generación de listas de tareas de implementación a partir de documentos de especificaciones","Análisis de YAML frontmatter para metadatos de especificaciones"],"fr":["Automatisation de la gestion des documents de spécifications","Génération de listes de tâches d''implémentation à partir de documents de spécifications","Analyse de YAML frontmatter pour les métadonnées de spécifications"],"de":["Automatisierung der Verwaltung von Spezifikationsdokumenten","Generierung von Implementierungsaufgabenlisten aus Spezifikationsdokumenten","Analyse von YAML-Frontmatter für Spezifikationsmetadaten"],"pt":["Automatizar a gestão de documentos de especificações","Gerar listas de tarefas de implementação a partir de documentos de especificações","Parsing YAML frontmatter para metadados de especificações"],"ru":["Автоматизировать управление документами спецификаций","Генерировать списки задач реализации из документов спецификаций","Парсинг YAML-заголовков для метаданных спецификаций"],"ar":["تحسين آلي لإدارة مستندات المواصفات","توليد قوائم مهام التنفيذ من مستندات المواصفات","تحليل YAML frontmatter لمتاديات المواصفات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the `specs/` directory","Limited to spec documents with YAML frontmatter"],"zh":["需要访问`specs/`目录","仅限于具有YAML前置内容的规格文档"],"ja":["`specs/`ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","YAMLフロントマターを持つ仕様ドキュメントのみに限定される"],"ko":["`specs/` 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요","YAML 프론티어 내용을 가진 규격 문서로만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio `specs/`","Limitado a documentos de especificaciones con YAML frontmatter"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire `specs/`","Limité aux documents de spécifications avec YAML frontmatter"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `specs/`","Begrenzt auf Spezifikationsdokumente mit YAML-Frontmatter"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao diretório `specs/`","Limitado a documentos de especificações com YAML frontmatter"],"ru":["Требует доступа к директории `specs/`","Ограничен документами спецификаций с YAML-заголовками"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `specs/`","محدود بمستندات المواصفات التي تحتوي على YAML frontmatter"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6666671a8a4c3f709e755338eb87877811718e5b3e2c762d8c71189dbbfb25a2","qualityScore":37}');
