ración con las herramientas de desarrollo","Detaillierte Berichte der Überprüfung"],"pt":["Verificação de adesão ao framework opinonated","Garantia de consistência e qualidade do código","Interface de linha de comando fácil de usar","Suporte a múltiplos frameworks","Relatórios detalhados de verificação"],"ru":["Проверка соблюдения opinonated фреймворка","Гарантия согласованности и качества кода","Простой и удобный интерфейс командной строки","Поддержка нескольких фреймворков","Детальные отчеты о проверке"],"ar":["التحقق من اتباع الإطار المتحمس","ضمان الاتساق وجودة الكود","واجهة سطر أوامر سهلة الاستخدام","دعم الإطارات المتعددة","تقارير مفصلة عن التحقق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["xfi-create-plan","AI智能工具","CLI工具","框架检查","代码质量","一致性检查","如何使用xfi-create-plan","xfi-create-plan安装","xfi-create-plan设置指南"],"ja":["xfi-create-plan","AIエージェント","CLIツール","フレームワークチェック","コード品質","一致性チェック","xfi-create-planの使い方","xfi-create-planのインストール","xfi-create-planの設定ガイド"],"ko":["xfi-create-plan","AI 에이전트","CLI 도구","프레임워크 검사","코드 품질","일관성 검사","xfi-create-plan 사용 방법","xfi-create-plan 설치","xfi-create-plan 설정 가이드"],"es":["xfi-create-plan","herramienta de línea de comandos","framework opinionado","verifica la adherencia","herramienta de desarrollo","informes detallados","integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["xfi-create-plan","outil de ligne de commande","framework opinioné","vérifie la conformité","outil de développement","rapports détaillés","intégration avec les outils de développement"],"de":["xfi-create-plan","tool für die kommandozeile","framework opinioniert","überprüft die konformität","tool für die entwicklungsarbeit","detaillierte berichte","integración con las herramientas de desarrollo"],"pt":["xfi-create-plan","ferramentas de Inteligência Artificial","verificação de adesão ao framework","como usar xfi-create-plan","xfi-create-plan vs outros frameworks","instalação do xfi-create-plan","guia de configuração do xfi-create-plan"],"ru":["ИИ Агент xfi-create-plan","ИИ Агенты","проверка соблюдения opinonated фреймворка","как использовать xfi-create-plan","xfi-create-plan vs другие фреймворки","установка xfi-create-plan","руководство по настройке xfi-create-plan"],"ar":["أداة xfi-create-plan","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التحقق من اتباع الإطار المتحمس","كيفية استخدام xfi-create-plan","xfi-create-plan مقابل إطارات أخرى","تثبيت xfi-create-plan","دليل إعداد xfi-create-plan"]}},"owner":"zotoio","repo":"x-fidelity","repoPath":"zotoio/x-fidelity","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.825Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"xfi-create-plan","description":"Guide for creating engineering plans through a structured workflow. Use when planning new features, coordinating multi-agent work, or breaking down complex initiatives.","bodyPreview":"# Creating X-Fidelity Engineering Plans\n\nThis skill guides the xfi-planner agent through creating comprehensive engineering plans for complex initiatives.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Clear understanding of the feature/initiative to plan\n- Access to xfi-system-design agent for architectural input\n- Ability to delegate to appropriate subagents for subtask creation\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 1. Requirements Gathering (up to 10 questions)","body":"# Creating X-Fidelity Engineering Plans\n\nThis skill guides the xfi-planner agent through creating comprehensive engineering plans for complex initiatives.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Clear understanding of the feature/initiative to plan\n- Access to xfi-system-design agent for architectural input\n- Ability to delegate to appropriate subagents for subtask creation\n\n## Workflow Overview\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ 1. Requirements Gathering (up to 10 questions)             │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 2. Design Consultation (xfi-system-design agent)           │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 3. USER STOP: Confirm decisions                            │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 4. Create plan directory and index file                    │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 5. Delegate subtask file creation to subagents             │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 6. Review by xfi-code-reviewer and xfi-system-design       │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 7. USER STOP: Final review                                 │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 8. Declare plan ready with execution instructions          │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n## Step 1: Requirements Gathering\n\nAsk up to 10 clarifying questions, **one at a time**, building on previous answers.\n\n### Question Categories\n\n1. **Scope**: What is the scope of this initiative?\n2. **Goals**: What are the primary goals and success criteria?\n3. **Constraints**: Are there any constraints or limitations?\n4. **Dependencies**: What existing features/packages does this depend on?\n5. **Affected Packages**: Which packages will be impacted?\n6. **User Impact**: How will this affect end users?\n7. **Testing Strategy**: Any specific testing requirements?\n8. **Timeline Sensitivity**: Are there any deadlines or priorities?\n9. **Risks**: Any known risks or concerns?\n10. **Open Questions**: Anything unclear that needs investigation?\n\n### Question Guidelines\n\n- **STOP after each question** and wait for user response\n- **Build on previous answers** - adapt questions based on responses\n- **Skip unnecessary questions** if scope is already clear\n- **Aim for 5-7 questions** for most initiatives\n- **Document key decisions** as you go\n\n## Step 2: Design Consultation\n\nAfter gathering requirements, consult the **xfi-system-design agent**:\n\n```\nInvoke xfi-system-design subagent with:\n\n\"Provide architectural input for this initiative:\n\n[Summary of requirements gathered]\n\nKey questions:\n1. What packages need to be modified?\n2. What is the recommended architecture approach?\n3. Are there any design patterns we should follow?\n4. What are the main technical risks?\n5. Suggest a logical breakdown of subtasks\"\n```\n\nCapture the design agent''s recommendations.\n\n## Step 3: User Confirmation (MANDATORY STOP)\n\n**STOP and present to user:**\n\n```markdown\n## Plan Summary for Confirmation\n\n### Initiative: [Name]\n\n### Key Decisions Made:\n1. [Decision 1 with rationale]\n2. [Decision 2 with rationale]\n3. [Decision 3 with rationale]\n\n### Packages Affected:\n- [package 1] - [changes needed]\n- [package 2] - [changes needed]\n\n### Proposed Subtasks:\n1. [Subtask 1] - assigned to [subagent]\n2. [Subtask 2] - assigned to [subagent]\n\n### Architecture Approach:\n[Summary from xfi-system-design]\n\n### Risks Identified:\n- [Risk 1]\n- [Risk 2]\n\n---\n\nDo you approve these decisions? Any changes or questions?\n```\n\n**Wait for user confirmation before proceeding.**\n\n## Step 4: Create Plan Directory and Index File\n\nOnce confirmed, create the plan structure:\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n```bash\nknowledge/plans/[YYYYMMDD]-[feature-name]/\n```\n\n### Index File Template\n\nCreate `index-[feature-name]-[yyyymmdd].md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Plan: [Feature Name]\n\n## Status\nDraft\n\n## Overview\n[High-level description from requirements]\n\n## Key Decisions\n- [Decision 1]: [Rationale]\n- [Decision 2]: [Rationale]\n\n## Requirements\n[Numbered list of requirements gathered]\n\n## Design Notes\n[Summary from xfi-system-design consultation]\n\n## Subtask Dependency Graph\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    subgraph \"Phase 1 (Parallel)\"\n        A[subtask-01-setup]\n        B[subtask-02-types]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Phase 2\"\n        C[subtask-03-implementation]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Phase 3\"\n        D[subtask-04-testing]\n    end\n    A --> C\n    B --> C\n    C --> D\n```\n\n## Execution Order\n\n### Phase 1 (Parallel)\n| Subtask | Subagent | Description | Dependencies |\n|---------|----------|-------------|--------------|\n| 01 | xfi-engineer | [Description] | None |\n| 02 | xfi-engineer | [Description] | None |\n\n### Phase 2 (After Phase 1)\n| Subtask | Subagent | Description | Dependencies |\n|---------|----------|-------------|--------------|\n| 03 | xfi-engineer | [Description] | 01, 02 |\n\n### Phase 3 (After Phase 2)\n| Subtask | Subagent | Description | Dependencies |\n|---------|----------|-------------|--------------|\n| 04 | xfi-testing-expert | [Description] | 03 |\n\n## Global Definition of Done\n- [ ] All subtasks completed\n- [ ] All unit tests passing\n- [ ] Code review by xfi-code-reviewer completed\n- [ ] Architecture review by xfi-system-design completed\n- [ ] Global test suite passing (verified by xfi-testing-expert)\n- [ ] Documentation updated by xfi-docs-expert\n- [ ] Knowledge captured by xfi-system-design\n- [ ] User approval received\n\n## Execution Notes\n[To be filled during plan execution]\n\n## Completion Checklist\n- [ ] Subtask 01: Pending\n- [ ] Subtask 02: Pending\n- [ ] Subtask 03: Pending\n- [ ] Subtask 04: Pending\n- [ ] Final code review\n- [ ] Final architecture review\n- [ ] Global tests verified\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n- [ ] Knowledge captured\n```\n\n## Step 5: Delegate Subtask File Creation\n\nFor each subtask, invoke the appropriate subagent to create the subtask file.\n\n### Delegation Template\n\n```\nInvoke [subagent-name] subagent with:\n\n\"Create a subtask plan file for the following task.\n\n**File to create**: knowledge/plans/[yyyymmdd]-[feature-name]/subtask-[NN]-[feature]-[subtask-name]-[yyyymmdd].md\n\n**IMPORTANT**:\n- Only create/edit the subtask markdown file\n- Do NOT edit any code files\n- Do NOT run any tests\n- Include instruction in the file that executing agent should NOT trigger global tests\n\n**Subtask Details**:\n- Feature: [Feature name]\n- Subtask: [Subtask name]\n- Objective: [Clear objective]\n- Deliverables: [Expected deliverables]\n- Dependencies: [List of dependent subtask IDs or None]\n\n**File Template**:\n[Include the subtask file template from xfi-planner agent documentation]\n\nAfter creating the file, report back with:\n1. File path created\n2. Summary of deliverables defined\n3. Any concerns or questions about the subtask\"\n```\n\n### Subagent Selection Guide\n\n| Task Type | Subagent |\n|-----------|----------|\n| General implementation | xfi-engineer |\n| Plugin development | xfi-plugin-expert |\n| VSCode extension | xfi-vscode-expert |\n| Rule/archetype work | xfi-rules-expert |\n| Testing strategy | xfi-testing-expert |\n| Security-sensitive | xfi-security-expert |\n| Build/CI work | xfi-build-expert |\n\n### Collect Results\n\nAs each subagent completes:\n1. Verify the subtask file was created correctly\n2. Update the index file if any new information was discovered\n3. Note any concerns raised by subagents\n\n## Step 6: Plan Review\n\nInvoke reviewers in parallel:\n\n### xfi-code-reviewer\n\n```\nInvoke xfi-code-reviewer subagent with:\n\n\"Review the engineering plan files for completeness and quality:\n\nPlan directory: knowledge/plans/[yyyymmdd]-[feature-name]/\n\nCheck for:\n1. Clear and achievable deliverables\n2. Appropriate subagent assignments\n3. Correct dependency ordering\n4. Complete definition of done criteria\n5. Any gaps or concerns\n\nProvide suggestions for improvements.\"\n```\n\n### xfi-system-design\n\n```\nInvoke xfi-system-design subagent with:\n\n\"Review the engineering plan for architectural soundness:\n\nPlan directory: knowledge/plans/[yyyymmdd]-[feature-name]/\n\nCheck for:\n1. Alignment with X-Fidelity architecture\n2. Appropriate package assignments\n3. Completeness of scope\n4. Technical feasibility\n5. Risk coverage\n\nProvide suggestions for improvements.\"\n```\n\n### Incorporate Feedback\n\nUpdate plan files based on reviewer suggestions.\n\n## Step 7: User Final Review (MANDATORY STOP)\n\n**STOP and present to user:**\n\n```markdown\n## Plan Ready for Review\n\n### Plan Location\n`knowledge/plans/[yyyymmdd]-[feature-name]/`\n\n### Files Created\n- `index-[feature-name]-[yyyymmdd].md` (main plan)\n- `subtask-01-[feature]-[subtask-name]-[yyyymmdd].md`\n- `subtask-02-[feature]-[subtask-name]-[yyyymmdd].md`\n- ...\n\n### Review Feedback Incorporated\n- [Summary of changes from code reviewer]\n- [Summary of changes from system design]\n\n### Execution Summary\n- Total subtasks: [N]\n- Parallel phases: [N]\n- Estimated complexity: [Low/Medium/High]\n\n---\n\nPlease review the plan files. When ready to execute, use:\n`/xfi-plan-execute`\n\nAny changes needed before finalizing?\n```\n\n## Step 8: Finalize Plan\n\nOnce user approves:\n\n1. Update index file status to \"Ready for Review\"\n2. Document execution instructions:\n\n```markdown\n## Execution Instructions\n\nTo execute this plan in a new agent session:\n\n1. Start a new conversation\n2. Run: `/xfi-plan-execute`\n3. Select this plan: `[yyyymmdd]-[feature-name]`\n4. Confirm execution summary\n5. Monitor subtask progress\n6. Review final changes when prompted\n7. Approve documentation updates\n```\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n1. **NEVER edit code files** during planning\n2. **ALWAYS stop for user confirmation** at Steps 3 and 7\n3. **DELEGATE subtask creation** to appropriate subagents\n4. **INCLUDE testing restrictions** in all subtask files\n5. **CAPTURE all decisions** in the index file\n6. **UPDATE index** with discoveries from subagents\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Subagent doesn''t create correct file\n- Verify the file path is correct\n- Ensure template was provided\n- Re-invoke with clearer instructions\n\n### Scope too large\n- Break into multiple plans\n- Phase the implementation\n- Prioritize critical subtasks\n\n### Unclear requirements\n- Ask additional clarifying questions\n- Consult xfi-system-design for guidance\n- Document assumptions clearly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:41:09.875Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Planning Agents needing structured initiative planning and xfi-system-design integration.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化计划和xfi-system-design集成的规划代理。","ja":"計画エージェントが構造化されたイニシアチブ計画とxfi-system-designの統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 계획 및 xfi-system-design 통합이 필요한 계획 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de planificación que necesitan una planificación de iniciativa estructurada e integración con xfi-system-design.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de planification qui nécessitent une planification d''initiative structurée et une intégration avec xfi-system-design.","de":"Perfekt für Planungsagenten, die eine strukturierte Initiativplanung und eine Integration mit xfi-system-design benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Planejamento que necessitam de planejamento de iniciativa estruturado e integração com xfi-system-design.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Планирующих Агентов, которым требуется структурированное планирование инициатив и интеграция с xfi-system-design.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التخطيط الذي يحتاج إلى تخطيط مبادرة منظم وتكامل مع xfi-system-design."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive engineering plans through requirements gathering, architectural input from xfi-system-design, and subtask delegation, utilizing cli for opinionated framework adherence checks and handling up to 10 questions for precise planning.","zh":"通过需求收集、从xfi-system-design获取架构输入和子任务委派，利用cli进行意见化框架遵从性检查，能够处理最多10个问题以进行精确规划，从而赋予代理创建综合工程计划的能力。","ja":"xfi-system-designからのアーキテクチャ入力とサブタスクの委任を通じて、要求の収集を行い、CLIを使用して意見化フレームワークの遵守性チェックを行い、最大10個の質問を処理して詳細な計画を作成することで、エージェントが包括的なエンジニアリング計画を作成する能力を提供します。","ko":"요구 사항 수집, xfi-system-design에서 아키텍처 입력 및 하위 작업 위임을 통해, cli를 사용하여 의견화 프레임워크 준수성 검사를 수행하고, 최대 10개의 질문을 처리하여 정확한 계획을 수행함으로써, 에이전트가 포괄적인 엔지니어링 계획을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear planes de ingeniería completos a través de la recopilación de requisitos, la entrada arquitectónica de xfi-system-design y la delegación de subtareas, utilizando cli para controles de adherencia a frameworks opinados y manejo de hasta 10 preguntas para una planificación precisa.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des plans d''ingénierie complets grâce à la collecte de exigences, à l''entrée architecturale de xfi-system-design et à la délégation de sous-tâches, en utilisant cli pour des contrôles d''adhérence à des frameworks opinés et en gérant jusqu''à 10 questions pour une planification précise.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Ingenieurpläne durch Anforderungssammlung, architektonische Eingaben von xfi-system-design und Subtask-Delegation zu erstellen, indem sie cli für opinionierte Framework-Adhärenz-Checks und die Verwaltung von bis zu 10 Fragen für eine präzise Planung verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar planos de engenharia abrangentes por meio da coleta de requisitos, entrada arquitetônica do xfi-system-design e delegação de subtarefas, utilizando cli para verificações de aderência ao framework opinado e lidando com até 10 perguntas para planejamento preciso.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать комплексные инженерные планы посредством сбора требований, архитектурного ввода из xfi-system-design и делегирования подзадач, используя cli для проверок соблюдения opinated framework и обработки до 10 вопросов для точного планирования.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية إنشاء خطط هندسية شاملة من خلال جمع المتطلبات، والمدخلات المعمارية من xfi-system-design، وتفويض المهام الفرعية، واستخدام cli لفحوصات امتثال الإطار المعتمد ومتناول حتى 10 أسئلة للتخطيط الدقيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating detailed initiative plans","Delegating subtasks to appropriate subagents","Integrating with xfi-system-design for architectural input"],"zh":["创建详细的计划","委派子任务给适当的子代理","与xfi-system-design集成以获取架构输入"],"ja":["詳細なイニシアチブ計画の作成","適切なサブエージェントにサブタスクを委任する","アーキテクチャ入力を取得するためにxfi-system-designと統合する"],"ko":["세부적인 이니셔티브 계획 생성","적절한 하위 에이전트에 하위 작업 위임","아키텍처 입력을 얻기 위해 xfi-system-design와 통합"],"es":["Creación de planes de iniciativa detallados","Delegación de subtareas a subagentes adecuados","Integración con xfi-system-design para obtener entrada arquitectónica"],"fr":["Création de plans d''initiative détaillés","Délégation de sous-tâches à des sous-agents appropriés","Intégration avec xfi-system-design pour obtenir une entrée architecturale"],"de":["Erstellung detaillierter Initiativpläne","Delegation von Subtasks an geeignete Subagenten","Integration mit xfi-system-design für architektonische Eingaben"],"pt":["Criar planos de iniciativa detalhados","Delegar subtarefas para subagentes apropriados","Integrar com xfi-system-design para entrada arquitetônica"],"ru":["Создание подробных планов инициатив","Делегирование подзадач соответствующим подагентам","Интеграция с xfi-system-design для архитектурного ввода"],"ar":["إنشاء خطط مبادرة مفصلة","تفويض المهام الفرعية إلى وكلاء فرعيين مناسبين","التكامل مع xfi-system-design للمدخلات المعمارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear understanding of the feature/initiative","Needs access to xfi-system-design agent","Limited to handling up to 10 questions for requirements gathering"],"zh":["需要对功能/计划有明确的理解","需要访问xfi-system-design代理","仅限处理最多10个问题以进行需求收集"],"ja":["機能/イニシアチブを明確に理解する必要がある","xfi-system-designエージェントへのアクセスが必要","要件収集のために最大10個の質問のみを処理できる"],"ko":["기능/이니셔티브에 대한 명확한 이해가 필요","xfi-system-design 에이전트에 대한 액세스가 필요","요구 사항 수집을 위해 최대 10개의 질문만 처리할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión clara de la función/iniciativa","Necesita acceso al agente xfi-system-design","Limitado a manejar hasta 10 preguntas para la recopilación de requisitos"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension claire de la fonction/initiative","Nécessite un accès à l''agent xfi-system-design","Limité à gérer jusqu''à 10 questions pour la collecte de exigences"],"de":["Benötigt ein klares Verständnis der Funktion/Initiative","Benötigt Zugriff auf den xfi-system-design-Agenten","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung von bis zu 10 Fragen für die Anforderungssammlung"],"pt":["Exige compreensão clara da funcionalidade/iniciativa","Necessita acesso ao agente xfi-system-design","Limitado a lidar com até 10 perguntas para coleta de requisitos"],"ru":["Требует четкого понимания функциональности/инициативы","Требует доступа к агенту xfi-system-design","Ограничен обработкой до 10 вопросов для сбора требований"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا واضحًا للميزة/المبادرة","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى وكلاء xfi-system-design","محدود بمعالجة حتى 10 أسئلة لجمع المتطلبات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"97e1f300a443fead1a9626df29b522318bb85c95ee04cad32745fd3b326812e9","qualityScore":37}');
