amesの最小バージョンでゲームを実行するためのツールです。AIエージェントの使用を簡素化します","ko":"Python 심플라이프는 telluriumgames의 최소 버전으로 게임을 실행하는 데 사용되는 도구입니다. AI 에이전트의 사용을 단순화합니다","es":"Python-simplifier es una versión minimalista de telluriumgames, diseñada para ejecutar juegos de manera eficiente","fr":"Python-simplifier est une version minimaliste de telluriumgames, conçue pour exécuter des jeux de manière efficace","de":"Python-simplifier ist eine minimalistische Version von telluriumgames, entwickelt für effizientes Spielen","pt":"O python-simplifier é uma versão minimalista do telluriumgames, projetada para executar jogos de forma eficiente","ru":"Python-simplifier - минималистичная версия telluriumgames, предназначенная для запуска игр","ar":"python-simplifier هو نسخة مبسطة من telluriumgames، مصممة لتشغيل الألعاب بفعالية","en":"minimal version of telluriumgames to run game"},"definition":{"en":"minimal version of telluriumgames to run game"},"features":{"zh":["支持telluriumgames的最小版本","提供简单的AI智能代理使用方式","适用于游戏开发者","使用Python语言开发","轻量级和易于使用"],"ja":["telluriumgamesの最小バージョンをサポート","AIエージェントの使用を簡素化","ゲーム開発者向け","Python言語で開発","軽量かつ使いやすい"],"ko":["telluriumgames의 최소 버전을 지원","AI 에이전트의 사용을 단순화","게임 개발자용","Python 언어로 개발","경량화되고 사용하기 쉬움"],"es":["Versión minimalista de telluriumgames","Ejecución eficiente de juegos","Diseñado para desarrolladores de juegos","Compatibilidad con Python","Fácil de instalar y configurar"],"fr":["Version minimaliste de telluriumgames","Exécution efficace de jeux","Conçu pour les développeurs de jeux","Compatibilité avec Python","Facile à installer et à configurer"],"de":["Minimalistische Version von telluriumgames","Effiziente Ausführung von Spielen","Entwickelt für Spieleentwickler","Kompatibilität mit Python","Einfach zu installieren und zu konfigurieren"],"pt":["Execução de jogos de forma eficiente","Versão minimalista do telluriumgames","Fácil de usar e configurar","Compatível com diferentes plataformas","Otimizado para desempenho"],"ru":["Эффективный запуск игр","Минималистичная версия telluriumgames","Легко использовать и настраивать","Совместим с различными платформами","Оптимизирован для производительности"],"ar":["تشغيل الألعاب بفعالية","نسخة مبسطة من telluriumgames","سهل الاستخدام والتهيئة","متوافق مع منصات مختلفة","مُحسّن لتحقيق الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["python-simplifier","AI智能代理","telluriumgames","游戏开发","Python语言","如何使用python-simplifier","python-simplifier安装","python-simplifier设置指南"],"ja":["Pythonシンプライフ","AIエージェント","telluriumgames","ゲーム開発","Python言語","Pythonシンプライフの使い方","Pythonシンプライフのインストール","Pythonシンプライフの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Python 심플라이프","AI 에이전트","telluriumgames","게임 개발","Python 언어","Python 심플라이프 사용법","Python 심플라이프 설치","Python 심플라이프 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para juegos","python-simplifier","telluriumgames","cómo usar python-simplifier","alternativas a telluriumgames","python-simplifier vs telluriumgames","instalación de python-simplifier","guía de configuración de python-simplifier"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour jeux","python-simplifier","telluriumgames","comment utiliser python-simplifier","alternatives à telluriumgames","python-simplifier vs telluriumgames","installation de python-simplifier","guide de configuration de python-simplifier"],"de":["KI-Tools für Spiele","python-simplifier","telluriumgames","wie man python-simplifier verwendet","alternativen zu telluriumgames","python-simplifier vs telluriumgames","installation von python-simplifier","konfigurationsanleitung für python-simplifier"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","python simplifier","telluriumgames","como usar python simplifier","o que é python simplifier","alternativas ao telluriumgames","python simplifier vs telluriumgames","instalar python simplifier","guia de configuração do python simplifier"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","python simplifier","telluriumgames","как использовать python simplifier","что такое python simplifier","альтернативы telluriumgames","python simplifier vs telluriumgames","установить python simplifier","руководство по настройке python simplifier"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","python simplifier","telluriumgames","كيفية استخدام python simplifier","ما هو python simplifier","بديلات telluriumgames","python simplifier مقابل telluriumgames","تثبيت python simplifier","دليل إعداد python simplifier"]}},"owner":"charlesmsiegel","repo":"tg","repoPath":"charlesmsiegel/tg","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.840Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"python-simplifier","description":"Simplify overly complex Python code. Use when user asks to simplify, refactor, clean up, make more readable, reduce complexity, improve code quality, find code smells, detect duplicates, or analyze coupling in Python code. Triggers on requests like simplify this code, this is too complex, make this more readable, refactor this, clean this up, find issues, analyze this codebase, or when reviewing code that exhibits complexity anti-patterns. For Django-specific analysis, use the django-simplifier skill instead.","bodyPreview":"# Python Code Simplifier\n\nTransform complex, hard-to-maintain Python code into clean, readable, idiomatic solutions.\n\n## Analysis Scripts\n\n```bash\n# Comprehensive analysis (runs all checks)\npython scripts/analyze_all.py /path/to/project\n\n# Individual analyzers:\npython scripts/analyze_complexity.py .       # Cyclomatic/cognitive complexity\npython scripts/find_code_smells.py .         # Mutable defaults, bare excepts, etc.\npython scripts/find_overengineering.py .     # YAGNI violations, unused abs","body":"# Python Code Simplifier\n\nTransform complex, hard-to-maintain Python code into clean, readable, idiomatic solutions.\n\n## Analysis Scripts\n\n```bash\n# Comprehensive analysis (runs all checks)\npython scripts/analyze_all.py /path/to/project\n\n# Individual analyzers:\npython scripts/analyze_complexity.py .       # Cyclomatic/cognitive complexity\npython scripts/find_code_smells.py .         # Mutable defaults, bare excepts, etc.\npython scripts/find_overengineering.py .     # YAGNI violations, unused abstractions\npython scripts/find_dead_code.py .           # Unused imports, functions, variables\npython scripts/find_unpythonic.py .          # Non-idiomatic patterns\npython scripts/find_coupling_issues.py .     # Feature envy, low cohesion\npython scripts/find_duplicates.py .          # Structural duplicate detection\n\n# JSON output for CI/tooling\npython scripts/analyze_all.py . --format json > report.json\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze**: Run `analyze_all.py` to identify all issues\n2. **Prioritize**: Address high-severity issues (🔴) first\n3. **Simplify**: Apply patterns below incrementally\n4. **Verify**: Ensure simplified code is functionally equivalent\n\n## Simplification Principles\n\n1. **YAGNI**: Don''t add abstractions until needed\n2. **Preserve behavior**: Simplification ≠ changing functionality\n3. **One change at a time**: Incremental is safer\n4. **Readability over cleverness**: Clear beats \"smart\"\n5. **Keep related code together**: Locality matters\n\n## Common Simplification Patterns\n\n### Extract and Name\n\n```python\n# Before: Complex inline condition\nif user.age >= 18 and user.country in ALLOWED and not user.banned:\n\n# After: Named condition\nis_eligible = user.age >= 18 and user.country in ALLOWED and not user.banned\nif is_eligible:\n```\n\n### Early Returns\n\n```python\n# Before: Deep nesting\ndef process(data):\n    if data:\n        if data.valid:\n            if data.ready:\n                return compute(data)\n    return None\n\n# After: Guard clauses\ndef process(data):\n    if not data or not data.valid or not data.ready:\n        return None\n    return compute(data)\n```\n\n### Comprehensions\n\n```python\n# Before: Manual loop\nresult = []\nfor item in items:\n    if item.active:\n        result.append(item.name)\n\n# After: List comprehension\nresult = [item.name for item in items if item.active]\n```\n\n### Dictionary Techniques\n\n```python\n# Before: Verbose key checking\nif key in d:\n    value = d[key]\nelse:\n    value = default\n\n# After: get() with default\nvalue = d.get(key, default)\n\n# Before: Manual grouping\ngroups = {}\nfor item in items:\n    if item.category not in groups:\n        groups[item.category] = []\n    groups[item.category].append(item)\n\n# After: defaultdict\nfrom collections import defaultdict\ngroups = defaultdict(list)\nfor item in items:\n    groups[item.category].append(item)\n```\n\n### Context Managers\n\n```python\n# Before: Manual cleanup\nf = open(''file.txt'')\ntry:\n    data = f.read()\nfinally:\n    f.close()\n\n# After: with statement\nwith open(''file.txt'') as f:\n    data = f.read()\n```\n\n## Over-Engineering Anti-Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Problem | Solution |\n|---------|---------|----------|\n| Single-impl interface | Abstract class with one subclass | Merge or wait for need |\n| Unnecessary factory | Factory that creates one type | Direct instantiation |\n| Premature strategy | Strategy pattern with one strategy | Simple function |\n| Thin wrapper | Class that just delegates | Use wrapped class directly |\n| Speculative generality | Code for \"future needs\" | Delete it (YAGNI) |\n| Deep inheritance | 4+ levels of inheritance | Composition over inheritance |\n\n## Code Smells Quick Reference\n\n| Smell | Detection | Fix |\n|-------|-----------|-----|\n| Mutable default | `def f(x=[])` | Use `None`, create inside |\n| Bare except | `except:` | `except Exception:` |\n| God class | 15+ methods, 10+ attrs | Split into focused classes |\n| Long function | 50+ lines | Extract helper functions |\n| Deep nesting | 4+ levels | Early returns, extract |\n| Feature envy | Method uses other class more | Move method |\n| Magic numbers | Unexplained numeric literals | Named constants |\n\n## Script Reference\n\n| Script | What It Detects |\n|--------|-----------------|\n| `analyze_complexity.py` | Cyclomatic complexity, cognitive complexity, nesting depth, function length, parameter count, class size |\n| `find_code_smells.py` | Mutable defaults, bare excepts, magic numbers, type comparisons, god classes, data classes, boolean blindness |\n| `find_overengineering.py` | Single-implementation interfaces, unused abstractions, unnecessary factories/builders, thin wrappers, premature strategies |\n| `find_dead_code.py` | Unused imports, unused functions/classes, unused parameters, unreachable code, constant conditions |\n| `find_unpythonic.py` | `range(len())`, `== True/False/None`, swallowed exceptions, manual index tracking |\n| `find_coupling_issues.py` | Feature envy, low cohesion (LCOM), message chains, middle man classes |\n| `find_duplicates.py` | Structurally similar code blocks using AST normalization |\n\n## When NOT to Simplify\n\n- Working legacy code with no tests\n- Performance-critical hot paths (measure first)\n- Code that will be replaced soon\n- External API constraints requiring complexity\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:46:50.368Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Optimization Agents needing advanced Python code simplification and analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Python 代码简化和分析能力的代码优化代理。","ja":"Python コードの高度な簡素化と分析機能を必要とするコード最適化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Python 코드 단순화 및 분석 기능이 필요한 코드 최적화 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Optimización de Código que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de simplificación y análisis de código Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de code nécessitant des capacités avancées de simplification et d''analyse de code Python.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Optimierungsagenten, die erweiterte Python-Code-Vereinfachungs- und Analysefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de simplificação e análise de código Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации кода, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности упрощения и анализа кода Python.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تعزيز قدراتهم على تحسين وتحليل شفرة Python المتقدمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform complex Python code into clean, readable, idiomatic solutions using cyclomatic complexity analysis, code smell detection, and overengineering checks, leveraging scripts like analyze_all.py and find_code_smells.py.","zh":"赋予代理转换复杂 Python 代码为干净、可读、惯用的解决方案的能力，使用环复杂度分析、代码异味检测和过度工程化检查，利用诸如 analyze_all.py 和 find_code_smells.py 的脚本。","ja":"複雑な Python コードをクリーンで読みやすいアイディア的なソリューションに変換するエージェントの能力を与えることで、サイクロマチック複雑性分析、コードスメル検出、および過剰エンジニアリングチェックを使用し、analyze_all.py および find_code_smells.py などのスクリプトを利用します。","ko":"복잡한 Python 코드를 깨끗하고 읽기 쉬운 관용적인 해결책으로 변환할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여함으로써, 사이클로매틱 복잡성 분석, 코드 냄새 감지 및 과잉 엔지니어링 확인을 사용하며, analyze_all.py 및 find_code_smells.py와 같은 스크립트를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar código Python complejo en soluciones limpias, legibles e idiomáticas utilizando análisis de complejidad ciclomática, detección de olores de código y controles de sobrediseño, aprovechando scripts como analyze_all.py y find_code_smells.py.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer du code Python complexe en des solutions propres, lisibles et idiomatiques en utilisant l''analyse de la complexité cyclomatique, la détection d''odeurs de code et les vérifications de surconception, en exploitant des scripts tels que analyze_all.py et find_code_smells.py.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexen Python-Code in saubere, lesbare, idiomatische Lösungen zu transformieren, indem sie eine Analyse der cyclischen Komplexität, Code-Geruchserkennung und Überkonstruktionsprüfungen verwenden und Skripte wie analyze_all.py und find_code_smells.py nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar código Python complexo em soluções limpas, legíveis e idiomáticas, utilizando análise de complexidade ciclomática, detecção de odores de código e verificações de sobre-engenharia, aproveitando scripts como analyze_all.py e find_code_smells.py.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать сложный код Python в чистые, читаемые и идиоматические решения, используя анализ цикломатической сложности, обнаружение запахов кода и проверки чрезмерного инжиниринга, используя скрипты, такие как analyze_all.py и find_code_smells.py.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحويل شفرة Python المعقدة إلى حلول نظيفة وقابلة للقراءة ومتوافقة مع اللغة، باستخدام تحليل التعقيد الدوري واكتشاف روائح الشفرة وفحص الهندسة المفرطة، مع الاستفادة من سكريبتات مثل analyze_all.py و find_code_smells.py."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing cyclomatic complexity","Detecting mutable defaults and bare excepts","Identifying YAGNI violations and unused abstracts"],"zh":["分析环复杂度","检测可变默认值和裸 except","识别 YAGNI 违规和未使用的抽象"],"ja":["サイクロマチック複雑性の分析","可変デフォルトと裸のexceptの検出","YAGNI違反と未使用の抽象の識別"],"ko":["사이클로매틱 복잡성 분석","가변 기본값 및 베어 예외 감지","YAGNI 위반 및 사용되지 않은 추상의 식별"],"es":["Análisis de complejidad ciclomática","Detección de valores predeterminados mutables y excepciones descubiertas","Identificación de violaciones de YAGNI y abstractos no utilizados"],"fr":["Analyse de la complexité cyclomatique","Détection de valeurs par défaut mutables et d''exceptions nues","Identification des violations de YAGNI et des abstraits non utilisés"],"de":["Analyse der cyclischen Komplexität","Erkennung von veränderbaren Standardwerten und unbekleideten Ausnahmen","Identifizierung von YAGNI-Verletzungen und nicht verwendeten Abstrakten"],"pt":["Analisar complexidade ciclomática","Detectar padrões mutáveis e exceções nuas","Identificar violações YAGNI e abstrações não utilizadas"],"ru":["Анализировать цикломатическую сложность","Обнаруживать изменяемые значения по умолчанию и голые исключения","Определять нарушения YAGNI и неиспользуемые абстракции"],"ar":["تحليل التعقيد الدوري","اكتشاف القيم المتغيرة افتراضيًا والاستثناءات النaked","تحديد انتهاكات YAGNI والتحديثات غير المستخدمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to Python code analysis"],"zh":["需要 Python 环境","仅限于 Python 代码分析"],"ja":["Python 環境が必要","Python コード分析のみ"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요함","Python 코드 분석에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere un entorno Python","Limitado al análisis de código Python"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité à l''analyse de code Python"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von Python-Code"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Limitado à análise de código Python"],"ru":["Требует среды Python","Ограничен анализом кода Python"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","محدود بتحليل شفرة Python"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b49df2fc820a27aacbbca7669c058d7efd4387161545999c87e82dc346c31737","qualityScore":37}');
