:"github-dev"},"description":{"zh":"GitHub Dev提供Autonomous AI agent模板，用于开发和GTM自动化，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"GitHub Devは、開発とGTM自動化用のAutonomous AIエージェントテンプレートを提供し、開発者の効率を向上させる","ko":"깃허브 Dev는 개발과 GTM 자동화를 위한 자율형 AI 에이전트 템플릿을 제공하여 개발자의 효율성을 향상시킵니다","es":"Las plantillas de agentes de IA para desarrollo y automatización de github-dev mejoran la eficiencia del flujo de trabajo","fr":"Les modèles d''agents de l''IA pour le développement et l''automatisation de github-dev améliorent l''efficacité du flux de travail","de":"Die Vorlagen für KI-Agents für Entwicklung und Automatisierung von github-dev verbessern die Effizienz des Arbeitsflusses","pt":"Os modelos de agentes de IA autônomos para desenvolvimento e automação de GTM permitem uma integração perfeita","ru":"ИИ Агенты для автоматизации разработки и GTM обеспечивают идеальную интеграцию","ar":"القوالب الأوتوماتيكية لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي للتنمية وتأتمتة GTM تمكنك من التكامل المثالي","en":"Autonomous AI agent templates for development and GTM automation"},"definition":{"en":"Autonomous AI agent templates for development and GTM automation"},"features":{"zh":["预构建的Autonomous AI agent模板","支持开发和GTM自动化","提高开发效率和生产力","简化开发和GTM流程","支持多种开发语言和框架"],"ja":["事前構築済みのAutonomous AIエージェントテンプレート","開発とGTM自動化のサポート","開発効率と生産性の向上","開発とGTMプロセスの簡素化","複数の開発言語とフレームワークのサポート"],"ko":["미리 구축된 자율형 AI 에이전트 템플릿","개발과 GTM 자동화 지원","개발 효율성과 생산성 향상","개발과 GTM 프로세스 간소화","다양한 개발 언어와 프레임워크 지원"],"es":["Automatización de tareas de desarrollo","Integración con GitHub","Soporte para múltiples lenguajes de programación","CLI para ejecución de comandos","Plantillas personalizables para proyectos"],"fr":["Automatisation des tâches de développement","Intégration avec GitHub","Prise en charge de plusieurs langages de programmation","CLI pour l''exécution de commandes","Modèles personnalisables pour les projets"],"de":["Automatisierung von Entwicklungs-Aufgaben","Integration mit GitHub","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen","CLI für die Ausführung von Befehlen","Anpassbare Vorlagen für Projekte"],"pt":["Integração com GitHub","Automação de desenvolvimento","GTM automático","Modelos de agentes de IA personalizados","Suporte a React, Python e Node.js"],"ru":["Интеграция с GitHub","Автоматизация разработки","Автоматизация GTM","Пользовательские модели ИИ Агентов","Поддержка React, Python и Node.js"],"ar":["التكامل مع GitHub","تأتمتة التنمية","تأتمتة GTM","نماذج وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المخصصة","دعم React و Python و Node.js"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub Dev","AI开发自动化","GTM自动化","Autonomous AI agent","开发效率","生产力","开发框架","如何使用GitHub Dev","GitHub Dev替代品"],"ja":["GitHub Dev","AIエージェント","GTM自動化","Autonomous AIエージェント","開発効率","生産性","開発フレームワーク","GitHub Devの使い方","GitHub Devの代替"],"ko":["깃허브 Dev","AI 에이전트","GTM 자동화","자율형 AI 에이전트","개발 효율성","생산성","개발 프레임워크","깃허브 Dev 사용법","깃허브 Dev 대안"],"es":["cómo usar github-dev","qué es un agente de IA","alternativas a github-dev","github-dev vs jenkins","instalación de github-dev","guía de configuración de github-dev"],"fr":["comment utiliser github-dev","qu''est-ce qu''un agent de l''IA","alternatives à github-dev","github-dev vs jenkins","installation de github-dev","guide de configuration de github-dev"],"de":["wie man github-dev verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu github-dev","github-dev vs jenkins","Installation von github-dev","Konfigurationsanleitung für github-dev"],"pt":["como usar agentes de IA","o que são agentes de IA","agentes de IA alternativos","agentes de IA vs competitors","instalar agentes de IA","guia de configuração de agentes de IA"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое ИИ Агенты","ИИ Агенты альтернативы","ИИ Агенты vs конкуренты","установить ИИ Агенты","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"consuelohq","repo":"openengineer","repoPath":"consuelohq/openengineer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.875Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-dev","description":"Remote development via GitHub API. Write code, create branches, commit files, and create PRs — all without a local clone. Pull tasks from Linear and implement them entirely through GitHub. Use when Ko wants features built remotely while working locally on other things.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Remote Development\n\nBuild features entirely through GitHub''s API — no local clone needed. Pull tasks from Linear, create branches, write code, batch commit, create PRs, and auto-sync task status.\n\n**Why this exists:** Ko works on multiple things at once. When coming to this project, he''s already working on something locally. This skill lets the agent develop features in parallel without touching the local machine. You could have 10 sessions each working on different features simultaneou","body":"# GitHub Remote Development\n\nBuild features entirely through GitHub''s API — no local clone needed. Pull tasks from Linear, create branches, write code, batch commit, create PRs, and auto-sync task status.\n\n**Why this exists:** Ko works on multiple things at once. When coming to this project, he''s already working on something locally. This skill lets the agent develop features in parallel without touching the local machine. You could have 10 sessions each working on different features simultaneously.\n\n## Default Repo\n\n`kokayicobb/consuelo_on_call_coaching`\n\nOverride with `--repo owner/name` on any command.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `gh` CLI installed at `/opt/homebrew/bin/gh` and authenticated\n- `LINEAR_API_KEY` set as env var (or available in `.agent/linear-api.sh`)\n- `requests` Python library (for Linear API calls)\n\n## Two Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: From Linear Task (default)\n\nKo says something like \"pull task CON-456 and implement it\" or \"work on the auth feature from Linear.\"\n\n**Steps:**\n\n1. **Fetch the task spec** — run `fetch_task.py` to pull the task from Linear and save as markdown\n2. **Read the markdown spec** — understand requirements, acceptance criteria, comments\n3. **Start the dev session** — this creates a branch and updates Linear status\n4. **Write code** — use the GitHub API to read existing files, write new files, update files\n5. **Commit** — batch commit all changes atomically\n6. **Create PR** — auto-generates body with Linear linking, moves task to \"In Review\"\n\n**Python usage (in agent context):**\n\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.insert(0, \"/Users/kokayi/Dev/claude-agent-workflow/.opencode/skills/github-dev\")\nfrom github_dev import RemoteDev\n\ndev = RemoteDev()\n\n# Start from a Linear task\nsummary = dev.start_task(\"CON-456\")\n# This: fetches task → saves spec → creates branch → updates Linear\n\n# Read the saved spec to understand what to build\n# The spec file is at: .opencode/skills/github-dev/tasks/CON-456.md\n\n# Read existing code to understand the codebase\ncontent = dev.read_file(\"src/components/Auth.tsx\")\ntree = dev.get_repo_structure(\"src/components/\")\n\n# Write new code (staged for batch commit)\ndev.write_file(\"src/components/NewFeature.tsx\", new_component_code)\ndev.write_file(\"src/utils/helper.ts\", helper_code)\ndev.write_file(\"src/tests/NewFeature.test.tsx\", test_code)\n\n# Commit all staged files atomically\ndev.commit(\"feat: implement new feature with helper utils and tests\")\n\n# Maybe write more code and commit again\ndev.write_file(\"src/styles/NewFeature.css\", css_code)\ndev.commit(\"style: add styling for new feature\")\n\n# Create PR when done (auto-links to Linear, moves task to \"In Review\")\npr = dev.create_pr()\n```\n\n**CLI usage:**\n\n```bash\n# Fetch task spec (saves to tasks/CON-456.md)\npython3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/fetch_task.py CON-456\n\n# Start a dev session\npython3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/dev task CON-456\n\n# Create a branch without a Linear task\npython3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/dev create-branch \"add user auth flow\"\n\n# Read files, list directories\npython3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/dev read src/file.tsx\npython3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/dev ls src/components/\npython3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/dev tree src/\n\n# Write/stage files for commit\necho ''file content'' | python3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/dev write src/new.tsx\npython3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/dev write src/file.tsx --content-file /tmp/code.tsx\npython3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/dev write src/quick.tsx --content \"const x = 1;\" --immediate\n\n# See what''s staged\npython3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/dev staged\n\n# Commit all staged files (atomic batch via Git Trees API)\npython3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/dev commit \"feat: add new component\"\n\n# Create a PR for the current branch\npython3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/dev create-pr --label kiro --label enhancement\npython3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/dev create-pr --title \"feat: user auth\" --label kiro\n\n# Check session status\npython3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/dev status\n\n# Resume a previous session\npython3 .opencode/skills/github-dev/dev resume\n```\n\n### Workflow 2: From Existing PR\n\nKo says something like \"work on PR #789, fix the review comments\" or \"push changes to that PR.\"\n\n**Steps:**\n\n1. **Attach to the PR** — fetches PR info, sets the branch\n2. **Read the PR diff** — understand what''s already changed\n3. **Make changes** — read/write files on the PR''s branch\n4. **Commit** — push changes to the PR\n\n```python\ndev = RemoteDev()\n\n# Attach to existing PR\ndev.work_on_pr(789)\n\n# Read the current state\ncontent = dev.read_file(\"src/fix-me.tsx\")\n\n# Make changes\ndev.write_file(\"src/fix-me.tsx\", fixed_content)\ndev.commit(\"fix: address review comments\")\n```\n\n## Branch Naming Convention\n\n`remote/{repo_name}-{4char_hash}--{kebab-description}`\n\nExample: `remote/consuelo_on_call_coaching-a3f2--implement-user-auth-flow`\n\nThe `remote/` prefix distinguishes these from the `agent/` prefix used by the local agent workflow.\n\n## File Operations\n\n### Reading Files\n\n```python\n# Single file\ncontent = dev.read_file(\"src/components/Auth.tsx\")\n\n# Directory listing\nitems = dev.list_files(\"src/components/\")\n# Returns: [{\"name\": \"Auth.tsx\", \"type\": \"file\", \"size\": 1234}, ...]\n\n# Full repo tree (filtered)\nfiles = dev.get_repo_structure(\"src/\")\n# Returns: [\"src/app.tsx\", \"src/index.tsx\", ...]\n```\n\n### Writing Files (Staging)\n\nFiles are staged by default and committed as a batch:\n\n```python\n# Stage files\ndev.write_file(\"src/new.tsx\", code)\ndev.write_file(\"src/utils.ts\", utils)\n\n# Check what''s staged\ndev.staged_files()  # [\"src/new.tsx\", \"src/utils.ts\"]\n\n# Unstage a file\ndev.unstage(\"src/utils.ts\")\n\n# Commit all staged files\ndev.commit(\"feat: add new component\")\n```\n\nFor single-file immediate commits:\n\n```python\ndev.write_file(\"src/quick-fix.tsx\", code, stage=False)\n# Committed immediately\n```\n\n### Deleting Files\n\n```python\ndev.delete_file(\"src/old-file.tsx\")  # Staged\ndev.commit(\"chore: remove old file\")\n\ndev.delete_file(\"src/old-file.tsx\", stage=False)  # Immediate\n```\n\n## Batch Commits (Git Trees API)\n\nThe `commit()` method uses the Git Trees API for atomic multi-file commits. This means:\n\n- All files are committed in a single operation (no partial commits)\n- Much more efficient than one-file-at-a-time for real coding work\n- Creates proper git history (one commit per logical change)\n\n## Linear Integration\n\n### Auto-Status Sync\n\n| Event | Linear Status | Action |\n|-------|---------------|--------|\n| `start_task()` called | In Progress | Adds comment with branch name |\n| `create_pr()` called | In Review | Adds comment with PR link |\n\n### Task Spec Files\n\nFetched tasks are saved as markdown in `tasks/`:\n\n```\n.opencode/skills/github-dev/tasks/\n├── CON-456.md      # Full spec with description, criteria, comments\n├── CON-789.md\n└── .session-state.json  # Current session state for resumption\n```\n\nEach task file includes:\n- Metadata (priority, state, labels, dates)\n- Full description from Linear\n- Acceptance criteria\n- All comments (with authors and dates)\n- Subtasks (if any)\n- Attachments/links\n\n## Session Persistence\n\nThe skill saves session state to `.session-state.json` so you can resume:\n\n```python\ndev = RemoteDev()\nif dev.resume():\n    # Picks up where you left off (same branch, task, PR)\n    dev.write_file(\"src/more-code.tsx\", code)\n    dev.commit(\"feat: continue implementation\")\n```\n\n## Important Notes\n\n### When to Ask Ko\n\nIf Ko''s instructions are ambiguous about which workflow to use:\n\n- **\"Work on CON-456\"** → Workflow 1 (Linear task)\n- **\"Fix PR #789\"** → Workflow 2 (existing PR)\n- **\"Implement the auth feature\"** → Ask: \"should I pull from a specific Linear task or create a fresh branch?\"\n- **\"Push changes to the feature branch\"** → Ask: \"which PR or branch?\"\n\n### Rate Limits\n\nGitHub API has rate limits (5,000 requests/hour for authenticated users). Each file read/write is 1-2 API calls. Batch commits are more efficient (1 call per file for blobs + 3 fixed calls). For a typical feature (reading 10 files, writing 5), that''s ~25 API calls — well within limits.\n\n### File Size Limits\n\nThe Contents API has a 100MB limit per file. Normal source code files are well within this. If you need to handle binary files or very large files, use the Git Blobs API directly (already used in batch_commit).\n\n### Error Handling\n\n- If a branch creation fails (name conflict), the error is printed and `start_task()` raises\n- If a file write fails, the error is printed but other staged files can still be committed\n- If Linear API is unavailable, the GitHub operations still work (just no status sync)\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\ngithub-dev/\n├── SKILL.md            # This file — instructions for the agent\n├── github_api.py       # GitHub API client (gh CLI + gh api hybrid)\n├── linear_api.py       # Linear GraphQL client\n├── fetch_task.py       # CLI: pull task → markdown\n├── github_dev.py       # Main orchestrator (RemoteDev class)\n├── dev                 # Entry point script\n└── tasks/              # Saved task specs and session state\n```\n\n### Component Responsibilities\n\n- **github_api.py** — All GitHub operations. Uses `gh` CLI for PRs/reviews and `gh api` for file CRUD, branches, and batch commits. No Linear awareness.\n- **linear_api.py** — All Linear operations. Fetches tasks by ID, updates status, adds comments. No GitHub awareness.\n- **fetch_task.py** — Standalone CLI script. Pulls a task and writes a markdown file. Designed to be called before the agent starts reading (saves context window).\n- **github_dev.py** — The brain. Ties GitHub + Linear together. Manages staging, session state, and the two workflows.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:51:44.140Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous Development Agents requiring parallel feature development without local environment conflicts.","zh":"非常适合需要并行功能开发且无本地环境冲突的自主开发Agent。","ja":"ローカル環境の競合なしで並行機能開発を必要とする自律開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"로컬 환경 충돌 없이 병렬 기능 개발이 필요한 자율 개발 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Autonomous Development Agents que requieren desarrollo de características en paralelo sin conflictos en el entorno local.","fr":"Parfait pour les Autonomous Development Agents nécessitant un développement de fonctionnalités en parallèle sans conflits d''environnement local.","de":"Perfekt für Autonomous Development Agents, die parallele Feature-Entwicklung ohne lokale Umweltkonflikte erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Autónomos que requerem desenvolvimento de funcionalidades em paralelo sem conflitos de ambiente local.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Автономных Агентов Разработки, требующих параллельной разработки функций без конфликтов локальной среды.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير المستقليين الذين يتطلبون تطوير ميزات متوازية دون تعارضات في البيئة المحلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables full GitHub API-driven development workflow from task ingestion to PR creation, including branch management, batch commits, and automated status synchronization with project management tools like Linear. Eliminates local cloning requirements for true parallel development.","zh":"支持从任务接收到PR创建的全GitHub API驱动开发工作流，包括分支管理、批量提交以及与Linear等项目管理工作工具的自动化状态同步。无需本地克隆即可实现真正的并行开发。","ja":"タスクの取り込みからPR作成まで、ブランチ管理、バッチコミット、Linearなどのプロジェクト管理ツールとの自動化されたステータス同期を含む、完全なGitHub API駆動の開発ワークフローを実現します。真の並行開発のためにローカルクローンの要件を排除します。","ko":"작업 수신부터 PR 생성에 이르는 전체 GitHub API 기반 개발 워크플로우를 가능하게 하며, 여기에는 브랜치 관리, 배치 커밋 및 Linear와 같은 프로젝트 관리 도구와의 자동화된 상태 동기화가 포함됩니다. 진정한 병렬 개발을 위해 로컬 클론 요구 사항을 제거합니다.","es":"Permite un flujo de trabajo de desarrollo completo impulsado por la GitHub API, desde la ingesta de tareas hasta la creación de PR, incluyendo la gestión de ramas, commits por lotes y la sincronización automatizada de estado con herramientas de gestión de proyectos como Linear. Elimina los requisitos de clonación local para un desarrollo paralelo real.","fr":"Permet un flux de travail de développement complet piloté par la GitHub API, de l''ingestion des tâches à la création de PR, y compris la gestion des branches, les commits par lots et la synchronisation automatisée des statuts avec les outils de gestion de projet comme Linear. Élimine les besoins de clonage local pour un véritable développement parallèle.","de":"Ermöglicht einen vollständigen GitHub API-gesteuerten Entwicklungs-Workflow von der Aufgabenaufnahme bis zur PR-Erstellung, einschließlich Branch-Management, Batch-Commit und automatisierter Statussynchronisation mit Projektmanagement-Tools wie Linear. Beseitigt die Notwendigkeit des lokalen Klonens für echte parallele Entwicklung.","pt":"Permite um fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento completo orientado pela API do GitHub, desde a ingestão de tarefas até a criação de PRs, incluindo gestão de branches, commits em lote e sincronização automatizada de status com ferramentas de gestão de projetos como o Linear. Elimina a necessidade de clonagem local para um verdadeiro desenvolvimento paralelo.","ru":"Обеспечивает полный рабочий процесс разработки на основе GitHub API, от получения задач до создания PR, включая управление ветками, пакетные коммиты и автоматизированную синхронизацию статуса с инструментами управления проектами, такими как Linear. Устраняет необходимость локального клонирования для истинной параллельной разработки.","ar":"يتيح سير عمل تطوير كامل مدفوعًا بواجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub من استيعاب المهمة حتى إنشاء طلب السحب، بما في ذلك إدارة الفروع، عمليات الإيداع المجمعة، والمزامنة التلقائية للحالة مع أدوات إدارة المشاريع مثل Linear. يلغي متطلبات الاستنساخ المحلي للتطوير المتوازي الحقيقي."},"useCases":{"en":["Pulling development tasks directly from Linear","Creating feature branches via GitHub API","Writing and committing code in batch operations","Automating PR creation and task status synchronization"],"zh":["直接从Linear拉取开发任务","通过GitHub API创建功能分支","在批量操作中编写和提交代码","自动化PR创建和任务状态同步"],"ja":["Linearから開発タスクを直接プル","GitHub APIを介した機能ブランチの作成","バッチ操作でのコードの記述とコミット","PR作成とタスクステータス同期の自動化"],"ko":["Linear에서 개발 작업 직접 가져오기","GitHub API를 통한 기능 브랜치 생성","배치 작업에서 코드 작성 및 커밋","PR 생성 및 작업 상태 동기화 자동화"],"es":["Extraer tareas de desarrollo directamente desde Linear","Crear ramas de características mediante la GitHub API","Escribir y realizar commits de código en operaciones por lotes","Automatizar la creación de PR y la sincronización del estado de las tareas"],"fr":["Récupération des tâches de développement directement depuis Linear","Création de branches de fonctionnalités via la GitHub API","Écriture et commit du code dans des opérations par lots","Automatisation de la création de PR et de la synchronisation du statut des tâches"],"de":["Entwicklungsaufgaben direkt aus Linear ziehen","Erstellen von Feature-Branches über die GitHub API","Schreiben und Committen von Code in Batch-Operationen","Automatisieren der PR-Erstellung und der Aufgabenstatussynchronisation"],"pt":["Puxar tarefas de desenvolvimento diretamente do Linear","Criar branches de funcionalidades via GitHub API","Escrever e fazer commit de código em operações em lote","Automatizar a criação de PRs e a sincronização do estado das tarefas"],"ru":["Получение задач разработки непосредственно из Linear","Создание feature branches через GitHub API","Написание и коммит кода в пакетных операциях","Автоматизация создания PR и синхронизации статуса задач"],"ar":["سحب مهام التطوير مباشرة من Linear","إنشاء فروع الميزات عبر واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub","كتابة التعليمات البرمجية وإيداعها في عمليات مجمعة","أتمتة إنشاء طلبات السحب ومزامنة حالة المهمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub API access","Dependent on Linear integration for task management","No local development environment access"],"zh":["需要GitHub API访问权限","任务管理依赖Linear集成","无法访问本地开发环境"],"ja":["GitHub APIへのアクセスが必要","タスク管理はLinearインテグレーションに依存","ローカル開発環境へのアクセス不可"],"ko":["GitHub API 액세스 권한 필요","작업 관리에 Linear 통합 의존","로컬 개발 환경 액세스 불가"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la GitHub API","Dependiente de la integración con Linear para la gestión de tareas","Sin acceso al entorno de desarrollo local"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la GitHub API","Dépend de l''intégration Linear pour la gestion des tâches","Pas d''accès à l''environnement de développement local"],"de":["Erfordert GitHub API-Zugriff","Abhängig von der Linear-Integration für das Aufgabenmanagement","Kein Zugriff auf die lokale Entwicklungsumgebung"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API do GitHub","Dependente da integração com Linear para gestão de tarefas","Sem acesso ao ambiente de desenvolvimento local"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к GitHub API","Зависит от интеграции с Linear для управления задачами","Нет доступа к локальной среде разработки"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub","يعتمد على تكامل Linear لإدارة المهام","لا يوجد وصول إلى بيئة التطوير المحلية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5f3799534ac12c4a3713c627dc87679e7d84832e4290894768c659fe10f69609","qualityScore":37}');
