js","Unterstützung für mehrere Paketverwalter","Integration mit dem Code-Editor VSCode","Erweiterung der Funktionalität des Code-Editors"],"pt":["Suporte a npm, yarn, pnpm e bun","Gerenciamento avançado de pacotes Node.js","Integração com o VS Code","Melhoria da produtividade do desenvolvedor","Suporte a múltiplos gerenciadores de pacotes"],"ru":["Поддержка npm, yarn, pnpm и bun","Расширенное управление пакетами Node.js","Интеграция с VS Code","Повышение производительности разработчика","Поддержка нескольких менеджеров пакетов"],"ar":["دعم npm و yarn و pnpm و bun","إدارة متقدمة للحزم Node.js","التكامل مع VS Code","تحسين إنتاجية المطور","دعم عدة أدوات لإدارة الحزم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Node.js包管理扩展","npm、yarn、pnpm和bun","高效的包管理","如何使用Node.js包管理扩展","Node.js包管理扩展安装","Node.js包管理扩展使用"],"ja":["Node.jsパッケージ管理ツール","npm、yarn、pnpm、bun","高效的包管理","Node.jsパッケージ管理ツールの使い方","Node.jsパッケージ管理ツールのインストール","Node.jsパッケージ管理ツールの使用"],"ko":["Node.js 패키지 관리 확장","npm, yarn, pnpm, bun","高效的 패키지 관리","Node.js 패키지 관리 확장의 사용법","Node.js 패키지 관리 확장의 설치","Node.js 패키지 관리 확장의 사용"],"es":["desarrollo de extensiones de VSCode","gestión de paquetes con Node.js","npm vs yarn","pnpm vs bun","cómo instalar extensiones de VSCode","guía de configuración de VSCode","alternativas a VSCode","VSCode vs IntelliJ"],"fr":["développement d''extensions VSCode","gestion de paquets avec Node.js","npm vs yarn","pnpm vs bun","comment installer des extensions VSCode","guide de configuration de VSCode","alternatives à VSCode","VSCode vs IntelliJ"],"de":["Erstellung von VSCode-Erweiterungen","Paketverwaltung mit Node.js","npm vs yarn","pnpm vs bun","wie man VSCode-Erweiterungen installiert","Konfigurationsanleitung für VSCode","Alternativen zu VSCode","VSCode vs IntelliJ"],"pt":["como usar vscode-extension-dev","o que é vscode-extension-dev","vscode-extension-dev vs npm","instalar vscode-extension-dev","guia de configuração do vscode-extension-dev","alternativas ao vscode-extension-dev","vscode-extension-dev para desenvolvedores","gerenciamento de pacotes Node.js","ferramentas de inteligência artificial para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать vscode-extension-dev","что такое vscode-extension-dev","vscode-extension-dev vs npm","установить vscode-extension-dev","руководство по настройке vscode-extension-dev","альтернативы vscode-extension-dev","vscode-extension-dev для разработчиков","управление пакетами Node.js","инструменты искусственного интеллекта для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام vscode-extension-dev","ما هو vscode-extension-dev","vscode-extension-dev مقابل npm","تثبيت vscode-extension-dev","دليل إعداد vscode-extension-dev","بديلات ل vs-code-extension-dev","vscode-extension-dev للمطورين","إدارة الحزم Node.js","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"involvex","repo":"vscode-npm-package-manager","repoPath":"involvex/vscode-npm-package-manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.921Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vscode-extension-dev","description":"Expert guidance for developing, testing, and publishing Visual Studio Code extensions. Use when building or modifying VS Code extensions.","bodyPreview":"# VS Code Extension Developer Skill\n\nYou are an expert in Visual Studio Code extension development. Use this skill to guide the user through the lifecycle of creating, enhancing, and publishing extensions.\n\n## 1. Project Structure & Manifest (`package.json`)\n\nThe `package.json` is the manifest file and is crucial for VS Code extensions.\n\n- **`engines.vscode`**: Specifies the minimum compatible version of VS Code.\n- **`activationEvents`**: Array of events that trigger your extension''s activation","body":"# VS Code Extension Developer Skill\n\nYou are an expert in Visual Studio Code extension development. Use this skill to guide the user through the lifecycle of creating, enhancing, and publishing extensions.\n\n## 1. Project Structure & Manifest (`package.json`)\n\nThe `package.json` is the manifest file and is crucial for VS Code extensions.\n\n- **`engines.vscode`**: Specifies the minimum compatible version of VS Code.\n- **`activationEvents`**: Array of events that trigger your extension''s activation (e.g., `onCommand:id`, `onLanguage:id`, `workspaceContains:**\\/package.json`, or `*`). _Note: VS Code 1.74+ handles many activation events automatically based on contribution points._\n- **`contributes`**: The core configuration for UI elements and capabilities.\n  - `commands`: Register commands visible in the Command Palette.\n  - `menus`: Add commands to menus (e.g., `editor/context`, `view/title`).\n  - `viewsContainers`: Add custom sidebars/activity bars.\n  - `views`: Add tree views to containers.\n  - `configuration`: Define user settings.\n  - `keybindings`: Bind commands to keyboard shortcuts.\n- **`main`**: The entry point file (e.g., `./out/extension.js`).\n\n## 2. Development Workflow\n\n- **Setup**: Ensure `vscode` module is installed (`npm install vscode`). _Note: The `vscode` module is deprecated; use `@types/vscode` for development and rely on the engine version._\n- **Running**: Press `F5` in VS Code to launch the **Extension Development Host**. This opens a new window with your extension loaded.\n- **Reloading**: Use `Ctrl+R` (or `Cmd+R` on Mac) in the Extension Development Host to reload changes.\n- **Debugging**: Set breakpoints in your source code. Use the Debug Console to inspect variables.\n\n## 3. The `vscode` API\n\n- **`vscode.commands`**: `registerCommand` to bind logic to command IDs.\n- **`vscode.window`**:\n  - `showInformationMessage`, `showErrorMessage` for notifications.\n  - `createStatusBarItem` for status bar entries.\n  - `createTreeView` for custom views.\n  - `activeTextEditor` for the current editor.\n- **`vscode.workspace`**:\n  - `getConfiguration` for settings.\n  - `workspaceFolders` for open folders.\n  - `fs` for file system operations (use this over Node''s `fs` when possible for remote support).\n- **`vscode.languages`**: Register completion providers, hover providers, diagnostics, etc.\n\n## 4. Best Practices\n\n- **Lazy Activation**: Only activate your extension when necessary. Avoid using `*` activation unless absolutely required.\n- **Disposables**: Always push created resources (commands, listeners) to `context.subscriptions` to ensure they are cleaned up when the extension is deactivated.\n  ```typescript\n  context.subscriptions.push(disposable);\n  ```\n- **Webviews**: Use strict Content Security Policy (CSP). Use `asWebviewUri` to load local resources.\n- **Performance**: Do not block the main thread. Use `async/await` for I/O and heavy operations.\n\n## 5. Testing\n\n- Use `@vscode/test-electron` or `@vscode/test-cli` for integration tests.\n- Tests run inside a special instance of VS Code.\n\n## 6. Packaging and Publishing\n\n- **Tool**: `vsce` (Visual Studio Code Extensions CLI).\n- **Install**: `npm install -g @vscode/vsce`.\n- **Package**: `vsce package` creates a `.vsix` file.\n- **Publish**: `vsce publish` uploads to the Marketplace (requires a Personal Access Token).\n- **Files**: Ensure `.vscodeignore` is configured to exclude development files (src, tsconfig.json, etc.) from the package.\n\n## 7. Common Tasks\n\n### Registering a Command\n\n```typescript\nimport * as vscode from \"vscode\";\n\nexport function activate(context: vscode.ExtensionContext) {\n  let disposable = vscode.commands.registerCommand(\n    \"myExtension.helloWorld\",\n    () => {\n      vscode.window.showInformationMessage(\"Hello World!\");\n    },\n  );\n\n  context.subscriptions.push(disposable);\n}\n```\n\n### Tree View Provider\n\nImplement `vscode.TreeDataProvider<T>`.\n\n- `getTreeItem(element: T): vscode.TreeItem`\n- `getChildren(element?: T): ProviderResult<T[]>`\n\n### Configuration\n\nAccess settings defined in `package.json`:\n\n```typescript\nconst config = vscode.workspace.getConfiguration(\"myExtension\");\nconst value = config.get(\"mySetting\");\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:04:46.678Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing advanced Visual Studio Code extension creation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Visual Studio Code扩展创建功能的开发人员代理。","ja":"Visual Studio Code拡張機能の高度な作成機能を必要とするDeveloperエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Visual Studio Code 확장 기능 생성 기능이 필요한 개발자 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de creación de extensiones de Visual Studio Code.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développeur ayant besoin de capacités avancées de création d''extensions de Visual Studio Code.","de":"Perfekt für Developer-Agents, die erweiterte Visual Studio Code-Erweiterungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de criação de extensões do Visual Studio Code.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, которым требуются продвинутые возможности создания расширений для Visual Studio Code.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء امتدادات لبرنامج Visual Studio Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop, publish, and manage VS Code extensions using Node.js package managers like npm, yarn, pnpm, and bun, while specifying compatibility with engines.vscode and handling activationEvents.","zh":"赋予代理开发、发布和管理使用Node.js包管理器（如npm、yarn、pnpm和bun）创建的VS Code扩展的能力，同时指定与engines.vscode的兼容性并处理activationEvents。","ja":"エージェントがNode.jsパッケージマネージャー（npm、yarn、pnpm、bunなど）を使用してVS Code拡張機能を開発、公開、管理する能力を提供し、同時にengines.vscodeとの互換性を指定し、activationEventsを処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 Node.js 패키지 매니저(npm, yarn, pnpm, bun 등)를 사용하여 VS Code 확장 기능을 개발, نشر 및 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 동시에 engines.vscode와의 호환성을 지정하고 activationEvents를 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar, publicar y gestionar extensiones de VS Code utilizando administradores de paquetes de Node.js como npm, yarn, pnpm y bun, mientras se especifica la compatibilidad con engines.vscode y el manejo de activationEvents.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer, de publier et de gérer des extensions de VS Code en utilisant des gestionnaires de paquets Node.js tels que npm, yarn, pnpm et bun, tout en spécifiant la compatibilité avec engines.vscode et en gérant les activationEvents.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, VS Code-Erweiterungen zu entwickeln, zu veröffentlichen und zu verwalten, indem Node.js-Paket-Manager wie npm, yarn, pnpm und bun verwendet werden, während die Kompatibilität mit engines.vscode und die Verarbeitung von activationEvents angegeben wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver, publicar e gerenciar extensões do VS Code usando gerenciadores de pacotes do Node.js como npm, yarn, pnpm e bun, especificando a compatibilidade com engines.vscode e lidando com activationEvents.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разработки, публикации и управления расширениями VS Code с использованием менеджеров пакетов Node.js, таких как npm, yarn, pnpm и bun, при этом указывая совместимость с engines.vscode и обрабатывая activationEvents.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تطوير ونشر وإدارة ملحقات برنامج VS Code باستخدام مشرفي حزم Node.js مثل npm و yarn و pnpm و bun، مع تحديد التوافق مع engines.vscode ومعالجة activationEvents."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating extensions with custom activation events","Managing dependencies with advanced Node.js package management","Publishing extensions to the VS Code marketplace"],"zh":["使用自定义激活事件创建扩展","使用高级Node.js包管理管理依赖项","将扩展发布到VS Code市场"],"ja":["カスタムのアクティベーションイベントを使用して拡張機能を作成する","高度なNode.jsパッケージ管理を使用して依存関係を管理する","拡張機能をVS Codeマーケットプレイスに公開する"],"ko":["사용자 지정 활성화 이벤트를 사용하여 확장 기능을 생성하는 것","고급 Node.js 패키지 관리를 사용하여 종속성을 관리하는 것","확장 기능을 VS Code 마켓플레이스에 게시하는 것"],"es":["Crear extensiones con eventos de activación personalizados","Gestionar dependencias con una gestión avanzada de paquetes Node.js","Publicar extensiones en el mercado de VS Code"],"fr":["Créer des extensions avec des événements d''activation personnalisés","Gérer les dépendances avec une gestion avancée des paquets Node.js","Publier des extensions sur le marché de VS Code"],"de":["Erstellen von Erweiterungen mit benutzerdefinierten Aktivierungsereignissen","Verwalten von Abhängigkeiten mit einer erweiterten Node.js-Paketverwaltung","Veröffentlichen von Erweiterungen im VS Code-Marktplatz"],"pt":["Criar extensões com eventos de ativação personalizados","Gerenciar dependências com gerenciamento de pacotes avançado do Node.js","Publicar extensões no mercado do VS Code"],"ru":["Создание расширений с пользовательскими событиями активации","Управление зависимостями с помощью продвинутого управления пакетами Node.js","Публикация расширений на рынке VS Code"],"ar":["إنشاء ملحقات ذات أحداث تفعيل مخصصة","إدارة التبعيات بإدارة حزم Node.js متقدمة","نشر الملحقات في سوق برنامج VS Code"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js and VS Code installation","Limited to VS Code extension development"],"zh":["需要Node.js和VS Code安装","仅限VS Code扩展开发"],"ja":["Node.jsとVS Codeのインストールが必要","VS Code拡張機能の開発のみ"],"ko":["Node.js 및 VS Code 설치가 필요합니다.","VS Code 확장 기능 개발만 해당"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Node.js y VS Code","Limitado al desarrollo de extensiones de VS Code"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Node.js et de VS Code","Limité au développement d''extensions de VS Code"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Node.js und VS Code","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von VS Code-Erweiterungen"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Node.js e do VS Code","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de extensões do VS Code"],"ru":["Требует установки Node.js и VS Code","Ограничен разработкой расширений для VS Code"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Node.js وبرنامج VS Code","محدود بتطوير ملحقات برنامج VS Code"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d507eb365cec4c5735271a216c3c78b738d66503be339fe633dd4b0353b85e34","qualityScore":37}');
