Segurança e conformidade de dados"],"ru":["Интеграция с платформой AWS","Разработка решений на основе искусственного интеллекта","Автоматизация задач и процессов","Анализ данных и принятие решений","Безопасность и соответствие данных"],"ar":["التكامل مع منصة AWS","تطوير حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي","التوفير التلقائي للمهام و العمليات","تحليل البيانات و اتخاذ القرارات","أمن و مطابقة البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AWS AI智能代理","iam功能","AI开发工具","如何使用iam","iam安装指南","AWS AI智能代理iam vs 其他AI工具"],"ja":["AWS AIエージェント","iamの機能","AI開発ツール","iamの使い方","iamのインストールガイド","AWS AIエージェントiam vs その他のAIツール"],"ko":["AWS AI 에이전트","iam의 기능","AI 개발 도구","iam의 사용 방법","iam의 설치 가이드","AWS AI 에이전트 iam vs 기타 AI 도구"],"es":["herramientas de AI para agentes","cómo utilizar herramientas de AI","qué es un agente de AI","alternativas a herramientas de AI","herramientas de AI vs herramientas de automatización","instalación de herramientas de AI","guía de configuración de herramientas de AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour agents","comment utiliser les outils d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''IA","alternatives aux outils d''IA","outils d''IA vs outils d''automatisation","installation des outils d''IA","guide de configuration des outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools für Agenten","wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu KI-Tools","KI-Tools vs Automatisierungstools","Installation von KI-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar AI Agents","o que é AI Agents","AWS Skills para desenvolvedores","alternativas para AI Agents","AI Agents vs outros produtos","instalar AI Agents","guia de configuração do AI Agents"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое ИИ Агенты","Навыки AWS для разработчиков","альтернативы для ИИ Агентов","ИИ Агенты vs другие продукты","установить ИИ Агенты","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","مهارات AWS للمطورين","بديل لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مقابل منتجات أخرى","تثبيت وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"itsmostafa","repo":"aws-agent-skills","repoPath":"itsmostafa/aws-agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.948Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"iam","description":"AWS Identity and Access Management for users, roles, policies, and permissions. Use when creating IAM policies, configuring cross-account access, setting up service roles, troubleshooting permission errors, or managing access control.","bodyPreview":"# AWS IAM\n\nAWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) enables secure access control to AWS services and resources. IAM is foundational to AWS security—every AWS API call is authenticated and authorized through IAM.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Core Concepts](#core-concepts)\n- [Common Patterns](#common-patterns)\n- [CLI Reference](#cli-reference)\n- [Best Practices](#best-practices)\n- [Troubleshooting](#troubleshooting)\n- [References](#references)\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Principals\n\nEntities that can mak","body":"# AWS IAM\n\nAWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) enables secure access control to AWS services and resources. IAM is foundational to AWS security—every AWS API call is authenticated and authorized through IAM.\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Core Concepts](#core-concepts)\n- [Common Patterns](#common-patterns)\n- [CLI Reference](#cli-reference)\n- [Best Practices](#best-practices)\n- [Troubleshooting](#troubleshooting)\n- [References](#references)\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Principals\n\nEntities that can make requests to AWS: IAM users, roles, federated users, and applications.\n\n### Policies\n\nJSON documents defining permissions. Types:\n- **Identity-based**: Attached to users, groups, or roles\n- **Resource-based**: Attached to resources (S3 buckets, SQS queues)\n- **Permission boundaries**: Maximum permissions an identity can have\n- **Service control policies (SCPs)**: Organization-wide limits\n\n### Roles\n\nIdentities with permissions that can be assumed by trusted entities. No permanent credentials—uses temporary security tokens.\n\n### Trust Relationships\n\nDefine which principals can assume a role. Configured via the role''s trust policy.\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Create a Service Role for Lambda\n\n**AWS CLI:**\n\n```bash\n# Create the trust policy\ncat > trust-policy.json << ''EOF''\n{\n  \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n  \"Statement\": [\n    {\n      \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n      \"Principal\": { \"Service\": \"lambda.amazonaws.com\" },\n      \"Action\": \"sts:AssumeRole\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nEOF\n\n# Create the role\naws iam create-role \\\n  --role-name MyLambdaRole \\\n  --assume-role-policy-document file://trust-policy.json\n\n# Attach a managed policy\naws iam attach-role-policy \\\n  --role-name MyLambdaRole \\\n  --policy-arn arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/service-role/AWSLambdaBasicExecutionRole\n```\n\n**boto3:**\n\n```python\nimport boto3\nimport json\n\niam = boto3.client(''iam'')\n\ntrust_policy = {\n    \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n    \"Statement\": [\n        {\n            \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n            \"Principal\": {\"Service\": \"lambda.amazonaws.com\"},\n            \"Action\": \"sts:AssumeRole\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n\n# Create role\niam.create_role(\n    RoleName=''MyLambdaRole'',\n    AssumeRolePolicyDocument=json.dumps(trust_policy)\n)\n\n# Attach managed policy\niam.attach_role_policy(\n    RoleName=''MyLambdaRole'',\n    PolicyArn=''arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/service-role/AWSLambdaBasicExecutionRole''\n)\n```\n\n### Create Custom Policy with Least Privilege\n\n```bash\ncat > policy.json << ''EOF''\n{\n  \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n  \"Statement\": [\n    {\n      \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n      \"Action\": [\n        \"dynamodb:GetItem\",\n        \"dynamodb:PutItem\",\n        \"dynamodb:Query\"\n      ],\n      \"Resource\": \"arn:aws:dynamodb:us-east-1:123456789012:table/MyTable\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nEOF\n\naws iam create-policy \\\n  --policy-name MyDynamoDBPolicy \\\n  --policy-document file://policy.json\n```\n\n### Cross-Account Role Assumption\n\n```bash\n# In Account B (trusted account), create role with trust for Account A\ncat > cross-account-trust.json << ''EOF''\n{\n  \"Version\": \"2012-10-17\",\n  \"Statement\": [\n    {\n      \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n      \"Principal\": { \"AWS\": \"arn:aws:iam::111111111111:root\" },\n      \"Action\": \"sts:AssumeRole\",\n      \"Condition\": {\n        \"StringEquals\": { \"sts:ExternalId\": \"unique-external-id\" }\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\nEOF\n\n# From Account A, assume the role\naws sts assume-role \\\n  --role-arn arn:aws:iam::222222222222:role/CrossAccountRole \\\n  --role-session-name MySession \\\n  --external-id unique-external-id\n```\n\n## CLI Reference\n\n### Essential Commands\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `aws iam create-role` | Create a new IAM role |\n| `aws iam create-policy` | Create a customer managed policy |\n| `aws iam attach-role-policy` | Attach a managed policy to a role |\n| `aws iam put-role-policy` | Add an inline policy to a role |\n| `aws iam get-role` | Get role details |\n| `aws iam list-roles` | List all roles |\n| `aws iam simulate-principal-policy` | Test policy permissions |\n| `aws sts assume-role` | Assume a role and get temporary credentials |\n| `aws sts get-caller-identity` | Get current identity |\n\n### Useful Flags\n\n- `--query`: Filter output with JMESPath\n- `--output table`: Human-readable output\n- `--no-cli-pager`: Disable pager for scripting\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Security\n\n- **Never use root account** for daily tasks\n- **Enable MFA** for all human users\n- **Use roles** instead of long-term access keys\n- **Apply least privilege** — grant only required permissions\n- **Use conditions** to restrict access by IP, time, or MFA\n- **Rotate credentials** regularly\n- **Use permission boundaries** for delegated administration\n\n### Policy Design\n\n- Start with AWS managed policies, customize as needed\n- Use policy variables (`${aws:username}`) for dynamic policies\n- Prefer explicit denies for sensitive actions\n- Group related permissions logically\n\n### Monitoring\n\n- Enable **CloudTrail** for API auditing\n- Use **IAM Access Analyzer** to identify overly permissive policies\n- Review **credential reports** regularly\n- Set up alerts for root account usage\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Access Denied Errors\n\n**Symptom:** `AccessDeniedException` or `UnauthorizedAccess`\n\n**Debug steps:**\n1. Verify identity: `aws sts get-caller-identity`\n2. Check attached policies: `aws iam list-attached-role-policies --role-name MyRole`\n3. Simulate the action:\n   ```bash\n   aws iam simulate-principal-policy \\\n     --policy-source-arn arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/MyRole \\\n     --action-names dynamodb:GetItem \\\n     --resource-arns arn:aws:dynamodb:us-east-1:123456789012:table/MyTable\n   ```\n4. Check for explicit denies in SCPs or permission boundaries\n5. Verify resource-based policies allow the principal\n\n### Role Cannot Be Assumed\n\n**Symptom:** `AccessDenied` when calling `AssumeRole`\n\n**Causes:**\n- Trust policy doesn''t include the calling principal\n- Missing `sts:AssumeRole` permission on the caller\n- ExternalId mismatch (for cross-account roles)\n- Session duration exceeds maximum\n\n**Fix:** Review and update the role''s trust relationship.\n\n### Policy Size Limits\n\n- Managed policy: 6,144 characters\n- Inline policy: 2,048 characters (user), 10,240 characters (role/group)\n- Trust policy: 2,048 characters\n\n**Solution:** Use multiple policies, reference resources by prefix/wildcard, or use tags-based access control.\n\n## References\n\n- [IAM User Guide](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/)\n- [IAM API Reference](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/APIReference/)\n- [IAM CLI Reference](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/cli/latest/reference/iam/)\n- [Policy Reference](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/reference_policies.html)\n- [boto3 IAM](https://boto3.amazonaws.com/v1/documentation/api/latest/reference/services/iam.html)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:11:22.480Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Security Agents needing fine-grained access control to AWS services and resources.","zh":"非常适合需要对 AWS 服务和资源进行细粒度访问控制的云安全代理。","ja":"AWS サービスおよびリソースへの細粒度のアクセス制御が必要なクラウド セキュリティ エージェントに最適です。","ko":"AWS 서비스 및 리소스에 대한 세분화된 액세스 제어가 필요한 클라우드 보안 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Seguridad en la Nube que necesitan un control de acceso detallado a servicios y recursos de AWS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de sécurité cloud nécessitant un contrôle d''accès détaillé aux services et ressources AWS.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Sicherheitsagenten, die eine feingranulare Zugriffskontrolle auf AWS-Dienste und -Ressourcen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Segurança em Nuvem que necessitam de controle de acesso granular aos serviços e recursos da AWS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов безопасности в облаке, которым требуется тонкий контроль доступа к сервисам и ресурсам AWS.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل أمن السحابة التي تحتاج إلى تحكم دقيق في الوصول إلى خدمات و موارد AWS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) for secure authentication and authorization, leveraging AWS APIs and CLI references for comprehensive access control, including principals, policies, and roles.","zh":"赋予代理管理 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 的能力，用于安全的身份验证和授权，利用 AWS APIs 和 CLI 参考进行全面访问控制，包括主体、策略和角色。","ja":"エージェントに AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) を管理する能力を与え、AWS APIs と CLI リファレンスを使用して、主体、ポリシー、ロールを含む包括的なアクセス制御によるセキュアな認証と認可を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM)을 관리할 수 있도록 해주어, AWS APIs 및 CLI 참조를 사용하여 주체, 정책, 역할 등을 포함한 포괄적인 액세스 제어를 통한 안전한 인증 및 인가를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) para una autenticación y autorización seguras, aprovechando AWS APIs y referencias de CLI para un control de acceso integral, incluyendo principios, políticas y roles.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) pour une authentification et une autorisation sécurisées, en exploitant les AWS APIs et les références CLI pour un contrôle d''accès complet, incluant les principaux, les politiques et les rôles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) für sichere Authentifizierung und Autorisierung zu verwalten, indem es AWS APIs und CLI-Referenzen für umfassende Zugriffskontrolle nutzt, einschließlich Prinzipien, Richtlinien und Rollen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar a Gerenciamento de Identidade e Acesso (IAM) da AWS para autenticação e autorização seguras, aproveitando as APIs e referências da CLI da AWS para controle de acesso abrangente, incluindo principais, políticas e funções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять сервисом Управление идентификацией и доступом (IAM) AWS для безопасной аутентификации и авторизации, используя API и ссылки на CLI AWS для комплексного контроля доступа, включая принципалы, политики и роли.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إدارة خدمة إدارة الهوية والوصول (IAM) من AWS من أجل التحقق والتفويض الآمنين، مستفيداً من واجهات برمجة التطبيقات (APIs) ومراجع واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) من AWS للتحكم الكامل في الوصول، بما في ذلك الأطراف، والسياسات، والأدوار."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating IAM role creation for AWS services","Generating policies for secure access control","Troubleshooting IAM authentication issues"],"zh":["为 AWS 服务自动创建 IAM 角色","为安全访问控制生成策略","故障排除 IAM 身份验证问题"],"ja":["AWS サービスの IAM ロールの自動作成","セキュアなアクセス制御のためのポリシーの生成","IAM 認証の問題のトラブルシューティング"],"ko":["AWS 서비스용 IAM 역할 자동 생성","안전한 액세스 제어를 위한 정책 생성","IAM 인증 문제 해결"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de roles de IAM para servicios de AWS","Generación de políticas para un control de acceso seguro","Solución de problemas de autenticación de IAM"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de rôles IAM pour les services AWS","Génération de politiques pour un contrôle d''accès sécurisé","Dépannage des problèmes d''authentification IAM"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von IAM-Rollen für AWS-Dienste","Erzeugung von Richtlinien für sicheren Zugriff","Behebung von IAM-Authentifizierungsproblemen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de funções do IAM para serviços da AWS","Gerar políticas para controle de acesso seguro","Solucionar problemas de autenticação do IAM"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание ролей IAM для сервисов AWS","Генерировать политики для безопасного контроля доступа","Устранять неполадки аутентификации IAM"],"ar":["توفير автомة لإنشاء أدوار IAM لموارد AWS","توليد سياسات للتحكم الآمن في الوصول","معالجة مشاكل التحقق من IAM"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires AWS account and credentials","AWS IAM specific"],"zh":["需要 AWS 账户和凭证","特定于 AWS IAM"],"ja":["AWS アカウントと資格情報が必要","AWS IAM 専用"],"ko":["AWS 계정 및 자격 증명 필요","AWS IAM 전용"],"es":["Requiere cuenta y credenciales de AWS","Específico de AWS IAM"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte et des informations d''identification AWS","Spécifique à AWS IAM"],"de":["Benötigt AWS-Konto und -Anmeldeinformationen","AWS IAM-spezifisch"],"pt":["Exige conta e credenciais da AWS","Específico do IAM da AWS"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи и учетных данных AWS","Специфичен для IAM AWS"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب و بيانات اعتماد AWS","محدد لخدمة IAM من AWS"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f30817982d3454139e3eecbf930f347ffd1b79c4e8a6cef851f75c5e8e02a1d7","qualityScore":37}');
