,"en":"backend-design"},"description":{"zh":"后端设计是AIエージェント开发的关键部分，Product Agentic提供了高效的后端解决方案","ja":"バックエンド設計はAIエージェント開発の重要な部分であり、Product Agenticは効率的なバックエンドソリューションを提供","ko":"백엔드 설계는 AI 에이전트 개발의 핵심 부분이며 Product Agentic은 효율적인 백엔드 솔루션을 제공","es":"El diseño de backend con agentes de IA es una forma innovadora de mejorar la eficiencia y la escalabilidad de tus proyectos de desarrollo.","fr":"La conception de backend avec des agents IA est une façon innovante d''améliorer l''efficacité et la scalabilité de vos projets de développement.","de":"Das Backend-Design mit KI-Agents ist eine innovative Methode, um die Effizienz und Skalierbarkeit Ihrer Entwicklungsvorhaben zu verbessern.","pt":"A habilidade de design de backend permite criar soluções de backend escaláveis e eficientes com Product Agentic e Ferramentas de IA","ru":"Навык проектирования бэкенда позволяет создавать масштабируемые и эффективные решения бэкенда с Product Agentic и ИИ Агентами","ar":"المهارة تصميم الخلفية تسمح بإنشاء حلول خلفية قابلة للتوسيع والفعالة مع Product Agentic وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"Product Agentic."},"definition":{"en":"Product Agentic."},"features":{"zh":["高效的后端开发","灵活的架构设计","易于维护和扩展","支持多种编程语言"],"ja":["効率的なバックエンド開発","柔軟なアーキテクチャ設計","容易なメンテナンスと拡張","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート"],"ko":["효율적인 백엔드 개발","유연한 아키텍처 설계","쉽게 유지 보수와 확장","다수의 프로그래밍 언어 지원"],"es":["Mejora de la eficiencia en el diseño de backend","Integración de herramientas de IA para la toma de decisiones","Escalabilidad y flexibilidad en la arquitectura de backend","Automatización de tareas con agentes de IA","Análisis de datos y monitoreo en tiempo real"],"fr":["Amélioration de l''efficacité dans la conception de backend","Intégration d''outils d''IA pour la prise de décision","Scalabilité et flexibilité dans l''architecture de backend","Automatisation de tâches avec des agents IA","Analyse de données et surveillance en temps réel"],"de":["Verbesserung der Effizienz im Backend-Design","Integration von KI-Tools für die Entscheidungsfindung","Skalierbarkeit und Flexibilität in der Backend-Architektur","Automatisierung von Aufgaben mit KI-Agents","Datenanalyse und Überwachung in Echtzeit"],"pt":["Criação de soluções de backend escaláveis","Integração com Ferramentas de IA","Desenvolvimento de APIs eficientes","Implementação de segurança de backend","Otimização de desempenho de backend"],"ru":["Создание масштабируемых решений бэкенда","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Разработка эффективных API","Реализация безопасности бэкенда","Оптимизация производительности бэкенда"],"ar":["إنشاء حلول خلفية قابلة للتوسيع","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير واجهات برمجة تطبيقات فعالة","تنفيذ أمان الخلفية","تحسين أداء الخلفية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AIエージェント后端设计","Product Agentic","后端开发","AI系统设计","如何使用AIエージェント","AIエージェント与React"],"ja":["AIエージェントのバックエンド設計","Product Agentic","バックエンド開発","AIシステム設計","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントとReact"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 백엔드 설계","Product Agentic","백엔드 개발","AI 시스템 설계","AI 에이전트 사용법","AI 에이전트와 React"],"es":["herramientas de diseño de backend","agentes de IA para desarrollo","integración de IA en proyectos de desarrollo","diseño de backend con Product Agentic","mejora de la eficiencia en el diseño de backend","alternativas a herramientas de diseño de backend","guía de instalación de herramientas de IA"],"fr":["outils de conception de backend","agents IA pour le développement","intégration de l''IA dans les projets de développement","conception de backend avec Product Agentic","amélioration de l''efficacité dans la conception de backend","alternatives aux outils de conception de backend","guide d''installation des outils d''IA"],"de":["Backend-Design-Tools","KI-Agents für die Entwicklung","Integration von KI in Entwicklungsvorhaben","Backend-Design mit Product Agentic","Verbesserung der Effizienz im Backend-Design","Alternativen zu Backend-Design-Tools","Installationsanleitung für KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar Ferramentas de IA","o que é design de backend","Ferramentas de IA alternative","Ferramentas de IA vs outros","instalar Ferramentas de IA","guia de configuração de Ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de backend com Python","desenvolvimento de backend com Node.js"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое проектирование бэкенда","ИИ Агенты alternative","ИИ Агенты vs другие","установка ИИ Агентов","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов","разработка бэкенда с Python","разработка бэкенда с Node.js"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو تصميم الخلفية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي بديلة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي مقابل الأخرى","تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير الخلفية مع Python","تطوير الخلفية مع Node.js"]}},"owner":"ivanyeors","repo":"product-agentic-templates","repoPath":"ivanyeors/product-agentic-templates","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:04:44Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"backend-design","description":"Guides backend design work including API contract specification, database schema design, auth model, and integration point design. Use when designing the API, creating OpenAPI specs, designing database schemas, defining auth and permissions, or when the user says design the API, API contract, schema design, database design, backend design, OpenAPI spec. Requires completed Product Discovery and Product Design artifacts as input.","bodyPreview":"# 04 — Backend Design\n\nTranslates discovery and product design artifacts into implementation-ready backend specifications. Produces API contracts (OpenAPI), schema design, auth model, and integration point specs for human review before Backend Implementation begins.\n\n---\n\n## Job Persona\n\n**Role:** Backend Architect / API Designer\n\n**Core mandate:** Convert PRD requirements and data dictionary into complete, validated API and schema specifications that backend engineers can implement without ambi","body":"# 04 — Backend Design\n\nTranslates discovery and product design artifacts into implementation-ready backend specifications. Produces API contracts (OpenAPI), schema design, auth model, and integration point specs for human review before Backend Implementation begins.\n\n---\n\n## Job Persona\n\n**Role:** Backend Architect / API Designer\n\n**Core mandate:** Convert PRD requirements and data dictionary into complete, validated API and schema specifications that backend engineers can implement without ambiguity. Contract-first — always.\n\n**Non-negotiables:**\n- Every endpoint must be traceable to an FR-ID from the PRD\n- Schema design must align with the data dictionary — no ad-hoc columns\n- Every endpoint must specify success, error, and validation failure responses\n- List endpoints must define pagination from the start\n- Auth and permission model must be designed before implementation — not deferred\n\n**Bad habits to eliminate:**\n- Designing endpoints without error response formats\n- Skipping pagination for list endpoints (\"we''ll add it later\")\n- Leaving auth \"for later\" — it affects every endpoint\n- Adding schema columns without data dictionary alignment\n- Designing only the happy path — error and empty states are required\n\n---\n\n## Phase Flow\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    start([Triggered]) --> prereq{Product Design artifacts exist?}\n    prereq -->|No| block[Trigger 02-product-design first]\n    prereq -->|Yes| accept[Accept Handoff Verify No-Go + Read-Back]\n    accept --> hi_check[Check human-interventions/active/ for phase:04-backend-design items]\n    hi_check --> pri[Prioritization Impact/Effort 2x2 for endpoint sequencing]\n    pri --> s1[Phase 1 API Contract Design]\n    s1 --> s2[Phase 2 Request/Response Specification]\n    s2 --> s3[Phase 3 Schema Design]\n    s3 --> s4[Phase 4 Auth & Permission Model]\n    s4 --> s5[Phase 5 Integration Points Design]\n    s5 --> s6[Phase 6 API Documentation]\n    s6 --> gate{Gate 4 Human Approval}\n    gate -->|APPROVED| next[06 Backend Implementation]\n    gate -->|REVISE| revise[Revise flagged artifacts]\n    revise --> gate\n```\n\n---\n\n## Accept Handoff (before starting work)\n\n1. Read the handoff package from Phase 02 (Product Design)\n2. **Verify Release Mode and MVP Scope** — if `Release Mode: MVP`, scope = MVP-tagged FR-IDs only; otherwise full P0.\n3. Verify all No-Go items pass (interpret \"P0\" as MVP scope when in MVP mode):\n   - [ ] PRD exists with FR-IDs for all P0 (or MVP) requirements\n   - [ ] Data dictionary exists (or Phase 5b marked N/A in discovery)\n   - [ ] User flows exist for every P0 (or MVP) user story\n   - [ ] Wireframe specs exist for data-dependent screens\n   - If any fail → **HALT**. Notify orchestrator.\n4. Log Read-Back: restate the backend design intent — \"We are designing the API and schema for [product]. **Release Mode: [Full Production | MVP].** Core entities are [list from data dictionary]. The primary flows requiring backend support are [list]. The constraints we must preserve are: [list from handoff Decisions and Intent table].\"\n5. Raise RFIs: list any unclear data dictionary entries, ambiguous business rules, or missing integration requirements. Resolve from artifacts or escalate to human.\n6. Review inherited Assumptions — flag any that affect API or schema design.\n7. Only after all above: begin Phase 04 work.\n\nSee [handoff-package-template.md](../00-product-workflow/handoff-package-template.md) for the full handoff structure.\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\nBefore starting, confirm these artifacts exist:\n- [ ] PRD with prioritized requirements (FR-IDs)\n- [ ] Data dictionary (entities, attributes, business rules, relationships)\n- [ ] User flow diagrams\n- [ ] Wireframe specifications\n- [ ] Content model (when content-heavy — feeds schema design)\n- [ ] Feedback Channels Plan (when feedback in scope — informs endpoint inventory, e.g. POST /feedback)\n\nIf any are missing, trigger `01-product-discovery` or `02-product-design` first.\n\nAsk the user:\n1. What API style? (REST, GraphQL, or both)\n2. What database? (Postgres, MySQL, MongoDB, etc.)\n3. Any existing API conventions or standards to follow?\n4. Any third-party integrations required? (auth provider, payments, webhooks)\n5. Any versioning strategy? (URL path, header, query param)\n\n---\n\n## Design Phases\n\n### Phase 1: API Contract Design\n- Inventory all endpoints required by user flows and wireframes\n- Map each endpoint to FR-IDs from the PRD\n- Define resource naming (plural nouns, kebab-case)\n- Assign HTTP methods (GET, POST, PATCH, PUT, DELETE)\n- Output: **Endpoint Inventory** (see [artifacts-template.md](artifacts-template.md))\n\n### Phase 2: Request/Response Specification\n- Define request body schemas for each mutation endpoint\n- Define response schemas for each endpoint (success, error, validation)\n- Specify status codes (200, 201, 400, 401, 403, 404, 422, 500)\n- Define standard error format (see [api-design-guide.md](api-design-guide.md))\n- Output: **OpenAPI Schemas** (request/response shapes, error format)\n\n### Phase 3: Schema Design\n- Map data dictionary entities to tables\n- Define columns, types, constraints, defaults\n- Define relationships (foreign keys, junction tables)\n- Design indexes for query patterns (see [schema-design-guide.md](schema-design-guide.md))\n- Output: **Schema Design Document** (tables, columns, indexes, migration plan)\n\n### Phase 4: Auth & Permission Model\n- Define auth strategy (JWT, session, OAuth, API key)\n- Define roles and permissions matrix\n- Map permissions to endpoints (who can access what)\n- Design RLS policies (if Postgres) or equivalent\n- Output: **Auth & Permission Model** (roles, permissions, endpoint mapping)\n\n### Phase 5: Integration Points Design\n- Define webhook payloads (if applicable)\n- Define third-party API contracts (auth provider, payments)\n- Specify event payloads for async flows\n- Output: **Integration Points Specification**\n\n### Phase 6: API Documentation\n- Produce complete OpenAPI 3.x spec\n- Add request/response examples for each endpoint\n- Document migration plan (order of migrations, rollback strategy)\n- Output: **Complete OpenAPI Spec + Migration Plan**\n\n---\n\n## Prioritization\n\nBefore beginning endpoint design, apply the Impact/Effort 2×2 matrix to sequence work. See [pm-prioritization.md](../00-product-workflow/pm-prioritization.md) → Impact/Effort Matrix.\n\n1. List all endpoints identified from user flows and data requirements\n2. Score each: Business Impact (1–5) × Design Effort (1–5)\n3. Map to quadrant\n4. **Sequence:** Quick Wins first → Major Projects → Fill-Ins → defer Thankless Tasks\n5. Design in this priority order — P0 endpoints first, then P1\n\n**Forcing function:** If scope exceeds the sprint, defer Thankless Tasks first. Present this trade-off to the human before proceeding.\n\n---\n\n## MVP Mode Behavior\n\nWhen `Release Mode: MVP` in the handoff package, adjust scope and detail:\n\n| Aspect | Full Production | MVP |\n|--------|-----------------|-----|\n| Endpoints | All P0 (+ P1) | MVP FR-IDs only |\n| Schema | Full schema | Core tables for MVP entities |\n| Auth | Full auth model | Basic auth (login, token) |\n| Pagination | All list endpoints | Defer for non-critical lists |\n| Integration points | Full spec | Core only (auth if required) |\n\n---\n\n## Active Intervention Check\n\nAt the start of every work session and before presenting the gate:\n1. Check `human-interventions/active/` for files tagged `phase: 04-backend-design` or `phase: all`\n2. If `urgency: immediate` — halt and process before continuing\n3. If `urgency: end-of-phase` — integrate before the gate presentation\n4. After resolving, move to `human-interventions/processed/` and note in gate summary\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    check[Check human-interventions/active/ for phase: 04-backend-design or phase: all] --> found{Files found?}\n    found -->|No| proceed([Continue phase work])\n    found -->|Yes| urgency{Urgency?}\n    urgency -->|immediate| halt[Halt current work Process intervention first]\n    urgency -->|end-of-phase| queue[Integrate before gate presentation]\n    halt --> archive[Move to processed/ Note in gate summary]\n    queue --> archive\n    archive --> proceed\n```\n\n---\n\n## Feedback & Update Loop\n\n### Receiving feedback\n- **From gate REVISE:** Update only flagged artifacts — do not redesign the entire phase\n- **From human intervention:** Complete Agent Interpretation and Impact Assessment, then integrate\n- **From 02-product-design:** If user flows change, re-audit affected endpoints and schema\n\n### Propagating updates downstream\n- If API contract changes post-approval: create `human-interventions/active/[date]-04-api-update/content.md` — notify `06-backend-implementation` and `07-integration`\n- If schema design changes: document what changed and why in the intervention file\n- Breaking API changes require a full impact assessment before proceeding\n\n### Revision limits\nMax 3 revision cycles at this gate. On the 3rd, escalate to orchestrator. See `00-product-workflow/SKILL.md`.\n\n---\n\n## Human Review Gate\n\nAfter completing all phases, present the design package:\n\n```\nBACKEND DESIGN COMPLETE — HUMAN REVIEW REQUIRED\n\nArtifacts produced:\n- [ ] Endpoint Inventory (all endpoints mapped to FR-IDs)\n- [ ] OpenAPI Spec (request/response schemas, error format)\n- [ ] Schema Design (tables, columns, indexes, migration plan)\n- [ ] Auth & Permission Model (roles, permissions, endpoint mapping)\n- [ ] Integration Points Specification (webhooks, third-party contracts)\n- [ ] Complete OpenAPI 3.x Spec + Examples\n\nPrioritization summary:\n- Quick Wins designed: [list]\n- Major Projects designed: [list]\n- Deferred (Thankless/out of scope): [list]\n\nReview checklist: see backend-design-checklist.md\n\nReply with:\n- APPROVED → begin 06 Backend Implementation\n- REVISE: [feedback] → agent will update and re-present\n```\n\n---\n\n## Design Principles\n\n- **Contract-first** — API spec is the source of truth before any code\n- **Traceability** — every endpoint maps to at least one FR-ID\n- **Schema alignment** — data dictionary drives schema; no orphan columns\n- **Error states required** — every endpoint has defined error responses\n- **Pagination by default** — list endpoints always define pagination\n\n---\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- [api-design-guide.md](api-design-guide.md) — REST conventions, versioning, pagination, error format\n- [schema-design-guide.md](schema-design-guide.md) — Naming, indexing, migration strategy\n- [artifacts-template.md](artifacts-template.md) — OpenAPI template, schema DDL template\n- [backend-design-checklist.md](backend-design-checklist.md) — human review gate checklist\n- [pm-prioritization.md](../00-product-workflow/pm-prioritization.md) — Impact/Effort 2×2 rubric\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T04:02:52.908Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Backend Architect Agents translating product requirements into implementation-ready API specifications.","zh":"非常适合后端架构代理将产品需求转化为可实施的API规范。","ja":"バックエンドアーキテクチャエージェントが製品要件を実装可能なAPI仕様に変換するのに最適です。","ko":"백엔드 아키텍처 에이전트가 제품 요구 사항을 구현 가능한 API 사양으로 변환하는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Arquitectura de Backend que traducen los requisitos del producto en especificaciones de API listas para implementar.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''architecture Backend qui traduisent les exigences de produit en spécifications d''API prêtes à l''implémentation.","de":"Perfekt für Backend-Architektur-Agenten, die Produktanforderungen in implementierbare API-Spezifikationen übersetzen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Arquiteto de Backend que traduzem requisitos de produtos em especificações de API prontas para implementação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-архитекторов бэкенда, переводящих требования к продукту в готовые к реализации спецификации API.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وكلاء الهندسة الخلفية الذين يترجمون متطلبات المنتج إلى مواصفات API جاهزة للتنفيذ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Converts PRD requirements and data dictionaries into complete OpenAPI contracts, schema designs, and integration point specs. Provides validated backend specifications that eliminate ambiguity for implementation teams.","zh":"将PRD要求和数据字典转换为完整的OpenAPI合同、模式设计和集成点规格。提供经过验证的后端规格，以消除实现团队的歧义。","ja":"PRD要件とデータディクショナリを完全なOpenAPI契約、スキーマ設計、統合ポイント仕様に変換します。実装チームの曖昧さを排除するために検証されたバックエンド仕様を提供します。","ko":"PRD 요구 사항과 데이터 사전에 대한 완전한 OpenAPI 계약, 스키마 디자인 및 통합 지점 사양을 생성합니다. 구현 팀의 모호성을 제거하기 위한 유효한 백엔드 사양을 제공합니다.","es":"Convierte los requisitos del PRD y los diccionarios de datos en contratos de OpenAPI completos, diseños de esquemas y especificaciones de puntos de integración. Proporciona especificaciones de backend validadas que eliminan la ambigüedad para los equipos de implementación.","fr":"Convertissez les exigences du PRD et les dictionnaires de données en contrats OpenAPI complets, conceptions de schémas et spécifications de points d''intégration. Fournit des spécifications de backend validées qui éliminent l''ambiguïté pour les équipes d''implémentation.","de":"Wandelt PRD-Anforderungen und Datendictionaries in vollständige OpenAPI-Verträge, Schemadesigns und Integrationspunktspezifikationen um. Bietet validierte Backendspezifikationen, die die Mehrdeutigkeit für Implementierungsteams beseitigen.","pt":"Converte requisitos do PRD e dicionários de dados em contratos OpenAPI completos, designs de esquema e especificações de pontos de integração. Fornece especificações de backend validadas que eliminam a ambiguidade para equipes de implementação.","ru":"Преобразует требования PRD и словари данных в полные контракты OpenAPI, проекты схемы и спецификации точек интеграции. Предоставляет проверенные спецификации бэкенда, которые устраняют двусмысленность для команд реализации.","ar":"يحول متطلبات PRD وقواميس البيانات إلى عقود OpenAPI كاملة وتصاميم مخططات ومواصفات نقاط التكامل. يوفر مواصفات خلفية محددة تمنع الغموض لفريق التنفيذ."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating OpenAPI contracts from product requirements","Designing database schema from data dictionaries","Creating authentication model specifications","Validating backend specifications before implementation"],"zh":["从产品需求生成OpenAPI合同","从数据字典设计数据库模式","创建身份验证模型规范","在实施之前验证后端规范"],"ja":["製品要件からOpenAPI契約を生成する","データディクショナリからデータベーススキーマを設計する","認証モデルの仕様を生成する","実装前にバックエンド仕様を検証する"],"ko":["제품 요구 사항에서 OpenAPI 계약 생성","데이터 사전에서 데이터베이스 스키마 설계","인증 모델 사양 생성","구현 전에 백엔드 사양 유효성 검사"],"es":["Generación de contratos de OpenAPI a partir de los requisitos del producto","Diseño de esquema de base de datos a partir de diccionarios de datos","Creación de especificaciones del modelo de autenticación","Validación de especificaciones de backend antes de la implementación"],"fr":["Génération de contrats OpenAPI à partir des exigences de produit","Conception de schéma de base de données à partir de dictionnaires de données","Création de spécifications du modèle d''authentification","Validation des spécifications de backend avant l''implémentation"],"de":["Erzeugung von OpenAPI-Verträgen aus Produktanforderungen","Entwurf von Datenbankschemata aus Datendictionaries","Erstellung von Authentifizierungsmodell-Spezifikationen","Validierung von Backendspezifikationen vor der Implementierung"],"pt":["Geração de contratos OpenAPI a partir de requisitos de produtos","Projeto de esquema de banco de dados a partir de dicionários de dados","Criação de especificações de modelo de autenticação","Validação de especificações de backend antes da implementação"],"ru":["Генерация контрактов OpenAPI из требований к продукту","Проектирование схемы базы данных из словарей данных","Создание спецификаций модели аутентификации","Валидация спецификаций бэкенда до реализации"],"ar":["توليد عقود OpenAPI من متطلبات المنتج","تصميم مخطط قاعدة البيانات من قواميس البيانات","إنشاء مواصفات نموذج المصادقة","التحقق من مواصفات الخلفية قبل التنفيذ"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product discovery artifacts as input","Outputs specifications for human review before implementation","Focuses on design phase before backend development"],"zh":["需要产品发现工件作为输入","输出规范需要人类审查后才能实施","专注于后端开发之前的设计阶段"],"ja":["製品発見アーティファクトを入力として必要とする","実装前に人間によるレビューが必要な仕様を出力する","バックエンド開発前の設計段階に焦点を当てている"],"ko":["제품 발견 아티팩트를 입력으로 필요로 함","구현 전에 인간의 검토가 필요한 사양을 출력함","백엔드 개발 이전의 설계 단계에 초점을 맞춤"],"es":["Requiere artefactos de descubrimiento de producto como entrada","Genera especificaciones para revisión humana antes de la implementación","Se centra en la fase de diseño antes del desarrollo de backend"],"fr":["Nécessite des artefacts de découverte de produit comme entrée","Génère des spécifications pour examen humain avant l''implémentation","Se concentre sur la phase de conception avant le développement de backend"],"de":["Benötigt Produktentdeckungsartefakte als Eingabe","Erzeugt Spezifikationen für menschliche Überprüfung vor der Implementierung","Konzentriert sich auf die Designphase vor der Backend-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Requer artefatos de descoberta de produtos como entrada","Produz especificações para revisão humana antes da implementação","Concentra-se na fase de design antes do desenvolvimento de backend"],"ru":["Требует артефактов открытия продукта в качестве входных данных","Выдает спецификации для проверки человеком до реализации","Сосредоточен на фазе проектирования до разработки бэкенда"],"ar":["يتطلب قطعاً اكتشاف المنتج كمدخلات","ينتج مواصفات للمراجعة البشرية قبل التنفيذ","يركز على مرحلة التصميم قبل تطوير الخلفية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d811bcd3a12a39e1542f84a383964858863d1fffd416218a5532dda70a14b953","qualityScore":37}');
