Collaboration avec la communauté de développeurs de blockchain"],"de":["Integration mit der Chia-Blockchain","Datenanalyse für das Klima-Handeln","Entwicklung von vertrauenswürdigen Lösungen","Nutzung von SpitzenTechnologien wie React und Node.js","Implementierung von CLI für eine höhere Effizienz","Zusammenarbeit mit der Entwickler-Community von Blockchain"],"pt":["Teste de confiança de dados de ação climática","Utilização da blockchain Chia","Desenvolvimento de soluções de ação climática","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Análise de dados de ação climática"],"ru":["Тестирование доверия к данным климатического действия","Использование блокчейна Chia","Разработка решений по климатическим действиям","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Анализ данных климатического действия"],"ar":["اختبار ثقة البيانات إجراءات المناخ","استخدام blockchain Chia","تطوير حلول العمل المناخي","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","تحليل البيانات إجراءات المناخ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["cadt-testing 使用方法","什么是 cadt-testing","cadt-testing 替代品","cadt-testing vs 其他平台","cadt-testing 安装","如何使用 Chia blockchain","AI 技术在数据安全中的应用","气候行动数据信任平台"],"ja":["cadt-testing の使い方","cadt-testing とは何か","cadt-testing の代替品","cadt-testing vs その他のプラットフォーム","cadt-testing のインストール","Chia blockchain の使い方","AI 技術がデータの安全性を確保する方法","気候行動データトラストプラットフォーム"],"ko":["cadt-testing 사용법","cadt-testing이 무엇인가","cadt-testing 대체품","cadt-testing vs 다른 플랫폼","cadt-testing 설치","Chia blockchain 사용법","AI 기술이 데이터 보안을 구현하는 방법","기후 행동 데이터 트러스트 플랫폼"],"es":["cadt-testing","herramientas de AI","blockchain de Chia","acción climática","análisis de datos","desarrollo de soluciones de confianza","React","Node.js","CLI","alternativas a cadt-testing"],"fr":["cadt-testing","outils d''IA","blockchain Chia","action climatique","analyse de données","développement de solutions de confiance","React","Node.js","CLI","alternatives à cadt-testing"],"de":["cadt-testing","KI-Tools","Chia-Blockchain","Klima-Handeln","Datenanalyse","Entwicklung von vertrauenswürdigen Lösungen","React","Node.js","CLI","Alternativen zu cadt-testing"],"pt":["cadt-testing","ferramentas de IA","testes de confiança de dados","ação climática","blockchain Chia","desenvolvimento de soluções","análise de dados","como usar cadt-testing","o que é cadt-testing"],"ru":["cadt-testing","ИИ Агенты","тестирование доверия к данным","климатическое действие","блокчейн Chia","разработка решений","анализ данных","как использовать cadt-testing","что такое cadt-testing"],"ar":["cadt-testing","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","اختبار ثقة البيانات","إجراءات المناخ","blockchain Chia","تطوير حلول","تحليل البيانات","كيفية استخدام اختبار cadt","ما هو اختبار cadt"]}},"owner":"Chia-Network","repo":"cadt","repoPath":"Chia-Network/cadt","stars":39,"forks":14,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T22:07:49Z","topics":["chia-blockchain"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cadt-testing","description":"Run CADT integration tests, live API tests, and test data cleanup. Use when the user asks to run integration tests, run v1 or v2 tests, run live API tests, or delete test data.","bodyPreview":"# CADT Testing\n\nPrefix all commands with `fnm use &&` per the `node-environment` rule.\n\n## Integration Tests (Simulation Mode)\n\nIn-memory SQLite with simulator. No CADT server, Chia, or datalayer required.\n\n### \"Run the integration tests\" = run both v1 and v2 in parallel\n\n```bash\nnpm run test:v1 &\nnpm run test:v2 &\nwait\n```\n\nV1 and V2 use different ports (31310 and 31311 via `CW_PORT` env var) and isolated\ndatabases (via `TEST_RUN_ID`), so they run safely in parallel. Do **not** use the\ncombined","body":"# CADT Testing\n\nPrefix all commands with `fnm use &&` per the `node-environment` rule.\n\n## Integration Tests (Simulation Mode)\n\nIn-memory SQLite with simulator. No CADT server, Chia, or datalayer required.\n\n### \"Run the integration tests\" = run both v1 and v2 in parallel\n\n```bash\nnpm run test:v1 &\nnpm run test:v2 &\nwait\n```\n\nV1 and V2 use different ports (31310 and 31311 via `CW_PORT` env var) and isolated\ndatabases (via `TEST_RUN_ID`), so they run safely in parallel. Do **not** use the\ncombined `npm test` script — it runs all specs in one process, causing v1/v2 interference.\n\n| Command | Port | Test files |\n|---------|------|-----------|\n| `npm run test:v1` | 31310 | `tests/integration/**/*.spec.js`, `tests/resources/**/*.spec.js` |\n| `npm run test:v2` | 31311 | `tests/v2/integration/**/*.spec.js` |\n\n### How they work\n\n- `run-tests.sh` generates a unique `TEST_RUN_ID`, creates isolated SQLite DBs in `tests/test-dbs/`, cleans up on exit\n- Environment: `NODE_ENV=test`, `USE_SIMULATOR=true`, `CW_PORT=<port>`\n- Port isolation: `CW_PORT` env var overrides `APP.CW_PORT` in config-loader.js\n- Timeout: 300s per test\n\n## Live API Tests\n\nRun against a real CADT server with actual Chia datalayer.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- CADT server running on port 31310\n- Chia node + datalayer running and synced\n- Home organization created\n- Empty database for POST phases (or `SKIP_EMPTY_CHECK=true`)\n- Config at `~/.chia/mainnet/cadt/config.yaml`\n- Optional: MySQL mirror DB for mirror verification\n\n### \"Run the v2 live API test\" = data-short\n\n```bash\nnpm run test:v2:live:data:short\n```\n\nRuns `tests/v2/live-api/data-short.js`:\n1. Validate request failures (bad data rejected)\n2. POST all test records, batch commit\n3. Validate child record failures\n4. PUT all records, batch commit\n5. DELETE all records, batch commit\n\nAfter each commit, verifies records in DB (and optionally MySQL mirror).\n\n### All live API commands\n\n| Command | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `npm run test:v2:live:data:short` | V2 short mode: batch commit per phase |\n| `npm run test:v2:live:data:extended` | V2 extended mode: commit per endpoint |\n| `npm run test:v1:live:data:short` | V1 short mode |\n| `npm run test:v2:live:organization:create` | Create V2 home organization |\n| `npm run test:v1:live:organization:create` | Create V1 home organization |\n| `npm run test:v1:live:organization:upgrade` | Upgrade V1 org to V2 |\n| `npm run test:v2:live:organization:delete` | Delete V2 organization |\n\n### Test modes\n\n- **Short** (`TEST_MODE=short`): Batch all POSTs/PUTs/DELETEs with one commit per phase. Faster.\n- **Extended** (`TEST_MODE=extended`): Each test file commits individually. More thorough.\n\n## Delete Test Data\n\nIf user specifies a version, run that version. If unspecified, run both:\n\n```bash\nnpm run test:v1:delete-test-data\nnpm run test:v2:delete-test-data\n```\n\n| Command | Behavior |\n|---------|----------|\n| `npm run test:v1:delete-test-data` | Deletes records with `TEST-` prefix from V1 projects and units |\n| `npm run test:v2:delete-test-data` | Deletes all records from 20 V2 data tables (children first) |\n\nBoth require a running CADT server. Timeout: 600s.\n\nV2 delete flow: clear staging -> GET all -> stage DELETEs -> commit -> wait for staging empty -> verify.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T13:07:49.301Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Testing Agents requiring advanced integration testing capabilities with in-memory SQLite and simulator support","zh":"适用于需要高级集成测试功能的测试代理，包括内存SQLite和模拟器支持","ja":"高度な統合テスト機能を必要とするテストエージェントに適しています。内メモリSQLiteおよびシミュレータサポートを提供します","ko":"고급 통합 테스트 기능을 필요로 하는 테스트 에이전트에 적합합니다. 内存 SQLite 및 시뮬레이터 지원","es":"Ideal para agentes de prueba que requieren capacidades de prueba de integración avanzadas con SQLite en memoria y soporte de simulador","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de test nécessitant des fonctionnalités de test d''intégration avancées avec SQLite en mémoire et un support de simulateur","de":"Ideal für Testagenten, die erweiterte Integrationstestfunktionen mit SQLite im Speicher und Simulatorenunterstützung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Testes que exigem capacidades avançadas de teste de integração com SQLite em memória e suporte a simulador","ru":"Идеально для агентов тестирования, требующих расширенных возможностей интеграционного тестирования с SQLite в памяти и поддержкой симулятора","ar":"مثالي لعميل اختبار يتطلب القدرات المتقدمة لاختبار التكامل مع SQLite في الذاكرة ودعم المحاكي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to run parallel integration tests for v1 and v2 using npm commands, leveraging environment variables like CW_PORT and TEST_RUN_ID for isolated databases and ports, and facilitating seamless testing without CADT server, Chia, or datalayer dependencies","zh":"赋予代理运行并行集成测试的能力，使用npm命令、环境变量如CW_PORT和TEST_RUN_ID实现隔离数据库和端口，并且无需CADT服务器、Chia或datalayer依赖即可实现无缝测试","ja":"エージェントに並行統合テストを実行する能力を付与します。npmコマンド、CW_PORTおよびTEST_RUN_IDなどの環境変数を使用して隔離されたデータベースおよびポートを実現し、CADTサーバー、Chia、またはdatalayerの依存関係なくシームレスなテストを実現します","ko":"에이전트가 병렬 통합 테스트를 실행할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. npm 명령어와 CW_PORT 및 TEST_RUN_ID 같은 환경 변수를 사용하여 격리된 데이터베이스와 포트를 구현하며, CADT 서버, Chia 또는 datalayer 의존성 없이 무결점 테스트를 구현합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar pruebas de integración paralelas para v1 y v2 usando comandos npm, aprovechando variables de entorno como CW_PORT y TEST_RUN_ID para bases de datos y puertos aislados, y facilitando pruebas sin dependencias de servidor CADT, Chia o datalayer","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tests d''intégration parallèles pour v1 et v2 en utilisant des commandes npm, en exploitant des variables d''environnement comme CW_PORT et TEST_RUN_ID pour des bases de données et des ports isolés, et en facilitant les tests sans dépendances de serveur CADT, Chia ou datalayer","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, parallele Integrationstests für v1 und v2 mit npm-Befehlen durchzuführen, wobei Umgebungsvariablen wie CW_PORT und TEST_RUN_ID für isolierte Datenbanken und Ports genutzt werden, und ermöglicht somit eine nahtlose Testausführung ohne Abhängigkeiten von CADT-Server, Chia oder datalayer","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar testes de integração paralelos para v1 e v2 usando comandos npm, aproveitando variáveis de ambiente como CW_PORT e TEST_RUN_ID para bancos de dados e portas isolados, e facilitando testes sem interrupções sem dependências do servidor CADT, Chia ou datalayer","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запускать параллельные интеграционные тесты для v1 и v2 с помощью команд npm, используя переменные среды, такие как CW_PORT и TEST_RUN_ID, для изолированных баз данных и портов, и обеспечивая бесшовное тестирование без зависимостей от сервера CADT, Chia или datalayer","ar":"يسمح للعميل بالتشغيل المتوازي لاختبار التكامل ل v1 و v2 باستخدام أوامر npm، واستغلال متغيرات البيئة مثل CW_PORT و TEST_RUN_ID للقواعد والمنافذ المفصولة، وتسهيل الاختبار دون انقطاع بدون зависимости على خادم CADT، Chia أو datalayer"},"useCases":{"en":["Running integration tests in simulation mode","Testing v1 and v2 in parallel with isolated databases","Debugging test failures using in-memory SQLite"],"zh":["在模拟模式下运行集成测试","使用隔离数据库并行测试v1和v2","使用内存SQLite调试测试失败"],"ja":["シミュレーションモードで統合テストを実行する","隔離されたデータベースを使用してv1およびv2を並行してテストする","内メモリSQLiteを使用してテストの失敗をデバッグする"],"ko":["시뮬레이션 모드에서 통합 테스트를 실행한다","격리된 데이터베이스를 사용하여 v1 및 v2를 병렬로 테스트한다","내存 SQLite를 사용하여 테스트 실패를 디버깅한다"],"es":["Ejecución de pruebas de integración en modo de simulación","Prueba de v1 y v2 en paralelo con bases de datos aisladas","Depuración de fallos de prueba utilizando SQLite en memoria"],"fr":["Exécution de tests d''intégration en mode de simulation","Test de v1 et v2 en parallèle avec des bases de données isolées","Débogage des échecs de test en utilisant SQLite en mémoire"],"de":["Ausführen von Integrationstests im Simulationsmodus","Testen von v1 und v2 parallel mit isolierten Datenbanken","Fehlerbehebung bei Testfehlern unter Verwendung von SQLite im Speicher"],"pt":["Execução de testes de integração no modo de simulação","Testar v1 e v2 em paralelo com bancos de dados isolados","Depuração de falhas de teste usando SQLite em memória"],"ru":["Выполнение интеграционных тестов в режиме симуляции","Тестирование v1 и v2 параллельно с изолированными базами данных","Отладка неудач тестирования с помощью SQLite в памяти"],"ar":["تشغيل اختبار التكامل في وضع المحاكاة","اختبار v1 و v2 بالتوازي مع قواعد بيانات مفصولة","تصحيح اخطاء الاختبار باستخدام SQLite في الذاكرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires node environment","Limited to in-memory SQLite with simulator","No support for CADT server, Chia, or datalayer in simulation mode"],"zh":["需要node环境","仅限内存SQLite和模拟器","不支持CADT服务器、Chia或datalayer在模拟模式"],"ja":["ノード環境が必要","内メモリSQLiteおよびシミュレータのみ","CADTサーバー、Chia、またはdatalayerをシミュレーションモードでサポートしない"],"ko":["노드 환경이 필요하다","내存 SQLite와 시뮬레이터만 해당","CADT 서버, Chia 또는 datalayer를 시뮬레이션 모드에서 지원하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere entorno de node","Limitado a SQLite en memoria con simulador","No admite servidor CADT, Chia o datalayer en modo de simulación"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de node","Limité à SQLite en mémoire avec simulateur","Ne prend pas en charge le serveur CADT, Chia ou datalayer en mode de simulation"],"de":["Benötigt eine Node-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf SQLite im Speicher mit Simulatoren","Unterstützt keinen CADT-Server, Chia oder datalayer im Simulationsmodus"],"pt":["Exige ambiente node","Limitado a SQLite em memória com simulador","Sem suporte para servidor CADT, Chia ou datalayer no modo de simulação"],"ru":["Требует среды node","Ограничен до SQLite в памяти с симулятором","Нет поддержки для сервера CADT, Chia или datalayer в режиме симуляции"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة node","محدود إلى SQLite في الذاكرة مع المحاكي","لا يدعم خادم CADT، Chia أو datalayer في وضع المحاكاة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"68345155bfa2b661522bb83f62a35609b203a78ab50c7eff3bc40064ebd7db17","qualityScore":36}');
