code","installation d''obsidian-cli","guide de configuration d''obsidian-cli","développement de projets avec obsidian-cli","intégration de l''ia dans le développement de logiciels"],"de":["ki-tools für ingenieure","wie man obsidian-cli verwendet","alternativen zu obsidian-cli","obsidian-cli vs claude code","installation von obsidian-cli","einrichtungsanleitung für obsidian-cli","entwicklung von projekten mit obsidian-cli","integration von ki in der softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","como usar obsidian-cli","o que é obsidian-cli","obsidian-cli vs outras ferramentas","guia de instalação do obsidian-cli","desenvolvimento de software com ia","ferramentas de desenvolvimento com ia","obsidian-cli para engenheiros","ia no desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["инструменты ии для разработчиков","как использовать obsidian-cli","что такое obsidian-cli","obsidian-cli vs другие инструменты","руководство по установке obsidian-cli","разработка программного обеспечения с ии","инструменты разработки с ии","obsidian-cli для инженеров","ии в разработке программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","كيفية استخدام obsidian-cli","ما هو obsidian-cli","obsidian-cli مقابل أدوات أخرى","دليل تثبيت obsidian-cli","تطوير البرمجيات مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات التطوير مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","obsidian-cli لمهندسي البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي في تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"breferrari","repo":"obsidian-mind","repoPath":"breferrari/obsidian-mind","stars":1,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T01:02:33Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"obsidian-cli","description":"Interact with Obsidian vaults using the Obsidian CLI to read, create, search, and manage notes, tasks, properties, and more. Also supports plugin and theme development with commands to reload plugins, run JavaScript, capture errors, take screenshots, and inspect the DOM. Use when the user asks to interact with their Obsidian vault, manage notes, search vault content, perform vault operations from the command line, or develop and debug Obsidian plugins and themes.","bodyPreview":"# Obsidian CLI\n\nUse the `obsidian` CLI to interact with a running Obsidian instance. Requires Obsidian to be open.\n\n## Command reference\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see all available commands. This is always up to date. Full docs: https://help.obsidian.md/cli\n\n## Syntax\n\n**Parameters** take a value with `=`. Quote values with spaces:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"\n```\n\n**Flags** are boolean switches with no value:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" silent overwrit","body":"# Obsidian CLI\n\nUse the `obsidian` CLI to interact with a running Obsidian instance. Requires Obsidian to be open.\n\n## Command reference\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see all available commands. This is always up to date. Full docs: https://help.obsidian.md/cli\n\n## Syntax\n\n**Parameters** take a value with `=`. Quote values with spaces:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"\n```\n\n**Flags** are boolean switches with no value:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" silent overwrite\n```\n\nFor multiline content use `\\n` for newline and `\\t` for tab.\n\n## File targeting\n\nMany commands accept `file` or `path` to target a file. Without either, the active file is used.\n\n- `file=<name>` — resolves like a wikilink (name only, no path or extension needed)\n- `path=<path>` — exact path from vault root, e.g. `folder/note.md`\n\n## Vault targeting\n\nCommands target the most recently focused vault by default. Use `vault=<name>` as the first parameter to target a specific vault:\n\n```bash\nobsidian vault=\"My Vault\" search query=\"test\"\n```\n\n## Common patterns\n\n```bash\nobsidian read file=\"My Note\"\nobsidian create name=\"New Note\" content=\"# Hello\" template=\"Template\" silent\nobsidian append file=\"My Note\" content=\"New line\"\nobsidian search query=\"search term\" limit=10\nobsidian daily:read\nobsidian daily:append content=\"- [ ] New task\"\nobsidian property:set name=\"status\" value=\"done\" file=\"My Note\"\nobsidian tasks daily todo\nobsidian tags sort=count counts\nobsidian backlinks file=\"My Note\"\n```\n\nUse `--copy` on any command to copy output to clipboard. Use `silent` to prevent files from opening. Use `total` on list commands to get a count.\n\n## Plugin development\n\n### Develop/test cycle\n\nAfter making code changes to a plugin or theme, follow this workflow:\n\n1. **Reload** the plugin to pick up changes:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian plugin:reload id=my-plugin\n   ```\n2. **Check for errors** — if errors appear, fix and repeat from step 1:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:errors\n   ```\n3. **Verify visually** with a screenshot or DOM inspection:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:screenshot path=screenshot.png\n   obsidian dev:dom selector=\".workspace-leaf\" text\n   ```\n4. **Check console output** for warnings or unexpected logs:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:console level=error\n   ```\n\n### Additional developer commands\n\nRun JavaScript in the app context:\n\n```bash\nobsidian eval code=\"app.vault.getFiles().length\"\n```\n\nInspect CSS values:\n\n```bash\nobsidian dev:css selector=\".workspace-leaf\" prop=background-color\n```\n\nToggle mobile emulation:\n\n```bash\nobsidian dev:mobile on\n```\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see additional developer commands including CDP and debugger controls.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T02:21:38.392Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code needing seamless integration with Obsidian vaults for comprehensive note management.","zh":"非常适合需要与 Obsidian vaults 无缝集成以进行综合笔记管理的 AI Agents，如 Claude Code。","ja":"Obsidian ヴォールトとのシームレスな統合を必要とする Claude Code のような AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Obsidian vaults와의 무결점 통합을 필요로 하는 Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 최적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude Code que necesitan una integración perfecta con los vaults de Obsidian para una gestión de notas integral.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA comme Claude Code ayant besoin d''une intégration transparente avec les coffres de Obsidian pour une gestion de notes complète.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, die eine nahtlose Integration mit Obsidian-Vaults für eine umfassende Notizenverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude Code que precisam de integração perfeita com cofres do Obsidian para gerenciamento de notas abrangente.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, которым требуется бесшовная интеграция с хранилищами Obsidian для комплексного управления заметками.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متوافق مع خزائن Obsidian لإدارة الملاحظات الشاملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to interact with Obsidian instances using the `obsidian` CLI, enabling features like note creation and content manipulation through parameters and flags, such as `create` and `silent` commands, and handling values with spaces using quotes.","zh":"赋予代理交互式地使用 `obsidian` CLI 与 Obsidian 实例进行交互，通过参数和标志（如 `create` 和 `silent` 命令）实现功能，如笔记创建和内容操作，并使用引号处理带空格的值。","ja":"エージェントが `obsidian` CLI を使用して Obsidian インスタンスとやり取りできるようにし、パラメータとフラグ（例： `create` コマンドと `silent` コマンド）を使用して機能を有効にし、引用符を使用して空白を含む値を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 `obsidian` CLI를 사용하여 Obsidian 인스턴스와 상호 작용할 수 있도록 하여, 매개 변수 및 플래그(예: `create` 및 `silent` 명령)를 통해 기능을 활성화하고, 따옴표를 사용하여 공백이 포함된 값을 처리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a interactuar con instancias de Obsidian utilizando el CLI `obsidian`, permitiendo características como la creación de notas y la manipulación de contenido a través de parámetros y flags, como los comandos `create` y `silent`, y el manejo de valores con espacios utilizando comillas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interagir avec des instances d''Obsidian en utilisant le CLI `obsidian`, permettant des fonctionnalités comme la création de notes et la manipulation de contenu via des paramètres et des flags, tels que les commandes `create` et `silent`, et la gestion de valeurs avec des espaces en utilisant des guillemets.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mit Obsidian-Instanzen über das `obsidian`-CLI zu interagieren, wodurch Funktionen wie die Notenerstellung und die Inhaltsmanipulation über Parameter und Flags, wie z.B. die Befehle `create` und `silent`, sowie die Verarbeitung von Werten mit Leerzeichen unter Verwendung von Anführungszeichen ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a interagir com instâncias do Obsidian usando o `obsidian` CLI, permitindo recursos como criação de notas e manipulação de conteúdo por meio de parâmetros e flags, como comandos `create` e `silent`, e lidando com valores com espaços usando aspas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью взаимодействия с экземплярами Obsidian с помощью `obsidian` CLI, что позволяет использовать функции, такие как создание заметок и манипуляция содержимым через параметры и флаги, такие как команды `create` и `silent`, и обработку значений со пробелами с помощью кавычек.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التفاعل مع مثيلات Obsidian باستخدام `obsidian` CLI ، مما يتيح ميزات مثل إنشاء الملاحظات وتنسيق المحتوى من خلال المعلمات والعلامات ، مثل أوامر `create` و `silent` ، ومعالجة القيم التي تحتوي على مسافات باستخدام علامات التحديد."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating note creation with specific names and content","Generating new notes with predefined templates","Debugging Obsidian vault interactions using the `obsidian help` command"],"zh":["使用特定名称和内容自动创建笔记","使用预定义模板生成新笔记","使用 `obsidian help` 命令调试 Obsidian vault 交互"],"ja":["特定の名前とコンテンツで自動的にノートを作成する","事前に定義されたテンプレートを使用して新しいノートを生成する","`obsidian help` コマンドを使用して Obsidian ヴォールトの相互作用をデバッグする"],"ko":["특정 이름 및 내용으로 자동으로 노트を作成하는 것","사전 정의된 템플릿을 사용하여 새로운 노트를 생성하는 것","`obsidian help` 명령을 사용하여 Obsidian 보관소 상호 작용을 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de notas con nombres y contenido específicos","Generar nuevas notas con plantillas predefinidas","Depurar interacciones con los vaults de Obsidian utilizando el comando `obsidian help`"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de notes avec des noms et un contenu spécifiques","Générer de nouvelles notes avec des modèles prédéfinis","Déboguer les interactions avec les coffres de Obsidian en utilisant la commande `obsidian help`"],"de":["Automatisieren der Notenerstellung mit spezifischen Namen und Inhalten","Erzeugen neuer Notizen mit vordefinierten Vorlagen","Fehlerbehebung bei der Interaktion mit Obsidian-Vaults unter Verwendung des Befehls `obsidian help`"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de notas com nomes e conteúdo específicos","Gerar novas notas com modelos predefinidos","Depurar interações do cofre do Obsidian usando o comando `obsidian help`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание заметок с конкретными именами и содержимым","Генерировать новые заметки с предварительно определёнными шаблонами","Отлаживать взаимодействия с хранилищем Obsidian, используя команду `obsidian help`"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء الملاحظات بأسماء ومحتوى محدد","توليد ملاحظات جديدة مع قوالب محددة مسبقا","تصحيح أخطاء التفاعل مع خزانة Obsidian باستخدام أمر `obsidian help`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Obsidian to be open","Limited to Obsidian-specific commands and functionality"],"zh":["需要 Obsidian 打开","仅限 Obsidian 特定命令和功能"],"ja":["Obsidian が開いている必要がある","Obsidian 特有のコマンドと機能に限定される"],"ko":["Obsidian이 열려 있어야 함","Obsidian 전용 명령 및 기능으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere que Obsidian esté abierto","Limitado a comandos y funcionalidades específicos de Obsidian"],"fr":["Nécessite que Obsidian soit ouvert","Limité aux commandes et fonctionnalités spécifiques à Obsidian"],"de":["Benötigt, dass Obsidian geöffnet ist","Begrenzt auf Obsidian-spezifische Befehle und Funktionalitäten"],"pt":["Exige que o Obsidian esteja aberto","Limitado a comandos e funcionalidades específicas do Obsidian"],"ru":["Требует, чтобы Obsidian был открыт","Ограничен командами и функциональностью, специфичными для Obsidian"],"ar":["يتطلب أن يكون Obsidian مفتوحا","محدود بأوامر ووظائف محددة من Obsidian"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b54257cdc0e5d04488b35b0c797bfe427b24359f0848d3c73924dcacf8da6358","qualityScore":36}');
