d deploy complex AI workflows with pre-built architecture patterns."},"features":{"zh":["支持复杂 AI 工作流的设计和编排","提供预建的架构模式","基于 Claude Agent SDK","支持高效的部署和管理","适用于生产环境"],"ja":["複雑な AI ワークフローの設計と作成をサポート","事前に構築されたアーキテクチャパターンを提供","Claude Agent SDK に基づく","効率的なデプロイと管理をサポート","生産環境向け"],"ko":["복잡한 AI 워크플로우의 설계 및 구성 지원","사전 구축된 아키텍처 패턴 제공","Claude Agent SDK 기반","효율적인 배포 및 관리 지원","생산 환경용"],"es":["Diseño de flujos de trabajo complejos","Patrones de arquitectura preconstruidos","Orquestación de agentes multi-","Integración con Claude Agent SDK","Despliegue de flujos de trabajo en producción"],"fr":["Conception de flux de travail complexes","Modèles d''architecture préconstruits","Orchestration d''agents multi-","Intégration avec Claude Agent SDK","Déploiement de flux de travail en production"],"de":["Entwurf komplexer Workflows","Vorkonfigurierte Architekturmuster","Orchestrierung von Multi-Agenten","Integration mit Claude Agent SDK","Bereitstellung von Workflows in der Produktion"],"pt":["Criação de workflows de AI complexos","Padrões de arquitetura pré-construídos","Orquestração de múltiplos agentes","Desenvolvimento de aplicações de IA","Integração com Claude Agent SDK"],"ru":["Создание сложных рабочих procesсов ИИ","Предварительно построенные шаблоны архитектуры","Оркестровка нескольких агентов","Разработка приложений ИИ","Интеграция с Claude Agent SDK"],"ar":["إنشاء تدفقات عمل ذكاء اصطناعي معقدة","أنماط بنية مُسبقة البناء","تنسيق متعدد الوكلاء","تطوير تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع Claude Agent SDK"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 工具集","PDF 工具集","多代理编排框架","AI 工作流","Claude Agent SDK","如何使用 PDF 工具集","PDF 工具集教程","AI 工具集比较"],"ja":["AIエージェント","PDF ツールキット","マルチエージェントオーケストレーションフレームワーク","AI ワークフロー","Claude Agent SDK","PDF ツールキットの使い方","PDF ツールキットのチュートリアル","AI エージェントの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","PDF 도구 모음","멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션 프레임워크","AI 워크플로우","Claude Agent SDK","PDF 도구 모음 사용법","PDF 도구 모음 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 비교"],"es":["herramientas de ai","flujos de trabajo complejos","patrones de arquitectura","orquestación de agentes","claude agent sdk","despliegue de flujos de trabajo","guias de instalación de herramientas de ai","alternativas a herramientas de ai","herramientas de ai vs competidores"],"fr":["outils d''ia","flux de travail complexes","modèles d''architecture","orchestration d''agents","claude agent sdk","déploiement de flux de travail","guides d''installation d''outils d''ia","alternatives aux outils d''ia","outils d''ia vs concurrents"],"de":["ki-tools","komplexe workflows","architekturmuster","orchestrierung von agenten","claude agent sdk","bereitstellung von workflows","installationsanleitungen für ki-tools","alternativen zu ki-tools","ki-tools vs wettbewerber"],"pt":["ferramentas de ai","pdf 工具集","orquestração de agentes","desenvolvimento de ia","claude agent sdk","como usar pdf 工具集","o que é pdf 工具集","pdf 工具集 vs concorrentes"],"ru":["ии агенты","pdf 工具集","оркестровка агентов","разработка ии","claude agent sdk","как использовать pdf 工具集","что такое pdf 工具集","pdf 工具集 альтернатива"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","pdf 工具集","تنسيق وكلاء","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","claude agent sdk","كيفية استخدام pdf 工具集","ما هو pdf 工具集","بديل pdf 工具集"]}},"owner":"uukuguy","repo":"claude-agent-framework","repoPath":"uukuguy/claude-agent-framework","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2025-12-27T20:17:49Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"PDF 工具集","description":"PDF 创建、编辑、合并、拆分工具集","bodyPreview":"# PDF 操作工具集\n\n本技能提供 PDF 文档操作的完整指南。\n\n## 依赖库\n\n```bash\npip install reportlab pypdf pdfplumber\n```\n\n## 1. 创建 PDF (reportlab)\n\n### 基础文档\n\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import A4, letter\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet, ParagraphStyle\nfrom reportlab.lib.units import inch, cm\nfrom reportlab.platypus import (\n    SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, Image,\n    Table, TableStyle, PageBreak\n)\nfrom reportlab.lib import colors\n\n# 创建文档\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\n    \"output.pdf\",","body":"# PDF 操作工具集\n\n本技能提供 PDF 文档操作的完整指南。\n\n## 依赖库\n\n```bash\npip install reportlab pypdf pdfplumber\n```\n\n## 1. 创建 PDF (reportlab)\n\n### 基础文档\n\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import A4, letter\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet, ParagraphStyle\nfrom reportlab.lib.units import inch, cm\nfrom reportlab.platypus import (\n    SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, Image,\n    Table, TableStyle, PageBreak\n)\nfrom reportlab.lib import colors\n\n# 创建文档\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\n    \"output.pdf\",\n    pagesize=A4,\n    rightMargin=72,\n    leftMargin=72,\n    topMargin=72,\n    bottomMargin=72\n)\n\n# 获取样式\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\n\n# 构建内容\nstory = []\n\n# 添加标题\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"报告标题\", styles[''Heading1'']))\nstory.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n\n# 添加段落\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"这是正文内容。\", styles[''Normal'']))\nstory.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n\n# 生成 PDF\ndoc.build(story)\n```\n\n### 添加图片\n\n```python\nfrom reportlab.platypus import Image\n\n# 添加图片（指定宽度，保持比例）\nimg = Image(\"chart.png\", width=400)\nstory.append(img)\n```\n\n### 添加表格\n\n```python\nfrom reportlab.platypus import Table, TableStyle\nfrom reportlab.lib import colors\n\ndata = [\n    [''标题1'', ''标题2'', ''标题3''],\n    [''数据1'', ''数据2'', ''数据3''],\n    [''数据4'', ''数据5'', ''数据6''],\n]\n\ntable = Table(data)\ntable.setStyle(TableStyle([\n    (''BACKGROUND'', (0, 0), (-1, 0), colors.grey),\n    (''TEXTCOLOR'', (0, 0), (-1, 0), colors.whitesmoke),\n    (''ALIGN'', (0, 0), (-1, -1), ''CENTER''),\n    (''FONTSIZE'', (0, 0), (-1, 0), 14),\n    (''BOTTOMPADDING'', (0, 0), (-1, 0), 12),\n    (''BACKGROUND'', (0, 1), (-1, -1), colors.beige),\n    (''GRID'', (0, 0), (-1, -1), 1, colors.black),\n]))\n\nstory.append(table)\n```\n\n### 自定义样式\n\n```python\n# 自定义段落样式\ncustom_style = ParagraphStyle(\n    ''CustomStyle'',\n    parent=styles[''Normal''],\n    fontSize=12,\n    leading=16,\n    spaceAfter=12,\n    textColor=colors.darkblue,\n)\n```\n\n## 2. 合并 PDF (pypdf)\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfMerger\n\nmerger = PdfMerger()\n\n# 添加 PDF 文件\nmerger.append(\"file1.pdf\")\nmerger.append(\"file2.pdf\")\nmerger.append(\"file3.pdf\")\n\n# 写入合并后的文件\nmerger.write(\"merged.pdf\")\nmerger.close()\n```\n\n## 3. 拆分 PDF\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\n\n# 提取特定页面\nfor i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n    writer = PdfWriter()\n    writer.add_page(page)\n    with open(f\"page_{i+1}.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n        writer.write(output)\n```\n\n## 4. 提取文本 (pdfplumber)\n\n```python\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"input.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        text = page.extract_text()\n        print(text)\n```\n\n## 5. 提取表格\n\n```python\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"input.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for table in tables:\n            for row in table:\n                print(row)\n```\n\n## 6. 完整报告示例\n\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import A4\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\nfrom reportlab.platypus import (\n    SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, Image, Table, TableStyle, PageBreak\n)\nfrom reportlab.lib import colors\nfrom reportlab.lib.units import inch\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\ndef create_research_report(\n    output_path: str,\n    title: str,\n    summary: str,\n    findings: list,\n    charts: list,\n    data_table: list\n):\n    \"\"\"创建研究报告 PDF\"\"\"\n\n    doc = SimpleDocTemplate(output_path, pagesize=A4)\n    styles = getSampleStyleSheet()\n    story = []\n\n    # 封面\n    story.append(Spacer(1, 2*inch))\n    story.append(Paragraph(title, styles[''Title'']))\n    story.append(Spacer(1, 0.5*inch))\n    story.append(Paragraph(\n        f\"生成日期: {datetime.now().strftime(''%Y-%m-%d'')}\",\n        styles[''Normal'']\n    ))\n    story.append(PageBreak())\n\n    # 执行摘要\n    story.append(Paragraph(\"执行摘要\", styles[''Heading1'']))\n    story.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n    story.append(Paragraph(summary, styles[''Normal'']))\n    story.append(Spacer(1, 24))\n\n    # 关键发现\n    story.append(Paragraph(\"关键发现\", styles[''Heading1'']))\n    story.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n    for i, finding in enumerate(findings, 1):\n        story.append(Paragraph(f\"{i}. {finding}\", styles[''Normal'']))\n        story.append(Spacer(1, 6))\n    story.append(Spacer(1, 24))\n\n    # 图表\n    if charts:\n        story.append(Paragraph(\"数据可视化\", styles[''Heading1'']))\n        story.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n        for chart_path in charts:\n            try:\n                img = Image(chart_path, width=5*inch)\n                story.append(img)\n                story.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n            except Exception as e:\n                story.append(Paragraph(f\"图表加载失败: {chart_path}\", styles[''Normal'']))\n\n    # 数据表格\n    if data_table:\n        story.append(Paragraph(\"详细数据\", styles[''Heading1'']))\n        story.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n        table = Table(data_table)\n        table.setStyle(TableStyle([\n            (''BACKGROUND'', (0, 0), (-1, 0), colors.HexColor(''#4472C4'')),\n            (''TEXTCOLOR'', (0, 0), (-1, 0), colors.whitesmoke),\n            (''ALIGN'', (0, 0), (-1, -1), ''CENTER''),\n            (''FONTSIZE'', (0, 0), (-1, -1), 10),\n            (''GRID'', (0, 0), (-1, -1), 0.5, colors.grey),\n            (''ROWBACKGROUNDS'', (0, 1), (-1, -1), [colors.white, colors.HexColor(''#E7E6E6'')]),\n        ]))\n        story.append(table)\n\n    # 生成 PDF\n    doc.build(story)\n    return output_path\n\n# 使用示例\ncreate_research_report(\n    output_path=\"files/reports/research_report.pdf\",\n    title=\"市场研究报告\",\n    summary=\"本报告分析了...\",\n    findings=[\"发现1\", \"发现2\", \"发现3\"],\n    charts=[\"files/charts/chart1.png\", \"files/charts/chart2.png\"],\n    data_table=[\n        [\"指标\", \"2023\", \"2024\", \"增长率\"],\n        [\"市场规模\", \"100亿\", \"120亿\", \"20%\"],\n        [\"用户数\", \"1000万\", \"1500万\", \"50%\"],\n    ]\n)\n```\n\n## 注意事项\n\n1. **中文支持**：reportlab 默认不支持中文，需要注册中文字体：\n   ```python\n   from reportlab.pdfbase import pdfmetrics\n   from reportlab.pdfbase.ttfonts import TTFont\n   pdfmetrics.registerFont(TTFont(''SimHei'', ''SimHei.ttf''))\n   ```\n\n2. **图片格式**：支持 PNG, JPG, GIF 格式\n\n3. **内存优化**：处理大文件时使用流式处理\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T13:09:04.713Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF creation and manipulation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级PDF创建和操作能力的文档分析代理。","ja":"高級なPDF作成および操作機能を必要とするドキュメント分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 PDF 생성 및 조작 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de creación y manipulación de PDF.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Documents ayant besoin de capacités avancées de création et de manipulation de PDF.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte PDF-Erstellung- und Manipulationsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de criação e manipulação de PDF.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа Документов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности создания и манипулирования PDF.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الوثائق التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لإنشاء وتعديل ملفات PDF."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and manipulate PDF documents using libraries like reportlab, pypdf, and pdfplumber, enabling advanced data visualization and document processing capabilities.","zh":"通过类似reportlab、pypdf和pdfplumber的库，赋予代理生成和操作PDF文档的能力，实现高级数据可视化和文档处理功能。","ja":"reportlab、pypdf、pdfplumberなどのライブラリを使用して、エージェントがPDFドキュメントを生成および操作できるようにし、高度なデータ視覚化およびドキュメント処理機能を実現します。","ko":"reportlab, pypdf, pdfplumberなどの 라이브러리를 사용하여 에이전트가 PDF 문서를 생성 및 조작할 수 있도록 하여 고급 데이터 시각화 및 문서 처리 기능을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar y manipular documentos PDF utilizando bibliotecas como reportlab, pypdf y pdfplumber, lo que permite capacidades avanzadas de visualización de datos y procesamiento de documentos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de manipuler des documents PDF en utilisant des bibliothèques comme reportlab, pypdf et pdfplumber, permettant ainsi des capacités avancées de visualisation de données et de traitement de documents.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, PDF-Dokumente mit Bibliotheken wie reportlab, pypdf und pdfplumber zu generieren und zu manipulieren, wodurch erweiterte Datenvisualisierungs- und Dokumentenverarbeitungsfunktionen möglich sind.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem e manipulem documentos PDF usando bibliotecas como reportlab, pypdf e pdfplumber, possibilitando capacidades avançadas de visualização de dados e processamento de documentos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать и манипулировать документами PDF с помощью библиотек, таких как reportlab, pypdf и pdfplumber, обеспечивая продвинутые возможности визуализации данных и обработки документов.","ar":"تمكن العميل من إنشاء وتعديل مستندات PDF باستخدام مكتبات مثل reportlab و pypdf و pdfplumber، ممكناً إمكانيات متقدمة لتصوير البيانات ومعالجة المستندات."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating complex PDF reports with tables and images","Merging and splitting PDF documents for data extraction","Automating PDF document generation with custom layouts and styles"],"zh":["创建包含表格和图像的复杂PDF报告","合并和拆分PDF文档以进行数据提取","使用自定义布局和样式自动化PDF文档生成"],"ja":["表や画像を含む複雑なPDFレポートの作成","データ抽出のためにPDFドキュメントを結合および分割","カスタムレイアウトやスタイルを使用してPDFドキュメントの自動生成"],"ko":["표 및 이미지 포함 복잡한 PDF 보고서 생성","데이터 추출을 위한 PDF 문서 결합 및 분할","사용자 정의 레이아웃 및 스타일을 사용한 PDF 문서 자동 생성"],"es":["Creación de informes PDF complejos con tablas e imágenes","Fusión y división de documentos PDF para la extracción de datos","Automatización de la generación de documentos PDF con diseños y estilos personalizados"],"fr":["Création de rapports PDF complexes avec des tableaux et des images","Fusion et division de documents PDF pour l''extraction de données","Automatisation de la génération de documents PDF avec des mises en page et des styles personnalisés"],"de":["Erstellung komplexer PDF-Berichte mit Tabellen und Bildern","Zusammenführung und Aufteilung von PDF-Dokumenten zur Datenextraktion","Automatisierung der PDF-Dokumentenerstellung mit benutzerdefinierten Layouts und Stilen"],"pt":["Criação de relatórios PDF complexos com tabelas e imagens","Mesclagem e divisão de documentos PDF para extração de dados","Automação da geração de documentos PDF com layouts e estilos personalizados"],"ru":["Создание сложных отчетов PDF с таблицами и изображениями","Объединение и разделение документов PDF для извлечения данных","Автоматизация генерации документов PDF с пользовательскими макетами и стилями"],"ar":["إنشاء تقارير PDF معقدة مع جداول وصور","دمج واستخراج مستندات PDF لاستخراج البيانات","تحسين إنتاجية إنشاء مستندات PDF باستخدام تخطيطات وأساليب مخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.x installation with reportlab, pypdf, and pdfplumber libraries","Limited to PDF document format only"],"zh":["需要Python 3.x安装reportlab、pypdf和pdfplumber库","仅限PDF文档格式"],"ja":["reportlab、pypdf、pdfplumberライブラリを含むPython 3.xのインストールが必要","PDFドキュメント形式のみに限定"],"ko":["reportlab, pypdf, pdfplumber 라이브러리를 포함한 Python 3.x 설치 필요","PDF 문서 형식만 지원"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Python 3.x con las bibliotecas reportlab, pypdf y pdfplumber","Limitado al formato de documento PDF solo"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation Python 3.x avec les bibliothèques reportlab, pypdf et pdfplumber","Limité au format de document PDF uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3.x-Installation mit den Bibliotheken reportlab, pypdf und pdfplumber","Begrenzt auf PDF-Dokumentenformat nur"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Python 3.x com as bibliotecas reportlab, pypdf e pdfplumber","Limitado ao formato de documento PDF apenas"],"ru":["Требуется установка Python 3.x с библиотеками reportlab, pypdf и pdfplumber","Ограничен только форматом документа PDF"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Python 3.x مع المكتبات reportlab و pypdf و pdfplumber","محدود بملف PDF فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"02e1a382a35b788295b674d07bc32c97df62dd495c4dcd6e6aca01f88cfd52f0","qualityScore":36}');
DELETE FROM skills_fts WHERE id = 'uukuguy/claude-agent-framework/PDF 工具集';
INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('uukuguy/claude-agent-framework/PDF 工具集', 'PDF 工具集', 'uukuguy', 'claude-agent-framework', 'community', 'PDF 工具集 uukuguy claude-agent-framework community PDF 工具集是一个生产就绪的多代理编排框架，基于 Claude Agent SDK，用于设计、编排和部署复杂的 AI 工作流 PDF ツールキットは、Claude Agent SDK に基づく生産就緒のマルチエージェントオーケストレーションフレームワークで、複雑な AI ワークフローの設計、作成、デプロイに使用されます PDF 도구 모음은 Claude Agent SDK를 기반으로 하는 생산 준비 멀티 에이전트 오케스트레이션 프레임워크로서 복잡한 AI 워크플로우의 설계, 구성, 배포에 사용 El PDF 工具集 es un framework de orquestación de agentes multi-para la creación de flujos de trabajo complejos con patrones de arquitectura preconstruidos Le PDF 工具集 est un framework d''orchestration d''agents multi- pour la création de flux de travail complexes avec des modèles d''architecture préconstruits Das PDF 工具集 ist ein Framework für die Orchestrierung von Multi-Agenten zur Erstellung komplexer Workflows mit vorkonfigurierten Architekturmuster O PDF 工具集 é um framework de orquestração de múltiplos agentes para designers e desenvolvedores. Ele permite criar workflows de AI complexos com padrões de arquitetura pré-construídos. PDF 工具集 - производственный фреймворк для оркестровки нескольких агентов. Он позволяет разработчикам создавать сложные рабочие процессы ИИ с предварительно построенными шаблонами архитектуры. PDF 工具集 هو إطار عمل لتنسيق متعدد الوكلاء للتصميم والتطوير. يسمح للمطورين بإنشاء تدفقات عمل ذكاء اصطناعي معقدة مع أنماط بنية مُسبقة البناء. A production-ready multi-agent orchestration framework built on Claude Agent SDK. Design, compose, and deploy complex AI workflows with pre-built architecture patterns. AI 工具集 PDF 工具集 多代理编排框架 AI 工作流 Claude Agent SDK 如何使用 PDF 工具集 PDF 工具集教程 AI 工具集比较 A production-ready multi-agent orchestration framework built on Claude Agent SDK. Design, compose, and deploy complex AI workflows with pre-built architecture patterns.');
