ки"],"ar":["نشر تلقائي للمشاريع","تحسين الأداء مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","CLI لإدارة المشاريع","دعم فرق التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Vercel部署","什么是AIエージェント","Vercel部署工具","RidenDine项目部署","Node.js部署","Python部署","Vercel vs Netlify","Vercel安装","Vercel设置指南"],"ja":["Vercelを使用してデプロイする方法","AIエージェントとは","Vercelデプロイツール","RidenDineプロジェクトのデプロイ","Node.jsのデプロイ","Pythonのデプロイ","Vercel vs Netlify","Vercelのインストール","Vercelの設定ガイド"],"ko":["버셀을 사용하여 배포하는 방법","AI 에이전트란","버셀 배포 도구","리덴다인 프로젝트 배포","Node.js 배포","Python 배포","버셀 vs 넷리파이","버셀 설치","버셀 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar Vercel","qué es un Agente de IA","alternativa a Netlify","Vercel vs Netlify","instalación de Vercel","guía de configuración de Vercel","despliegue de proyectos con Vercel"],"fr":["comment utiliser Vercel","qu''est-ce qu''un Outil d''IA","alternative à Netlify","Vercel vs Netlify","installation de Vercel","guide de configuration de Vercel","déploiement de projets avec Vercel"],"de":["wie man Vercel verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternative zu Netlify","Vercel vs Netlify","Installation von Vercel","Konfigurationsanleitung für Vercel","Bereitstellung von Projekten mit Vercel"],"pt":["como usar Vercel","o que é implantação Vercel","Ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","Vercel vs Netlify","guia de instalação Vercel","alternativas ao Vercel"],"ru":["как использовать Vercel","что такое развертывание Vercel","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","Vercel vs Netlify","руководство по установке Vercel","альтернативы Vercel"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Vercel","ما هي عملية نشر Vercel","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","Vercel vs Netlify","دليل تثبيت Vercel","بديلات Vercel"]}},"owner":"Ritenoob","repo":"ridedine","repoPath":"Ritenoob/ridedine","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T11:44:29Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-deployment","description":"|","version":"1.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Vercel Deployment\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nRidenDine has two Next.js 15 apps (web, admin) deployed to Vercel. Each needs separate Vercel projects, environment variables, and domain configuration. Preview deployments for PRs, production deployments on main branch.\r\n\r\n## Context / Trigger Conditions\r\n\r\nUse this skill when:\r\n- Deploying apps to production\r\n- Setting up new Vercel projects\r\n- Configuring environment variables\r\n- Debugging build failures\r\n- Setting up custom domains\r\n- Configuring preview","body":"# Vercel Deployment\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nRidenDine has two Next.js 15 apps (web, admin) deployed to Vercel. Each needs separate Vercel projects, environment variables, and domain configuration. Preview deployments for PRs, production deployments on main branch.\r\n\r\n## Context / Trigger Conditions\r\n\r\nUse this skill when:\r\n- Deploying apps to production\r\n- Setting up new Vercel projects\r\n- Configuring environment variables\r\n- Debugging build failures\r\n- Setting up custom domains\r\n- Configuring preview deployments\r\n\r\n## Pattern 1: Vercel Project Setup\r\n\r\n**Create Vercel Project:**\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Install Vercel CLI\r\npnpm add -g vercel\r\n\r\n# Link web app\r\ncd apps/web\r\nvercel link\r\n\r\n# Link admin app\r\ncd apps/admin\r\nvercel link\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Project Configuration (vercel.json):**\n\nKeep per-app `vercel.json` minimal to allow Vercel''s Next.js builder to handle install/build.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"framework\": \"nextjs\"\n}\n```\n\r\n## Pattern 2: Environment Variables\r\n\r\n**Web App (.env.production):**\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-id>.supabase.co\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<production-anon-key>\nNEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_...\r\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...\n```\r\n\r\n**Set via Vercel Dashboard:**\r\n\r\n1. Dashboard → Project → Settings → Environment Variables\r\n2. Add each variable for Production, Preview, Development\r\n3. Redeploy to apply changes\r\n\r\n**Or via CLI:**\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nvercel env add NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL production\r\nvercel env add STRIPE_SECRET_KEY production\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Pattern 3: Deployment\r\n\r\n**Automatic Deployment:**\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Push to main → production deployment\r\ngit push origin main\r\n\r\n# Push to feature branch → preview deployment\r\ngit push origin feature/new-feature\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Manual Deployment:**\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ncd apps/web\r\nvercel --prod  # Deploy to production\r\nvercel         # Deploy to preview\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Pattern 4: Build Configuration\r\n\r\n**pnpm Monorepo Support:**\r\n\r\n```json\r\n// apps/web/package.json\r\n{\r\n  \"scripts\": {\r\n    \"build\": \"next build\",\r\n    \"dev\": \"next dev\",\r\n    \"start\": \"next start\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Install Command (vercel.json):**\n\nDo not set this in per-app `vercel.json`. Leave install commands blank so Vercel runs pnpm from the repo root.\n\r\n## Pattern 5: Monorepo Root Directory Configuration (CRITICAL)\r\n\r\n**Problem: \"No Next.js version detected\" error**\r\n\r\nWhen deploying from a monorepo subdirectory, Vercel looks for `next` in the repository root''s `package.json`. It cannot be configured via `vercel.json` alone.\r\n\r\n**Solution: Set Root Directory via Dashboard**\r\n\r\n1. Deploy once (will fail with \"No Next.js version detected\")\r\n2. Go to Vercel Dashboard → Project → Settings → General\r\n3. Find \"Root Directory\" section → Click \"Edit\"\r\n4. Set to subdirectory path: `apps/admin` or `apps/web`\r\n5. Click \"Save\"\r\n6. Redeploy from Deployments tab\r\n\r\n**Alternative: GitHub Integration (Recommended for Free Tier)**\r\n\r\nGitHub integration auto-detects monorepo structure:\r\n\r\n1. Go to https://vercel.com/new\r\n2. Import GitHub repository\r\n3. Vercel shows \"Multiple apps detected\"\r\n4. Configure each app:\r\n   - **Name:** admin / web\r\n   - **Root Directory:** apps/admin / apps/web\r\n   - **Framework:** Next.js (auto-detected)\r\n    - **Build Command:** *(leave blank)*\n    - **Install Command:** *(leave blank)*\n5. Deploy both projects\r\n\r\n**Free Tier Strategy:**\r\n\r\n- ✅ **Separate projects** (admin + web) - Recommended\r\n  - 2 projects = 2 separate domains\r\n  - Independent deployments\r\n  - Easier environment variable management\r\n  - Both deployments count toward free tier quota\r\n\r\n- ❌ **Single project with routing** - NOT recommended\r\n  - Complex routing configuration\r\n  - Harder to manage separate domains\r\n  - No benefit on free tier\r\n\r\n## Debugging Build Failures\r\n\r\n**Issue: \"No Next.js version detected\"**\r\n\r\n**Cause:** Root Directory not configured for monorepo\r\n\r\n**Fix:** Set Root Directory to subdirectory path via Vercel dashboard (see Pattern 5)\r\n\r\n**Issue: Module not found**\r\n\r\nFix: Verify workspace dependencies installed, check tsconfig paths\r\n\r\n**Issue: Environment variable undefined**\r\n\r\nFix: Add to Vercel dashboard, redeploy\r\n\r\n**Issue: Build timeout**\r\n\r\nFix: Optimize build time, increase timeout in Vercel settings\r\n\r\n## References\r\n\r\n- Vercel docs: https://vercel.com/docs\r\n- Next.js deployment: https://nextjs.org/docs/deployment\r\n- Monorepo deployment: https://vercel.com/docs/concepts/monorepos\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T15:24:38.820Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing streamlined Next.js deployment to Vercel.","zh":"非常适合需要将 Next.js 应用简化部署到 Vercel 的全栈智能体。","ja":"Vercel への Next.js の効率的なデプロイを必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Vercel로의 간소화된 Next.js 배포가 필요한 풀 스택 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full Stack que necesitan una implementación optimizada de Next.js en Vercel.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''un déploiement rationalisé de Next.js sur Vercel.","de":"Perfekt für Full Stack Agents, die eine optimierte Next.js-Bereitstellung auf Vercel benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de uma implantação simplificada de Next.js para a Vercel.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Full Stack агентов, которым требуется упрощённое развертывание Next.js в Vercel.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء Full Stack الذين يحتاجون إلى نشر مبسط لتطبيقات Next.js على Vercel."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Vercel deployments for Next.js 15 apps, configure environment variables, and set up custom domains using Vercel projects, enabling efficient preview deployments for PRs and production deployments on the main branch.","zh":"赋能智能体自动化 Next.js 15 应用的 Vercel 部署、配置环境变量以及使用 Vercel 项目设置自定义域，从而为 PR 实现高效的预览部署并在主分支上进行生产部署。","ja":"Next.js 15 アプリの Vercel デプロイの自動化、環境変数の設定、Vercel プロジェクトを使用したカスタムドメインの設定を可能にし、PR のための効率的なプレビューデプロイとメインブランチでの本番デプロイを実現します。","ko":"Next.js 15 앱의 Vercel 배포 자동화, 환경 변수 구성, Vercel 프로젝트를 사용한 사용자 정의 도메인 설정을 통해 에이전트를 강화하여 PR을 위한 효율적인 프리뷰 배포와 메인 브랜치의 프로덕션 배포를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar las implementaciones en Vercel para aplicaciones Next.js 15, configurar variables de entorno y establecer dominios personalizados utilizando proyectos de Vercel, lo que permite implementaciones de vista previa eficientes para PRs e implementaciones de producción en la rama principal.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les déploiements Vercel pour les applications Next.js 15, de configurer les variables d''environnement et de mettre en place des domaines personnalisés en utilisant les projets Vercel, permettant ainsi des déploiements de prévisualisation efficaces pour les PR et des déploiements en production sur la branche principale.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents die Automatisierung von Vercel-Bereitstellungen für Next.js 15-Apps, die Konfiguration von Umgebungsvariablen und die Einrichtung benutzerdefinierter Domains mithilfe von Vercel-Projekten, was effiziente Preview-Bereitstellungen für PRs und Produktionsbereitstellungen auf dem Main Branch ermöglicht.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a automatizar implantações na Vercel para aplicativos Next.js 15, configurar variáveis de ambiente e configurar domínios personalizados usando projetos Vercel, permitindo implantações de visualização eficientes para PRs e implantações de produção no branch principal.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать развертывание в Vercel для приложений Next.js 15, настраивать переменные окружения и настраивать пользовательские домены с использованием проектов Vercel, обеспечивая эффективные предпросмотровые развертывания для PR и рабочие развертывания на основной ветке.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من أتمتة عمليات النشر على Vercel لتطبيقات Next.js 15، وتهيئة متغيرات البيئة، وإعداد النطاقات المخصصة باستخدام مشاريع Vercel، مما يتيح عمليات نشر فعالة للمعاينة لطلبات السحب (PRs) وعمليات النشر للإنتاج على الفرع الرئيسي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Next.js app deployments to Vercel","Configuring environment variables for separate Vercel projects","Debugging build failures in Vercel deployments","Setting up custom domains for production environments"],"zh":["自动化 Next.js 应用部署到 Vercel","为独立的 Vercel 项目配置环境变量","调试 Vercel 部署中的构建失败","为生产环境设置自定义域"],"ja":["Next.js アプリの Vercel へのデプロイ自動化","個別の Vercel プロジェクトの環境変数設定","Vercel デプロイにおけるビルド失敗のデバッグ","本番環境のカスタムドメイン設定"],"ko":["Next.js 앱을 Vercel로 배포 자동화","별도의 Vercel 프로젝트에 대한 환경 변수 구성","Vercel 배포에서 빌드 실패 디버깅","프로덕션 환경을 위한 사용자 정의 도메인 설정"],"es":["Automatización de implementaciones de aplicaciones Next.js en Vercel","Configuración de variables de entorno para proyectos separados de Vercel","Depuración de fallos de compilación en implementaciones de Vercel","Configuración de dominios personalizados para entornos de producción"],"fr":["Automatisation des déploiements d''applications Next.js sur Vercel","Configuration des variables d''environnement pour des projets Vercel distincts","Débogage des échecs de build dans les déploiements Vercel","Mise en place de domaines personnalisés pour les environnements de production"],"de":["Automatisierung von Next.js-App-Bereitstellungen auf Vercel","Konfigurieren von Umgebungsvariablen für separate Vercel-Projekte","Debugging von Build-Fehlern in Vercel-Bereitstellungen","Einrichten benutzerdefinierter Domains für Produktionsumgebungen"],"pt":["Automatizando implantações de aplicativos Next.js na Vercel","Configurando variáveis de ambiente para projetos Vercel separados","Depurando falhas de build em implantações da Vercel","Configurando domínios personalizados para ambientes de produção"],"ru":["Автоматизация развертывания приложений Next.js в Vercel","Настройка переменных окружения для отдельных проектов Vercel","Отладка сбоев сборки при развертывании в Vercel","Настройка пользовательских доменов для рабочих сред"],"ar":["أتمتة نشر تطبيقات Next.js على Vercel","تهيئة متغيرات البيئة لمشاريع Vercel منفصلة","تصحيح أعطال البناء في عمليات النشر على Vercel","إعداد نطاقات مخصصة لبيئات الإنتاج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vercel account and project setup","Specific to Next.js 15 apps","Needs separate Vercel projects for each app"],"zh":["需要 Vercel 账户和项目设置","特定于 Next.js 15 应用","每个应用都需要单独的 Vercel 项目"],"ja":["Vercel アカウントとプロジェクトの設定が必要","Next.js 15 アプリに特化","アプリごとに個別の Vercel プロジェクトが必要"],"ko":["Vercel 계정 및 프로젝트 설정 필요","Next.js 15 앱에 특화됨","각 앱마다 별도의 Vercel 프로젝트 필요"],"es":["Requiere cuenta de Vercel y configuración del proyecto","Específico para aplicaciones Next.js 15","Necesita proyectos separados de Vercel para cada aplicación"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Vercel et une configuration de projet","Spécifique aux applications Next.js 15","Nécessite des projets Vercel distincts pour chaque application"],"de":["Erfordert ein Vercel-Konto und Projekteinrichtung","Spezifisch für Next.js 15-Apps","Benötigt separate Vercel-Projekte für jede App"],"pt":["Requer conta Vercel e configuração de projeto","Específico para aplicativos Next.js 15","Necessita de projetos Vercel separados para cada aplicativo"],"ru":["Требует наличия учетной записи Vercel и настройки проекта","Специфично для приложений Next.js 15","Требует отдельных проектов Vercel для каждого приложения"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب Vercel وإعداد المشروع","مخصص لتطبيقات Next.js 15","يحتاج إلى مشاريع Vercel منفصلة لكل تطبيق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1a83a88fc484bdd3d07b1b88d6065b957609ae3e28b6ba30266ad51af084699f","qualityScore":36}');
