outils de développement tels que React et Node.js"],"de":["Umwandlung von Werbeideen in Teilnahme-Plattformen","Integration mit KI-Technologien","Entwicklung von maßgeschneiderten Teilnahme-Plattformen","Datenanalyse und Teilnahme-Metriken","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js"],"pt":["Transformação de ideias publicitárias em plataformas de participação","Integração com tecnologias de IA","Criação de experiências de usuário personalizadas","Análise de dados para otimização de campanhas","Integração com plataformas de mídia social"],"ru":["Преобразование пассивных рекламных идей в платформы для участия","Интеграция с технологиями ИИ","Создание персонализированных пользовательских опытов","Анализ данных для оптимизации кампаний","Интеграция с платформами социальных сетей"],"ar":["تحويل الأفكار الإعلانية إلى منصات مشاركة قوية","التكامل مع تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء تجارب مستخدم شخصي","تحليل البيانات لتحسين الحملات","التكامل مع منصات وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","会话流程优化","广告参与度提升","如何使用AI智能代理","Session Workflow会话工作流","AI智能代理安装","AI智能代理设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","セッションワークフロー","参加型プラットフォーム","AIエージェントの使い方","セッションの流れを最適化","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","세션 워크플로우","참여형 플랫폼","AI 에이전트 사용법","세션의 흐름을 최적화","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo utilizar herramientas de AI","qué es un traductor de participación","alternativas a traductores de participación","traductores de participación vs herramientas de marketing","instalación de traductores de participación","guía de configuración de traductores de participación","desarrollo de plataformas de participación con React","integración de herramientas de AI con Node.js"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un traducteur de participation","alternatives à des traducteurs de participation","traducteurs de participation vs outils de marketing","installation de traducteurs de participation","guide de configuration de traducteurs de participation","développement de plateformes de participation avec React","intégration d''outils d''IA avec Node.js"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist ein Teilnahme-Übersetzer","Alternativen zu Teilnahme-Übersetzern","Teilnahme-Übersetzer vs Marketing-Tools","Installation von Teilnahme-Übersetzern","Konfigurationsanleitung für Teilnahme-Übersetzer","Entwicklung von Teilnahme-Plattformen mit React","Integration von KI-Tools mit Node.js"],"pt":["como usar Participation Translator","o que é Participation Translator","Participation Translator alternativa","Participation Translator vs outras ferramentas","instalar Participation Translator","guia de configuração do Participation Translator","ferramentas de IA para marketing","plataformas de participação"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент Participation Translator","что такое ИИ Агент Participation Translator","ИИ Агент Participation Translator альтернатива","ИИ Агент Participation Translator vs другие инструменты","установить ИИ Агент Participation Translator","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента Participation Translator","инструменты ИИ для маркетинга","платформы для участия"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مترجم المشاركة","ما هو مترجم المشاركة","بديل مترجم المشاركة","مترجم المشاركة مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت مترجم المشاركة","دليل إعداد مترجم المشاركة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتسويق","منصات المشاركة"]}},"owner":"Absolute-Space-GHCP","repo":"leo-participation-translator","repoPath":"Absolute-Space-GHCP/leo-participation-translator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T01:58:23.401Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"session-workflow","description":"Session management including startup, wrap-up, and handoff procedures. Use when starting a new session, ending a session, creating session logs, or preparing handoff documentation.","bodyPreview":"# Session Workflow Skill\n\n## Session Start Checklist\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Verify workspace\n- [ ] Step 2: Check git status\n- [ ] Step 3: Review TASKS.md priorities\n- [ ] Step 4: Check claude-mem status\n- [ ] Step 5: Validate API keys & services\n- [ ] Step 6: Verify dev server (if needed)\n```\n\n### Step 1: Verify Workspace\n\n```bash\n# Confirm correct workspace\npwd\n# Expected: /Users/charleymm/Projects/leo-participation-translator\n\n# Verify it''s the right project\nls CLAUDE.md PLAN.md TAS","body":"# Session Workflow Skill\n\n## Session Start Checklist\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Verify workspace\n- [ ] Step 2: Check git status\n- [ ] Step 3: Review TASKS.md priorities\n- [ ] Step 4: Check claude-mem status\n- [ ] Step 5: Validate API keys & services\n- [ ] Step 6: Verify dev server (if needed)\n```\n\n### Step 1: Verify Workspace\n\n```bash\n# Confirm correct workspace\npwd\n# Expected: /Users/charleymm/Projects/leo-participation-translator\n\n# Verify it''s the right project\nls CLAUDE.md PLAN.md TASKS.md\n```\n\n### Step 2: Check Git Status\n\n```bash\ngit status\ngit fetch origin main\ngit log HEAD..origin/main --oneline  # Check if behind\n```\n\n### Step 3: Review Priorities\n\nRead `TASKS.md` to identify current priorities and in-progress tasks.\n\n### Step 4: Check Claude-Mem\n\n```bash\ncurl -s http://127.0.0.1:37777/api/readiness\n# Expected: {\"status\":\"ready\",\"mcpReady\":true}\n```\n\n### Step 5: Validate API Keys & Services\n\nRun these checks to verify all external dependencies are healthy:\n\n```bash\n# --- GCP Authentication ---\ngcloud auth application-default print-access-token > /dev/null 2>&1 \\\n  && echo \"âœ… GCP auth valid\" || echo \"âŒ GCP auth expired â€” run: gcloud auth login --update-adc\"\n\n# --- Exa.ai API Key ---\nEXA_KEY=$(grep \"EXA_API_KEY\" app/.env.local | cut -d''='' -f2)\nEXA_STATUS=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" -X POST \"https://api.exa.ai/search\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -H \"x-api-key: $EXA_KEY\" \\\n  -d ''{\"query\":\"test\",\"numResults\":1}'')\n[ \"$EXA_STATUS\" = \"200\" ] && echo \"âœ… Exa.ai key valid\" || echo \"âŒ Exa.ai key INVALID ($EXA_STATUS) â€” rotate at dashboard.exa.ai\"\n\n# --- Tavily API Key ---\nTAVILY_KEY=$(grep \"TAVILY_API_KEY\" app/.env.local | cut -d''='' -f2)\nTAVILY_STATUS=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" -X POST \"https://api.tavily.com/search\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\\\"api_key\\\":\\\"$TAVILY_KEY\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"test\\\",\\\"max_results\\\":1}\")\n[ \"$TAVILY_STATUS\" = \"200\" ] && echo \"âœ… Tavily key valid\" || echo \"âŒ Tavily key INVALID ($TAVILY_STATUS) â€” check app.tavily.com\"\n\n# --- Anthropic API Key ---\nANTHROPIC_KEY=$(grep \"ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\" app/.env.local | cut -d''='' -f2)\nANTHROPIC_STATUS=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" \"https://api.anthropic.com/v1/models\" \\\n  -H \"x-api-key: $ANTHROPIC_KEY\" -H \"anthropic-version: 2023-06-01\")\n[ \"$ANTHROPIC_STATUS\" = \"200\" ] && echo \"âœ… Anthropic key valid\" || echo \"âŒ Anthropic key INVALID ($ANTHROPIC_STATUS)\"\n\n# --- Cloud Run (production) ---\nPROD_STATUS=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" \\\n  \"https://participation-translator-897334523591.us-central1.run.app/login\")\n[ \"$PROD_STATUS\" = \"200\" ] && echo \"âœ… Cloud Run healthy\" || echo \"âŒ Cloud Run issue ($PROD_STATUS)\"\n```\n\n### Step 6: Verify Dev Server (if needed)\n\n```bash\ncd app && npx next dev --port 3005\n# Verify: curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" http://localhost:3005/api/stats\n```\n\n---\n\n## Session End Checklist\n\n```\nTask Progress:\n- [ ] Step 1: Update TASKS.md\n- [ ] Step 2: Create session log\n- [ ] Step 3: Commit changes\n- [ ] Step 4: Push to remote\n- [ ] Step 5: Create handoff\n```\n\n### Step 1: Update TASKS.md\n\nMark completed tasks, update progress percentages.\n\n### Step 2: Create Session Log\n\nCreate `sessions/SESSION_{DATE}_{VERSION}.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Session Summary: Participation Translator vX.X.X\n\n**Date:** YYYY-MM-DD\n**Duration:** X hours\n\n## What Was Done\n\n- [Key accomplishment 1]\n- [Key accomplishment 2]\n\n## Files Changed\n\n- `file1.ts` - Description\n- `file2.md` - Description\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. [Priority task 1]\n2. [Priority task 2]\n```\n\n### Step 3: Commit Changes\n\n```bash\ngit add -A\ngit commit -m \"feat(vX.X.X): brief description of changes\"\n```\n\n### Step 4: Push to Remote\n\n```bash\n# Archive remote first if it has diverged\ngit fetch origin main\ngit log HEAD..origin/main --oneline\n# If empty, safe to push\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n### Step 5: Create Handoff\n\nProvide handoff summary in conversation:\n\n```\n## Participation Translator Handoff\n\n**Session End**: {datetime}\n**Version**: {version}\n\n### What Was Done\n- [Key items]\n\n### Current State\n- Git: Clean/Dirty\n- Phase: 0/1/2/etc\n\n### Next Steps\n1. [Priority 1]\n2. [Priority 2]\n\n### Quick Commands\nnpm run dev\nnpm test\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference Commands\n\n| Task            | Command                                     |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Check workspace | `pwd`                                       |\n| Git status      | `git status`                                |\n| Run dev server  | `cd app && npx next dev --port 3005`        |\n| Run tests       | `npm test`                                  |\n| Build           | `cd app && npm run build`                   |\n| Type check      | `cd app && npx tsc --noEmit`                |\n| Deploy          | `cd app && gcloud run deploy participation-translator --source . --region us-central1 --project participation-translator --allow-unauthenticated` |\n| Production URL  | `https://participation-translator-897334523591.us-central1.run.app` |\n\n---\n\nAuthor: Charley Scholz, JLAI\nCo-authored: Claude Opus 4.6, Cursor (IDE)\nLast Updated: 2026-02-13\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T03:20:55.301Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured session management and workflow automation.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化会话管理和工作流自动化的开发代理。","ja":"構造化されたセッション管理とワークフローの自動化が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 세션 관리와 워크플로 자동화가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una gestión de sesiones estructurada y automatización de flujos de trabajo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une gestion de sessions structurée et d''une automatisation de flux de travail.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine strukturierte Sitzungsverwaltung und eine Workflow-Automatisierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de sessão estruturado e automação de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходимы структурированное управление сессиями и автоматизация рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطويين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة جلسة منظمة وتأتمتية للتدفقات العملية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline development workflows using git, API key validation, and Claude memory status checks, ensuring a verified workspace and prioritized task management via TASKS.md.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 git、API 密钥验证和 Claude 内存状态检查来简化开发工作流的能力，确保验证后的工作空间和通过 TASKS.md 进行的任务管理。","ja":"git、API キーの検証、Claude メモリ状態のチェックを使用して開発ワークフローを簡素化することで、エージェントが検証されたワークスペースと TASKS.md を介した優先順位付けされたタスク管理を可能にします。","ko":"git, API 키 유효성 검사, Claude 메모리 상태 확인을 사용하여 개발 워크플로를 간소화함으로써 에이전트가 검증된 작업 공간과 TASKS.md를 통해 우선 순위가 지정된 작업 관리를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar los flujos de trabajo de desarrollo utilizando git, validación de claves de API y comprobaciones de estado de memoria de Claude, garantizando un espacio de trabajo verificado y una gestión de tareas priorizada a través de TASKS.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les flux de travail de développement en utilisant git, la validation des clés d''API et les vérifications de l''état de mémoire de Claude, garantissant un espace de travail vérifié et une gestion de tâches priorisée via TASKS.md.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Entwicklungsmittel-Workflows mithilfe von git, API-Schlüsselvalidierung und Claude-Speicherstatusprüfungen zu optimieren, um einen verifizierten Arbeitsbereich und eine priorisierte Aufgabenverwaltung über TASKS.md sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar os fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento usando git, validação de chaves de API e verificações de status de memória do Claude, garantindo um espaço de trabalho verificado e gerenciamento de tarefas prioritárias via TASKS.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать рабочие процессы разработки с помощью git, проверки ключей API и проверок состояния памяти Claude, обеспечивая проверенную рабочую среду и приоритетное управление задачами через TASKS.md.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحسين سير عمل التطوير باستخدام git و검증 مفتاح API وفحوصات حالة ذاكرة Claude، مما يضمن بيئة عمل محققة وإدارة مهام ذات أولوية من خلال TASKS.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing development environments","Validating API keys and services","Prioritizing tasks based on TASKS.md"],"zh":["初始化开发环境","验证 API 密钥和服务","基于 TASKS.md 优先级任务"],"ja":["開発環境の初期化","API キーとサービスの検証","TASKS.md に基づくタスクの優先順位付け"],"ko":["개발 환경 초기화","API 키 및 서비스 유효성 검사","TASKS.md 기반 작업 우선 순위 지정"],"es":["Inicialización de entornos de desarrollo","Validación de claves de API y servicios","Priorización de tareas en función de TASKS.md"],"fr":["Initialisation des environnements de développement","Validation des clés d''API et des services","Priorisation des tâches en fonction de TASKS.md"],"de":["Initialisierung von Entwicklungsumgebungen","Validierung von API-Schlüsseln und Diensten","Priorisierung von Aufgaben basierend auf TASKS.md"],"pt":["Inicialização de ambientes de desenvolvimento","Validação de chaves de API e serviços","Priorização de tarefas com base em TASKS.md"],"ru":["Инициализация среды разработки","Проверка ключей API и сервисов","Приоритизация задач на основе TASKS.md"],"ar":["تشرين بيئات التطوير"," التحقق من مفتاح API والخدمات","التحديد الأولوي ل المهام بناءً على TASKS.md"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git installation","Claude memory status access needed","API key validation dependencies"],"zh":["需要 git 安装","需要 Claude 内存状态访问","API 密钥验证依赖"],"ja":["git のインストールが必要","Claude メモリ状態へのアクセスが必要","API キーの検証依存"],"ko":["git 설치가 필요함","Claude 메모리 상태 액세스가 필요함","API 키 유효성 검사 의존"],"es":["Requiere instalación de git","Se necesita acceso al estado de memoria de Claude","Dependencias de validación de claves de API"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de git","L''accès à l''état de mémoire de Claude est nécessaire","Dépendances de validation des clés d''API"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von git","Zugriff auf den Speicherstatus von Claude ist erforderlich","Abhängigkeiten von API-Schlüsselvalidierungen"],"pt":["Requer instalação do git","Acesso ao status de memória do Claude necessário","Dependências de validação de chaves de API"],"ru":["Требуется установка git","Необходим доступ к состоянию памяти Claude","Зависимости проверки ключей API"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت git","تحتاج إلى الوصول إلى حالة ذاكرة Claude","اعتمادات التحقق من مفتاح API"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"aca15f63d27dcf7f9250e0c80c3bad6c76927d3237a378d15eee377dfc2cbcef","qualityScore":36}');
