,"Iteración y mejora","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Sélection d''outils d''IA","Flux de travail de développement","Tests et débogage","Déploiement d''applications","Itération et amélioration","Intégration avec des outils de développement"],"de":["Auswahl von KI-Tools","Entwicklungsworkflow","Tests und Debugging","Bereitstellung von Anwendungen","Iteration und Verbesserung","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Seleção de ferramentas de código","Fluxo de trabalho de construção personalizado","Integração com IA para desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Otimização do ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento de software","Suporte para fundadores não técnicos"],"ru":["Выбор инструментов кодирования","Пользовательский рабочий процесс построения","Интеграция с ИИ для разработки приложений","Оптимизация цикла разработки программного обеспечения","Поддержка нетехнических основателей"],"ar":["اختيار أدوات الكود","تدفق عمل بناء مخصص","التكامل مع الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير التطبيقات","تحسين دورة حياة تطوير البرمجيات","دعم المؤسسين غير التقنيين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SaaS应用构建","AI工具","开发工作流","MVP构建","代码优化","自动化测试","非技术创始人","快速开发"],"ja":["SaaSアプリケーションの構築","AIツール","開発ワークフロー","MVPの構築","コードの最適化","自動テスト","非技術的な創業者","迅速な開発"],"ko":["SaaS 애플리케이션 구축","AI 도구","개발 워크플로","MVP 구축","코드 최적화","자동 테스트","비기술 창업자","빠른 개발"],"es":["desarrollo de aplicaciones SaaS","herramientas de IA","ciclo de vida de desarrollo de software","construir aplicaciones","desarrollo de software","SaaS","IA","desarrollo de aplicaciones","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["développement d''applications SaaS","outils d''IA","cycle de vie de développement de logiciels","concevoir des applications","développement de logiciels","SaaS","IA","développement d''applications","outils de développement"],"de":["Entwicklung von SaaS-Anwendungen","KI-Tools","Lebenszyklus der Softwareentwicklung","Erstellen von Anwendungen","Softwareentwicklung","SaaS","KI","Anwendungsentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de aplicativos SaaS","IA para desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de código","ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento de software","fundadores não técnicos","construção de aplicativos com IA"],"ru":["разработка приложений SaaS","ИИ для разработки программного обеспечения","инструменты кодирования","цикл разработки программного обеспечения","нетехнические основатели","построение приложений с ИИ"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات SaaS","الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الكود","دورة حياة تطوير البرمجيات","المؤسسون غير التقنيين","بناء التطبيقات مع الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"whawkinsiv","repo":"solo-founder-superpowers","repoPath":"whawkinsiv/solo-founder-superpowers","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.668Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"build","description":"Use this skill when the user needs to build features with AI coding tools, choose between Claude Code, Lovable, Replit, or Cursor, write effective prompts for code generation, or iterate on AI-generated code. Covers tool selection, prompting strategies, and development workflows for non-technical founders.","bodyPreview":"# Build\n\n## Tool Selection\n\n**Starting from scratch?** → Lovable (fastest MVP)  \n**Existing codebase?** → Claude Code (best context)  \n**Learning to code?** → Replit (educational)  \n**Already code?** → Cursor (power features)\n\nSee [TOOLS.md](TOOLS.md) for detailed comparison.\n\n---\n\n## Build Workflow\n\n```\n- [ ] Start with spec (use scope skill)\n- [ ] Give spec to AI tool\n- [ ] Test happy path + edge cases\n- [ ] Give specific feedback on issues\n- [ ] Iterate (expect 2-4 rounds)\n- [ ] Deploy when w","body":"# Build\n\n## Tool Selection\n\n**Starting from scratch?** → Lovable (fastest MVP)  \n**Existing codebase?** → Claude Code (best context)  \n**Learning to code?** → Replit (educational)  \n**Already code?** → Cursor (power features)\n\nSee [TOOLS.md](TOOLS.md) for detailed comparison.\n\n---\n\n## Build Workflow\n\n```\n- [ ] Start with spec (use scope skill)\n- [ ] Give spec to AI tool\n- [ ] Test happy path + edge cases\n- [ ] Give specific feedback on issues\n- [ ] Iterate (expect 2-4 rounds)\n- [ ] Deploy when working\n```\n\n---\n\n## Giving AI Your Spec\n\n### Claude Code\n```\nBuild this feature: [paste spec]\n\nCodebase: React + TypeScript + Tailwind\nReference: src/components/Button.tsx for button patterns\n```\n\n### Lovable\n```\nBuild: [paste simplified spec focusing on outcome]\nMake it look like Linear (minimal, clean)\n```\n\n### Replit\n```\nCreate: [paste spec emphasizing what user sees]\nUse React. Keep simple.\n```\n\nSee [PROMPTS.md](PROMPTS.md) for patterns.\n\n---\n\n## Reviewing What AI Built\n\nTest, don''t just run:\n\n```\n- [ ] Looks right?\n- [ ] Happy path works?\n- [ ] Edge cases work?\n- [ ] Works on mobile?\n- [ ] Error messages clear?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Giving Feedback\n\n**Bad:** \"This doesn''t work\"  \n**Good:** \"Clicking ''Save'' does nothing. Expected: ''Saved!'' message\"\n\n**Template:**\n```\nWhat I tried: [action]\nExpected: [outcome]\nGot: [what happened]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Iteration Expectations\n\n**Normal:** 2-4 rounds per feature  \n**First build:** AI builds from spec, you find 3-5 issues  \n**Second build:** Fixes those, you find 1-2 more  \n**Third build:** Final polish\n\n**Stop when:**\n- Happy path works\n- Edge cases handled\n- Mobile works\n- No obvious bugs\n\n**Don''t iterate for:**\n- Perfection\n- Features beyond spec\n- Premature optimization\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| No spec | Use scope skill first |\n| \"Build a dashboard\" | Specify what''s on it |\n| Skip edge case testing | Try breaking it |\n| Accept without review | Always test |\n| Add features mid-build | Finish current feature first |\n| Fix code yourself | Describe problem, let AI fix |\n\n---\n\n## Right-Sizing Work\n\n**Too big:** \"Build entire app\"  \n**Too small:** \"Add one button\"  \n**Right:** \"Build user auth flow\" (1-3 hours)\n\n**Good chunks:**\n- User login/signup flow\n- Dashboard with 4 metrics\n- Settings page with profile editing\n\n---\n\n## When Stuck\n\n**AI keeps breaking things:**\n→ Break into smaller piece, start fresh session\n\n**Can''t figure out complex feature:**\n→ Ask: \"What''s simplest way?\" Accept simpler solution\n\n**Each fix breaks something else:**\n→ Stop. Ask: \"Better approach?\" Consider starting over\n\n---\n\n## Working with Existing Code\n\n```\nAdd [feature] to existing project.\n\nStack: [React, Next.js, etc]\nPatterns: Check src/components for examples\nStyle: Tailwind + custom design system\nFollow existing code style\n```\n\n---\n\n## Prompting Patterns\n\n**Reference existing:**\n```\nBuild Settings page.\nReference Dashboard page layout.\nUse same Card/Button components.\n```\n\n**Provide examples:**\n```\nPricing page with 3 tiers.\nLike Linear''s pricing - clean, minimal.\n```\n\n**Specify constraints:**\n```\nBuild profile page.\nMust work offline.\nLoad under 2 seconds.\nWCAG AA accessible.\n```\n\nSee [PROMPTS.md](PROMPTS.md) for more.\n\n---\n\n## Review for Non-Technical Founders\n\n**Check:**\n- Does it match spec?\n- Buttons work?\n- Forms validate?\n- Looks like design reference?\n- Works on mobile?\n- Error messages clear?\n\n**Don''t check:**\n- Code cleanliness\n- Optimization\n- \"Best practices\"\n\nAI handles code quality. You handle requirements.\n\n---\n\n## Success Looks Like\n\n✅ Features match specs  \n✅ 2-4 iterations (not 10+)  \n✅ Can explain what''s wrong  \n✅ Building faster each week\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:22:13.750Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain needing streamlined software development lifecycle management for SaaS applications","zh":"适用于 Claude Code、AutoGPT 和 LangChain 等 AI 代理，需要简化的软件开发生命周期管理，用于 SaaS 应用程序","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChain などの AI エージェントに適しており、SaaS アプリケーション向けのストリームライン化されたソフトウェア開発ライフサイクル管理が必要","ko":"Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, SaaS 애플리케이션을 위한简化된 소프트웨어 개발 생명주기 관리가 필요","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan una gestión del ciclo de vida de desarrollo de software optimizada para aplicaciones SaaS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain ayant besoin d''une gestion du cycle de vie de développement de logiciels rationalisée pour les applications SaaS","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine optimierte Software-Entwicklungslebenszyklusverwaltung für SaaS-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que necessitam de gestão do ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento de software simplificada para aplicações SaaS","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, которым требуется упрощенное управление жизненным циклом разработки программного обеспечения для приложений SaaS","ar":"مثالية لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة دورة حياة تطوير البرمجيات المبسطة للتطبيقات السحابية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage tools like Lovable, Replit, and Cursor for rapid MVP development, educational coding, and power feature implementation, streamlining the build workflow with spec-driven development, AI tool integration, and iterative testing using protocols like happy path and edge case analysis","zh":"赋予代理使用 Lovable、Replit 和 Cursor 等工具进行快速 MVP 开发、教育编码和功能实现，通过使用规范驱动开发、AI 工具集成和迭代测试等方式简化构建工作流，并使用诸如 happy path 和边缘情况分析等协议","ja":"Lovable、Replit、Cursor などのツールを使用して、迅速な MVP 開発、教育コーディング、機能実装を可能にし、ビルド ワークフローをストリームライン化するために、仕様駆動開発、AI ツール統合、反復テストなどの方法を使用し、happy path やエッジ ケース分析などのプロトコルを使用","ko":"Lovable, Replit, Cursor 등의 도구를 사용하여 빠른 MVP 개발, 교육 코딩, 기능 구현을 가능하게 하며, 빌드 워크플로우를簡化하기 위해 규격 주도 개발, AI 도구 통합, 반복 테스트 등의 방법을 사용하고, happy path 또는 에지 케이스 분석 등의 프로토콜을 사용","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar herramientas como Lovable, Replit y Cursor para un desarrollo de MVP rápido, codificación educativa y implementación de características potentes, racionalizando el flujo de trabajo de compilación con desarrollo basado en especificaciones, integración de herramientas de IA y pruebas iterativas utilizando protocolos como análisis de ruta feliz y caso límite","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser des outils comme Lovable, Replit et Cursor pour un développement de MVP rapide, une codification éducative et une mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités puissantes, en rationalisant le flux de travail de construction avec un développement basé sur des spécifications, une intégration d''outils d''IA et des tests itératifs en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''analyse de chemin heureux et d''analyse de cas limite","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Tools wie Lovable, Replit und Cursor für eine schnelle MVP-Entwicklung, Bildungscoding und leistungsstarke Funktionsimplementierung zu nutzen, indem sie den Build-Workflow mit spezifikationsgetriebenem Entwicklungsprozess, KI-Tool-Integration und iterativem Testen unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Happy-Path- und Edge-Case-Analyse rationalisieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar ferramentas como Lovable, Replit e Cursor para desenvolvimento rápido de MVP, codificação educacional e implementação de recursos poderosos, simplificando o fluxo de trabalho de compilação com desenvolvimento orientado por especificações, integração de ferramentas de IA e teste iterativo usando protocolos como análise de caminho feliz e caso de bordo","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать инструменты, такие как Lovable, Replit и Cursor, для быстрой разработки MVP, образовательного кодирования и реализации мощных функций, оптимизируя рабочий процесс сборки с помощью разработки, управляемой спецификациями, интеграции инструментов ИИ и итеративного тестирования с использованием протоколов, таких как анализ счастливого пути и краевого случая","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من أدوات مثل Lovable و Replit و Cursor من أجل تطوير MVP سريع والبرمجة التعليمية وتنفيذ ميزات قوية، وبذلك تُبسط تدفق العمل لبناء البرمجيات باستخدام تطوير مدفوع بالمواصفات وتكامل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي والاختبار التكراري باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تحليل المسار السعيد و تحليل الحالات الحدودية"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SaaS application builds with Lovable","Debugging existing codebases with Claude Code","Generating educational coding environments with Replit"],"zh":["使用 Lovable 自动化 SaaS 应用程序构建","使用 Claude Code 调试现有代码库","使用 Replit 生成教育编码环境"],"ja":["Lovable を使用して SaaS アプリケーションのビルドを自動化する","Claude Code を使用して既存のコードベースをデバッグする","Replit を使用して教育コーディング環境を生成する"],"ko":["Lovable을 사용하여 SaaS 애플리케이션 빌드를 자동화","Claude Code를 사용하여 기존 코드베이스를 디버깅","Replit을 사용하여 교육 코딩 환경을 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de aplicaciones SaaS con Lovable","Depuración de código existente con Claude Code","Generación de entornos de codificación educativa con Replit"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création d''applications SaaS avec Lovable","Débogage de codebases existantes avec Claude Code","Génération d''environnements de codage éducatif avec Replit"],"de":["Automatisierung von SaaS-Anwendungsbuilds mit Lovable","Fehlerbehebung in bestehenden Codebasen mit Claude Code","Erzeugung von Bildungscoding-Umgebungen mit Replit"],"pt":["Automatizar compilações de aplicações SaaS com Lovable","Depurar código existente com Claude Code","Gerar ambientes de codificação educacional com Replit"],"ru":["Автоматизировать сборку приложений SaaS с помощью Lovable","Отлаживать существующий код с помощью Claude Code","Генерировать образовательные среды кодирования с помощью Replit"],"ar":["تأتمتة بناء تطبيقات السحابة باستخدام Lovable","تصحيح أخطاء الكود الموجود باستخدام Claude Code","إنشاء بيئات برمجة تعليمية باستخدام Replit"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires AI tool access like Lovable, Replit, or Claude Code","Limited to SaaS application development"],"zh":["需要访问 AI 工具，如 Lovable、Replit 或 Claude Code","仅限 SaaS 应用程序开发"],"ja":["Lovable、Replit、または Claude Code などの AI ツールへのアクセスが必要","SaaS アプリケーション開発に限定"],"ko":["Lovable, Replit, Claude Code 등의 AI 도구 액세스가 필요","SaaS 애플리케이션 개발에 한정"],"es":["Requiere acceso a herramientas de IA como Lovable, Replit o Claude Code","Limitado a la desarrollo de aplicaciones SaaS"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à des outils d''IA comme Lovable, Replit ou Claude Code","Limité au développement d''applications SaaS"],"de":["Benötigt Zugang zu KI-Tools wie Lovable, Replit oder Claude Code","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von SaaS-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige acesso a ferramentas de IA como Lovable, Replit ou Claude Code","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicações SaaS"],"ru":["Требует доступа к инструментам ИИ, таким как Lovable, Replit или Claude Code","Ограничен разработкой приложений SaaS"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Lovable و Replit و Claude Code","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات السحابة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0c1f4469b5c1138e2f9e9bf2445362fb0efc9a284f0e2f9b2990521cf056e5f6","qualityScore":36}');
