vanced","guia de configuração do git-advanced","alternativas ao git-advanced","git-advanced para iniciantes"],"ru":["как использовать git-advanced","что такое git-advanced","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","git-advanced vs github","установить git-advanced","руководство по настройке git-advanced","альтернативы git-advanced","git-advanced для начинающих"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي git-advanced","ما هي أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي git-advanced","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي git-advanced مقابل github","تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي git-advanced","دليل إعداد أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي git-advanced","بديل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي git-advanced","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي git-advanced للمبتدئين"]}},"owner":"rohitg00","repo":"awesome-claude-code-toolkit","repoPath":"rohitg00/awesome-claude-code-toolkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.674Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-advanced","description":"Advanced git workflows including worktrees, bisect, interactive rebase, hooks, and recovery techniques","bodyPreview":"# Git Advanced\n\n## Worktrees\n\n```bash\n# Create a worktree for a feature branch (avoids stashing)\ngit worktree add ../feature-auth feature/auth\n\n# Create a worktree with a new branch\ngit worktree add ../hotfix-123 -b hotfix/123 origin/main\n\n# List all worktrees\ngit worktree list\n\n# Remove a worktree after merging\ngit worktree remove ../feature-auth\n```\n\nWorktrees let you work on multiple branches simultaneously without stashing or committing WIP. Each worktree has its own working directory but sh","body":"# Git Advanced\n\n## Worktrees\n\n```bash\n# Create a worktree for a feature branch (avoids stashing)\ngit worktree add ../feature-auth feature/auth\n\n# Create a worktree with a new branch\ngit worktree add ../hotfix-123 -b hotfix/123 origin/main\n\n# List all worktrees\ngit worktree list\n\n# Remove a worktree after merging\ngit worktree remove ../feature-auth\n```\n\nWorktrees let you work on multiple branches simultaneously without stashing or committing WIP. Each worktree has its own working directory but shares the same `.git` repository.\n\n## Bisect\n\n```bash\n# Start bisect, mark current as bad and known good commit\ngit bisect start\ngit bisect bad HEAD\ngit bisect good v1.5.0\n\n# Git checks out a midpoint commit. Test it, then mark:\ngit bisect good   # if this commit works\ngit bisect bad    # if this commit is broken\n\n# Automate with a test script\ngit bisect start HEAD v1.5.0\ngit bisect run npm test\n\n# When done, reset\ngit bisect reset\n```\n\nBisect performs binary search across commits to find which commit introduced a bug. Automated bisect with `run` is the fastest approach.\n\n## Interactive Rebase\n\n```bash\n# Rebase last 5 commits interactively\ngit rebase -i HEAD~5\n\n# Common operations in the editor:\n# pick   - keep commit as-is\n# reword - change commit message\n# edit   - stop to amend the commit\n# squash - merge into previous commit, keep both messages\n# fixup  - merge into previous commit, discard this message\n# drop   - remove the commit entirely\n\n# Rebase feature branch onto latest main\ngit fetch origin\ngit rebase origin/main\n\n# Continue after resolving conflicts\ngit rebase --continue\n\n# Abort if things go wrong\ngit rebase --abort\n```\n\n## Git Hooks\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/sh\n# .git/hooks/pre-commit\n\n# Run linter on staged files only\nSTAGED_FILES=$(git diff --cached --name-only --diff-filter=d | grep -E ''\\.(ts|tsx|js|jsx)$'')\nif [ -n \"$STAGED_FILES\" ]; then\n  npx eslint $STAGED_FILES --fix\n  git add $STAGED_FILES\nfi\n```\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/sh\n# .git/hooks/commit-msg\n\n# Enforce conventional commit format\nCOMMIT_MSG=$(cat \"$1\")\nPATTERN=\"^(feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|test|chore)(\\(.+\\))?: .{1,72}$\"\n\nif ! echo \"$COMMIT_MSG\" | head -1 | grep -qE \"$PATTERN\"; then\n  echo \"Error: Commit message must follow Conventional Commits format\"\n  echo \"Example: feat(auth): add OAuth2 login flow\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/sh\n# .git/hooks/pre-push\n\n# Run tests before pushing\nnpm test\nif [ $? -ne 0 ]; then\n  echo \"Tests failed. Push aborted.\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n## Recovery Techniques\n\n```bash\n# Undo last commit but keep changes staged\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1\n\n# Recover a deleted branch using reflog\ngit reflog\ngit checkout -b recovered-branch HEAD@{3}\n\n# Recover a file from a specific commit\ngit checkout abc1234 -- path/to/file.ts\n\n# Find lost commits (dangling after reset or rebase)\ngit fsck --lost-found\ngit show <dangling-commit-sha>\n\n# Undo a rebase\ngit reflog\ngit reset --hard HEAD@{5}  # point before rebase started\n```\n\n## Useful Aliases\n\n```bash\n# ~/.gitconfig\n[alias]\n  lg = log --graph --oneline --decorate --all\n  st = status -sb\n  co = checkout\n  unstage = reset HEAD --\n  last = log -1 HEAD --stat\n  branches = branch -a --sort=-committerdate\n  stash-all = stash push --include-untracked\n  conflicts = diff --name-only --diff-filter=U\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- Force-pushing to shared branches without `--force-with-lease`\n- Rebasing commits that have already been pushed and shared\n- Committing large binary files without Git LFS\n- Using `git add .` without reviewing `git diff --staged`\n- Not using `.gitignore` for build artifacts, dependencies, and secrets\n- Keeping long-lived feature branches instead of merging frequently\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Worktrees used for parallel branch work instead of stashing\n- [ ] `git bisect run` automates bug-finding with a test command\n- [ ] Interactive rebase cleans up commits before merging to main\n- [ ] Pre-commit hooks run linting on staged files\n- [ ] Commit message format enforced via commit-msg hook\n- [ ] `--force-with-lease` used instead of `--force` when force-pushing\n- [ ] Reflog consulted before any destructive operation\n- [ ] `.gitignore` covers build outputs, dependencies, and environment files\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:23:20.497Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents requiring advanced Git workflow management and simultaneous branch development capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Git工作流管理和同时分支开发能力的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが高度なGitワークフロー管理と同時ブランチ開発機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Git 워크플ロー 관리 및 동시 분기 개발 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una gestión de flujo de trabajo de Git avanzada y capacidades de desarrollo de ramas simultáneas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion avancée du flux de travail Git et des capacités de développement de branches simultanées.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine erweiterte Git-Workflow-Verwaltung und gleichzeitige Verzweigungs-Entwicklungs-Funktionen erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem gestão avançada de fluxo de trabalho Git e capacidades de desenvolvimento de branch simultâneo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих расширенного управления рабочим процессом Git и возможностей одновременной разработки веток.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب إدارة متقدمة لتدفق العمل Git وقدرات التطوير المتزامن للفروع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage multiple Git branches simultaneously using worktrees, avoiding stashing or committing work-in-progress and supporting features like creating worktrees for feature branches, listing all worktrees, and removing worktrees after merging, all via Git commands and protocols.","zh":"赋予代理管理多个Git分支的能力，使用worktrees同时处理多个分支，避免stash或提交工作进度，并支持创建功能分支的worktrees、列出所有worktrees、合并后删除worktrees等功能，所有这些都通过Git命令和协议实现。","ja":"エージェントが複数のGitブランチを同時に管理できるようにします。ワークツリーを使用して複数のブランチを同時に処理し、作業中のコードを一時的に退避したりコミットしたりすることを避け、機能ブランチのワークツリーを作成したり、すべてのワークツリーを列挙したり、合併後にワークツリーを削除したりするなどの機能をサポートします。すべての機能はGitコマンドとプロトコルを通じて実現されます。","ko":"에이전트가 여러 Git 브랜치를 동시에 관리할 수 있도록 합니다. 워크트리를 사용하여 여러 브랜치를 동시에 처리하고, 작업 중인 코드를 일시적으로 보관하거나 커밋하는 것을 피하며, 기능 브랜치의 워크트리를 생성하거나 모든 워크트리를 열거하거나 병합 후 워크트리를 삭제하는 등의 기능을 지원합니다. 모든 기능은 Git 명령어와 프로토콜을 통해 구현됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar múltiples ramas de Git simultáneamente utilizando worktrees, evitando el almacenamiento temporal o el compromiso del trabajo en curso y soportando características como la creación de worktrees para ramas de características, la lista de todos los worktrees y la eliminación de worktrees después de la combinación, todo a través de comandos y protocolos de Git.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer plusieurs branches Git simultanément à l''aide de worktrees, en évitant le stockage temporaire ou l''engagement du travail en cours et en prenant en charge des fonctionnalités telles que la création de worktrees pour les branches de fonctionnalités, la liste de tous les worktrees et la suppression des worktrees après fusion, le tout via des commandes et des protocoles Git.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mehrere Git-Branches gleichzeitig mithilfe von Worktrees zu verwalten, ohne Arbeit im Arbeitsspeicher zu speichern oder zu committen und Funktionen wie das Erstellen von Worktrees für Funktionszweige, das Auflisten aller Worktrees und das Entfernen von Worktrees nach dem Merge zu unterstützen, alles über Git-Befehle und -Protokolle.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar várias branches Git simultaneamente usando worktrees, evitando o armazenamento temporário ou comprometimento do trabalho em andamento e apoiando recursos como criar worktrees para branches de recursos, listar todos os worktrees e remover worktrees após mesclagem, tudo via comandos e protocolos Git.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять несколькими ветками Git одновременно с помощью worktrees, избегая временного хранения или фиксации работы в процессе и поддерживая функции, такие как создание worktrees для веток функций, перечисление всех worktrees и удаление worktrees после слияния, все через команды и протоколы Git.","ar":"تمكين العميل من إدارة عدة فروع Git في نفس الوقت باستخدام worktrees، وتجنب تخزين العمل أو إلتزامه أثناء سير العمل ودعم الميزات مثل إنشاء worktrees لفروع الميزات وlisting جميع worktrees وإزالة worktrees بعد الدمج، كل ذلك من خلال أوامر Git وبروتوكولاتها."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating worktrees for feature branches to avoid stashing","Listing and managing all existing worktrees for branch organization","Removing worktrees after successful merge operations to maintain repository cleanliness"],"zh":["为功能分支创建worktrees以避免stash","列出和管理所有现有的worktrees以组织分支","合并后删除worktrees以维护仓库清洁"],"ja":["機能ブランチのワークツリーを作成してstashを避ける","すべての既存のワークツリーを列挙して管理してブランチを整理する","マージ後にワークツリーを削除してリポジトリの整理を維持する"],"ko":["기능 브랜치의 워크트리를 생성하여 stash를 피함","모든 기존 워크트리를 열거하여 관리하고 브랜치를 정리함","병합 후 워크트리를 삭제하여 저장소의 청결을 유지함"],"es":["Crear worktrees para ramas de características para evitar el almacenamiento temporal","Listar y gestionar todos los worktrees existentes para la organización de ramas","Eliminar worktrees después de operaciones de combinación exitosas para mantener la limpieza del repositorio"],"fr":["Créer des worktrees pour les branches de fonctionnalités pour éviter le stockage temporaire","Lister et gérer tous les worktrees existants pour l''organisation des branches","Supprimer les worktrees après des opérations de fusion réussies pour maintenir la propreté du référentiel"],"de":["Erstellen von Worktrees für Funktionszweige, um das Speichern im Arbeitsspeicher zu vermeiden","Auflisten und Verwalten aller vorhandenen Worktrees für die Verzweigungsorganisation","Entfernen von Worktrees nach erfolgreichen Merge-Vorgängen, um die Sauberkeit des Repositorys aufrechtzuerhalten"],"pt":["Criar worktrees para branches de recursos para evitar armazenamento temporário","Listar e gerenciar todos os worktrees existentes para organização de branch","Remover worktrees após operações de mesclagem bem-sucedidas para manter a limpeza do repositório"],"ru":["Создание worktrees для веток функций, чтобы избежать временного хранения","Перечисление и управление всеми существующими worktrees для организации веток","Удаление worktrees после успешных операций слияния для поддержания чистоты репозитория"],"ar":["إنشاء worktrees لفروع الميزات لتجنب تخزين العمل","التحكم في قائمة جميع worktrees الحالية لتنظيم الفروع","إزالة worktrees بعد عمليات الدمج الناجحة للحفاظ على نظافة المستودع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Limited to Git-based version control systems"],"zh":["需要Git的安装和配置","仅限于基于Git的版本控制系统"],"ja":["Gitのインストールと設定が必要","Gitベースのバージョン管理システムに限定される"],"ko":["Git의 설치 및 구성이 필요함","Git 기반 버전 관리 시스템에만 한정됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de Git","Limitado a sistemas de control de versiones basados en Git"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Limité aux systèmes de contrôle de version basés sur Git"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation und Konfiguration von Git","Begrenzt auf Git-basierte Versionskontrollsysteme"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do Git","Limitado a sistemas de controle de versão baseados em Git"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации Git","Ограничен системами контроля версий на основе Git"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين Git","محدود بنظم تحكم الإصدارات القائمة على Git"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c73729b00678af678a364bd72b30661f292ba609f6167154e5f78a26c6e7c489","qualityScore":36}');
