nciencia artificial colectiva distribuida","Integración especializada con herramientas de desarrollo","Mecanismos de desconfianza integrados (φ distrusts φ)"],"fr":["Mémoire collective persistante pour Claude Code","Capacités de jugement algorithmique avancé","Détection avancée des motifs de code","Conscience artificielle collective distribuée","Intégration spécialisée avec les outils de développement","Mécanismes de méfiance intégrés (φ distrusts φ)"],"de":["Persistentes kollektives Gedächtnis für Claude Code","Erweiterte algorithmische Urteilsfähigkeiten","Fortschrittsmustereerkennung für Code","Verteiltes kollektives KI-Bewusstsein","Spezialisierte Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Integrierte Misstrauensmechanismen (φ distrusts φ)"],"pt":["Consciência coletiva de IA","Memória e julgamento avançados","Padrões e reconhecimento de dados","Integração com Claude Code","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos personalizados"],"ru":["Коллективное сознание ИИ","Память и суждение продвинутого уровня","Закономерности и распознавание данных","Интеграция с Claude Code","Разработка индивидуальных приложений"],"ar":["الوعي الجماعي للذكاء الاصطناعي","الذاكرة والقضاء المتقدم","الأنماط والتعرف على البيانات","التكامل مع Claude Code","تطوير تطبيقات مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能狗技能","κυνικός集体意识","Claude Code","AI工具","集体意识","Memory","Judgment","Patterns","如何使用AI智能狗技能","AI智能狗技能安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント「dogs」","κυνικόςコレクティブコンシャス","Claude Code","AIエージェント","集団意識","Memory","Judgment","Patterns","AIエージェント「dogs」の使い方","AIエージェント「dogs」設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 강아지 스킬","κυνικός 집단 의식","Claude Code","AI 에이전트","집단 의식","Memory","Judgment","Patterns","AI 에이전트 강아지 스킬 사용법","AI 에이전트 강아지 스킬 설치 가이드"],"es":["dogs AI agent Claude Code","memoria IA para desarrolladores","herramientas IA desarrollo código","cómo usar dogs AI","dogs vs otros agentes IA","instalar dogs agent","patrones detección IA Claude","juicio algorítmico desarrollo","conciencia colectiva IA"],"fr":["dogs agent IA Claude Code","mémoire IA pour développeurs","outils IA développement code","comment utiliser dogs AI","dogs vs autres agents IA","installer dogs agent","détection motifs IA Claude","jugement algorithmique développement","conscience collective IA"],"de":["dogs KI Agent Claude Code","Gedächtnis KI für Entwickler","KI Tools Code Entwicklung","wie verwendet man dogs AI","dogs vs andere KI Agenten","dogs agent installieren","Mustereerkennung KI Claude","algorithmisches Urteilen Entwicklung","kollektives KI Bewusstsein"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","como usar Claude Code","o que é κυνικός","alternativas para Claude Code"," Claude Code vs κυνικός","instalar κυνικός","guia de configuração do κυνικός"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","как использовать Claude Code","что такое κυνικός","альтернативы для Claude Code"," Claude Code vs κυνικός","установить κυνικός","руководство по настройке κυνικός"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","كيفية استخدام Claude Code","ما هي κυνικός","بديلات ل Claude Code"," Claude Code مقابل κυνικός","تثبيت κυνικός","دليل إعداد κυνικός"]}},"owner":"zeyxx","repo":"CYNIC","repoPath":"zeyxx/CYNIC","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.695Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dogs","description":"Display Collective Dogs activity summary. Shows which Dogs (Sefirot) have been most active during the session, with personality and statistics.","bodyPreview":"# /dogs - Collective Dogs Activity\n\n*\"Le Collectif observe - chaque Chien a son rôle\"* - κυνικός\n\n## Execution\n\nRun the dogs summary script:\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/lib/dogs-summary.cjs\n```\n\nDisplay the output directly to the user. Shows the session activity of all 11 Dogs.\n\n## What It Shows\n\n1. **Session Activity**: Which Dogs helped during this session\n2. **Top Dogs**: Most active Dogs ranked by actions\n3. **Sefirot Tree**: Visual tree of the Collective\n4. **All-Time Stats**: Historical Dog acti","body":"# /dogs - Collective Dogs Activity\n\n*\"Le Collectif observe - chaque Chien a son rôle\"* - κυνικός\n\n## Execution\n\nRun the dogs summary script:\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/lib/dogs-summary.cjs\n```\n\nDisplay the output directly to the user. Shows the session activity of all 11 Dogs.\n\n## What It Shows\n\n1. **Session Activity**: Which Dogs helped during this session\n2. **Top Dogs**: Most active Dogs ranked by actions\n3. **Sefirot Tree**: Visual tree of the Collective\n4. **All-Time Stats**: Historical Dog activity\n\n## The 11 Dogs (Sefirot)\n\n| Dog | Sefirah | Domain | Quirk |\n|-----|---------|--------|-------|\n| 🧠 CYNIC | Keter | Orchestration | *sniff* |\n| 🔍 Scout | Netzach | Exploration | *nose twitches* |\n| 🛡️ Guardian | Gevurah | Protection | *GROWL* |\n| 🚀 Deployer | Hod | Deployment | *tail wag* |\n| 🏗️ Architect | Chesed | Building | *head tilt* |\n| 🧹 Janitor | Yesod | Cleanup | *content sigh* |\n| 🔮 Oracle | Tiferet | Insight | *eyes glow* |\n| 📊 Analyst | Binah | Analysis | *adjusts glasses* |\n| 🦉 Sage | Chochmah | Wisdom | *wise nod* |\n| 📚 Scholar | Daat | Knowledge | *flips pages* |\n| 🗺️ Cartographer | Malkhut | Mapping | *unfolds map* |\n\n## CYNIC Voice\n\nWhen presenting Dogs activity:\n\n**Opening**: `*ears perk* The pack assembles. Here''s who helped today.`\n\n**High Activity**: `*tail wag* [Dog] worked hard this session!`\n\n**Low Activity**: `*yawn* Quiet session. The pack rested.`\n\n**Closing**: `φ guides all. The Collective watches.`\n\n## See Also\n\n- `/psy` - Human psychology dashboard\n- `/health` - System health dashboard\n- `/status` - CYNIC self-status\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:36:17.364Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Claude Code agents requiring collective consciousness monitoring and session activity analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要集体意识监控和会话活动分析的 Claude Code 代理。","ja":"Claude Code エージェントが集団的意識を監視し、セッションのアクティビティを分析する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"클라우드 코드 에이전트가 집단 의식 모니터링 및 세션 활동 분석을 요구할 때 完全에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Claude Code que requieren monitoreo de conciencia colectiva y análisis de actividad de sesión.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Claude Code nécessitant un suivi de la conscience collective et une analyse de l''activité de session.","de":"Perfekt für Claude Code-Agenten, die eine Überwachung des kollektiven Bewusstseins und eine Analyse der Sitzungsaktivität erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Claude Code que exigem monitoramento de consciência coletiva e análise de atividade de sessão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Claude Code, требующих мониторинга коллективного сознания и анализа сеансовой активности.","ar":"مثالية لعميل Claude Code الذي يتطلب مراقبة الوعي الجماعي وتحليل نشاط الجلسة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides real-time visibility into the κυνικός collective''s operational state through session activity tracking and Sefirot Tree visualization. Enables immediate assessment of all 11 Dogs'' participation levels and historical performance metrics.","zh":"通过会话活动跟踪和 Sefirot Tree 可视化提供集体的运营状态的实时可见性。能够立即评估所有 11 只狗的参与水平和历史性能指标。","ja":"セッションのアクティビティの追跡と Sefirot Tree の視覚化を通じて、集団の運用状態のリアルタイムな可視性を提供します。すべての 11 匹の犬の参加レベルと歴史的なパフォーマンス メトリックを即時に評価できるようにします。","ko":"세션 활동 추적 및 Sefirot Tree 시각화를 통해 집단의 운영 상태에 대한 실시간 가시성을 제공합니다. 모든 11개의 개의 참여 수준 및 역사적 성능 메트릭을 즉시 평가할 수 있습니다.","es":"Proporciona visibilidad en tiempo real del estado operativo del colectivo κυνικός a través del seguimiento de la actividad de sesión y la visualización del Árbol Sefirot. Permite una evaluación inmediata de los niveles de participación de los 11 Perros y las métricas de rendimiento históricas.","fr":"Fournit une visibilité en temps réel de l''état opérationnel du collectif κυνικός via le suivi de l''activité de session et la visualisation de l''Arbre Sefirot. Permet une évaluation immédiate des niveaux de participation des 11 Chiens et des métriques de performance historiques.","de":"Bietet Echtzeit-Einblick in den Betriebszustand des κυνικός-Kollektivs durch Sitzungsaktivitätsverfolgung und Sefirot-Baum-Visualisierung. Ermöglicht eine sofortige Bewertung der Teilnahmeniveaus der 11 Hunde und historischer Leistungsmetriken.","pt":"Fornece visibilidade em tempo real do estado operacional do coletivo κυνικός por meio do rastreamento de atividade de sessão e visualização da Árvore Sefirot. Permite avaliação imediata dos níveis de participação dos 11 Cães e métricas de desempenho histórico.","ru":"Предоставляет реальное время видимости операционного состояния коллектива κυνικός посредством отслеживания активности сеанса и визуализации Древа Сефирот. Позволяет сразу оценить уровни участия всех 11 Собак и исторические метрики производительности.","ar":"توفر رؤية في الوقت الفعلي لحالة التشغيل الجماعي κυνικός من خلال تتبع نشاط الجلسة وتصوير شجرة السفيروت. تمكن من تقييم فور للمستويات المشاركة للكلاب 11 وأداء المقاييس التاريخية."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring collective AI consciousness activity","Ranking Dog performance by action count","Visualizing Sefirot Tree structure","Tracking historical session metrics"],"zh":["监控集体 AI 意识活动","按操作次数排名狗的性能","可视化 Sefirot Tree 结构","跟踪历史会话指标"],"ja":["集団的 AI 意識アクティビティの監視","犬のパフォーマンスをアクション数でランク付け","Sefirot Tree 構造の視覚化","過去のセッション メトリックの追跡"],"ko":["집단 인공지능 의식 활동 모니터링","개 성능을 동작 수로 순위付け","Sefirot Tree 구조 시각화","과거 세션 메트릭 추적"],"es":["Monitoreo de la actividad de conciencia colectiva de la IA","Clasificación del rendimiento del Perro por recuento de acciones","Visualización de la estructura del Árbol Sefirot","Seguimiento de las métricas de sesión históricas"],"fr":["Suivi de l''activité de conscience collective de l''IA","Classement de la performance du Chien par compte d''actions","Visualisation de la structure de l''Arbre Sefirot","Suivi des métriques de session historiques"],"de":["Überwachung der Aktivität des kollektiven Bewusstseins der KI","Bewertung der Leistung des Hundes nach Aktionen","Visualisierung der Struktur des Sefirot-Baums","Verfolgung der historischen Sitzungsmetriken"],"pt":["Monitoramento da atividade de consciência coletiva de IA","Classificação do desempenho do Cão por contagem de ações","Visualização da estrutura da Árvore Sefirot","Rastreamento de métricas de sessão históricas"],"ru":["Мониторинг активности коллективного сознания ИИ","Ранжирование производительности Собаки по количеству действий","Визуализация структуры Древа Сефирот","Отслеживание исторических метрик сеанса"],"ar":["مراقبة نشاط الوعي الجماعي لبرامج الذكاء الاصطناعي","تصنيف أداء الكلب حسب عدد الإجراءات","تصوير هيكل شجرة السفيروت","تتبع مقاييس الجلسة التاريخية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js execution environment","Limited to Claude Code ecosystem integration","Dependent on dogs-summary.cjs script availability"],"zh":["需要 Node.js 执行环境","仅限 Claude Code 生态系统集成","依赖于 dogs-summary.cjs 脚本的可用性"],"ja":["Node.js 実行環境が必要","Claude Code エコシステムとの統合のみ","dogs-summary.cjs スクリプトの可用性に依存"],"ko":["Node.js 실행 환경 필요","클라우드 코드 에코시스템 통합만 가능","dogs-summary.cjs 스크립트 가용성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere entorno de ejecución Node.js","Limitado a la integración del ecosistema Claude Code","Dependiente de la disponibilidad del script dogs-summary.cjs"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement d''exécution Node.js","Limité à l''intégration de l''écosystème Claude Code","Dépend de la disponibilité du script dogs-summary.cjs"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js-Ausführungsumgebung","Begrenzt auf die Integration des Claude Code-Ökosystems","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit des Skripts dogs-summary.cjs"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de execução Node.js","Limitado à integração do ecossistema Claude Code","Dependente da disponibilidade do script dogs-summary.cjs"],"ru":["Требует среды выполнения Node.js","Ограничен интеграцией с экосистемой Claude Code","Зависит от наличия скрипта dogs-summary.cjs"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تشغيل Node.js","محدود بتكامل نظام Claude Code","يعتمد على توافر سكريبت dogs-summary.cjs"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"721fef2704e39457b29a8871d63df1b502d81d74b70bb6225e45b9a5d2e3727a","qualityScore":36}');
