 avec LangGraph","Stockage de vecteurs avec Supabase","Compatibilité avec Vercel AI SDK","Déploiement d''applications avec LangChain.js","Outils de récupération de données avancés"],"de":["Integration mit LangGraph","Vektorspeicherung mit Supabase","Kompatibilität mit Vercel AI SDK","Bereitstellung von Anwendungen mit LangChain.js","Erweiterte Datenrückgewinnungstools"],"pt":["Integração com LangGraph","Suporte a Supabase vector store","Utilização do Vercel AI SDK","Build e deploy de aplicativos","Ferramenta de IA para desenvolvedores","LangChain.js para desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["Интеграция с LangGraph","Поддержка Supabase vector store","Использование Vercel AI SDK","Построение и развертывание приложений","Инструмент ИИ для разработчиков","LangChain.js для разработки приложений"],"ar":["التكامل مع لانجغراف","دعم مخزن متجه سوبربايز","استخدام فيرسيل آي إس دي كي","بناء وتوزيع التطبيقات","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للمطورين","لانجشين جافاسكريبت لتطوير التطبيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","LangChain.js","LangGraph","Supabase","Vercel AI SDK","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理的应用","LangChain.js教程","LangGraph使用指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","LangChain.js","LangGraph","Supabase","Vercel AI SDK","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントの応用","LangChain.jsチュートリアル","LangGraphの使い方"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","LangChain.js","LangGraph","Supabase","Vercel AI SDK","AI 에이전트의 사용법","AI 에이전트의 적용","LangChain.js 튜토리얼","LangGraph의 사용법"],"es":["cómo usar LangChain.js","qué es un agente de herramientas AI","alternativas a LangChain.js","LangChain.js vs Supabase","instalación de LangChain.js","guía de configuración de LangChain.js"],"fr":["comment utiliser LangChain.js","qu''est-ce qu''un outil IA","alternatives à LangChain.js","LangChain.js vs Supabase","installation de LangChain.js","guide de configuration de LangChain.js"],"de":["wie man LangChain.js verwendet","was ist ein KI-Tool","Alternativen zu LangChain.js","LangChain.js vs Supabase","Installation von LangChain.js","Konfigurationsanleitung für LangChain.js"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","langchain js","build e deploy","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","supabase vector store","vercel ai sdk","como usar langchain js","o que é langchain js","langchain js vs outros","guias de instalação langchain js"],"ru":["инструменты ии","langchain js","построение и развертывание","разработка приложений","supabase vector store","vercel ai sdk","как использовать langchain js","что такое langchain js","langchain js vs другие","руководства по установке langchain js"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","لانجشين جافاسكريبت","بناء وتوزيع","تطوير التطبيقات","مخزن متجه سوبربايز","فيرسيل آي إس دي كي","كيفية استخدام لانجشين جافاسكريبت","ما هو لانجشين جافاسكريبت","لانجشين جافاسكريبت مقارنة بالآخرين","دليل تثبيت لانجشين جافاسكريبت"]}},"owner":"rebyteai-template","repo":"langchain-retrieval-agent","repoPath":"rebyteai-template/langchain-retrieval-agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.696Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"build-and-deploy","description":"Build and deploy this Next.js LangChain retrieval agent application with Supabase vector store. Use when building, deploying, setting up vector store, or preparing the project for production.","bodyPreview":"# Build and Deploy LangChain Retrieval Agent\n\n> **CRITICAL: For Vercel, you MUST use `vercel build --prod` then `vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod`.**\n> Do NOT use `vercel --prod` or `vercel deploy --prod` directly - these will fail due to Git author permission issues in VM environments.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Setup Environment Variables\n\n**Read `.env.example` to see all required variables:**\n\n```bash\ncat .env.example\n```\n\n**Create `.env` by reading values from current environment:**\n\nFor each varia","body":"# Build and Deploy LangChain Retrieval Agent\n\n> **CRITICAL: For Vercel, you MUST use `vercel build --prod` then `vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod`.**\n> Do NOT use `vercel --prod` or `vercel deploy --prod` directly - these will fail due to Git author permission issues in VM environments.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Setup Environment Variables\n\n**Read `.env.example` to see all required variables:**\n\n```bash\ncat .env.example\n```\n\n**Create `.env` by reading values from current environment:**\n\nFor each variable in `.env.example`, read the value from the current environment and write to `.env`. Example approach:\n\n```bash\n# Read .env.example and create .env with values from current environment\nwhile IFS= read -r line || [[ -n \"$line\" ]]; do\n  # Skip comments and empty lines\n  [[ \"$line\" =~ ^#.*$ || -z \"$line\" ]] && continue\n  # Extract variable name (before = sign)\n  var_name=$(echo \"$line\" | cut -d''='' -f1)\n  # Get value from environment\n  var_value=\"${!var_name}\"\n  # Write to .env\n  echo \"${var_name}=${var_value}\" >> .env\ndone < .env.example\n```\n\nOr manually inspect `.env.example` and create `.env` with the required values from environment variables.\n\n### 2. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\nyarn install\n```\n\n### 3. Setup Supabase Vector Store\n\nGet the database connection URL from Supabase Dashboard:\n- Go to Settings → Database → Connection string → URI\n- Copy the URI and add it to `.env` as `SUPABASE_DB_URL`\n\n```bash\nyarn setup-db\n```\n\nThis creates the pgvector extension, documents table, and match_documents function in your Supabase project.\n\n### 4. Build\n\n```bash\nyarn build\n```\n\n### 5. Deploy\n\n**Vercel:**\n\nAll vercel CLI commands require `-t <token>` or `--token <token>` for authentication.\n\n```bash\n# Pull project settings (also links project, creates .vercel/project.json)\nvercel pull --yes -t $VERCEL_TOKEN\n\n# Push env vars to Vercel (first time only)\n# Must add to each environment separately\nwhile IFS=''='' read -r key value; do\n  [[ \"$key\" =~ ^#.*$ || -z \"$key\" || -z \"$value\" ]] && continue\n  for env in production preview development; do\n    printf ''%s'' \"$value\" | vercel env add \"$key\" $env -t $VERCEL_TOKEN\n  done\ndone < .env\n\n# Build locally for production\nvercel build --prod -t $VERCEL_TOKEN\n\n# Deploy prebuilt\nvercel deploy --prebuilt --prod --yes -t $VERCEL_TOKEN\n```\n\n**Netlify:**\n```bash\n# Import all env vars from .env (first time only)\nnetlify env:import .env\n\n# Deploy\nnetlify deploy --prod\n```\n\n## Critical Notes\n\n- **VERCEL PREBUILT MODE IS MANDATORY:** Always use `vercel build --prod` followed by `vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod`. Never use `vercel --prod` or `vercel deploy --prod` without `--prebuilt` flag.\n- **Supabase Required:** Need a Supabase project (free tier works)\n- **Vector Store Setup:** Run `yarn setup-db` to create tables automatically\n- **Environment Variables:** All values come from current environment - inspect `.env.example` for required variables\n- **OpenAI for Embeddings:** OPENAI_API_KEY is always required for vector embeddings\n- **No Dev Server:** Never run `yarn dev` in VM environment\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:36:39.378Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced deployment capabilities, particularly those using LangChain.js and Vercel AI SDK.","zh":"非常适合需要高级部署能力的AI代理，特别是那些使用LangChain.js和Vercel AI SDK的代理。","ja":"LangChain.jsやVercel AI SDKを使用するAIエージェントに高度なデプロイ機能が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"LangChain.js와 Vercel AI SDK를 사용하는 AI 에이전트가 고급 배포 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de implementación avanzadas, particularmente aquellos que utilizan LangChain.js y Vercel AI SDK.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des capacités de déploiement avancées, en particulier ceux utilisant LangChain.js et Vercel AI SDK.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Bereitstellungs-Funktionen benötigen, insbesondere solche, die LangChain.js und Vercel AI SDK verwenden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades de implantação avançadas, particularmente aqueles que usam LangChain.js e Vercel AI SDK.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности развертывания, особенно тех, кто использует LangChain.js и Vercel AI SDK.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات نشر متقدمة، خاصة تلك التي تستخدم LangChain.js و Vercel AI SDK."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy LangChain retrieval agents with ease, leveraging LangGraph, Supabase vector store, and the Vercel AI SDK for seamless integration and production-ready deployments.","zh":"使代理能够轻松部署LangChain检索代理，利用LangGraph、Supabase向量存储和Vercel AI SDK实现无缝集成和生产就绪的部署。","ja":"LangGraph、Supabaseベクトルストア、Vercel AI SDKを利用して、エージェントがLangChainの検索エージェントを簡単にデプロイできるようにし、シームレスな統合と本番環境へのデプロイを可能にします。","ko":"LangGraph, Supabase 벡터 저장소, Vercel AI SDK를 활용하여 에이전트가 LangChain 검색 에이전트를 쉽게 배포할 수 있도록 하며, 무縫한 통합과 프로덕션 준비가 된 배포를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar agentes de recuperación de LangChain con facilidad, aprovechando LangGraph, Supabase vector store y Vercel AI SDK para una integración sin problemas y despliegues listos para producción.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des agents de récupération LangChain avec facilité, en exploitant LangGraph, Supabase vector store et Vercel AI SDK pour une intégration transparente et des déploiements prêts pour la production.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, LangChain-Retrieval-Agents mit Leichtigkeit zu bereitstellen, indem es LangGraph, Supabase-Vektor-Speicher und Vercel AI SDK für eine nahtlose Integration und produktionsreife Bereitstellungen nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar agentes de recuperação LangChain com facilidade, aproveitando LangGraph, Supabase vector store e o Vercel AI SDK para integração perfeita e implantações prontas para produção.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать агенты поиска LangChain с легкостью, используя LangGraph, Supabase vector store и Vercel AI SDK для бесшовной интеграции и развертывания, готового к производству.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر وكلاء استرجاع LangChain بسهولة، مستفيدًا من LangGraph ومخزن Supabase المتجه وال.sdk الاصطناعي Vercel من أجل التكامل السلس والتنصيب الجاهز للانتاج."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying LangChain retrieval agents to Vercel","Integrating LangGraph with Supabase vector store","Automating deployment of AI-powered applications"],"zh":["将LangChain检索代理部署到Vercel","将LangGraph与Supabase向量存储集成","自动化部署AI驱动的应用程序"],"ja":["LangChainの検索エージェントをVercelにデプロイする","LangGraphとSupabaseベクトルストアを統合する","AI駆動のアプリケーションのデプロイを自動化する"],"ko":["LangChain 검색 에이전트를 Vercel에 배포하는 것","LangGraph와 Supabase 벡터 저장소를 통합하는 것","AI 구동 애플리케이션의 배포를 자동화하는 것"],"es":["Implementación de agentes de recuperación de LangChain en Vercel","Integración de LangGraph con Supabase vector store","Automatización de la implementación de aplicaciones impulsadas por IA"],"fr":["Déploiement d''agents de récupération LangChain sur Vercel","Intégration de LangGraph avec Supabase vector store","Automatisation du déploiement d''applications alimentées par l''IA"],"de":["Bereitstellung von LangChain-Retrieval-Agents auf Vercel","Integration von LangGraph mit Supabase-Vektor-Speicher","Automatisierung der Bereitstellung von KI-gesteuerten Anwendungen"],"pt":["Implantando agentes de recuperação LangChain no Vercel","Integrando LangGraph com Supabase vector store","Automatizando a implantação de aplicações impulsionadas por IA"],"ru":["Развертывание агентов поиска LangChain на Vercel","Интеграция LangGraph с Supabase vector store","Автоматизация развертывания приложений на основе ИИ"],"ar":["نشر وكلاء استرجاع LangChain على Vercel","دمج LangGraph مع مخزن Supabase المتجه","أتمتة نشر التطبيقات القائمة على الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vercel build and deploy commands","Must use `vercel build --prod` and `vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod` commands"],"zh":["需要Vercel构建和部署命令","必须使用`vercel build --prod`和`vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod`命令"],"ja":["Vercelのビルドおよびデプロイコマンドが必要","`vercel build --prod`および`vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod`コマンドを使用する必要がある"],"ko":["Vercel 빌드 및 배포 명령어가 필요","`vercel build --prod` 및 `vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod` 명령어를 사용해야 함"],"es":["Requiere comandos de compilación y despliegue de Vercel","Debe utilizar los comandos `vercel build --prod` y `vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod`"],"fr":["Nécessite les commandes de construction et de déploiement Vercel","Doit utiliser les commandes `vercel build --prod` et `vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod`"],"de":["Erfordert Vercel-Build- und Deploy-Befehle","Muss die Befehle `vercel build --prod` und `vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod` verwenden"],"pt":["Exige comandos de compilação e implantação do Vercel","Deve usar comandos `vercel build --prod` e `vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod`"],"ru":["Требует команд сборки и развертывания Vercel","Должен использовать команды `vercel build --prod` и `vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod`"],"ar":["يتطلب أوامر بناء ونشر Vercel","يجب استخدام أوامر `vercel build --prod` و `vercel deploy --prebuilt --prod`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f77c23abb3cccf1bc6c32fa29a55f073ced5fbb7a04284334219ac8f2cef9b1f","qualityScore":36}');
