g","optimización de campañas publicitarias con IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''agent d''intelligence artificielle","structure de campagne pour le marketing digital","alternatives à Claude Code","Claude Code vs concurrents","installation de plugins Claude Code","guide de configuration de campagnes","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour le marketing","optimisation de campagnes publicitaires avec l''IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Agent-Tools verwendet","Kampagnenstruktur für digitales Marketing","Alternativen zu Claude Code","Claude Code vs Wettbewerber","Installation von Claude-Code-Plugins","Anleitung zur Kampagnenkonfiguration","KI-Tools für Marketing","Optimierung von Werbekampagnen mit KI"],"pt":["como usar ferramentas de IA","o que é mercado de plugins de compra de mídia","ferramentas de IA para marketing","mercado de plugins de compra de mídia alternative","guia de instalação de plugins de compra de mídia","configuração de plugins de compra de mídia","ferramentas de IA para compra de mídia","mercado de plugins de compra de mídia vs concorrentes"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ инструменты","что такое маркетплейс плагинов для медийных покупок","ИИ инструменты для медийных покупок","маркетплейс плагинов для медийных покупок alternative","гид по установке плагинов для медийных покупок","настройка плагинов для медийных покупок","ИИ инструменты для медийных покупок","маркетплейс плагинов для медийных покупок vs конкуренты"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو سوق البرامج الإضافية لعمليات الشراء الإعلامي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لعمليات التسويق","سوق البرامج الإضافية لعمليات الشراء الإعلامي بديل","دليل تثبيت البرامج الإضافية لعمليات الشراء الإعلامي","تضبيط البرامج الإضافية لعمليات الشراء الإعلامي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لعمليات الشراء الإعلامي","سوق البرامج الإضافية لعمليات الشراء الإعلامي مقابل المنافسين"]}},"owner":"WalkerHi11","repo":"mediabuy-plugins","repoPath":"WalkerHi11/mediabuy-plugins","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.697Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"campaign-structure","description":"Design optimal Facebook/Meta campaign structure for testing including ABO vs CBO, ad set organization, targeting, and budget allocation. Use when setting up new campaigns, planning test structure, or optimizing account architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Campaign Structure Designer\r\n\r\nCreate optimal campaign architecture for testing and scaling.\r\n\r\n## Process\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Assess Offer and Budget\r\n\r\n**Offer Type Assessment**\r\n- VSL/long-form funnel → More controlled testing\r\n- Lead gen/simple funnel → Can be more aggressive\r\n- New offer → Need more testing budget\r\n- Proven offer → Can scale faster\r\n\r\n**Budget Allocation**\r\n- Daily testing budget\r\n- Target CPA/CPL\r\n- Acceptable loss threshold\r\n- Timeline to profitability\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Choose","body":"# Campaign Structure Designer\r\n\r\nCreate optimal campaign architecture for testing and scaling.\r\n\r\n## Process\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Assess Offer and Budget\r\n\r\n**Offer Type Assessment**\r\n- VSL/long-form funnel → More controlled testing\r\n- Lead gen/simple funnel → Can be more aggressive\r\n- New offer → Need more testing budget\r\n- Proven offer → Can scale faster\r\n\r\n**Budget Allocation**\r\n- Daily testing budget\r\n- Target CPA/CPL\r\n- Acceptable loss threshold\r\n- Timeline to profitability\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Choose Structure Type\r\n\r\n**ABO Testing Structure (Recommended for Testing)**\r\nUse when: Finding initial winners, testing new angles\r\n\r\n```\r\nCampaign: [Offer] Testing\r\n├── Ad Set 1: [Concept A] - $X/day\r\n│   ├── Ad 1: Hook variation 1\r\n│   ├── Ad 2: Hook variation 2\r\n│   └── Ad 3: Hook variation 3\r\n├── Ad Set 2: [Concept B] - $X/day\r\n│   ├── Ad 1...\r\n...\r\n```\r\n\r\n**CBO Scaling Structure**\r\nUse when: Scaling proven winners\r\n\r\n```\r\nCampaign: [Offer] Scale - $X/day CBO\r\n├── Ad Set 1: Winners Only\r\n│   ├── Winner Ad 1\r\n│   ├── Winner Ad 2\r\n│   └── Winner Ad 3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**2x2x3 Testing Method (Jason K)**\r\n- 2 Headlines\r\n- 2 Ad texts\r\n- 3 Images/faces\r\n= 12 ad variations testing copy combinations\r\n\r\n**Double Six Shooter (Jason K)**\r\n- 10-12 ad sets (different avatars)\r\n- Same 10-12 images per ad set\r\n- Large CBO with minimum spend per ad set\r\n- Let Facebook find winning avatar + image combos\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Set Targeting Parameters\r\n\r\n**Testing Phase**\r\n- 2% Lookalike audiences (Jason K recommends)\r\n- Mobile newsfeed only\r\n- WiFi only (for VSL)\r\n\r\n**Scaling Phase**\r\n- 10% Lookalike (Jason K)\r\n- All placements\r\n- Broader audiences\r\n\r\n**Audience Sources**\r\n- Purchase lookalikes\r\n- Add to cart lookalikes\r\n- Email list lookalikes\r\n- Page engagers (for exclusions)\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Define Budget Rules\r\n\r\n**Testing Budget**\r\n- Spend 1.5-2x target CPL before calling winner (Casto)\r\n- Use initiate checkout as leading indicator (3x purchase data)\r\n- Kill at threshold, don''t hold hoping\r\n\r\n**Winner Criteria (Jason K)**\r\n- Doesn''t lose more than once in 3 days\r\n- Doesn''t lose more than twice in 7 days\r\n- Consistent performance, not just spikes\r\n\r\n**Scaling Budget**\r\n- 20% increases (safe)\r\n- Can jump when hot, but risk breaking\r\n- Spread across multiple ad accounts\r\n\r\n### Step 5: Output Campaign Blueprint\r\n\r\n```\r\n## CAMPAIGN STRUCTURE: [Offer Name]\r\n\r\n### PHASE 1: INITIAL TESTING\r\n\r\n**Campaign: [Offer] - ABO Test**\r\n- Objective: Conversions\r\n- Budget: $[X]/day per ad set\r\n- Duration: [X] days minimum\r\n\r\n**Ad Set Structure:**\r\n| Ad Set | Concept | Targeting | Budget |\r\n|--------|---------|-----------|--------|\r\n| 1 | [Concept A] | 2% LAL | $X |\r\n| 2 | [Concept B] | 2% LAL | $X |\r\n| 3 | [Concept C] | 2% LAL | $X |\r\n\r\n**Per Ad Set:**\r\n- 5-10 ads per concept\r\n- Mix of hooks/variations\r\n- Mobile newsfeed only\r\n\r\n**Kill Criteria:**\r\n- CPL > [X] after $[spend]\r\n- CPA > [X] after [conversions]\r\n\r\n**Winner Criteria:**\r\n- CPL < [target]\r\n- Consistent 3+ days\r\n- Scalable volume\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### PHASE 2: WINNER VALIDATION\r\n\r\n**Campaign: [Offer] - CBO Scale**\r\n- Budget: $[X]/day CBO\r\n- Winners only (3-5 ads)\r\n- Scale in place initially\r\n\r\n**Expansion:**\r\n- Replicate to Ad Account 2\r\n- Replicate to Ad Account 3\r\n- De-risk across accounts\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### PHASE 3: FULL SCALE\r\n\r\n**Structure:**\r\n- Multiple CBOs across accounts\r\n- $10K max per CBO (avoid instability)\r\n- Weekend campaigns (separate)\r\n- Day-parting: 4AM-1PM Eastern (VSL)\r\n\r\n**Targeting Expansion:**\r\n- Move to 10% LAL\r\n- Test broad\r\n- All placements\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### CREATIVE TESTING CADENCE\r\n\r\n**Weekly:**\r\n- 50-100 new creative variations\r\n- New hooks on proven angles\r\n- New angles on proven offers\r\n\r\n**Monthly:**\r\n- New concept batches\r\n- Founder content refresh\r\n- Seasonal angles\r\n\r\n### TRACKING SETUP\r\n- UTM structure: [Define]\r\n- Conversion events: [List]\r\n- Attribution window: [Setting]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Key Principles\r\n\r\n**From Casto:**\r\n- Broad targeting, let creative do targeting\r\n- Use bid caps/cost caps when margins thin\r\n- Spread across multiple ad accounts\r\n- Build internal tools for launch automation\r\n\r\n**From Jason K:**\r\n- 2% LAL for testing, 10% for scaling\r\n- Watch initiate checkouts (3x data)\r\n- Day-part for VSL (turn off afternoon)\r\n- Weekend campaigns with higher budgets\r\n- Large CBO of winners is end goal\r\n\r\nSource: Jason K, Casto (Meta-CastovsJasonK)\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:36:46.277Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced campaign architecture design and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级_campaign architecture 设计和优化能力的营销代理","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが高度なキャンペーンアーキテクチャ設計と最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 캠페인 아키텍처 설계 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan capacidades de diseño y optimización de arquitectura de campaña avanzada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de marketing ayant besoin de capacités de conception et d''optimisation d''architecture de campagne avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die erweiterte Kampagnen-Architektur-Design- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de design e otimização de arquitetura de campanha.","ru":"Идеально для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности проектирования и оптимизации архитектуры кампании.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتصميم وتنظيم هيكل الحملات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create optimal campaign structures using offer type assessments, budget allocations, and target CPA/CPL analysis, streamlining testing and scaling operations through professionally configured plugins.","zh":"赋予代理创建最优_campaign 结构的能力，使用 offer 类型评估、预算分配和目标 CPA/CPL 分析，通过专业配置的插件简化测试和扩展操作","ja":"エージェントがオファーの種類評価、予算割り当て、目標CPA/CPL分析を使用して最適なキャンペーン構造を作成できるようにし、専門家が設定したプラグインを通じてテストと拡張操作を簡素化","ko":"에이전트가 offer 유형 평가, 예산 할당 및 목표 CPA/CPL 분석을 사용하여 최적의 캠페인 구조를 만들 수 있도록 하며, 전문가가 구성한 플러그인을 통해 테스트 및 확장 운영을 간소화","es":"Permite a los agentes crear estructuras de campaña óptimas utilizando evaluaciones de tipo de oferta, asignaciones de presupuesto y análisis de CPA/CPL objetivo, racionalizando las operaciones de prueba y escalado a través de plugins configurados profesionalmente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des structures de campagne optimales en utilisant des évaluations de type d''offre, des allocations de budget et des analyses de CPA/CPL cible, en rationalisant les opérations de test et de mise à l''échelle à travers des plugins configurés professionnellement.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, optimale Kampagnenstrukturen zu erstellen, indem sie Angebotstypbewertungen, Budgetzuweisungen und Ziel-CPA/CPL-Analysen verwenden, und rationalisiert Test- und Skalierungsvorgänge durch professionell konfigurierte Plugins.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem estruturas de campanha ótimas usando avaliações de tipo de oferta, alocações orçamentárias e análise de CPA/CPL de destino, racionalizando operações de teste e escala por meio de plugins configurados profissionalmente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать оптимальные структуры кампаний с помощью оценок типа предложения, распределения бюджета и анализа целевого CPA/CPL, оптимизируя операции тестирования и масштабирования посредством профессионально настроенных плагинов.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء هياكل حملة مثالية باستخدام تقييمات لنوع العرض وتخصيص الميزانية وتحليل CPA/CPL المستهدف، وتبسيط عمليات الاختبار والتوسع من خلال البرامج المساعدة المكونة بشكل محترف."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing campaign architectures for VSL/long-form funnels","Optimizing budget allocations for lead gen/simple funnels","Scaling proven offers with aggressive testing strategies"],"zh":["为 VSL/长形式_funnel 设计_campaign 架构","为_lead gen/简单_funnel 优化预算分配","使用激进的测试策略扩展已证明的 offer"],"ja":["VSL/ロングフォームファネル用のキャンペーンアーキテクチャ設計","リードジェン/シンプルファネル用の予算割り当ての最適化","積極的なテスト戦略を使用して確立されたオファーをスケール"],"ko":["VSL/길이 형_펀널을 위한 캠페인 아키텍처 설계","리드 ジェン/간단한 펀널을 위한 예산 할당 최적화","적극적인 테스트 전략을 사용하여 확립된 offer를 확장"],"es":["Diseñar arquitecturas de campaña para embudos VSL/long-form","Optimizar las asignaciones de presupuesto para embudos de generación de leads/simples","Escalar ofertas probadas con estrategias de prueba agresivas"],"fr":["Concevoir des architectures de campagne pour les tunnels VSL/long-form","Optimiser les allocations de budget pour les tunnels de génération de leads/simples","Mettre à l''échelle des offres éprouvées avec des stratégies de test agressives"],"de":["Kampagnenarchitekturen für VSL/long-form-Trichter entwerfen","Budgetzuweisungen für Lead-Gen-/Simple-Trichter optimieren","Bewährte Angebote mit aggressiven Teststrategien skalieren"],"pt":["Projeto de arquiteturas de campanha para funis VSL/long-form","Otimização de alocações orçamentárias para funis de geração de leads/simples","Escala de ofertas comprovadas com estratégias de teste agressivas"],"ru":["Проектирование архитектур кампаний для воронок VSL/long-form","Оптимизация распределения бюджета для воронок генерации лидов/простых воронок","Масштабирование проверенных предложений с агрессивными стратегиями тестирования"],"ar":["تصميم هياكل حملة لمرشحات VSL/المرشحات الطويلة","تحسين تخصيص الميزانية لمرشحات توليد الرسائل/مرشحات بسيطة","توسيع العروض المثبتة مع استراتيجيات اختبار هجومية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of offer types and budgeting principles","Limited to media buying operations and campaign structure design"],"zh":["需要理解 offer 类型和预算原则","仅限媒体购买操作和_campaign 结构设计"],"ja":["オファーの種類と予算原則の理解が必要","メディア購入操作とキャンペーン構造設計のみに限定"],"ko":["offer 유형 및 예산 원칙을 이해해야 함","미디어 구매 운영 및 캠페인 구조 설계에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de los tipos de oferta y la presupuestación","Limitado a operaciones de compra de medios y diseño de estructura de campaña"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes des types d''offre et de la budgétisation","Limité aux opérations d''achat de médias et à la conception de la structure de campagne"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für die Grundsätze der Angebotsarten und der Budgetierung","Begrenzt auf Medienkaufoperationen und Kampagnenstruktur-Design"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de tipos de ofertas e princípios de orçamento","Limitado a operações de compra de mídia e design de estrutura de campanha"],"ru":["Требует понимания типов предложений и бюджетных принципов","Ограничен операциями по покупке медиа и проектированию структуры кампании"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا لأنواع العروض ومبادئ الميزانية","محدود لعمليات شراء الوسائط وتصميم هيكل الحملة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"84b19708afaee08b8f818efd0fcfe4cf225a8613e5a37e965d9dd557d5d0c5a5","qualityScore":36}');
