ko":["Next.js 프론트엔드 프레임워크","FastAPI 백엔드 프레임워크","Flutter 모바일 애플리케이션 개발","Terraform 인프라스트럭처 즉 코드","Mise 프로젝트 관리"],"es":["Plantilla de monorepo lista para producción","Integración con Next.js y FastAPI","Compatibilidad con Flutter y Terraform","Incluye mise para la gestión de estado","Ideal para proyectos de fullstack"],"fr":["Modèle de monorepo prêt pour la production","Intégration avec Next.js et FastAPI","Compatibilité avec Flutter et Terraform","Inclut mise pour la gestion d''état","Idéal pour les projets fullstack"],"de":["Produktionsbereite Monorepo-Vorlage","Integration mit Next.js und FastAPI","Kompatibilität mit Flutter und Terraform","Inklusive mise für Statusverwaltung","Ideal für Fullstack-Projekte"],"pt":["Integração com Next.js","Suporte a FastAPI","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis com Flutter","Gerenciamento de infraestrutura com Terraform","Otimização de desempenho com mise"],"ru":["Интеграция с Next.js","Поддержка FastAPI","Разработка мобильных приложений на Flutter","Управление инфраструктурой с помощью Terraform","Оптимизация производительности с mise"],"ar":["التكامل مع Next.js","دعم FastAPI","تطوير تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول مع Flutter","إدارة البنية التحتية مع Terraform","تحسين الأداء مع mise"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Paid Ads开发","全栈模板","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","Mise","如何使用Paid Ads模板","Paid Ads模板安装","Paid Ads开发教程"],"ja":["Paid Ads開発","フルスタックテンプレート","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","Mise","Paid Adsテンプレートの使用方法","Paid Adsテンプレートのインストール","Paid Ads開発ガイド"],"ko":["Paid Ads 개발","풀스택 템플릿","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","Mise","Paid Ads 템플릿 사용법","Paid Ads 템플릿 설치","Paid Ads 개발 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI Agent","plantilla monorepo","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","desarrollo fullstack","cómo usar AI Agent","alternativas a AI Agent"],"fr":["outils d''Agent IA","modèle de monorepo","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","développement fullstack","comment utiliser Agent IA","alternatives à Agent IA"],"de":["AI-Agent-Tools","Monorepo-Vorlage","Next.js","FastAPI","Flutter","Terraform","mise","Fullstack-Entwicklung","wie man AI-Agent verwendet","Alternativen zu AI-Agent"],"pt":["como usar Next.js","o que é FastAPI","guia de instalação do Flutter","configuração do Terraform","otimização de desempenho com mise","alternativas ao Next.js","Next.js vs React"],"ru":["как использовать Next.js","что такое FastAPI","руководство по установке Flutter","настройка Terraform","оптимизация производительности с mise","альтернативы Next.js","Next.js vs React"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Next.js","ما هي FastAPI","دليل تثبيت Flutter","تكوين Terraform","تحسين الأداء مع mise","بديل Next.js","Next.js مقابل React"]}},"owner":"first-fluke","repo":"fullstack-starter","repoPath":"first-fluke/fullstack-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.706Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"paid-ads","description":"When the user wants help with paid advertising campaigns on Google Ads, Meta (Facebook/Instagram), LinkedIn, Twitter/X, or other ad platforms. Also use when the user mentions PPC, paid media, ad copy, ad creative, ROAS, CPA, ad campaign, retargeting, or audience targeting. This skill covers campaign strategy, ad creation, audience targeting, and optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Paid Ads\n\nYou are an expert performance marketer with direct access to ad platform accounts. Your goal is to help create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns that drive efficient customer acquisition.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):","body":"# Paid Ads\n\nYou are an expert performance marketer with direct access to ad platform accounts. Your goal is to help create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns that drive efficient customer acquisition.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Campaign Goals\n- What''s the primary objective? (Awareness, traffic, leads, sales, app installs)\n- What''s the target CPA or ROAS?\n- What''s the monthly/weekly budget?\n- Any constraints? (Brand guidelines, compliance, geographic)\n\n### 2. Product & Offer\n- What are you promoting? (Product, free trial, lead magnet, demo)\n- What''s the landing page URL?\n- What makes this offer compelling?\n\n### 3. Audience\n- Who is the ideal customer?\n- What problem does your product solve for them?\n- What are they searching for or interested in?\n- Do you have existing customer data for lookalikes?\n\n### 4. Current State\n- Have you run ads before? What worked/didn''t?\n- Do you have existing pixel/conversion data?\n- What''s your current funnel conversion rate?\n\n---\n\n## Platform Selection Guide\n\n| Platform | Best For | Use When |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| **Google Ads** | High-intent search traffic | People actively search for your solution |\n| **Meta** | Demand generation, visual products | Creating demand, strong creative assets |\n| **LinkedIn** | B2B, decision-makers | Job title/company targeting matters, higher price points |\n| **Twitter/X** | Tech audiences, thought leadership | Audience is active on X, timely content |\n| **TikTok** | Younger demographics, viral creative | Audience skews 18-34, video capacity |\n\n---\n\n## Campaign Structure Best Practices\n\n### Account Organization\n\n```\nAccount\n├── Campaign 1: [Objective] - [Audience/Product]\n│   ├── Ad Set 1: [Targeting variation]\n│   │   ├── Ad 1: [Creative variation A]\n│   │   ├── Ad 2: [Creative variation B]\n│   │   └── Ad 3: [Creative variation C]\n│   └── Ad Set 2: [Targeting variation]\n└── Campaign 2...\n```\n\n### Naming Conventions\n\n```\n[Platform]_[Objective]_[Audience]_[Offer]_[Date]\n\nExamples:\nMETA_Conv_Lookalike-Customers_FreeTrial_2024Q1\nGOOG_Search_Brand_Demo_Ongoing\nLI_LeadGen_CMOs-SaaS_Whitepaper_Mar24\n```\n\n### Budget Allocation\n\n**Testing phase (first 2-4 weeks):**\n- 70% to proven/safe campaigns\n- 30% to testing new audiences/creative\n\n**Scaling phase:**\n- Consolidate budget into winning combinations\n- Increase budgets 20-30% at a time\n- Wait 3-5 days between increases for algorithm learning\n\n---\n\n## Ad Copy Frameworks\n\n### Key Formulas\n\n**Problem-Agitate-Solve (PAS):**\n> [Problem] → [Agitate the pain] → [Introduce solution] → [CTA]\n\n**Before-After-Bridge (BAB):**\n> [Current painful state] → [Desired future state] → [Your product as bridge]\n\n**Social Proof Lead:**\n> [Impressive stat or testimonial] → [What you do] → [CTA]\n\n**For detailed templates and headline formulas**: See [references/ad-copy-templates.md](references/ad-copy-templates.md)\n\n---\n\n## Audience Targeting Overview\n\n### Platform Strengths\n\n| Platform | Key Targeting | Best Signals |\n|----------|---------------|--------------|\n| Google | Keywords, search intent | What they''re searching |\n| Meta | Interests, behaviors, lookalikes | Engagement patterns |\n| LinkedIn | Job titles, companies, industries | Professional identity |\n\n### Key Concepts\n\n- **Lookalikes**: Base on best customers (by LTV), not all customers\n- **Retargeting**: Segment by funnel stage (visitors vs. cart abandoners)\n- **Exclusions**: Always exclude existing customers and recent converters\n\n**For detailed targeting strategies by platform**: See [references/audience-targeting.md](references/audience-targeting.md)\n\n---\n\n## Creative Best Practices\n\n### Image Ads\n- Clear product screenshots showing UI\n- Before/after comparisons\n- Stats and numbers as focal point\n- Human faces (real, not stock)\n- Bold, readable text overlay (keep under 20%)\n\n### Video Ads Structure (15-30 sec)\n1. Hook (0-3 sec): Pattern interrupt, question, or bold statement\n2. Problem (3-8 sec): Relatable pain point\n3. Solution (8-20 sec): Show product/benefit\n4. CTA (20-30 sec): Clear next step\n\n**Production tips:**\n- Captions always (85% watch without sound)\n- Vertical for Stories/Reels, square for feed\n- Native feel outperforms polished\n- First 3 seconds determine if they watch\n\n### Creative Testing Hierarchy\n1. Concept/angle (biggest impact)\n2. Hook/headline\n3. Visual style\n4. Body copy\n5. CTA\n\n---\n\n## Campaign Optimization\n\n### Key Metrics by Objective\n\n| Objective | Primary Metrics |\n|-----------|-----------------|\n| Awareness | CPM, Reach, Video view rate |\n| Consideration | CTR, CPC, Time on site |\n| Conversion | CPA, ROAS, Conversion rate |\n\n### Optimization Levers\n\n**If CPA is too high:**\n1. Check landing page (is the problem post-click?)\n2. Tighten audience targeting\n3. Test new creative angles\n4. Improve ad relevance/quality score\n5. Adjust bid strategy\n\n**If CTR is low:**\n- Creative isn''t resonating → test new hooks/angles\n- Audience mismatch → refine targeting\n- Ad fatigue → refresh creative\n\n**If CPM is high:**\n- Audience too narrow → expand targeting\n- High competition → try different placements\n- Low relevance score → improve creative fit\n\n### Bid Strategy Progression\n1. Start with manual or cost caps\n2. Gather conversion data (50+ conversions)\n3. Switch to automated with targets based on historical data\n4. Monitor and adjust targets based on results\n\n---\n\n## Retargeting Strategies\n\n### Funnel-Based Approach\n\n| Funnel Stage | Audience | Message | Goal |\n|--------------|----------|---------|------|\n| Top | Blog readers, video viewers | Educational, social proof | Move to consideration |\n| Middle | Pricing/feature page visitors | Case studies, demos | Move to decision |\n| Bottom | Cart abandoners, trial users | Urgency, objection handling | Convert |\n\n### Retargeting Windows\n\n| Stage | Window | Frequency Cap |\n|-------|--------|---------------|\n| Hot (cart/trial) | 1-7 days | Higher OK |\n| Warm (key pages) | 7-30 days | 3-5x/week |\n| Cold (any visit) | 30-90 days | 1-2x/week |\n\n### Exclusions to Set Up\n- Existing customers (unless upsell)\n- Recent converters (7-14 day window)\n- Bounced visitors (<10 sec)\n- Irrelevant pages (careers, support)\n\n---\n\n## Reporting & Analysis\n\n### Weekly Review\n- Spend vs. budget pacing\n- CPA/ROAS vs. targets\n- Top and bottom performing ads\n- Audience performance breakdown\n- Frequency check (fatigue risk)\n- Landing page conversion rate\n\n### Attribution Considerations\n- Platform attribution is inflated\n- Use UTM parameters consistently\n- Compare platform data to GA4\n- Look at blended CAC, not just platform CPA\n\n---\n\n## Platform Setup\n\nBefore launching campaigns, ensure proper tracking and account setup.\n\n**For complete setup checklists by platform**: See [references/platform-setup-checklists.md](references/platform-setup-checklists.md)\n\n### Universal Pre-Launch Checklist\n- [ ] Conversion tracking tested with real conversion\n- [ ] Landing page loads fast (<3 sec)\n- [ ] Landing page mobile-friendly\n- [ ] UTM parameters working\n- [ ] Budget set correctly\n- [ ] Targeting matches intended audience\n\n---\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n### Strategy\n- Launching without conversion tracking\n- Too many campaigns (fragmenting budget)\n- Not giving algorithms enough learning time\n- Optimizing for wrong metric\n\n### Targeting\n- Audiences too narrow or too broad\n- Not excluding existing customers\n- Overlapping audiences competing\n\n### Creative\n- Only one ad per ad set\n- Not refreshing creative (fatigue)\n- Mismatch between ad and landing page\n\n### Budget\n- Spreading too thin across campaigns\n- Making big budget changes (disrupts learning)\n- Stopping campaigns during learning phase\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What platform(s) are you currently running or want to start with?\n2. What''s your monthly ad budget?\n3. What does a successful conversion look like (and what''s it worth)?\n4. Do you have existing creative assets or need to create them?\n5. What landing page will ads point to?\n6. Do you have pixel/conversion tracking set up?\n\n---\n\n## Tool Integrations\n\nFor implementation, see the [tools registry](../../tools/REGISTRY.md). Key advertising platforms:\n\n| Platform | Best For | MCP | Guide |\n|----------|----------|:---:|-------|\n| **Google Ads** | Search intent, high-intent traffic | ✓ | [google-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/google-ads.md) |\n| **Meta Ads** | Demand gen, visual products, B2C | - | [meta-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/meta-ads.md) |\n| **LinkedIn Ads** | B2B, job title targeting | - | [linkedin-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/linkedin-ads.md) |\n| **TikTok Ads** | Younger demographics, video | - | [tiktok-ads.md](../../tools/integrations/tiktok-ads.md) |\n\nFor tracking, see also: [ga4.md](../../tools/integrations/ga4.md), [segment.md](../../tools/integrations/segment.md)\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **copywriting**: For landing page copy that converts ad traffic\n- **analytics-tracking**: For proper conversion tracking setup\n- **ab-test-setup**: For landing page testing to improve ROAS\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing post-click conversion rates\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:42:06.778Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Marketing Agents needing advanced paid advertising campaign optimization and customer acquisition strategies.","zh":"非常适合需要高级付费广告活动优化和客户获取策略的营销代理。","ja":"マーケティングエージェントが高度な有料広告キャンペーンの最適化と顧客の取得戦略を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 유료 광고 캠페인 최적화 및 고객 확보 전략이 필요한 마케팅 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de marketing que necesitan una optimización avanzada de campañas publicitarias pagas y estrategias de adquisición de clientes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents marketing qui ont besoin d''une optimisation avancée des campagnes publicitaires payantes et de stratégies d''acquisition de clients.","de":"Perfekt für Marketing-Agenten, die eine erweiterte Optimierung von Paid-Advertising-Kampagnen und Kundenakquise-Strategien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Marketing que precisam de otimização avançada de campanhas publicitárias pagas e estratégias de aquisição de clientes.","ru":"Идеально для маркетинговых агентов, которым необходима продвинутая оптимизация платных рекламных кампаний и стратегии привлечения клиентов.","ar":"مثالي لعمال التسويق الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين متقدم لحملات الإعلانات المدفوعة واستراتيجيات الحصول على العملاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, optimize, and scale paid advertising campaigns using Next.js, FastAPI, and Terraform, driving efficient customer acquisition through data-driven decision making and access to ad platform accounts.","zh":"通过Next.js、FastAPI和Terraform赋予代理创建、优化和扩大有料广告活动的能力，通过数据驱动的决策和访问广告平台账户来实现高效的客户获取。","ja":"Next.js、FastAPI、Terraformを使用して、エージェントが有料広告キャンペーンを作成、最適化、拡大できるようにし、データドリブンの意思決定と広告プラットフォームアカウントへのアクセスを通じて効率的な顧客の取得を実現します。","ko":"Next.js, FastAPI 및 Terraform를 사용하여 에이전트가 유료 광고 캠페인을 생성, 최적화 및 확장할 수 있도록 하여 데이터 驱动 의 의사결정과 광고 플랫폼 계정에 대한 액세스를 통해 효율적인 고객 확보를 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, optimizar y ampliar campañas publicitarias pagas utilizando Next.js, FastAPI y Terraform, lo que impulsa la adquisición eficiente de clientes a través de la toma de decisiones basada en datos y el acceso a cuentas de plataformas de publicidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, d''optimiser et de faire évoluer des campagnes publicitaires payantes en utilisant Next.js, FastAPI et Terraform, ce qui impulse l''acquisition efficace de clients grâce à la prise de décision basée sur les données et l''accès aux comptes de plateformes de publicité.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, bezahlte Werbekampagnen mithilfe von Next.js, FastAPI und Terraform zu erstellen, zu optimieren und zu skalieren, wodurch eine effiziente Kundenakquise durch datengetriebene Entscheidungsfindung und Zugriff auf Werbeplattform-Konten ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, otimizar e dimensionar campanhas publicitárias pagas usando Next.js, FastAPI e Terraform, impulsionando a aquisição eficiente de clientes por meio de tomada de decisões baseada em dados e acesso a contas de plataformas de anúncios.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, оптимизировать и масштабировать платные рекламные кампании с помощью Next.js, FastAPI и Terraform, обеспечивая эффективное привлечение клиентов посредством принятия решений на основе данных и доступа к учетным записям рекламных платформ.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء حملات إعلانية مدفوعة وتحسينها وتوسيعها باستخدام Next.js و FastAPI و Terraform، مما يدفع الحصول الفعال على العملاء من خلال اتخاذ قرارات مدفوعة بالبيانات ووصول إلى حسابات منصات الإعلانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating targeted ad campaigns","Optimizing ad spend for maximum ROI","Scaling customer acquisition through data analysis"],"zh":["创建定向广告活动","优化广告支出以实现最大化ROI","通过数据分析扩大客户获取规模"],"ja":["ターゲットを絞った広告キャンペーンの作成","広告支出の最適化による最大のROIの実現","データ分析を通じた顧客の取得の拡大"],"ko":["대상 고객을 위한 광고 캠페인 생성","광고 비용 최적화로 최대 ROI 달성","데이터 분석을 통한 고객 확보 확대"],"es":["Creación de campañas publicitarias dirigidas","Optimización del gasto publicitario para un máximo de ROI","Escalado de la adquisición de clientes a través del análisis de datos"],"fr":["Création de campagnes publicitaires ciblées","Optimisation des dépenses publicitaires pour un ROI maximum","Évolution de l''acquisition de clients grâce à l''analyse de données"],"de":["Erstellung von gezielten Werbekampagnen","Optimierung der Werbeausgaben für ein maximales ROI","Skalierung der Kundenakquise durch Datenanalyse"],"pt":["Criação de campanhas publicitárias direcionadas","Otimização do gasto publicitário para máximo ROI","Dimensionamento da aquisição de clientes por meio da análise de dados"],"ru":["Создание целевых рекламных кампаний","Оптимизация рекламных расходов для максимального ROI","Масштабирование привлечения клиентов через анализ данных"],"ar":["إنشاء حملات إعلانية مستهدفة","تحسين إنفاق الإعلانات للحصول على أعلى عائد على الاستثمار","توسيع الحصول على العملاء من خلال تحليل البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to ad platform accounts","Dependent on product marketing context for optimal performance"],"zh":["需要访问广告平台账户","依赖于产品营销环境以实现最佳性能"],"ja":["広告プラットフォームアカウントへのアクセスが必要","最適なパフォーマンスを実現するために製品マーケティングの文脈に依存する"],"ko":["광고 플랫폼 계정에 대한 액세스가 필요","최적의 성능을 달성하기 위해 제품 마케팅 환경에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a cuentas de plataformas de publicidad","Depende del contexto de marketing de productos para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux comptes de plateformes de publicité","Dépend du contexte de marketing de produits pour des performances optimales"],"de":["Erfordert den Zugriff auf Werbeplattform-Konten","Hängt vom Produktmarketing-Kontext für optimale Leistung ab"],"pt":["Requer acesso a contas de plataformas de anúncios","Dependente do contexto de marketing de produtos para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Требует доступа к учетным записям рекламных платформ","Зависит от контекста маркетинга продукта для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى حسابات منصات الإعلانات","يعتمد على سياق تسويق المنتج لأداء مثالي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"29d1f50e17b59b04556191bf82a77e51f72ce34d3034525f017d4835109ed35a","qualityScore":36}');
