バッグをサポート","包括的なログ ライブラリ","開発効率を向上","簡単に使える","複数のログ レベルをサポート"],"ko":["Erlang 및 JavaScript의 크로스 플랫폼 디버깅 지원","포괄적인 로깅 라이브러리","개발 효율성 향상","쉽게 사용할 수 있음","다중 로그 레벨 지원"],"es":["Registro claro y conciso","Compatibilidad con Erlang y JavaScript","Depuración eficiente","Código abierto","Fácil de implementar"],"fr":["Journalisation claire et concise","Compatibilité avec Erlang et JavaScript","Débogage efficace","Code open source","Facile à mettre en œuvre"],"de":["Klares und präzises Protokoll","Kompatibilität mit Erlang und JavaScript","Effiziente Fehlersuche","Open-Source-Code","Einfach zu implementieren"],"pt":["Depuração multiplataforma","Biblioteca de logging para Erlang e JavaScript","Logs claros e concisos","Facilidade de uso","Compatibilidade com várias plataformas"],"ru":["Многоплатформенная отладка","Библиотека логирования для Erlang и JavaScript","Ясные и краткие логи","Легкость использования","Совместимость с несколькими платформами"],"ar":["تصحيح الأخطاء المتعددة المنصات","مكتبة لتسجيل الدخول ل Erlang و JavaScript","سجلات واضحة وموجزة","سهولة الاستخدام","توافق مع منصات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 debug-cross-platform","什么是跨平台调试","debug-cross-platform 安装","debug-cross-platform 教程","Erlang 调试工具","JavaScript 调试工具","跨平台调试库","debug-cross-platform vs 其他调试工具"],"ja":["debug-cross-platform の使用方法","マルチプラットフォーム デバッグとは","debug-cross-platform のインストール","debug-cross-platform のチュートリアル","Erlang デバッグ ツール","JavaScript デバッグ ツール","マルチプラットフォーム デバッグ ライブラリ","debug-cross-platform と他のデバッグ ツールの比較"],"ko":["debug-cross-platform 사용 방법","크로스 플랫폼 디버깅이란","debug-cross-platform 설치","debug-cross-platform 튜토리얼","Erlang 디버깅 툴","JavaScript 디버깅 툴","크로스 플랫폼 디버깅 라이브러리","debug-cross-platform와 다른 디버깅 툴의 비교"],"es":["herramientas de depuración","Gleam","Erlang","JavaScript","cómo usar Gleam","depuración multiplataforma","alternativas a Gleam","Gleam vs otras herramientas","instalación de Gleam","guía de configuración de Gleam"],"fr":["outils de débogage","Gleam","Erlang","JavaScript","comment utiliser Gleam","débogage multiplateforme","alternatives à Gleam","Gleam vs autres outils","installation de Gleam","guide de configuration de Gleam"],"de":["Debug-Tools","Gleam","Erlang","JavaScript","wie man Gleam verwendet","Fehlersuche auf mehreren Plattformen","Alternativen zu Gleam","Gleam im Vergleich zu anderen Tools","Gleam-Installation","Gleam-Konfigurationsanleitung"],"pt":["ferramentas de depuração","debug-cross-platform","biblioteca de logging","Erlang","JavaScript","como usar Gleam","guia de instalação do Gleam","alternativas ao Gleam"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","инструменты отладки","debug-cross-platform","библиотека логирования","Erlang","JavaScript","как использовать Gleam","руководство по установке Gleam","альтернативы Gleam"],"ar":["أدوات تصحيح الأخطاء","أداة تصحيح الأخطاء المتعددة المنصات","مكتبة لتسجيل الدخول","Erlang","JavaScript","كيفية استخدام Gleam","دليل تثبيت Gleam","بديلات ل Gleam"]}},"owner":"tylerbutler","repo":"birch","repoPath":"tylerbutler/birch","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.724Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"debug-cross-platform","description":"Debug issues that only occur on one target (Erlang or JavaScript). Use when tests pass on one target but fail on the other.","bodyPreview":"# Cross-Platform Debugging\n\nSystematic approach to debugging issues that only occur on Erlang OR JavaScript.\n\n## Quick Diagnosis\n\n```bash\n# Run on both targets to identify which fails\njust test-erlang\njust test-js\n```\n\n## Common Causes\n\n### 1. FFI Implementation Mismatch\n\n**Symptom**: Different behavior between targets for the same function.\n\n**Check**:\n```bash\n# Compare FFI implementations\ndiff <(grep -A 20 \"function_name\" src/birch_ffi.erl) \\\n     <(grep -A 20 \"function_name\" src/birch_ffi.mjs","body":"# Cross-Platform Debugging\n\nSystematic approach to debugging issues that only occur on Erlang OR JavaScript.\n\n## Quick Diagnosis\n\n```bash\n# Run on both targets to identify which fails\njust test-erlang\njust test-js\n```\n\n## Common Causes\n\n### 1. FFI Implementation Mismatch\n\n**Symptom**: Different behavior between targets for the same function.\n\n**Check**:\n```bash\n# Compare FFI implementations\ndiff <(grep -A 20 \"function_name\" src/birch_ffi.erl) \\\n     <(grep -A 20 \"function_name\" src/birch_ffi.mjs)\n```\n\n**Common issues**:\n- Return type mismatch (tuples vs arrays)\n- Error handling differences\n- String encoding (UTF-8 handling)\n\n### 2. Platform-Specific APIs\n\n**Symptom**: Function works on one platform, undefined/error on other.\n\n**JavaScript-only APIs**:\n- `process.stdout`, `process.stderr` (Node.js)\n- `Deno.isatty()` (Deno)\n- `console.log` behavior varies by runtime\n\n**Erlang-only APIs**:\n- Process dictionary (`erlang:put/get`)\n- OTP behaviors (`gen_server`, etc.)\n- `:logger` integration\n\n### 3. Async Behavior\n\n**Symptom**: Race conditions or timing issues on JavaScript.\n\n**Check**:\n- Erlang is synchronous by default\n- JavaScript may need `await` or callbacks\n- Look for Promise handling in FFI\n\n### 4. Type Coercion\n\n**Symptom**: Unexpected values or type errors.\n\n| Gleam Type | Erlang | JavaScript |\n|------------|--------|------------|\n| `Int` | Integer | Number |\n| `Float` | Float | Number |\n| `String` | Binary | String |\n| `List` | List | Array |\n| `Tuple` | Tuple | Array |\n| `Nil` | `nil` atom | `undefined` |\n\n### 5. TTY/Terminal Detection\n\n**Symptom**: Color output works on one platform.\n\n**Check**:\n```gleam\n// In platform.gleam\nis_stdout_tty()  // Different implementation per platform\n```\n\n## Debugging Steps\n\n### Step 1: Isolate the Failure\n\n```bash\n# Run specific test\ngleam test --target erlang -- --filter \"test_name\"\ngleam test --target javascript -- --filter \"test_name\"\n```\n\n### Step 2: Add Debug Output\n\n```gleam\n// Temporary debug logging\nimport gleam/io\nio.debug(value)  // Works on both targets\n```\n\n### Step 3: Check FFI\n\n1. Read `src/birch/internal/platform.gleam` for declarations\n2. Compare `src/birch_ffi.erl` and `src/birch_ffi.mjs`\n3. Look for behavioral differences\n\n### Step 4: Test JavaScript Runtimes\n\n```bash\n# Test on all JS runtimes\njust test-integration-node\njust test-integration-deno\njust test-integration-bun\n```\n\n### Step 5: Check Runtime Detection\n\nIn `birch_ffi.mjs`, verify runtime detection:\n```javascript\n// Node.js\ntypeof process !== ''undefined'' && process.versions?.node\n\n// Deno\ntypeof Deno !== ''undefined''\n\n// Bun\ntypeof Bun !== ''undefined''\n\n// Browser\ntypeof window !== ''undefined''\n```\n\n## FFI Debugging Checklist\n\n- [ ] Both implementations exist for the function\n- [ ] Return types match Gleam declaration\n- [ ] Error cases handled identically\n- [ ] Edge cases (empty string, null, special chars) tested\n- [ ] All JS runtimes have fallbacks (Node, Deno, Bun, browser)\n\n## Quick Fixes\n\n| Issue | Erlang Fix | JavaScript Fix |\n|-------|------------|----------------|\n| Undefined function | Check module exports | Check `export` statement |\n| Wrong return type | Match Gleam type exactly | Return correct JS type |\n| Encoding issues | Use `unicode:characters_to_binary` | Use `TextEncoder` |\n| TTY detection | Check `os:type()` | Check `process.stdout.isTTY` |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:54:22.495Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Erlang and JavaScript Agents requiring comprehensive cross-platform debugging capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要全面跨平台调试功能的Erlang和JavaScript代理。","ja":"ErlangとJavaScriptエージェントが包括的なクロスプラットフォームデバッグ機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"전면적인 크로스 플랫폼 디버깅 기능을 필요로 하는 Erlang 및 JavaScript 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Erlang y JavaScript que requieren capacidades de depuración integral entre plataformas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Erlang et JavaScript nécessitant des fonctionnalités de débogage complètes entre les plates-formes.","de":"Ideal für Erlang- und JavaScript-Agents, die umfassende Cross-Plattform-Debugging-Funktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes Erlang e JavaScript que exigem capacidades de depuração cross-platform abrangentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Erlang и JavaScript, требующих всесторонних возможностей отладки в нескольких платформах.","ar":"مثالي لعميل Erlang و JavaScript الذين يتطلبون إمكانيات فحص متقاطعة الشكل الشامل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically diagnose issues using a logging library that targets both Erlang and JavaScript, facilitating the identification of FFI implementation mismatches and other cross-platform discrepancies through protocols like diff and grep.","zh":"使得代理能够系统地使用针对Erlang和JavaScript的日志记录库来诊断问题，从而通过诸如diff和grep的协议来识别FFI实现的不匹配和其他跨平台的差异。","ja":"ErlangとJavaScriptの両方を対象としたログ記録ライブラリを使用して、問題を体系的に診断するエージェントを可能にし、diffやgrepなどのプロトコルを介してFFI実装の不一致やその他のクロスプラットフォームの相違点を識別します。","ko":"에이전트가 에를랭과 자바스크립트의 로깅 라이브러리를 사용하여 문제를 체계적으로 진단할 수 있도록 하여, diff 및 grep과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 FFI 구현의 불일치 및 기타 크로스 플랫폼 불일치를 식별할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diagnosticar sistemáticamente problemas utilizando una biblioteca de registro que se dirige tanto a Erlang como a JavaScript, facilitando la identificación de discrepancias de implementación de FFI y otras discrepancias entre plataformas a través de protocolos como diff y grep.","fr":"Permet aux agents de diagnostiquer systématiquement les problèmes en utilisant une bibliothèque de journalisation qui cible à la fois Erlang et JavaScript, facilitant l''identification des différences d''implémentation de FFI et d''autres différences entre les plates-formes via des protocoles tels que diff et grep.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Probleme systematisch zu diagnostizieren, indem sie eine Logging-Bibliothek verwenden, die sich sowohl an Erlang als auch an JavaScript richtet, wodurch die Identifizierung von FFI-Implementierungsunterschieden und anderen Plattformunterschieden durch Protokolle wie diff und grep erleichtert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a diagnosticar systematicamente problemas usando uma biblioteca de logging que targetiza tanto Erlang quanto JavaScript, facilitando a identificação de discrepâncias de implementação de FFI e outras discrepâncias de cross-platform por meio de protocolos como diff e grep.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически диагностировать проблемы с использованием библиотеки журналирования, нацеленной на Erlang и JavaScript, что облегчает выявление несоответствий в реализации FFI и других расхождений между платформами посредством протоколов типа diff и grep.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تشخيص المشكلات بشكل منهجي باستخدام مكتبة سجل تستهدف كل من Erlang و JavaScript، وتسهل تحديد انسجامات تنفيذ FFI وتناقضات متقاطعة الشكل الأخرى من خلال بروتوكولات مثل diff و grep."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging issues specific to Erlang or JavaScript","Comparing FFI implementations across platforms","Identifying behavioral differences between targets"],"zh":["调试特定于Erlang或JavaScript的问题","比较平台之间的FFI实现","识别目标之间的行为差异"],"ja":["ErlangまたはJavaScript固有の問題のデバッグ","プラットフォーム間のFFI実装の比較","ターゲット間の動作の違いを特定"],"ko":["에를랭 또는 자바스크립트 특정 문제 디버깅","플랫폼 간 FFI 구현 비교","대상 간의 행동 차이 식별"],"es":["Depuración de problemas específicos de Erlang o JavaScript","Comparación de implementaciones de FFI entre plataformas","Identificación de diferencias de comportamiento entre objetivos"],"fr":["Débogage de problèmes spécifiques à Erlang ou JavaScript","Comparaison des implémentations de FFI entre les plates-formes","Identification des différences de comportement entre les cibles"],"de":["Behandlung von Problemen, die spezifisch für Erlang oder JavaScript sind","Vergleich von FFI-Implementierungen zwischen Plattformen","Identifizierung von Verhaltensunterschieden zwischen Zielen"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas específicos do Erlang ou JavaScript","Comparação de implementações de FFI entre plataformas","Identificação de diferenças comportamentais entre alvos"],"ru":["Отладка проблем, специфичных для Erlang или JavaScript","Сравнение реализаций FFI между платформами","Определение поведенческих различий между целями"],"ar":["فحص مشاكل محددة لعميل Erlang أو JavaScript","مقارنة تنفيذ FFI عبر المنصات","تحديد الفروق السلوكية بين الأهداف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Gleam logging library","Erlang and JavaScript targets only","just command-line tool dependency"],"zh":["需要Gleam日志记录库","仅支持Erlang和JavaScript目标","仅命令行工具依赖"],"ja":["Gleamログ記録ライブラリが必要","ErlangとJavaScriptのターゲットのみをサポート","コマンドラインツール依存のみ"],"ko":["Gleam 로깅 라이브러리 필요","에를랭 및 자바스크립트 대상만 지원","명령줄 도구 종속성만"],"es":["Requiere la biblioteca de registro Gleam","Solo objetivos Erlang y JavaScript","solo dependencia de herramienta de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Nécessite la bibliothèque de journalisation Gleam","Cibles Erlang et JavaScript uniquement","dépendance uniquement de l''outil de ligne de commande"],"de":["Benötigt die Gleam-Logging-Bibliothek","Nur Erlang- und JavaScript-Ziele","nur Kommandozeilen-Tool-Abhängigkeit"],"pt":["Exige biblioteca de logging Gleam","Alvos Erlang e JavaScript apenas","apenas dependência de ferramenta de linha de comando"],"ru":["Требует библиотеки журналирования Gleam","Цели Erlang и JavaScript только","только зависимость командной строки"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبة سجل Gleam","أهداف Erlang و JavaScript فقط","依赖 أداة سطر الأوامر فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e26333c97f9cf6442dd50e77e968edcdacc53ad2c0e56f089589b2faba9c043a","qualityScore":36}');
