anleitung für Finance Guru"],"pt":["como usar relatórios de prontidão","o que é relatório de prontidão","ferramentas de ia para finanças","finance guru alternative","finance guru vs competitor","instalar finance guru","configurar finance guru"],"ru":["как использовать отчеты о готовности","что такое отчет о готовности","инструменты ии для финансов","finance guru альтернатива","finance guru vs конкурент","установить finance guru","настроить finance guru"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام تقارير الجاهزية","ما هو تقرير الجاهزية","أدوات الإي آي للتمويل","finance guru بديل","finance guru vs منافس","تثبيت finance guru","إعداد finance guru"]}},"owner":"AojdevStudio","repo":"Finance-Guru","repoPath":"AojdevStudio/Finance-Guru","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.736Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"readiness-report","description":"Evaluate how well a codebase supports autonomous AI development. Analyzes repositories across nine technical pillars (Style & Validation, Build System, Testing, Documentation, Dev Environment, Debugging & Observability, Security, Task Discovery, Product & Analytics) and five maturity levels. Use when users request `/readiness-report` or want to assess agent readiness, codebase maturity, or identify gaps preventing effective AI-assisted development.","bodyPreview":"# Agent Readiness Report\n\nEvaluate how well a repository supports autonomous AI development by analyzing it across nine technical pillars and five maturity levels.\n\n## Overview\n\nAgent Readiness measures how prepared a codebase is for AI-assisted development. Poor feedback loops, missing documentation, or lack of tooling cause agents to waste cycles on preventable errors. This skill identifies those gaps and prioritizes fixes.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThe user will run `/readiness-report` to evaluate the","body":"# Agent Readiness Report\n\nEvaluate how well a repository supports autonomous AI development by analyzing it across nine technical pillars and five maturity levels.\n\n## Overview\n\nAgent Readiness measures how prepared a codebase is for AI-assisted development. Poor feedback loops, missing documentation, or lack of tooling cause agents to waste cycles on preventable errors. This skill identifies those gaps and prioritizes fixes.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThe user will run `/readiness-report` to evaluate the current repository. The agent will then:\n1. Clone the repo, scan repository structure, CI configs, and tooling\n2. Evaluate 81 criteria across 9 technical pillars\n3. Determine maturity level (L1-L5) based on 80% threshold per level\n4. Provide prioritized recommendations\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Run Repository Analysis\n\nExecute the analysis script to gather signals from the repository:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/analyze_repo.py --repo-path .\n```\n\nThis script checks for:\n- Configuration files (.eslintrc, pyproject.toml, etc.)\n- CI/CD workflows (.github/workflows/, .gitlab-ci.yml)\n- Documentation (README, AGENTS.md, CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- Test infrastructure (test directories, coverage configs)\n- Security configurations (CODEOWNERS, .gitignore, secrets management)\n\n### Step 2: Generate Report\n\nAfter analysis, generate the formatted report:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/generate_report.py --analysis-file /tmp/readiness_analysis.json\n```\n\n### Step 3: Present Results\n\nThe report includes:\n1. **Overall Score**: Pass rate percentage and maturity level achieved\n2. **Level Progress**: Bar showing L1-L5 completion percentages\n3. **Strengths**: Top-performing pillars with passing criteria\n4. **Opportunities**: Prioritized list of improvements to implement\n5. **Detailed Criteria**: Full breakdown by pillar showing each criterion status\n\n## Nine Technical Pillars\n\nEach pillar addresses specific failure modes in AI-assisted development:\n\n| Pillar | Purpose | Key Signals |\n|--------|---------|-------------|\n| **Style & Validation** | Catch bugs instantly | Linters, formatters, type checkers |\n| **Build System** | Fast, reliable builds | Build docs, CI speed, automation |\n| **Testing** | Verify correctness | Unit/integration tests, coverage |\n| **Documentation** | Guide the agent | AGENTS.md, README, architecture docs |\n| **Dev Environment** | Reproducible setup | Devcontainer, env templates |\n| **Debugging & Observability** | Diagnose issues | Logging, tracing, metrics |\n| **Security** | Protect the codebase | CODEOWNERS, secrets management |\n| **Task Discovery** | Find work to do | Issue templates, PR templates |\n| **Product & Analytics** | Error-to-insight loop | Error tracking, product analytics |\n\nSee `references/criteria.md` for the complete list of 81 criteria per pillar.\n\n## Five Maturity Levels\n\n| Level | Name | Description | Agent Capability |\n|-------|------|-------------|------------------|\n| L1 | Initial | Basic version control | Manual assistance only |\n| L2 | Managed | Basic CI/CD and testing | Simple, well-defined tasks |\n| L3 | Standardized | Production-ready for agents | Routine maintenance |\n| L4 | Measured | Comprehensive automation | Complex features |\n| L5 | Optimized | Full autonomous capability | End-to-end development |\n\n**Level Progression**: To unlock a level, pass ≥80% of criteria at that level AND all previous levels.\n\nSee `references/maturity-levels.md` for detailed level requirements.\n\n## Interpreting Results\n\n### Pass vs Fail vs Skip\n\n- ✓ **Pass**: Criterion met (contributes to score)\n- ✗ **Fail**: Criterion not met (opportunity for improvement)\n- — **Skip**: Not applicable to this repository type (excluded from score)\n\n### Priority Order\n\nFix gaps in this order:\n1. **L1-L2 failures**: Foundation issues blocking basic agent operation\n2. **L3 failures**: Production readiness gaps\n3. **High-impact L4+ failures**: Optimization opportunities\n\n### Common Quick Wins\n\n1. **Add AGENTS.md**: Document commands, architecture, and workflows for AI agents\n2. **Configure pre-commit hooks**: Catch style issues before CI\n3. **Add PR/issue templates**: Structure task discovery\n4. **Document single-command setup**: Enable fast environment provisioning\n\n## Resources\n\n- `scripts/analyze_repo.py` - Repository analysis script\n- `scripts/generate_report.py` - Report generation and formatting\n- `references/criteria.md` - Complete criteria definitions by pillar\n- `references/maturity-levels.md` - Detailed level requirements\n\n## Automated Remediation\n\nAfter reviewing the report, common fixes can be automated:\n- Generate AGENTS.md from repository structure\n- Add missing issue/PR templates\n- Configure standard linters and formatters\n- Set up pre-commit hooks\n\nAsk to \"fix readiness gaps\" to begin automated remediation of failing criteria.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:03:21.569Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous AI Agents needing comprehensive repository analysis and technical pillar evaluation.","zh":"适用于需要全面仓库分析和技术支柱评估的自主AI代理。","ja":"包括技術的柱の評価や、包括的なリポジトリ分析が必要な、自律的なAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"포괄적인 저장소 분석 및 기술 기둥 평가가 필요한 자율형 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Autónomos que necesitan un análisis de repositorio integral y una evaluación de pilares técnicos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''IA autonomes ayant besoin d''une analyse de référentiel complète et d''une évaluation de piliers techniques.","de":"Perfekt für autonome KI-Agents, die eine umfassende Repository-Analyse und eine technische Pfeilerbewertung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Autônomos que necessitam de análise abrangente de repositórios e avaliação de pilares técnicos.","ru":"Идеально для автономных агентов ИИ, которым требуется всесторонний анализ репозиториев и оценка технических столпов.","ar":"مثالي لعميلAI المستقل الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل شامل لمستودع و تقييم عمود تقني."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to evaluate codebases across nine technical pillars and five maturity levels, identifying gaps and prioritizing fixes using the BMAD-CORE v6 architecture, and providing actionable feedback for improvement.","zh":"赋予代理评估代码库的九个技术支柱和五个成熟度级别的能力，识别差距并使用BMAD-CORE v6架构优先考虑修复，并为改进提供可行的反馈。","ja":"BMAD-CORE v6アーキテクチャを使用して、9つの技術的柱や5つの成熟度レベルに基づいてコードベースを評価し、ギャップを特定し、修復を優先する能力をエージェントに与え、改善のための実行可能なフィードバックを提供します。","ko":"BMAD-CORE v6 아키텍처를 사용하여 코드베이스를 9개의 기술 기둥과 5개의 성숙도 수준으로 평가하고, 차이를 식별하고, 수정을 우선순위로 지정하며, 개선에 대한 실행 가능한 피드백을 제공하는 에이전트의 능력을 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a evaluar las bases de código a través de nueve pilares técnicos y cinco niveles de madurez, identificando brechas y priorizando soluciones utilizando la arquitectura BMAD-CORE v6, y proporcionando comentarios concretos para la mejora.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer les bases de code à travers neuf piliers techniques et cinq niveaux de maturité, en identifiant les lacunes et en priorisant les correctifs en utilisant l''architecture BMAD-CORE v6, et en fournissant des commentaires exploitables pour l''amélioration.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Codebasen über neun technische Pfeiler und fünf Reifegradstufen hinweg zu bewerten, Lücken zu identifizieren und Korrekturen basierend auf Reifegradstufen und technischen Pfeilern zu priorisieren, unter Verwendung der BMAD-CORE v6-Architektur, und liefert handhabbare Rückmeldungen zur Verbesserung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliarem codebases em nove pilares técnicos e cinco níveis de maturidade, identificando lacunas e priorizando correções usando a arquitetura BMAD-CORE v6, e fornecendo feedback ação para melhoria.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оценивать кодовые базы по девяти техническим столпам и пяти уровням зрелости, выявлять пробелы и устанавливать приоритеты исправлений с использованием архитектуры BMAD-CORE v6, и предоставлять действенные отзывы для улучшения.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تقييم قواعد التعليمات البرمجية عبر تسعة أعمدة تقنية وخمسة مستويات من النضج، وتحديد الفجوات وتحديد الأولويات للتصحيحات باستخدام هندسة BMAD-CORE v6، وتقديم ملاحظات قابلة للتنفيذ للتحسين."},"useCases":{"en":["Evaluating repository readiness for AI-assisted development","Identifying preventable errors and gaps in documentation","Prioritizing fixes based on maturity levels and technical pillars"],"zh":["评估仓库对AI辅助开发的准备情况","识别可防止的错误和文档中的差距","根据成熟度级别和技术支柱优先考虑修复"],"ja":["AIアシスト開発のためのリポジトリの準備状況を評価する","ドキュメントの中のギャップや防止可能なエラーを特定する","成熟度レベルや技術的柱に基づいて修復を優先する"],"ko":["AI 지원 개발을 위한 저장소 준비 상태 평가","문서의 차이 및 방지 가능한 오류 식별","성숙도 수준 및 기술 기둥에 따라 수정 우선순위 지정"],"es":["Evaluación de la preparación del repositorio para el desarrollo asistido por IA","Identificación de errores prevenibles y lagunas en la documentación","Priorización de soluciones en función de los niveles de madurez y los pilares técnicos"],"fr":["Évaluation de la préparation du référentiel pour le développement assisté par l''IA","Identification des erreurs évitables et des lacunes dans la documentation","Priorisation des correctifs en fonction des niveaux de maturité et des piliers techniques"],"de":["Bewertung der Repository-Vorbereitung für die KI-gestützte Entwicklung","Identifizierung von vermeidbaren Fehlern und Lücken in der Dokumentation","Priorisierung von Korrekturen basierend auf Reifegradstufen und technischen Pfeilern"],"pt":["Avaliando a preparação do repositório para desenvolvimento assistido por IA","Identificando erros evitáveis e lacunas na documentação","Priorizando correções com base em níveis de maturidade e pilares técnicos"],"ru":["Оценка готовности репозитория к разработке с помощью ИИ","Выявление предотвратимых ошибок и пробелов в документации","Установление приоритетов исправлений на основе уровней зрелости и технических столпов"],"ar":["تقييم استعداد المستودع للتنمية بمساعدة عميل AI","تحديد الأخطاء التي يمكن منعها والفجوات في الوثائق","تحديد الأولويات للتصحيحات بناءً على مستويات النضج والأعمدة الفنية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the repository''s codebase","Limited to evaluating repositories with compatible architecture"],"zh":["需要访问仓库的代码库","仅限于评估具有兼容架构的仓库"],"ja":["コードベースへのアクセスが必要","互換性のあるアーキテクチャを持つリポジトリのみを評価する"],"ko":["코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요함","호환되는 아키텍처를 갖춘 저장소만 평가"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código del repositorio","Limitado a la evaluación de repositorios con arquitectura compatible"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code du référentiel","Limité à l''évaluation des référentiels avec une architecture compatible"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Codebasis des Repositorys","Begrenzt auf die Bewertung von Repositorys mit kompatibler Architektur"],"pt":["Exige acesso à codebase do repositório","Limitado à avaliação de repositórios com arquitetura compatível"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе репозитория","Ограничен оценкой репозиториев с совместимой архитектурой"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة التعليمات البرمجية للمستودع","محدود بتقييم المستودعات بهندسة متوافقة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"732c594cf3859aafa281c104a09b6c6ad896014924258a7ab6012b7279156503","qualityScore":36}');
