ue C++20","Collisions et contraintes","Liens Python","Applications en robotique et animation","Intégration facile avec des projets existants","Compatibilité avec C++20"],"de":["C++20-Physik-Motor","Kollisionen und Einschränkungen","Python-Bindings","Anwendungen in Robotik und Animation","Einfache Integration mit bestehenden Projekten","Kompatibilität mit C++20"],"pt":["Motor de física C++20","Recursos de colisão e restrições","Bindings Python","Simulação de robótica e animação","Otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Движок физики C++20","Функции столкновения и ограничений","Python-биндинги","Симуляция робототехники и анимации","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["محرك فيزياء سي++20","ميزات التصادم والقيود","ربط بايثون","تحاكي الروبوتات والرسم المتحرك","تحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Dart-CI","C++20物理引擎","机器人和动画","如何使用Dart-CI","Dart-CI教程","C++20物理引擎比较","Dart-CI安装","Dart-CI设置指南"],"ja":["Dart-CI","C++20物理エンジン","ロボティクスとアニメーション","Dart-CIの使い方","Dart-CIチュートリアル","C++20物理エンジンの比較","Dart-CIのインストール","Dart-CIの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Dart-CI","C++20 물리 엔진","로봇과 애니메이션","Dart-CI 사용법","Dart-CI 튜토리얼","C++20 물리 엔진 비교","Dart-CI 설치","Dart-CI 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar dart-ci","qué es dart-ci","alternativas a dart-ci","dart-ci vs otros motores de física","instalación de dart-ci","guía de configuración de dart-ci","desarrollo de aplicaciones con dart-ci","robotica y animación con dart-ci","bindings de Python para dart-ci"],"fr":["comment utiliser dart-ci","qu''est-ce que dart-ci","alternatives à dart-ci","dart-ci vs autres moteurs de physique","installation de dart-ci","guide de configuration de dart-ci","développement d''applications avec dart-ci","robotique et animation avec dart-ci","liens Python pour dart-ci"],"de":["wie man dart-ci verwendet","was ist dart-ci","alternativen zu dart-ci","dart-ci vs andere physik-motoren","installation von dart-ci","konfigurationsanleitung für dart-ci","entwicklung von anwendungen mit dart-ci","robotik und animation mit dart-ci","python-bindings für dart-ci"],"pt":["como usar dart-ci","o que é dart-ci","alternativas ao dart-ci","dart-ci vs outros motores de física","instalar dart-ci","guia de configuração do dart-ci","desenvolvimento de robótica com dart-ci","simulação de animação com dart-ci"],"ru":["как использовать dart-ci","что такое dart-ci","альтернативы dart-ci","dart-ci vs другие движки физики","установить dart-ci","руководство по настройке dart-ci","разработка робототехники с dart-ci","симуляция анимации с dart-ci"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام dart-ci","ما هو dart-ci","بديل dart-ci","dart-ci مقابل محركات فيزياء أخرى","تثبيت dart-ci","دليل إعداد dart-ci","تطوير الروبوتات مع dart-ci","تحاكي الرسوم المتحركة مع dart-ci"]}},"owner":"dartsim","repo":"dart","repoPath":"dartsim/dart","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.737Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dart-ci","description":"DART CI/CD troubleshooting - GitHub Actions, cache debugging, platform-specific failures","bodyPreview":"<!-- AUTO-GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT MANUALLY -->\n<!-- Source: .claude/skills/dart-ci/SKILL.md -->\n<!-- Sync script: scripts/sync_ai_commands.py -->\n<!-- Run `pixi run sync-ai-commands` to update -->\n\n# DART CI/CD Troubleshooting\n\nLoad this skill when debugging CI failures or working with GitHub Actions.\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Monitor PR checks\ngh pr checks <PR_NUMBER>\ngh pr checks <PR_NUMBER> --watch --interval 30 --fail-fast\n\n# View run details\ngh run list --branch <BRANCH> -e pull_re","body":"<!-- AUTO-GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT MANUALLY -->\n<!-- Source: .claude/skills/dart-ci/SKILL.md -->\n<!-- Sync script: scripts/sync_ai_commands.py -->\n<!-- Run `pixi run sync-ai-commands` to update -->\n\n# DART CI/CD Troubleshooting\n\nLoad this skill when debugging CI failures or working with GitHub Actions.\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Monitor PR checks\ngh pr checks <PR_NUMBER>\ngh pr checks <PR_NUMBER> --watch --interval 30 --fail-fast\n\n# View run details\ngh run list --branch <BRANCH> -e pull_request -L 20\ngh run watch <RUN_ID> --interval 30\ngh run view <RUN_ID> --json status,conclusion,url\n\n# Debug failures\ngh run view <RUN_ID> --job <JOB_ID> --log-failed\ngh run view <RUN_ID> --json jobs --jq ''.jobs[] | {name, databaseId}''\n\n# Rerun failed jobs\ngh run rerun <RUN_ID> --failed\ngh run rerun <RUN_ID> --job <DATABASE_ID>\n```\n\n## Full Documentation\n\nFor complete CI/CD guide: `docs/onboarding/ci-cd.md`\n\n## Common Failure Modes\n\n| Failure Type         | Solution                                                 |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Formatting fails     | `pixi run lint` then push                                |\n| Codecov patch fails  | Add tests for uncovered lines                            |\n| FreeBSD RTTI fails   | Use type enums + `static_cast` instead of `dynamic_cast` |\n| macOS ARM64 SEGFAULT | Replace `alloca()`/VLAs with `std::vector<T>`            |\n| RTD build fails      | Use defensive `.get(key, default)` patterns              |\n| gz-physics fails     | Reproduce with `pixi run -e gazebo test-gz`              |\n\n## Workflow Architecture\n\n| Workflow            | Purpose                 | Platforms |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------- | --------- |\n| `ci_lint.yml`       | Formatting              | Ubuntu    |\n| `ci_ubuntu.yml`     | Build + test + coverage | Ubuntu    |\n| `ci_macos.yml`      | Build + test            | macOS     |\n| `ci_windows.yml`    | Build + test            | Windows   |\n| `ci_freebsd.yml`    | Build + test (VM)       | FreeBSD   |\n| `ci_gz_physics.yml` | Gazebo integration      | Ubuntu    |\n\n## Fast Iteration Loop\n\n1. Identify failing step from job logs\n2. Reproduce locally with same build toggles\n3. Fix the smallest failing test\n4. Push and monitor: `gh run watch <RUN_ID>`\n\n## Caching\n\n- sccache/ccache reduces build time 50-70%\n- Check cache hit rates in workflow logs\n- Force cache bust by changing cache key if needed\n\n## Expected CI Times\n\n| Platform | Cached    | Uncached  |\n| -------- | --------- | --------- |\n| Ubuntu   | 20-30 min | 45-60 min |\n| macOS    | 15-25 min | 30-45 min |\n| Windows  | 15-20 min | 25-35 min |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:03:29.159Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Robotics and Animation Agents utilizing C++20 physics engines with collision and constraint capabilities","zh":"适用于利用C++20物理引擎具有碰撞和约束能力的机器人和动画代理","ja":"C++20物理エンジンを使用し、衝突および制約機能を備えたロボティクスおよびアニメーションエージェントに最適","ko":"충돌 및 제약 기능을 갖춘 C++20 물리 엔진을 사용하는 로봇 및 애니메이션 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Robótica y Animación que utilizan motores de física C++20 con capacidades de colisión y restricción","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de robotique et d''animation utilisant des moteurs de physique C++20 avec des capacités de collision et de contrainte","de":"Ideal für Robotik- und Animationsagenten, die C++20-Physik-Engines mit Kollisions- und Constraints-Funktionen verwenden","pt":"Ideal para agentes de Robótica e Animação que utilizam motores de física C++20 com capacidades de colisão e restrição","ru":"Идеально подходит для роботов и анимационных агентов, использующих физические движки C++20 с возможностями столкновения и ограничения","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الروبوتية والرسوم المتحركة الذين ي''utilizam محركات الفيزياء C++20 مع القدرات التصادم والقيود"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to troubleshoot CI/CD pipelines with GitHub Actions, utilizing commands like `gh pr checks` and `gh run list` to monitor and debug PR checks and run details, leveraging Python bindings for seamless integration","zh":"赋予代理人使用GitHub Actions排查CI/CD管道问题的能力，利用命令如`gh pr checks`和`gh run list`监控和调试PR检查和运行详细信息，利用Python绑定实现无缝集成","ja":"GitHub Actionsを使用してCI/CDパイプラインの問題をトラブルシューティングするエージェントを強化することで、`gh pr checks`や`gh run list`などのコマンドを使用してPRチェックと実行の詳細を監視およびデバッグし、Pythonバインディングを使用してシームレスな統合を実現する","ko":"GitHub Actions를 사용하여 CI/CD 파이프라인 문제를 해결할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화하여 `gh pr checks` 및 `gh run list`와 같은 명령을 사용하여 PR 확인 및 실행 세부 정보를 모니터링하고 디버깅하며 Python 바인딩을 사용하여 무결점 통합을 구현","es":"Habilita a los agentes a solucionar problemas en tuberías de CI/CD con GitHub Actions, utilizando comandos como `gh pr checks` y `gh run list` para supervisar y depurar comprobaciones de PR y detalles de ejecución, aprovechando enlaces de Python para una integración sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de dépanner les pipelines CI/CD avec GitHub Actions, en utilisant des commandes telles que `gh pr checks` et `gh run list` pour surveiller et déboguer les vérifications de PR et les détails d''exécution, en exploitant les liaisons Python pour une intégration transparente","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, CI/CD-Pipelines mit GitHub Actions zu debuggen, indem Befehle wie `gh pr checks` und `gh run list` verwendet werden, um PR-Checks und Laufdetails zu überwachen und zu debuggen, und Python-Bindings für eine nahtlose Integration nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a solucionar problemas de pipelines CI/CD com GitHub Actions, utilizando comandos como `gh pr checks` e `gh run list` para monitorar e depurar verificações e detalhes de execução de PR, aproveitando vinculações Python para integração transparente","ru":"Позволяет агентам устранять неполадки в конвейерах CI/CD с помощью GitHub Actions, используя команды типа `gh pr checks` и `gh run list` для мониторинга и отладки проверок и деталей запуска PR, используя привязки Python для бесшовной интеграции","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تصحيح الأخطاء في أنابيب CI/CD باستخدام GitHub Actions، باستخدام أوامر مثل `gh pr checks` و `gh run list` لمراقبة وتصحيح تفاصيل الفحص والتشغيل من PR، واستخدام ربط Python للتكامل السلس"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging CI failures in robotics and animation projects","Monitoring PR checks for collision and constraint-related issues","Viewing run details for GitHub Actions workflows"],"zh":["调试机器人和动画项目中的CI故障","监控与碰撞和约束相关的问题的PR检查","查看GitHub Actions工作流的运行详细信息"],"ja":["ロボティクスおよびアニメーションプロジェクトのCI障害をデバッグする","衝突および制約関連の問題のPRチェックを監視する","GitHub Actionsワークフローの実行の詳細を表示する"],"ko":["로봇 및 애니메이션 프로젝트의 CI 오류를 디버깅","충돌 및 제약과 관련된 문제의 PR 확인을 모니터링","GitHub Actions 워크플로우의 실행 세부 정보를 표시"],"es":["Depuración de fallos de CI en proyectos de robótica y animación","Supervisión de comprobaciones de PR para problemas relacionados con colisiones y restricciones","Visualización de detalles de ejecución para flujos de trabajo de GitHub Actions"],"fr":["Débogage des échecs de CI dans les projets de robotique et d''animation","Surveillance des vérifications de PR pour les problèmes liés aux collisions et aux contraintes","Affichage des détails d''exécution pour les flux de travail GitHub Actions"],"de":["Debuggen von CI-Fehlern in Robotik- und Animationsprojekten","Überwachung von PR-Checks für Probleme im Zusammenhang mit Kollisionen und Constraints","Anzeige von Laufdetails für GitHub Actions-Workflows"],"pt":["Depuração de falhas de CI em projetos de robótica e animação","Monitoramento de verificações de PR para problemas relacionados a colisão e restrição","Visualização de detalhes de execução para fluxos de trabalho do GitHub Actions"],"ru":["Отладка сбоев CI в проектах робототехники и анимации","Мониторинг проверок PR на наличие проблем, связанных со столкновением и ограничением","Просмотр деталей запуска для рабочих процессов GitHub Actions"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء CI في مشاريع الروبوتية والرسوم المتحركة","مراقبة فحوصات PR لتحديد المشكلات المتعلقة بالتصادم والقيود","عرض تفاصيل التشغيل لأنظمة العمل GitHub Actions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Actions setup","Limited to C++20 physics engine and Python bindings","Dependent on `gh` command-line tool for GitHub interactions"],"zh":["需要GitHub Actions设置","仅限C++20物理引擎和Python绑定","依赖于`gh`命令行工具进行GitHub交互"],"ja":["GitHub Actionsの設定が必要","C++20物理エンジンおよびPythonバインディングに限定","GitHubとのやり取りには`gh`コマンドラインツールに依存"],"ko":["GitHub Actions 설정이 필요","C++20 물리 엔진 및 Python 바인딩으로 제한","GitHub와의 상호 작용에는 `gh` 명령줄 도구에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de GitHub Actions","Limitado a motor de física C++20 y enlaces de Python","Dependiente de la herramienta de línea de comandos `gh` para interacciones de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de GitHub Actions","Limité au moteur de physique C++20 et aux liaisons Python","Dépend de l''outil de ligne de commande `gh` pour les interactions GitHub"],"de":["Erfordert GitHub Actions-Setup","Begrenzt auf C++20-Physik-Engine und Python-Bindings","Abhängig von der Kommandozeilen-Tool `gh` für GitHub-Interaktionen"],"pt":["Requer configuração do GitHub Actions","Limitado ao motor de física C++20 e vinculações Python","Dependente da ferramenta de linha de comando `gh` para interações do GitHub"],"ru":["Требует настройки GitHub Actions","Ограничен физическим движком C++20 и привязками Python","Зависит от инструмента командной строки `gh` для взаимодействия с GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد GitHub Actions","محدود بمحرك الفيزياء C++20 وربطات Python","يعتمد على أداة سطر الأوامر `gh` للتفاعل مع GitHub"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a2b9639f752dcf7cc0f5cb351e99f44b340d9a6598587a747d83d623a4eae562","qualityScore":36}');
