","Développement d''agents d''intelligence artificielle","Amélioration de l''efficacité du développement"],"de":["Kooperative Entwicklungsumgebung","Integration von Claude Code und Codex CLI","tmux-Sitzung für verbesserte Produktivität","Entwicklung von KI-Agents","Verbesserung der EntwicklungsEffizienz"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento em dual-agente","Integração com Claude Code e Codex CLI","Sessão colaborativa do tmux","Ambiente de desenvolvimento personalizado","Suporte a linguagens de programação múltiplas"],"ru":["Разработка в среде двойного агента","Интеграция с Claude Code и Codex CLI","Совместная сессия tmux","Настраиваемая среда разработки","Поддержка нескольких языков программирования"],"ar":["التطوير في بيئة وحدات مزدوجة","التكامل مع Claude Code و Codex CLI","جلسة تعاونية من tmux","بيئة تطوير مخصصة","دعم لغات برمجة متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","read-task教程","双代理开发环境","Claude Code使用方法","Codex CLI安装","开发效率提高","开发协作工具","tmux会话管理"],"ja":["AIエージェント","read-taskの使い方","双代理開発環境","Claude Codeの使い方","Codex CLIのインストール","開発効率の向上","開発協力ツール","tmuxセッションの管理"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","read-task 사용법","쌍방향 개발 환경","Claude Code 사용 방법","Codex CLI 설치","개발 효율성 높이기","개발 협력 도구","tmux 세션 관리"],"es":["cómo usar Claude Code","qué es un agente de inteligencia artificial","alternativas a Codex CLI","Claude Code vs Codex CLI","instalación de Codex CLI","guía de configuración de Claude Code"],"fr":["comment utiliser Claude Code","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''intelligence artificielle","alternatives à Codex CLI","Claude Code vs Codex CLI","installation de Codex CLI","guide de configuration de Claude Code"],"de":["wie man Claude Code verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu Codex CLI","Claude Code vs Codex CLI","Installation von Codex CLI","Konfigurationsanleitung für Claude Code"],"pt":["como usar read-task","o que é read-task","read-task vs codex","instalar read-task","guia de configuração do read-task","alternativas ao read-task","desenvolvimento de software com read-task","read-task e Claude Code"],"ru":["как использовать read-task","что такое read-task","read-task vs codex","установить read-task","руководство по настройке read-task","альтернативы read-task","разработка программного обеспечения с read-task","read-task и Claude Code"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام read-task","ما هو read-task","read-task مقابل codex","تثبيت read-task","دليل إعداد read-task","بديلات read-task","تطوير البرمجيات مع read-task","read-task و Claude Code"]}},"owner":"antorsae","repo":"dual-agent","repoPath":"antorsae/dual-agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.738Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"read-task","description":"Read and execute task delegated from Claude. Use when user says read task, get task, or pick up claude task.","bodyPreview":"# Read Task Skill\n\nRead and execute a task delegated from Claude Code.\n\n## Steps\n\nBefore any file operations, resolve the `.agent-collab` directory so commands work outside the project root:\n\n```bash\nAGENT_COLLAB_DIR=\"${AGENT_COLLAB_DIR:-}\"\nif [ -n \"$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR\" ]; then\n  if [ -d \"$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR/.agent-collab\" ]; then\n    AGENT_COLLAB_DIR=\"$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR/.agent-collab\"\n  elif [ ! -d \"$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR\" ]; then\n    AGENT_COLLAB_DIR=\"\"\n  fi\nfi\n\nif [ -z \"$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR\" ]; then\n  AGE","body":"# Read Task Skill\n\nRead and execute a task delegated from Claude Code.\n\n## Steps\n\nBefore any file operations, resolve the `.agent-collab` directory so commands work outside the project root:\n\n```bash\nAGENT_COLLAB_DIR=\"${AGENT_COLLAB_DIR:-}\"\nif [ -n \"$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR\" ]; then\n  if [ -d \"$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR/.agent-collab\" ]; then\n    AGENT_COLLAB_DIR=\"$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR/.agent-collab\"\n  elif [ ! -d \"$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR\" ]; then\n    AGENT_COLLAB_DIR=\"\"\n  fi\nfi\n\nif [ -z \"$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR\" ]; then\n  AGENT_COLLAB_DIR=\"$(pwd)\"\n  while [ \"$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR\" != \"/\" ] && [ ! -d \"$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR/.agent-collab\" ]; do\n    AGENT_COLLAB_DIR=\"$(dirname \"$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR\")\"\n  done\n  AGENT_COLLAB_DIR=\"$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR/.agent-collab\"\nfi\n```\n\nIf `$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR` does not exist, stop and ask for the project root.\n\n### 1. Update Status\n\nWrite `working` to `$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR/status`\n\n### 2. Read the Task\n\nRead `$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR/requests/task.md` and parse:\n- Task Type: CODE_REVIEW, IMPLEMENT, or PLAN_REVIEW\n- All requirements and context\n\n### 3. Read Shared Context\n\nAlso read `$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR/context/shared.md` for project context.\n\n### 4. Execute Based on Task Type\n\n#### CODE_REVIEW\n\nPerform thorough code review:\n- Analyze code line by line\n- Look for bugs, logic errors, edge cases\n- Check for security vulnerabilities\n- Identify performance problems\n- Check error handling\n- Suggest concrete improvements with code examples\n\nBe thorough - take your time.\n\n#### IMPLEMENT\n\nImplement the requested feature:\n- Follow all requirements exactly\n- Match existing code patterns\n- Write clean, well-structured code\n- Handle edge cases and errors\n- Write code to specified target files\n\nTake time for high-quality implementation.\n\n#### PLAN_REVIEW\n\nCritically analyze the plan:\n- Evaluate overall approach\n- Identify failure modes\n- Consider scalability/maintainability\n- Suggest alternatives if applicable\n- Point out missing considerations\n- Assess risks\n- Provide concrete recommendations\n\n### 5. Write Response\n\nWrite complete response to `$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR/responses/response.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Codex Response\n\n## Task Type\n[Task type handled]\n\n## Completed At\n[Timestamp]\n\n## Summary\n[Brief summary]\n\n## Detailed Findings/Output\n\n[For CODE_REVIEW:]\n### Critical Issues\n[List with severity]\n\n### Security Concerns\n[Security issues]\n\n### Suggestions\n[Improvements with examples]\n\n---\n\n[For IMPLEMENT:]\n### Implementation Overview\n[What was implemented]\n\n### Files Created/Modified\n[List of files]\n\n### Integration Notes\n[How to integrate]\n\n---\n\n[For PLAN_REVIEW:]\n### Overall Assessment\n[Is plan sound?]\n\n### Concerns\n[Issues identified]\n\n### Recommendations\n[Specific suggestions]\n```\n\n### 6. Update Status\n\nWrite `done` to `$AGENT_COLLAB_DIR/status`\n\n### 7. Notify\n\nTell user response is ready and Claude can read it with `/codex-read`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:04:05.698Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Collaborative Agents like Claude Code and Codex CLI needing task execution and delegation capabilities in a dual-agent development environment.","zh":"适用于像 Claude Code 和 Codex CLI 这样的协作代理，需要在双代理开发环境中执行任务和委托任务的能力。","ja":"Claude Code と Codex CLI のようなコラボレーションエージェントに適しており、デュアルエージェント開発環境でタスクの実行と委任機能が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code와 Codex CLI 같은 협업 에이전트에게 적합하며, 이중 에이전트 개발 환경에서 작업 실행 및 위임 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes colaborativos como Claude Code y Codex CLI que necesitan capacidades de ejecución y delegación de tareas en un entorno de desarrollo de agente dual.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents collaboratifs comme Claude Code et Codex CLI ayant besoin de capacités d''exécution et de délégation de tâches dans un environnement de développement d''agent double.","de":"Ideal für kollaborative Agenten wie Claude Code und Codex CLI, die Aufgaben-Ausführungs- und Delegationsfunktionen in einer dualen Agent-Entwicklungsumgebung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Colaborativos como Claude Code e Codex CLI que necessitam de capacidades de execução e delegação de tarefas em um ambiente de desenvolvimento de agente dual.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Коллаборативных Агентов, таких как Claude Code и Codex CLI, которые требуют возможностей выполнения и делегирования задач в среде разработки двойного агента.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التعاون مثل Claude Code و Codex CLI الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات تنفيذ المهام وتفويضها في بيئة تطوير العميل المزدوج."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute tasks delegated from Claude Code, leveraging collaborative tmux sessions and resolving the `.agent-collab` directory for seamless command execution outside the project root, utilizing bash scripting and directory resolution protocols.","zh":"赋予代理执行从 Claude Code 委托的任务的能力，利用协作的 tmux 会话和解析 `.agent-collab` 目录以实现项目根目录以外的命令执行，使用 bash 脚本和目录解析协议。","ja":"Claude Code から委任されたタスクを実行するためのエージェントをエンパワーメントし、コラボレーションの tmux セッションと `.agent-collab` ディレクトリの解析を利用して、プロジェクトルートの外側でのコマンド実行を可能にします。bash スクリプトとディレクトリ解析プロトコルを使用します。","ko":"클라우드 코드에서 위임된 작업을 실행할 수 있는 에이전트를 활성화하여 협업 tmux 세션 및 `.agent-collab` 디렉토리 해석을 통해 프로젝트 루트 외부에서 명령 실행을 가능하게 하며, bash 스크립트 및 디렉토리 해석 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar tareas delegadas desde Claude Code, aprovechando sesiones colaborativas de tmux y resolviendo el directorio `.agent-collab` para una ejecución de comandos sin problemas fuera de la raíz del proyecto, utilizando scripting de bash y protocolos de resolución de directorios.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter des tâches déléguées depuis Claude Code, en exploitant des sessions collaboratives tmux et en résolvant le répertoire `.agent-collab` pour une exécution de commandes sans problème en dehors de la racine du projet, en utilisant le scripting bash et les protocoles de résolution de répertoires.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Aufgaben auszuführen, die von Claude Code delegiert wurden, indem sie collaborative tmux-Sitzungen nutzen und das Verzeichnis `.agent-collab` auflösen, um einen reibungslosen Befehlsausführung außerhalb des Projektstamms zu ermöglichen, wobei bash-Skripting und Verzeichnisauflösungsprotokolle verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar tarefas delegadas do Claude Code, aproveitando sessões colaborativas do tmux e resolvendo o diretório `.agent-collab` para execução de comandos sem interrupção fora da raiz do projeto, utilizando scripts de bash e protocolos de resolução de diretório.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять задачи, делегированные от Claude Code, используя коллаборативные сеансы tmux и решая директорию `.agent-collab` для бесперебойного выполнения команд вне корня проекта, используя скрипты bash и протоколы разрешения директории.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تنفيذ المهام المفوضة من Claude Code، مستفيداً من جلسات tmux التعاونية وحل مسألة دليل `.agent-collab` من أجل تنفيذ أوامر بدون انقطاع خارج根 المشروع، مستخدماً برمجة باش وبروتوكولات حل الدليل."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing tasks from Claude Code in a collaborative environment","Resolving directory paths for command execution","Integrating with Codex CLI for enhanced development workflows"],"zh":["在协作环境中从 Claude Code 执行任务","解析目录路径以执行命令","与 Codex CLI 集成以增强开发工作流"],"ja":["コラボレーション環境で Claude Code からタスクを実行する","コマンド実行のためのディレクトリパスの解析","Codex CLI と統合して開発ワークフローを強化する"],"ko":["협업 환경에서 클라우드 코드로부터 작업을 실행하는こと","명령 실행을 위한 디렉토리 경로 해석","코덱스 CLI와의 통합을 통한 개발 워크플로 강화"],"es":["Ejecutar tareas desde Claude Code en un entorno colaborativo","Resolver rutas de directorio para la ejecución de comandos","Integrar con Codex CLI para flujos de trabajo de desarrollo mejorados"],"fr":["Exécuter des tâches depuis Claude Code dans un environnement collaboratif","Résoudre les chemins de répertoire pour l''exécution de commandes","Intégrer avec Codex CLI pour des flux de travail de développement améliorés"],"de":["Aufgaben von Claude Code in einer kollaborativen Umgebung ausführen","Verzeichnispfade für die Befehlsausführung auflösen","Integration mit Codex CLI für verbesserte Entwicklungswerkflüsse"],"pt":["Executar tarefas do Claude Code em um ambiente colaborativo","Resolver caminhos de diretório para execução de comandos","Integrar com Codex CLI para fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento aprimorados"],"ru":["Выполнять задачи из Claude Code в коллаборативной среде","Разрешать пути директории для выполнения команд","Интегрироваться с Codex CLI для улучшения рабочих процессов разработки"],"ar":["تنفيذ المهام من Claude Code في بيئة تعاونية","حل مسارات الدليل لتنفيذ الأوامر","التكامل مع Codex CLI لتحسين سير عمل التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires collaborative tmux session setup","Dependent on `.agent-collab` directory resolution","Limited to bash-compatible environments"],"zh":["需要协作 tmux 会话设置","依赖于 `.agent-collab` 目录解析","仅限 bash 兼容环境"],"ja":["コラボレーション tmux セッションの設定が必要","`.agent-collab` ディレクトリの解析に依存","bash との互換性のある環境に限る"],"ko":["협업 tmux 세션 설정이 필요함","`.agent-collab` 디렉토리 해석에 의존","bash와 호환되는 환경에서만 사용 가능"],"es":["Requiere configuración de sesión colaborativa de tmux","Dependiente de la resolución del directorio `.agent-collab`","Limitado a entornos compatibles con bash"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de session collaborative tmux","Dépend de la résolution du répertoire `.agent-collab`","Limité aux environnements compatibles bash"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration einer kollaborativen tmux-Sitzung","Abhängig von der Auflösung des Verzeichnisses `.agent-collab`","Begrenzt auf bash-kompatible Umgebungen"],"pt":["Requer configuração de sessão colaborativa do tmux","Depende da resolução do diretório `.agent-collab`","Limitado a ambientes compatíveis com bash"],"ru":["Требует настройки коллаборативной сессии tmux","Зависит от разрешения директории `.agent-collab`","Ограничен средами, совместимыми с bash"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد جلسة تعاونية tmux","يعتمد على حل مسألة دليل `.agent-collab`","محدود بالبيئات المتوافقة مع باش"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"39870b52a0274aa5fcfa50556601804041b2051906f0b6f3badf1d19cebd207b","qualityScore":36}');
