ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a desenvolvedores","Documentação completa"],"ru":["Генерация общего workflow на Java DDD","Создание общих рабочих процессов с легкостью","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка разработчиков","Полная документация"],"ar":["إنشاء تدفق العمل المشترك في Java DDD","إنشاء تدفقات العمل المشتركة بسهولة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم المطورين","وثائق كاملة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Java DDD Scaffold","AI","Java DDD Scaffold - AI","Java DDD Scaffold - AI","Java DDD Scaffold - AI","Java DDD Scaffold - AI"],"ja":["Java DDD Scaffold","AI","Java DDD Scaffold - AI","Java DDD Scaffold - AI","Java DDD Scaffold - AI","Java DDD Scaffold - AI"],"ko":["Java DDD Scaffold","AI","Java DDD Scaffold - AI","Java DDD Scaffold - AI","Java DDD Scaffold - AI","Java DDD Scaffold - AI"],"es":["cómo usar app-common-workflow-generator","qué es Java DDD","alternativas a app-common-workflow-generator","app-common-workflow-generator vs scaffold de Java","instalación de app-common-workflow-generator","guía de configuración de app-common-workflow-generator","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Java DDD","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser app-common-workflow-generator","qu''est-ce que Java DDD","alternatives à app-common-workflow-generator","app-common-workflow-generator vs scaffold de Java","installation de app-common-workflow-generator","guide de configuration de app-common-workflow-generator","développement d''applications avec Java DDD","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour développeurs"],"de":["wie man app-common-workflow-generator verwendet","was ist Java DDD","alternativen zu app-common-workflow-generator","app-common-workflow-generator vs Java DDD-Scaffold","installation von app-common-workflow-generator","einrichtungsanleitung für app-common-workflow-generator","entwicklung von anwendungen mit Java DDD","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar o app-common-workflow-generator","o que é java ddd","app-common-workflow-generator alternative","app-common-workflow-generator vs outras ferramentas","instalar app-common-workflow-generator","guia de configuração do app-common-workflow-generator","desenvolvedores de java","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент app-common-workflow-generator","что такое java ddd","ИИ Агент app-common-workflow-generator alternative","ИИ Агент app-common-workflow-generator vs другие инструменты","установить ИИ Агент app-common-workflow-generator","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента app-common-workflow-generator","разработчики java","инструменты ии для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي app-common-workflow-generator","ما هو java ddd","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي app-common-workflow-generator بديلة","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي app-common-workflow-generator مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي app-common-workflow-generator","دليل إعداد أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي app-common-workflow-generator","مطورو جافا","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"ryan-alexander-zhang","repo":"persimmon","repoPath":"ryan-alexander-zhang/persimmon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.750Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"app-common-workflow-generator","description":"Generates/extends the workflow engine in app-common: step handlers, retry policies, processors, and unit tests.","bodyPreview":"# App Common Workflow Generator\n\n> Follow `.codex/skills/GENERATOR_SKILL_STRUCTURE.md`.\n\nTemplates: See `references/templates.md`.\n\n## Use For\n- `{{basePackage}}.app.common.workflow.*`\n\n## Inputs Required\n- `workflowType` (stable string)\n- Step list (linear): ordered `stepSeq` + `stepType`\n- Retry policy requirements (max attempts, backoff)\n- WAITING semantics (deadline + wake-up event type) if used\n\n## Outputs\n- App/common workflow:\n  - step handler(s) implementing `WorkflowStepHandler`\n  - opt","body":"# App Common Workflow Generator\n\n> Follow `.codex/skills/GENERATOR_SKILL_STRUCTURE.md`.\n\nTemplates: See `references/templates.md`.\n\n## Use For\n- `{{basePackage}}.app.common.workflow.*`\n\n## Inputs Required\n- `workflowType` (stable string)\n- Step list (linear): ordered `stepSeq` + `stepType`\n- Retry policy requirements (max attempts, backoff)\n- WAITING semantics (deadline + wake-up event type) if used\n\n## Outputs\n- App/common workflow:\n  - step handler(s) implementing `WorkflowStepHandler`\n  - optional retry policy implementation + unit tests\n  - services that start/tick/signal workflows\n\n## Naming & Packaging\n- Handler names: `<WorkflowType><StepType>Handler` or `<StepType>WorkflowStepHandler`\n- Keep engine types in `app/common/workflow/**`; business-specific in `app/{{bcName}}/**` if needed.\n\n## Implementation Rules\n- Linear execution (responsibility chain) unless explicitly requested otherwise.\n- Steps must be idempotent (replay safe).\n- Retry policy must be configurable and unit-tested.\n- State transitions must be guarded (status predicates at store boundary).\n\n## Reference Implementations\n- `{{appModuleDir}}/src/main/java/{{basePackagePath}}/app/common/workflow/service/WorkflowRunner.java`\n- `{{appModuleDir}}/src/main/java/{{basePackagePath}}/app/common/workflow/service/WorkflowTaskProcessorImpl.java`\n- `{{infraModuleDir}}/src/main/java/{{basePackagePath}}/infra/repository/workflow/store/MybatisWorkflowStore.java`\n- `{{domainModuleDir}}/src/main/java/{{basePackagePath}}/domain/common/workflow/WorkflowStepStatus.java`\n\n## Tests\n- Unit tests for definition/registry/step results/policies.\n- Integration tests for store lease + state transitions.\n\n## Pitfalls\n- Forgetting to insert steps up front (breaks recovery after restart).\n- Updating step status without lock owner predicates.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:11:06.021Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Java-based AI Agents requiring automated workflow generation and management.","zh":"适用于需要自动化工作流生成和管理的基于Java的AI代理。","ja":"JavaベースのAIエージェントが自動化されたワークフローの生成と管理を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"자동화된 워크플로우 생성 및 관리가 필요한 자바 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Java que requieren generación y gestión de flujos de trabajo automatizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA basés sur Java nécessitant une génération et une gestion de flux de travail automatisées.","de":"Ideal für Java-basierte KI-Agents, die eine automatisierte Workflow-Generierung und -Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Java que exigem geração e gerenciamento de fluxos de trabalho automatizados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Java, требующих автоматизированного создания и управления рабочими процессами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكية القائمة على Java التي تتطلب توليد وادارة تدفقات العمل التلقائي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create customized workflow handlers implementing WorkflowStepHandler, leveraging Java DDD Scaffold and managing retry policies, deadlines, and wake-up events using stable string workflow types and linear step sequences.","zh":"赋予代理创建自定义的工作流处理程序，实现WorkflowStepHandler，利用Java DDD Scaffold，并使用稳定的字符串工作流类型和线性步骤序列管理重试策略，截止日期和唤醒事件。","ja":"エージェントがカスタマイズされたワークフロー ハンドラーを作成できるようにし、WorkflowStepHandler を実装し、Java DDD Scaffold を利用し、安定した文字列ワークフロー タイプと線形ステップ シーケンスを使用して、再試行ポリシー、期限、および起動イベントを管理します。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 지정 워크플로 핸들러를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 WorkflowStepHandler를 구현하고 자바 DDD 스캐폴드를 활용하며 안정적인 문자열 워크플로 타입 및 선형 단계 시퀀스를 사용하여 재시도 정책, 기한 및 대기 이벤트를 관리합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear controladores de flujo de trabajo personalizados que implementan WorkflowStepHandler, aprovechando Java DDD Scaffold y gestionando políticas de reintento, plazos y eventos de activación utilizando tipos de flujo de trabajo de cadena estable y secuencias de pasos lineales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des gestionnaires de flux de travail personnalisés implémentant WorkflowStepHandler, en exploitant Java DDD Scaffold et en gérant les stratégies de réessai, les délais et les événements de réveil à l''aide de types de flux de travail de chaîne stable et de séquences de pas linéaires.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, benutzerdefinierte Workflow-Handler zu erstellen, die WorkflowStepHandler implementieren, indem sie Java DDD Scaffold nutzen und Wiederholungsrichtlinien, Fristen und Wake-up-Ereignisse mithilfe stabiler Zeichenfolgen-Workflotypen und linearer Schrittfolgen verwalten.","pt":"Habilita agentes a criar manipuladores de fluxo de trabalho personalizados que implementam WorkflowStepHandler, aproveitando o Java DDD Scaffold e gerenciando políticas de repetição, prazos e eventos de despertar usando tipos de fluxo de trabalho de string estável e sequências de etapas lineares.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать настраиваемые обработчики рабочих процессов, реализующие WorkflowStepHandler, используя Java DDD Scaffold и управляя политиками повторных попыток, сроками и событиями пробуждения с помощью стабильных строковых типов рабочих процессов и линейных последовательностей шагов.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء معالجات تدفق عمل مخصصة تطبق WorkflowStepHandler، وتستفيد من Java DDD Scaffold وادارة سياسات إعادة المحاولة والانتهاء والأحداث الاستيقاظ باستخدام أنواع سلسلة تدفق العمل المستقر وتسلسلات الخطوات الخطية"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating step handlers for complex workflows","Automating retry policy configurations","Creating deadline-based waiting semantics"],"zh":["为复杂工作流生成步骤处理程序","自动化重试策略配置","创建基于截止日期的等待语义"],"ja":["複雑なワークフローのステップ ハンドラーを生成する","再試行ポリシーの構成を自動化する","期限に基づく待機セマンティクスを作成する"],"ko":["복잡한 워크플로우의 단계 핸들러 생성","재시도 정책 구성 자동화","기한 기반 대기 의미 생성"],"es":["Generación de controladores de pasos para flujos de trabajo complejos","Automatización de configuraciones de políticas de reintento","Creación de semántica de espera basada en plazos"],"fr":["Génération de gestionnaires d''étapes pour des flux de travail complexes","Automatisation des configurations de stratégies de réessai","Création de sémantique d''attente basée sur les délais"],"de":["Generierung von Schritt-Handlern für komplexe Workflows","Automatisierung von Konfigurationen für Wiederholungsrichtlinien","Erstellung von Warte-Semantik basierend auf Fristen"],"pt":["Geração de manipuladores de etapas para fluxos de trabalho complexos","Automação de configurações de política de repetição","Criação de semântica de espera baseada em prazos"],"ru":["Генерация обработчиков шагов для сложных рабочих процессов","Автоматизация конфигураций политики повторных попыток","Создание семантики ожидания на основе сроков"],"ar":["توليد معالجات المراحل لتدفقات العمل المعقدة","أتمتة تكوين سياسات إعادة المحاولة","إنشاء معاني الإنتظار القائمة على الموعد النهائي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Java DDD Scaffold setup","Limited to linear step sequences"],"zh":["需要Java DDD Scaffold设置","仅限线性步骤序列"],"ja":["Java DDD Scaffold の設定が必要","線形ステップ シーケンスのみ"],"ko":["자바 DDD 스캐폴드 설정 필요","선형 단계 시퀀스만"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Java DDD Scaffold","Limitado a secuencias de pasos lineales"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Java DDD Scaffold","Limité à des séquences de pas linéaires"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration von Java DDD Scaffold","Begrenzt auf lineare Schrittfolgen"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Java DDD Scaffold","Limitado a sequências de etapas lineares"],"ru":["Требует настройки Java DDD Scaffold","Ограничен линейными последовательностями шагов"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Java DDD Scaffold","محدود بالتسلسلات الخطية للخطوات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7b4bb0099d16cd674f570125c93f05316f7c56769facfae58115a73f8c2a806c","qualityScore":36}');
