nálisis de ecuaciones diferenciales"],"fr":["Application de méthodes de groupe de Lie","Intégration avec REDUCE CAS + ReLie","Résolution d''équations différentielles","Flux de travail d''outil d''IA","Analyse d''équations différentielles"],"de":["Anwendung von Lie-Gruppen-Methoden","Integration mit REDUCE CAS + ReLie","Lösung von Differentialgleichungen","Workflow der AI-Tool","Analyse von Differentialgleichungen"],"pt":["Fluxo de trabalho de agente de IA para equações diferenciais","Métodos de grupo de Lie para resolução de equações","Utilização de REDUCE CAS e ReLie","Resolução de equações diferenciais de forma eficiente","Integração com outras ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["Рабочий процесс ИИ агента для дифференциальных уравнений","Методы Ли группы для решения уравнений","Использование REDUCE CAS и ReLie","Эффективное решение дифференциальных уравнений","Интеграция с другими инструментами ИИ"],"ar":["تدفق عمل لوكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي للمعادلات التفاضلية","طرق مجموعة لي لحل المعادلات","استخدام REDUCE CAS و ReLie","حل المعادلات التفاضلية بفعالية","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Lie群方法","微分方程计算","REDUCE CAS","ReLie","工作流自动化","如何使用AI智能代理","Lie群方法的优点"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Lie群法","微分方程式計算","REDUCE CAS","ReLie","ワークフローの自動化","AIエージェントの使い方","Lie群法の利点"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","리 군 방법","미분 방정식 계산","REDUCE CAS","ReLie","워크플로우 자동화","AI 에이전트 사용법","리 군 방법의 장점"],"es":["cómo usar reduce-relie-basics","qué es el grupo de Lie","reduce-relie-basics alternativa","reduce-relie-basics vs otros","instalación de reduce-relie-basics","guía de configuración de reduce-relie-basics","ecuaciones diferenciales con AI","herramientas de AI para ecuaciones diferenciales"],"fr":["comment utiliser reduce-relie-basics","quoi est le groupe de Lie","reduce-relie-basics alternative","reduce-relie-basics vs autres","installation de reduce-relie-basics","guide de configuration de reduce-relie-basics","équations différentielles avec IA","outils d''IA pour équations différentielles"],"de":["wie man reduce-relie-basics verwendet","was ist die Lie-Gruppe","reduce-relie-basics Alternative","reduce-relie-basics vs andere","Installation von reduce-relie-basics","Konfigurationsanleitung für reduce-relie-basics","Differentialgleichungen mit KI","KI-Tools für Differentialgleichungen"],"pt":["como usar reduce-relie-basics","o que é reduce-relie-basics","reduce-relie-basics alternativa","reduce-relie-basics vs outros agentes de IA","instalar reduce-relie-basics","guia de configuração do reduce-relie-basics","métodos de grupo de Lie","equações diferenciais","ferramentas de IA para equações diferenciais"],"ru":["как использовать reduce-relie-basics","что такое reduce-relie-basics","reduce-relie-basics альтернатива","reduce-relie-basics vs другие ИИ агенты","установить reduce-relie-basics","руководство по настройке reduce-relie-basics","методы Ли группы","дифференциальные уравнения","инструменты ИИ для дифференциальных уравнений"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام reduce-relie-basics","ما هو reduce-relie-basics","reduce-relie-basics بديل","reduce-relie-basics مقابل وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الآخرين","تثبيت reduce-relie-basics","دليل إعداد reduce-relie-basics","طرق مجموعة لي","المعادلات التفاضلية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمعادلات التفاضلية"]}},"owner":"hinsley","repo":"DiffSymAgent","repoPath":"hinsley/DiffSymAgent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.780Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reduce-relie-basics","description":"Run REDUCE in Docker for this repo (using lunacamp/reduce-algebra), load the vendored ReLie file from resources/relie-src/relie.red, and perform a tiny smoke test. Use when you need the canonical docker run command or a minimal ReLie bootstrap.","bodyPreview":"# REDUCE + ReLie basics\n\n## Ensure Docker is running\n\n- Check the CLI is available: `docker --version`.\n- Check the daemon is reachable: `docker info`.\n- If the daemon is not available, start Docker Desktop (macOS: `open -a Docker`) and wait until `docker info` succeeds.\n  - Example wait loop:\n    ```bash\n    for i in {1..60}; do docker info >/dev/null 2>&1 && break; sleep 1; done\n    ```\n- If you use Colima instead of Docker Desktop, start it with `colima start` and then re-check `docker info`.","body":"# REDUCE + ReLie basics\n\n## Ensure Docker is running\n\n- Check the CLI is available: `docker --version`.\n- Check the daemon is reachable: `docker info`.\n- If the daemon is not available, start Docker Desktop (macOS: `open -a Docker`) and wait until `docker info` succeeds.\n  - Example wait loop:\n    ```bash\n    for i in {1..60}; do docker info >/dev/null 2>&1 && break; sleep 1; done\n    ```\n- If you use Colima instead of Docker Desktop, start it with `colima start` and then re-check `docker info`.\n- If you see `permission denied while trying to connect to the docker API at unix:///.../docker.sock`, rerun the command with elevated permissions or fix your socket access.\n  - In Codex CLI with sandboxing, rerun the docker command with escalated permissions so it can reach the socket.\n\n## Use local ReLie source\n\nUse the vendored ReLie file in this repo:\n\n`resources/relie-src/relie.red`\n\n## Run REDUCE in Docker (repo mounted)\n\nUse this canonical command from the repo root:\n\n```bash\ndocker run --rm -it --platform linux/amd64 \\\n  -v \"$PWD\":/workspace -w /workspace \\\n  --entrypoint /usr/lib/reduce/cslbuild/csl/reduce \\\n  lunacamp/reduce-algebra\n```\n\nNotes:\n- On Apple Silicon, keep `--platform linux/amd64`.\n- If `docker` is not in PATH, use its full path.\n\n## Load ReLie and run a tiny smoke test\n\nIn the REDUCE prompt:\n\n```reduce\nin \"resources/relie-src/relie.red\"$\n\n% Tiny smoke test: confirm the REPL responds after load.\n1+1;\n```\n\nExit with `bye;` when done.\n\n## Optional: run a tiny ReLie pipeline test (heat equation)\n\nThis mirrors a full run without interactive typing:\n\n```bash\ndocker run --rm -i --platform linux/amd64 \\\n  -v \"$PWD\":/workspace -w /workspace \\\n  --entrypoint /usr/lib/reduce/cslbuild/csl/reduce \\\n  lunacamp/reduce-algebra <<''EOF''\n\nin \"resources/relie-src/relie.red\"$\n\njetorder := 2$\nxvar := {t,x}$\nuvar := {u}$\ndiffeqs := {u_t - u_xx}$\nleadders := {u_xx}$\n\nrelie(4)$\nreliegen(1,{})$\n\nsymmetries;\ngenerators;\nbye;\nEOF\n```\n\nIf you present results to a user, summarize them in natural language (see `reduce-relie-lie-symmetries`).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:24:08.131Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mathematical Agents needing advanced differential equation solving capabilities with Lie group methods via REDUCE CAS and ReLie","zh":"适用于需要高级微分方程求解能力的数学代理，使用Lie群方法通过REDUCE CAS和ReLie","ja":"Lie群方法を使用してREDUCE CASとReLieを介して高度な微分方程式を解く機能が必要な数学エージェントに適しています","ko":"Lie 그룹 방법을 사용하여 REDUCE CAS 및 ReLie를 통해 고급 미분 방정식을 풀 수 있는 수학 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Matemáticos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de resolución de ecuaciones diferenciales con métodos de grupo de Lie a través de REDUCE CAS y ReLie","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Mathématiques ayant besoin de capacités avancées de résolution d''équations différentielles avec des méthodes de groupe de Lie via REDUCE CAS et ReLie","de":"Perfekt für Mathematische Agenten, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Lösung von Differentialgleichungen mit Lie-Gruppenmethoden über REDUCE CAS und ReLie benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Matemáticos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de resolução de equações diferenciais com métodos de grupo de Lie via REDUCE CAS e ReLie","ru":"Идеально для математических агентов, которым требуются расширенные возможности решения дифференциальных уравнений с помощью методов группы Ли через REDUCE CAS и ReLie","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الرياضية التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لحل المعادلات التفاضلية باستخدام أساليب مجموعة لي عبر REDUCE CAS و ReLie"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Docker for seamless integration of REDUCE and ReLie, enabling advanced symbolic computation and Lie group analysis for differential equations using protocols like CLI and Docker info","zh":"使代理能够利用Docker无缝集成REDUCE和ReLie，实现使用CLI和Docker info等协议的高级符号计算和Lie群分析","ja":"REDUCEとReLieの統合をDockerでシームレスに実行することで、CLIやDocker infoなどのプロトコルを使用した高度な記号計算やLie群解析をエージェントが活用できるようにします","ko":"Docker를 사용하여 REDUCE 및 ReLie를无缝하게 통합하여 CLI 및 Docker 정보와 같은 프로토콜을 사용한 고급 기호 계산 및 Lie 그룹 분석을 에이전트가 활용할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar Docker para una integración sin problemas de REDUCE y ReLie, lo que permite un cálculo simbólico avanzado y un análisis de grupo de Lie para ecuaciones diferenciales utilizando protocolos como CLI y Docker info","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser Docker pour une intégration transparente de REDUCE et ReLie, permettant ainsi un calcul symbolique avancé et une analyse de groupe de Lie pour les équations différentielles en utilisant des protocoles tels que CLI et Docker info","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Docker zu nutzen, um REDUCE und ReLie nahtlos zu integrieren, wodurch erweiterte symbolische Berechnungen und Lie-Gruppenanalyse für Differentialgleichungen mithilfe von Protokollen wie CLI und Docker-Info ermöglicht werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o Docker para integração sem problemas do REDUCE e ReLie, permitindo computação simbólica avançada e análise de grupo de Lie para equações diferenciais usando protocolos como CLI e informações do Docker","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать Docker для бесшовной интеграции REDUCE и ReLie, что позволяет выполнять расширенные символические вычисления и анализ группы Ли для дифференциальных уравнений с использованием протоколов như CLI и информации о Docker","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من استخدام Docker من أجل دمج REDUCE و ReLie بطريقة دون اتصال، مما يسمح بالحوسبة الرمزية المتقدمة وتحليل مجموعة لي للمعادلات التفاضلية باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل CLI ومعلومات Docker"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Lie group method workflows for differential equations","Debugging REDUCE CAS and ReLie integrations","Generating solutions for complex differential equations using ReLie basics"],"zh":["为微分方程自动化Lie群方法工作流程","调试REDUCE CAS和ReLie集成","使用ReLie基础知识生成复杂微分方程的解"],"ja":["微分方程式のLie群方法ワークフローを自動化する","REDUCE CASとReLieの統合をデバッグする","ReLieの基礎知識を使用して複雑な微分方程式の解を生成する"],"ko":["미분 방정식의 Lie 그룹 방법 워크플로를 자동화하는 것","REDUCE CAS 및 ReLie 통합을 디버깅하는 것","ReLie 기본 지식을 사용하여 복잡한 미분 방정식의 해를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo de métodos de grupo de Lie para ecuaciones diferenciales","Depurar integraciones de REDUCE CAS y ReLie","Generar soluciones para ecuaciones diferenciales complejas utilizando los conceptos básicos de ReLie"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail de méthodes de groupe de Lie pour les équations différentielles","Déboguer les intégrations de REDUCE CAS et ReLie","Générer des solutions pour les équations différentielles complexes en utilisant les bases de ReLie"],"de":["Automatisieren von Workflows für Lie-Gruppenmethoden für Differentialgleichungen","Fehlerbehebung bei der Integration von REDUCE CAS und ReLie","Generieren von Lösungen für komplexe Differentialgleichungen unter Verwendung der Grundlagen von ReLie"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de métodos de grupo de Lie para equações diferenciais","Depurar integrações do REDUCE CAS e ReLie","Gerar soluções para equações diferenciais complexas usando conceitos básicos do ReLie"],"ru":["Автоматизация рабочих процессов методов группы Ли для дифференциальных уравнений","Отладка интеграций REDUCE CAS и ReLie","Генерация решений для сложных дифференциальных уравнений с помощью базовых концепций ReLie"],"ar":["آليّة تدفقات عمل أساليب مجموعة لي للمعادلات التفاضلية","تصحيح أخطاء دمج REDUCE CAS و ReLie","توليد حلول للمعادلات التفاضلية المعقدة باستخدام المفاهيم الأساسية ل ReLie"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Docker daemon to be running","Needs CLI access for Docker version and info checks","Compatibility issues may arise with Colima instead of Docker Desktop"],"zh":["需要Docker守护进程正在运行","需要CLI访问以检查Docker版本和信息","可能与Colima而不是Docker Desktop发生兼容性问题"],"ja":["Dockerデーモンが実行されている必要がある","Dockerのバージョンや情報を確認するためにCLIアクセスが必要","ColimaではなくDocker Desktopを使用した場合、互換性の問題が発生する可能性がある"],"ko":["Docker 데몬이 실행 중이어야 함","Docker 버전 및 정보 확인을 위해 CLI 액세스가 필요함","Colima 대신 Docker Desktop을 사용하는 경우 호환성 문제가 발생할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere que el daemon de Docker esté en ejecución","Necesita acceso a CLI para comprobaciones de versión y información de Docker","Pueden surgir problemas de compatibilidad con Colima en lugar de Docker Desktop"],"fr":["Nécessite que le démon Docker soit en cours d''exécution","Nécessite un accès CLI pour les vérifications de version et d''information de Docker","Des problèmes de compatibilité peuvent survenir avec Colima au lieu de Docker Desktop"],"de":["Benötigt einen laufenden Docker-Daemon","Benötigt CLI-Zugriff für Docker-Version- und Info-Checks","Kompatibilitätsprobleme können mit Colima anstelle von Docker Desktop auftreten"],"pt":["Requer que o daemon do Docker esteja em execução","Necessita acesso ao CLI para verificar a versão e informações do Docker","Pode ocorrer problemas de compatibilidade com o Colima em vez do Docker Desktop"],"ru":["Требуется запущенный демон Docker","Необходим доступ к CLI для проверки версии и информации о Docker","Могут возникнуть проблемы совместимости с Colima вместо Docker Desktop"],"ar":["يتطلب تشغيل دايمون Docker","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى CLI للتحقق من إصدار و معلومات Docker","قد تحدث مشاكل في التوافق مع Colima بدلاً من Docker Desktop"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"cb4f6751ae17202b7c15ef1434fc73c2005d568f8de97290bc8b3da1c0f4118d","qualityScore":36}');
