rselle MCP-Dokumentationspipeline","Für KI-Assistenten konzipiert","Vereinfacht die Dokumentation von Projekten","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Automatisierte Dokumentation"],"pt":["Pipeline de documentação MCP universal","Compatível com assistentes de IA","Melhora a produtividade e a eficiência","Fácil de usar e configurar","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de documentação"],"ru":["Универсальная документация MCP","Совместим с помощниками ИИ","Повышает производительность и эффективность","Легко использовать и настраивать","Поддержка нескольких форматов документации"],"ar":["خط أنابيب توثيق MCP عالمي","متوافق مع المساعدين الذكاء الاصطناعي","يحسن الإنتاجية والكفاءة","سهل الاستخدام والتهيئة","دعم عدة صيغ توثيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用ralph-deep-init","什么是MCP文档管道","ralph-deep-init安装","ralph-deep-init设置指南","AI智能助手文档管理","MCP文档管道工具"],"ja":["ralph-deep-initの使い方","MCPドキュメントパイプラインとは","ralph-deep-initのインストール","ralph-deep-initの設定ガイド","AIエージェントのドキュメント管理","MCPドキュメントパイプラインツール"],"ko":["ralph-deep-init 사용법","MCP 문서 파이프라인이란","ralph-deep-init 설치","ralph-deep-init 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트의 문서 관리","MCP 문서 파이프라인 도구"],"es":["herramientas de AI","documentación MCP","asistentes de IA","pipeline de documentación","ralph-deep-init","cómo usar ralph-deep-init","alternativas a ralph-deep-init","instalación de ralph-deep-init"],"fr":["outils d''IA","documentation MCP","assistants d''IA","pipeline de documentation","ralph-deep-init","comment utiliser ralph-deep-init","alternatives à ralph-deep-init","installation de ralph-deep-init"],"de":["KI-Tools","MCP-Dokumentation","KI-Assistenten","Dokumentationspipeline","ralph-deep-init","wie man ralph-deep-init verwendet","Alternativen zu ralph-deep-init","Installation von ralph-deep-init"],"pt":["como usar ralph-deep-init","o que é ralph-deep-init","ralph-deep-init alternative","ralph-deep-init vs outras ferramentas","ralph-deep-init instalação","guia de configuração ralph-deep-init","ferramentas de ia para documentação","ralph-deep-init documentação"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент ralph-deep-init","что такое ИИ Агент ralph-deep-init","ИИ Агент ralph-deep-init альтернатива","ИИ Агент ralph-deep-init vs другие инструменты","установка ИИ Агент ralph-deep-init","руководство по настройке ИИ Агент ralph-deep-init","инструменты ИИ для документации","документация ИИ Агент ralph-deep-init"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ralph-deep-init","ما هو ralph-deep-init","ralph-deep-init بديل","ralph-deep-init مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت ralph-deep-init","دليل إعداد ralph-deep-init","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتوثيق","توثيق ralph-deep-init"]}},"owner":"jusedit","repo":"any-docs-mcp","repoPath":"jusedit/any-docs-mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.851Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph-deep-init","description":"Build a comprehensive project backlog through multi-stage architectural analysis. Creates 6 functional groups and generates detailed tasks for each. Use when you need a large, well-organized backlog for complex projects.","bodyPreview":"# Ralph Deep Initialization\n\nThis skill performs a comprehensive, multi-stage project initialization that generates a large, well-organized backlog by breaking down the project into functional architectural groups.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse ralph-deep-init instead of ralph-initialize when:\n\n- Building a complex project with many features\n- Need 20-40+ detailed tasks in the backlog\n- Want tasks organized by architectural concerns\n- Project has multiple distinct functional areas\n\n## Prerequi","body":"# Ralph Deep Initialization\n\nThis skill performs a comprehensive, multi-stage project initialization that generates a large, well-organized backlog by breaking down the project into functional architectural groups.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse ralph-deep-init instead of ralph-initialize when:\n\n- Building a complex project with many features\n- Need 20-40+ detailed tasks in the backlog\n- Want tasks organized by architectural concerns\n- Project has multiple distinct functional areas\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Git repository initialized\n- No existing `prd.json` (or user approves overwrite)\n- Clear understanding of project requirements\n\n## Multi-Stage Process\n\n### Phase 1: Architecture\n\n**Goal:** Initialize the project structure and define the architectural map.\n\n1. **Analyze Request**\n   - Ask: \"What do you want to build?\" if not already provided\n   - Gather comprehensive project requirements\n\n2. **Create Foundation Files**\n   - `progress.md` - Standard Ralph progress log\n   - `.windsurf/rules/tech-stack.md` - Tech stack & conventions\n   - `init_progress.txt` - Temporary initialization tracking\n\n3. **Generate Architecture**\n   - Identify **6 distinct functional groups** needed for this project\n   - Examples: Auth, Database, API, Frontend, Testing, DevOps\n   - Create `groups.json` containing ONLY a JSON array of these string names\n   - Format: `[\"Group1\", \"Group2\", \"Group3\", \"Group4\", \"Group5\", \"Group6\"]`\n\n### Phase 2: Expansion (6 Iterations)\n\n**Goal:** Generate detailed tasks for each functional group.\n\nFor each of the 6 groups (iterate 1 through 6):\n\n1. **Select Target:** Pick group N from `groups.json`\n2. **Generate Tasks:** Create 3-5 detailed implementation tasks for this group\n3. **Write to File:** Save to `partial_N.json`\n\n**Task Template:**\n\nUse `.windsurf/skills/ralph-deep-init/task-examples.json` as the reference schema for each `partial_N.json`.\n\n### Phase 3: Assembly\n\n**Goal:** Compile the final Product Requirements Document.\n\n1. **Create PRD**\n   - Create `prd.json` (use `.windsurf/skills/ralph-initialize/prd-template.json` as reference)\n   - Read all `partial_*.json` files\n   - Merge all `tasks` arrays into the `backlog` field\n   - Ensure valid JSON structure\n\n2. **Cleanup**\n   - Delete `groups.json`\n   - Delete all `partial_*.json` files\n   - Keep `init_progress.txt` for reference\n\n3. **Report**\n   - Announce: \"Initialization Complete. Backlog created with [X] tasks.\"\n   - Summarize task breakdown by group\n\n## Supporting Resources\n\nReference these files:\n\n- `architecture-examples.md` - Sample functional group breakdowns\n- `task-examples.json` - Well-formed task examples\n- `groups-template.json` - Template for groups array\n\n## Success Criteria\n\nDeep initialization is complete when:\n\n- ✅ `prd.json` exists with 20+ tasks\n- ✅ Tasks are organized by functional groups\n- ✅ All tasks have `passes: false`\n- ✅ Each task has clear acceptance criteria\n- ✅ `progress.md` exists\n- ✅ Temporary files are cleaned up\n\n## Tips\n\n- Choose groups that represent distinct technical concerns\n- Ensure tasks within a group are cohesive\n- Order tasks to respect dependencies\n- Include infrastructure/testing as separate groups\n- Aim for 3-5 tasks per group (total: 18-30 tasks)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:50:25.679Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Project Management Agents needing comprehensive project initialization with multi-stage backlog generation.","zh":"非常适合需要全面项目初始化和多阶段待办事项生成的项目管理代理。","ja":"プロジェクト管理エージェントが包括的なプロジェクト初期化とマルチステージのバックログ生成を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"포괄적인 프로젝트 초기화 및 다단계 백로그 생성이 필요한 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Proyectos que necesitan una inicialización de proyecto completa con generación de backlog de varias etapas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de projet nécessitant une initialisation de projet complète avec génération de backlog à plusieurs étapes.","de":"Perfekt für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die eine umfassende Projektinitialisierung mit Mehretappen-Backlog-Generierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que necessitam de inicialização de projeto abrangente com geração de backlog em multi-etapas.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Управления Проектами, которым требуется комплексная инициализация проекта с генерацией бэклога в несколько этапов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المشاريع التي تحتاج إلى تهيئة مشروع شاملة مع توليد قائمة عمل متعددة المراحل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to break down complex projects into functional architectural groups, generating 20-40+ detailed tasks organized by architectural concerns, utilizing a universal MCP documentation pipeline for AI assistants.","zh":"赋予代理人将复杂项目分解为功能性架构组的能力，生成20-40+个详细任务，组织这些任务以架构关注点，利用通用MCP文档管道为AI助手。","ja":"エージェントが複雑なプロジェクトを機能的なアーキテクチャグループに分割し、20-40+の詳細タスクを生成する能力を提供し、これらのタスクをアーキテクチャの関心事によって組織し、AIアシスタントのためのユニバーサルMCPドキュメントパイプラインを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 복잡한 프로젝트를 기능적 아키텍처 그룹으로 분할할 수 있도록 하며, 20-40+개의详细 태스크를 생성하여 아키텍처 관련 사항에 따라 태스크를 조직화하며, AI 보조를 위한 유니버설 MCP 문서 파이프라인을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a descomponer proyectos complejos en grupos arquitectónicos funcionales, generando 20-40+ tareas detalladas organizadas por preocupaciones arquitectónicas, utilizando una canalización de documentación MCP universal para asistentes de IA.","fr":"Permet aux agents de décomposer des projets complexes en groupes architecturaux fonctionnels, générant 20-40+ tâches détaillées organisées par des préoccupations architecturales, en utilisant un pipeline de documentation MCP universel pour les assistants IA.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Projekte in funktionale architektonische Gruppen aufzuteilen, 20-40+ detaillierte Aufgaben zu generieren, die nach architektonischen Belangen organisiert sind, unter Verwendung einer universellen MCP-Dokumentationspipeline für KI-Assistenten.","pt":"Habilita agentes a quebrar projetos complexos em grupos arquiteturais funcionais, gerando 20-40+ tarefas detalhadas organizadas por preocupações arquiteturais, utilizando um pipeline de documentação MCP universal para assistentes de IA.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разбивать сложные проекты на функциональные архитектурные группы, генерируя 20-40+ подробных задач, организованных по архитектурным проблемам, используя универсальный конвейер документации MCP для помощников ИИ.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تقسيم المشاريع المعقدة إلى مجموعات وظيفية معمارية، وتوليد 20-40+ مهمة مفصلة منظمة حسب المخاوف المعمارية، باستخدام трубة وثائق MCP универсальная للمساعدين الذكيين."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing complex projects with multiple features","Generating detailed task backlogs for large-scale projects","Organizing tasks by architectural concerns for enhanced project clarity"],"zh":["使用多个功能初始化复杂项目","为大规模项目生成详细的任务待办事项","通过架构关注点组织任务以增强项目清晰度"],"ja":["複数の機能を使用して複雑なプロジェクトを初期化する","大規模プロジェクトのための詳細なタスクバックログを生成する","アーキテクチャの関心事によってタスクを組織してプロジェクトの明確性を高める"],"ko":["여러 기능을 사용하여 복잡한 프로젝트를 초기화하는 것","대규모 프로젝트를 위한 상세한 태스크 백로그를 생성하는 것","아키텍처 관련 사항에 따라 태스크를 조직화하여 프로젝트의 명확성을 높이는 것"],"es":["Inicialización de proyectos complejos con varias características","Generación de backlogs de tareas detalladas para proyectos a gran escala","Organización de tareas por preocupaciones arquitectónicas para una mayor claridad del proyecto"],"fr":["Initialisation de projets complexes avec plusieurs fonctionnalités","Génération de backlogs de tâches détaillées pour les projets à grande échelle","Organisation des tâches par des préoccupations architecturales pour une plus grande clarté du projet"],"de":["Initialisierung komplexer Projekte mit mehreren Funktionen","Generierung detaillierter Aufgaben-Backlogs für Großprojekte","Organisation von Aufgaben nach architektonischen Belangen für eine verbesserte Projektübersichtlichkeit"],"pt":["Inicializando projetos complexos com múltiplas funcionalidades","Gerando backlogs de tarefas detalhadas para projetos em larga escala","Organizando tarefas por preocupações arquiteturais para clareza de projeto aprimorada"],"ru":["Инициализация сложных проектов с несколькими функциями","Генерация подробных задач для крупномасштабных проектов","Организация задач по архитектурным проблемам для улучшения ясности проекта"],"ar":["تهيئة المشاريع المعقدة المتعددة المزايا","توليد قوائم عمل مفصلة للمشاريع ذات النطاق الكبير","تنظيم المهام حسب المخاوف المعمارية لتحسين وضوح المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires project complexity with multiple features","Ideal for projects needing 20-40+ detailed tasks","Specifically designed for projects with multiple distinct functional areas"],"zh":["需要具有多个功能的项目复杂性","适合需要20-40+个详细任务的项目","专门为具有多个不同功能区域的项目设计"],"ja":["複数の機能を備えたプロジェクトの複雑性が必要","20-40+の詳細タスクを必要とするプロジェクトに適しています","複数の異なる機能領域を備えたプロジェクトのために特別に設計されています"],"ko":["여러 기능을 갖춘 프로젝트의 복잡성이 필요함","20-40+개의 상세 태스크가 필요한 프로젝트에 적합함","여러 개의 다른 기능 영역을 갖춘 프로젝트를 위한 것으로 특별히 설계됨"],"es":["Requiere complejidad del proyecto con varias características","Ideal para proyectos que necesitan 20-40+ tareas detalladas","Diseñado específicamente para proyectos con varias áreas funcionales distintas"],"fr":["Nécessite une complexité de projet avec plusieurs fonctionnalités","Conçu pour les projets qui nécessitent 20-40+ tâches détaillées","Conçu spécifiquement pour les projets avec plusieurs domaines fonctionnels distincts"],"de":["Erfordert Projekt-Komplexität mit mehreren Funktionen","Ideal für Projekte, die 20-40+ detaillierte Aufgaben benötigen","Speziell für Projekte mit mehreren deutlich unterschiedlichen funktionalen Bereichen konzipiert"],"pt":["Requer complexidade de projeto com múltiplas funcionalidades","Ideal para projetos que necessitam de 20-40+ tarefas detalhadas","Especificamente projetado para projetos com múltiplas áreas funcionais distintas"],"ru":["Требует сложности проекта с несколькими функциями","Идеально для проектов, которым требуется 20-40+ подробных задач","Специально разработан для проектов с несколькими различными функциональными областями"],"ar":["يتطلب تعقيد المشروع مع المزايا المتعددة","مثالي للمشاريع التي تحتاج إلى 20-40+ مهام مفصلة","صممت خصيصًا للمشاريع ذات المناطق الوظيفية المتعددة والمنفصلة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"acb124344ca7a6832d0e58f6765af141b2ca4418eac582e4585fff9205ce46d5","qualityScore":36}');
