duction de films et multimédia","Collaboration en ligne et édition en temps réel","Compatibilité avec plusieurs formats de fichiers"],"de":["Kreatives Projekt-Template für Drehbücher und Romane","KI-Technologie für die Synchronisation in Echtzeit","Film- und Multimedia-Produktion","Online-Kollaboration und Echtzeit-Bearbeitung","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Dateiformaten"],"pt":["Modelo de projeto criativo para screenplays, novels e film production","Multi-AI com sincronização upstream","Ferramenta de IA para aumentar a produtividade criativa","Suporte para produção de filmes e séries","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Шаблон креативного проекта для сценариев, романов и кинопроизводства","Мульти-ИИ с синхронизацией upstream","Инструмент ИИ для увеличения творческой производительности","Поддержка производства фильмов и сериалов","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["قالب مشروع إبداعي لكتابة السيناريو والروايات وإنتاج الأفلام","مulti-أداة ذكاء اصطناعي مع مزامنة 업스트림","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لزيادة الإنتاجية الإبداعية","دعم لإنتاج الأفلام والمسلسلات","تكامل مع أدوات التطوير الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用logline","什么是AI智能工具","logline替代品","logline vs 其他AI工具","logline安装","logline设置指南","创意项目模板","多AI协同"],"ja":["loglineの使い方","AIエージェントとは","loglineの代替","logline vs その他のAIツール","loglineのインストール","loglineの設定ガイド","クリエイティブ プロジェクト テンプレート","多AIハーネス"],"ko":["logline 사용법","AI 에이전트란","logline 대체","logline vs 다른 AI 도구","logline 설치","logline 설정 가이드","창의적 프로젝트 템플릿","다중 AI 하네스"],"es":["herramientas de AI para escritores","plantillas de proyecto creativo","producción de cine con IA","logline alternativa","cómo usar logline","guías de instalación de logline","logline vs otros herramientas de IA"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour écrivains","modèles de projet créatif","production de films avec IA","alternative à logline","comment utiliser logline","guides d''installation de logline","logline vs autres outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools für Schriftsteller","kreative Projekt-Template","Filmproduktion mit KI","logline Alternative","wie man logline verwendet","Installationsanleitungen für logline","logline vs andere KI-Tools"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para criativos","logline para screenplays","como usar logline","o que é logline","ferramentas de desenvolvimento para filmes","alternativas para logline","logline vs outras ferramentas de ia"],"ru":["инструменты ИИ для креативных проектов","logline для сценариев","как использовать logline","что такое logline","инструменты разработки для кинопроизводства","альтернативы logline","logline vs другие инструменты ИИ"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمشاريع الإبداعية","لوجلاين لكتابة السيناريو","كيفية استخدام لوجلاين","ما هي لوجلاين","أدوات التطوير لإنتاج الأفلام","بديلات لوجلاين","لوجلاين مقابل أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى"]}},"owner":"bybren-llc","repo":"story-systems-template","repoPath":"bybren-llc/story-systems-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.890Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"logline","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Logline Skill\n\n## Invocation Triggers\nApply this skill when:\n- Distilling a story to its essential hook\n- Preparing pitch materials\n- Testing if a concept is clear and compelling\n- Marketing a screenplay\n\n## What is a Logline?\n\nA logline (also called a \"hook\") is a one to two sentence description of your movie that captures the essence of the story in a way that makes people want to see it.\n\n## The Four Components of a Hook\n\nPer WTFB methodology, every effective hook contains these four elemen","body":"# Logline Skill\n\n## Invocation Triggers\nApply this skill when:\n- Distilling a story to its essential hook\n- Preparing pitch materials\n- Testing if a concept is clear and compelling\n- Marketing a screenplay\n\n## What is a Logline?\n\nA logline (also called a \"hook\") is a one to two sentence description of your movie that captures the essence of the story in a way that makes people want to see it.\n\n## The Four Components of a Hook\n\nPer WTFB methodology, every effective hook contains these four elements:\n\n### 1. Characters\n- Who are they?\n- What do they want?\n- What are their goals?\n\n### 2. Conflict\n- What is the main obstacle to achieving their goal?\n- Who or what opposes them?\n\n### 3. Setting\n- Time period\n- Genre\n- Style/tone\n\n### 4. Action\n- What exciting things happen?\n- **Never be boring!**\n\n## Logline Formula\n\n```\n[ADJECTIVE] [PROTAGONIST TYPE] must [GOAL/ACTION]\nwhen [INCITING INCIDENT/CONFLICT],\nor else [STAKES].\n```\n\n### Alternative Formula\n```\nWhen [SETUP], a [PROTAGONIST] must [OBJECTIVE]\nbefore [ANTAGONIST] [THREAT].\n```\n\n### Genre-Specific Formula\n```\nA [GENRE] about [PROTAGONIST] who [SITUATION]\nuntil [CATALYST] forces them to [ACTION]\nagainst [ANTAGONIST/OBSTACLE].\n```\n\n## Classic Logline Examples\n\n### Raiders of the Lost Ark\n\"An archeologist is hired by the U.S. government to find the Ark of the Covenant before the Nazis.\"\n\n**Breakdown**:\n- Character: Archeologist (implies adventure, intelligence)\n- Conflict: Race against Nazis\n- Setting: Implied WWII era, adventure genre\n- Action: \"Find\" + competing with Nazis = excitement\n\n### Gladiator\n\"A Roman general is betrayed and his family killed by an insane emperor. Now a gladiator, he comes to Rome for revenge.\"\n\n**Breakdown**:\n- Character: Roman general (status, skill)\n- Conflict: Betrayal, loss, revenge against emperor\n- Setting: Roman era, epic drama\n- Action: Gladiator combat, revenge journey\n\n## Logline Development Worksheet\n\n### Step 1: Core Elements\n```\nPROTAGONIST: ___________________________________\n(Be specific: not \"a man\" but \"a disgraced surgeon\")\n\nGOAL: ___________________________________\n(What do they actively pursue?)\n\nANTAGONIST/OBSTACLE: ___________________________________\n(Person, force, or circumstance opposing them)\n\nSTAKES: ___________________________________\n(What happens if they fail?)\n\nUNIQUE ELEMENT: ___________________________________\n(What makes THIS story different?)\n```\n\n### Step 2: Draft Loglines\n\n**Draft 1** (Basic):\n```\n___________________________________________________\n___________________________________________________\n```\n\n**Draft 2** (Add specificity):\n```\n___________________________________________________\n___________________________________________________\n```\n\n**Draft 3** (Add stakes):\n```\n___________________________________________________\n___________________________________________________\n```\n\n**Final Logline**:\n```\n___________________________________________________\n___________________________________________________\n```\n\n## Logline Quality Checklist\n\n### Must Have\n- [ ] Protagonist clearly identified\n- [ ] Goal/objective stated\n- [ ] Conflict/obstacle present\n- [ ] Implies genre\n- [ ] One to two sentences maximum\n- [ ] Creates desire to know more\n\n### Should Have\n- [ ] Unique hook or twist\n- [ ] Stakes implied or stated\n- [ ] Active voice (character DOES something)\n- [ ] Specific rather than vague\n\n### Must Avoid\n- [ ] No questions (\"What if...?\")\n- [ ] No character names (unless famous)\n- [ ] No theme statements\n- [ ] No backstory\n- [ ] No \"and then\" chains\n\n## Common Logline Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Example | Fix |\n|---------|---------|-----|\n| Too vague | \"A man faces challenges\" | \"A retired hitman hunts the men who killed his dog\" |\n| Too long | Multiple sentences | Cut to one powerful sentence |\n| No conflict | \"A woman discovers her past\" | \"A woman must confront the cult that raised her\" |\n| Passive | \"A story about love\" | \"A dying man races to reconnect with his estranged daughter\" |\n| Lists events | \"First X, then Y, then Z\" | Focus on central conflict |\n| Theme not story | \"An exploration of grief\" | \"A widow must solve her husband''s murder\" |\n\n## Genre-Specific Tips\n\n### Action/Thriller\n- Emphasize physical stakes and ticking clock\n- \"Must stop X before Y happens\"\n\n### Comedy\n- Hint at the comedic situation or irony\n- Include the fish-out-of-water element\n\n### Drama\n- Focus on internal conflict made external\n- Emphasize emotional stakes\n\n### Horror\n- Establish the threat\n- Imply isolation or helplessness\n\n### Romance\n- Show the obstacle to love\n- Include what makes this couple unique\n\n## Logline Testing\n\nShare your logline and ask:\n1. Do they understand the genre?\n2. Do they know who the protagonist is?\n3. Can they identify the conflict?\n4. Do they want to know what happens?\n5. Can they picture the movie?\n\nIf \"no\" to any, revise.\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\n- [ ] Logline is 25 words or fewer\n- [ ] Protagonist is specific and interesting\n- [ ] Goal is clear and active\n- [ ] Conflict/obstacle is compelling\n- [ ] Stakes are implied or stated\n- [ ] Genre is clear\n- [ ] Creates curiosity to see the film\n- [ ] No character names used\n- [ ] Active voice throughout\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:54:30.180Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Creative Writing Agents needing concise story hooks and pitch materials","zh":"非常适合需要简洁故事钩子和推介材料的创意写作AI Agent","ja":"簡潔なストーリーフックとピッチ材料を必要とするクリエイティブライティングAgentに最適","ko":"간결한 스토리 후크와 피치 자료가 필요한 창의적 글쓰기 에이전트에 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Escritura Creativa que necesitan ganchos de historia concisos y materiales de presentación","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''écriture créative ayant besoin d''accroches de histoire concise et de matériel de présentation","de":"Perfekt für Kreative Schreibagenten, die prägnante Story-Hooks und Pitch-Materialien benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Criativa que precisam de ganchos de história concisos e materiais de pitch","ru":"Идеально для Креативных Литературных Агентов, которым необходимы краткие крючки истории и материалы для презентации","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الكتابة الإبداعية الذين يحتاجون إلى مشابك قصة متواضعة ومواد غرض"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft compelling loglines using WTFB methodology, incorporating essential hook components for effective storytelling and marketing screenplays, leveraging multi-AI harness with upstream sync for comprehensive content analysis","zh":"赋能Agent使用WTFB方法论制作引人入胜的故事梗概，结合有效叙事和剧本营销的基本钩子组件，利用多AI协同与上游同步进行全面的内容分析","ja":"WTFB手法を使用して効果的な物語作りと脚本マーケティングのための必須フックコンポーネントを組み込み、包括的なコンテンツ分析のためにアップストリーム同期を活用するマルチAIハーネスを活用して、魅力的なログラインを作成するAgentを強化","ko":"WTFB 방법론을 사용하여 효과적인 스토리텔링과 스크린플레이 마케팅을 위한 필수 후크 구성요소를 통합하고, 포괄적인 콘텐츠 분석을 위한 업스트림 동기화와 다중 AI 연동을 활용하여 매력적인 로그라인을 제작하는 에이전트의 역량 강화","es":"Empodera a los agentes para crear loglines convincentes utilizando la metodología WTFB, incorporando componentes esenciales de ganchos para una narración y marketing de guiones efectivos, aprovechando un arnés multi-AI con sincronización upstream para un análisis de contenido integral","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des loglines convaincantes en utilisant la méthodologie WTFB, en intégrant des composants essentiels d''accroches pour un récit et un marketing de scénarios efficaces, en exploitant un harnais multi-AI avec une synchronisation en amont pour une analyse de contenu globale","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, überzeugende Loglines mit der WTFB-Methode zu erstellen, indem sie wesentliche Hook-Komponenten für effektive Erzählung und Marketing von Drehbüchern einbeziehen, und nutzt ein Multi-AI-Geschirr mit Upstream-Synchronisierung für eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar loglines atraentes usando a metodologia WTFB, incorporando componentes essenciais de gancho para uma história e marketing de roteiros eficazes, aproveitando o harness multi-AI com sincronização upstream para análise de conteúdo abrangente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать привлекательные логлайны с использованием методологии WTFB, включающей необходимые компоненты крючка для эффективного рассказа и маркетинга сценариев, используя многопоточный AI-гарнитуру с синхронизацией upstream для комплексного анализа контента","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء لوغلاينز جذابة باستخدام منهجية WTFB، ودمج مكونات حبكة أساسية لفعالية السرد والتسويق لسيناريوهات الأفلام، واستفادة من حزمة متعددة الوسائط مع مزامنة تيار للأعلى لتحليل المحتوى الشامل"},"useCases":{"en":["Distilling complex stories into one-sentence hooks","Preparing pitch materials for film production","Testing concept clarity and compellingness","Marketing screenplays with captivating loglines"],"zh":["将复杂故事提炼为单句钩子","为电影制作准备推介材料","测试概念的清晰度和吸引力","用引人入胜的梗概营销剧本"],"ja":["複雑なストーリーを一文のフックに蒸留","映画制作のためのピッチ材料の準備","コンセプトの明確さと魅力のテスト","魅力的なログラインを使用した脚本のマーケティング"],"ko":["복잡한 스토리를 한 문장 후크로 정제","영화 제작을 위한 피치 자료 준비","개념 명확성과 매력도 테스트","매력적인 로그라인으로 스크린플레이 마케팅"],"es":["Destilar historias complejas en ganchos de una oración","Preparar materiales de presentación para la producción de películas","Probar la claridad y atractivo de los conceptos","Comercializar guiones con loglines cautivadores"],"fr":["Distiller des histoires complexes en accroches d''une phrase","Préparer des matériaux de présentation pour la production de films","Tester la clarté et la force d''attraction des concepts","Commercialiser des scénarios avec des loglines accrocheurs"],"de":["Komplexe Geschichten in ein-sätzige Hooks destillieren","Präsentationsmaterialien für die Filmproduktion vorbereiten","Konzeptklarheit und Attraktivität testen","Drehbücher mit fesselnden Loglines vermarkten"],"pt":["Destilar histórias complexas em ganchos de uma frase","Preparar materiais de pitch para produção de filmes","Testar clareza e atração de conceitos","Marketing de roteiros com loglines cativantes"],"ru":["Переливать сложные истории в крючки из одного предложения","Подготавливать материалы для презентации для кинопроизводства","Тестировать ясность и привлекательность концепций","Маркетинг сценариев с привлекательными логлайнами"],"ar":["إزالة القصص المعقدة إلى مشابك جملة واحدة","إعداد مواد غرض لإنتاج الأفلام","اختبار وضوح وجذب المفاهيم","تسويق السيناريوهات بمشابك جذابة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of storytelling principles","Limited to screenplays, novels, and film production contexts"],"zh":["需要理解叙事原则","仅限于剧本、小说和电影制作场景"],"ja":["ストーリーテリングの原則の理解が必要","脚本、小説、映画制作の文脈に限定"],"ko":["스토리텔링 원칙에 대한 이해 필요","스크린플레이, 소설 및 영화 제작 컨텍스트로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de la narración","Limitado a contextos de producción de películas, novelas y guiones"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de narration","Limité aux contextes de production de films, romans et scénarios"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis der Erzählprinzipien","Begrenzt auf Kontexte der Filmproduktion, Romane und Drehbücher"],"pt":["Requer entendimento de princípios de storytelling","Limitado a contextos de roteiros, romances e produção de filmes"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов рассказа","Ограничен контекстами сценариев, романов и кинопроизводства"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ السرد","محدود بالسياقات لسيناريوهات والروايات وإنتاج الأفلام"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f5f7c6ddd66ddb52c6183af56bf90a5a44f9919f353266c2e9a6030fb710a429","qualityScore":36}');
