ammation"],"de":["Full-Stack-Entwicklung mit React und Node.js","AI-nativer Entwicklung-Workflow","Implementierung der CLI für eine höhere Effizienz","Produktion in Tagen, nicht in Monaten","Integration mit beliebten Entwicklungstools","Kompatibilität mit Python und anderen Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento full-stack com IA","Fluxo de trabalho nativo de IA","Pronto para produção em dias","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","CLI para automação de tarefas","Suporte a desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Полный стек разработки с ИИ","Родной поток работы ИИ","Готов к производству за несколько дней","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","CLI для автоматизации задач","Поддержка разработчиков"],"ar":["تطوير كامل للعاملين مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","تدفق عمل اصطناعي أصلي","جاهز للانتاج في أيام","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","CLI للتحكم الآلي في المهام","دعم للعاملين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能开发助手","dev-workflow教程","如何使用dev-workflow","dev-workflow与其他开发工具的比较","dev-workflow安装指南","dev-workflow设置教程","React开发","Python开发","Node.js开发"],"ja":["AIエージェント","dev-workflowの使い方","dev-workflowのチュートリアル","dev-workflowと他の開発ツールの比較","dev-workflowのインストール方法","dev-workflowの設定方法","React開発","Python開発","Node.js開発"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","dev-workflow 사용법","dev-workflow 튜토리얼","dev-workflow와 다른 개발 도구의 비교","dev-workflow 설치 가이드","dev-workflow 설정 가이드","React 개발","Python 개발","Node.js 개발"],"es":["herramientas de AI Agents","flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","desarrollo full-stack","React y Node.js","cómo usar herramientas de desarrollo","qué es un flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","alternativas a herramientas de desarrollo","instalación de herramientas de desarrollo","guía de configuración de herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["outils d''agents IA","workflow de développement","développement full-stack","React et Node.js","comment utiliser des outils de développement","qu''est-ce qu''un workflow de développement","alternatives aux outils de développement","installation d''outils de développement","guide de configuration des outils de développement"],"de":["AI-Tools","Entwicklung-Workflow","Full-Stack-Entwicklung","React und Node.js","wie man Entwicklungstools verwendet","was ist ein Entwicklung-Workflow","Alternativen zu Entwicklungstools","Installation von Entwicklungstools","Einrichtungsanleitung für Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","dev-workflow alternative","como usar dev-workflow","o que é dev-workflow","dev-workflow vs outros","instalar dev-workflow","guia de configuração do dev-workflow"],"ru":["ИИ агенты для разработки","dev-workflow альтернатива","как использовать dev-workflow","что такое dev-workflow","dev-workflow vs другие","установить dev-workflow","руководство по настройке dev-workflow"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للعاملين","بديل dev-workflow","كيفية استخدام dev-workflow","ما هو dev-workflow","dev-workflow مقابل أخرى","تثبيت dev-workflow","دليل إعداد dev-workflow"]}},"owner":"muyen","repo":"vibe-to-prod","repoPath":"muyen/vibe-to-prod","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.900Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dev-workflow","description":"SDLC workflow with MCP tools. Triggers on start, implement, work on, or unclear workflow.","bodyPreview":"# SDLC: Intake → Triage → Explore → Plan → Code → Test → Review → Commit → Deploy → Improve\n\n## MCP Tools by Phase\n\n| Phase | Tools |\n|-------|-------|\n| Intake | `mcp__linear__get_issue`, `mcp__notion__notion-search` |\n| Explore | `mcp__memory__search_nodes`, `mcp__github__search_code`, `mcp__context7__query-docs` |\n| Plan | `mcp__linear__create_issue` (subtasks), `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`, `mcp__github__create_branch` |\n| Code | `mcp__context7__query-docs`, Read, Write, Edit |\n| Test","body":"# SDLC: Intake → Triage → Explore → Plan → Code → Test → Review → Commit → Deploy → Improve\n\n## MCP Tools by Phase\n\n| Phase | Tools |\n|-------|-------|\n| Intake | `mcp__linear__get_issue`, `mcp__notion__notion-search` |\n| Explore | `mcp__memory__search_nodes`, `mcp__github__search_code`, `mcp__context7__query-docs` |\n| Plan | `mcp__linear__create_issue` (subtasks), `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`, `mcp__github__create_branch` |\n| Code | `mcp__context7__query-docs`, Read, Write, Edit |\n| Test | Bash (make test, npm test), `/quick-test` |\n| Deploy | `mcp__github__create_pull_request`, `/smoke-test` |\n| Improve | `mcp__memory__create_entities`, `mcp__linear__create_issue` |\n\n## Triage Decision\n\n| Change Type | Path |\n|-------------|------|\n| New feature, breaking change, architecture | OpenSpec → `/openspec:proposal` |\n| Bug fix, config, tests, typo | Quick → `TodoWrite` |\n\n## Phase Actions\n\n**Intake**: Fetch Linear issue, search Notion for context\n**Explore**: Search Memory for learnings, explore codebase, check related PRs\n**Plan**: OpenSpec proposal OR TodoWrite, create branch\n**Code**: Follow tasks, use platform rules, mark todos complete\n**Test**: `/quick-test`, add tests for new logic\n**Review**: `/code-review`, `/security-scan` if auth/data\n**Commit**: `/commit` with `type: description`\n**Deploy**: Create PR, run smoke tests after merge\n**Improve**: Store learnings in Memory, create improvement tasks if needed\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Backend\ncd backend && make test\ncd backend && make build\n\n# Web\ncd web && npm test\ncd web && npm run build\n\n# iOS\ncd mobile/ios && make test\n\n# Android\ncd mobile/android && ./gradlew test\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- Coding without exploring → miss patterns\n- Skipping Linear context → untracked work\n- No Memory capture → repeat learnings\n- Big commits → hard to review\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:56:54.628Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack Development Agents requiring streamlined SDLC integration and AI-native workflow automation.","zh":"适用于需要简化SDLC集成和AI原生工作流自动化的全栈开发代理。","ja":"ストリーミングされたSDLC統合とAIネイティブのワークフローオートメーションを必要とするフルスタック開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"스트림라인된 SDLC 통합 및 AI 네이티브 워크플로 자동화가 필요한 풀스택 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de pilas completas que requieren una integración de SDLC optimizada y una automatización de flujo de trabajo nativa de IA.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement full-stack nécessitant une intégration SDLC rationalisée et une automatisation de workflow native IA.","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine optimierte SDLC-Integration und eine AI-native Workflow-Automatisierung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Full-Stack que exigem integração de SDLC simplificada e automação de fluxo de trabalho nativa de IA.","ru":"Идеально для агентов полного цикла разработки, требующих упрощенной интеграции SDLC и автоматизации рабочего процесса на основе ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الكامل الذي يتطلب دمج SDLC المُبسّط وتutomatisation تدفق العمل الأصلي للتعليم الآلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate the entire software development life cycle (SDLC) using tools like `mcp__linear__get_issue`, `mcp__notion__notion-search`, and `mcp__github__search_code`, facilitating seamless project management from intake to deployment via protocols like GitHub branching and Notion page creation.","zh":"赋予代理人使用像 `mcp__linear__get_issue`、`mcp__notion__notion-search` 和 `mcp__github__search_code` 的工具来自动化整个软件开发生命周期（SDLC），从而通过像 GitHub 分支和 Notion 页面创建这样的协议实现无缝的项目管理。","ja":"エージェントに、`mcp__linear__get_issue`、`mcp__notion__notion-search`、`mcp__github__search_code` などのツールを使用して、ソフトウェア開発ライフサイクル（SDLC）を自動化する力を与え、GitHub ブランチングや Notion ページ作成などのプロトコルを介したプロジェクト管理を無縫に実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 `mcp__linear__get_issue`, `mcp__notion__notion-search`, `mcp__github__search_code`와 같은 도구를 사용하여 전체 소프트웨어 개발 생명주기(SDLC)를 자동화할 수 있도록 하여 GitHub 브랜칭 및 Notion 페이지 생성과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 무중단 프로젝트 관리를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar todo el ciclo de vida de desarrollo de software (SDLC) utilizando herramientas como `mcp__linear__get_issue`, `mcp__notion__notion-search` y `mcp__github__search_code`, lo que facilita una gestión de proyectos sin problemas desde la ingesta hasta la implementación a través de protocolos como la ramificación de GitHub y la creación de páginas de Notion.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser tout le cycle de vie de développement de logiciels (SDLC) en utilisant des outils tels que `mcp__linear__get_issue`, `mcp__notion__notion-search` et `mcp__github__search_code`, ce qui facilite une gestion de projet sans problème de la prise en charge à la mise en production via des protocoles tels que la création de branches GitHub et la création de pages Notion.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den gesamten Software-Entwicklungslebenszyklus (SDLC) mithilfe von Tools wie `mcp__linear__get_issue`, `mcp__notion__notion-search` und `mcp__github__search_code` zu automatisieren, was eine nahtlose Projektverwaltung von der Aufnahme bis zur Bereitstellung über Protokolle wie GitHub-Branching und Notion-Seitenerstellung ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar todo o ciclo de vida de desenvolvimento de software (SDLC) usando ferramentas como `mcp__linear__get_issue`, `mcp__notion__notion-search` e `mcp__github__search_code`, facilitando a gestão de projetos sem interrupções desde a ingestão até a implantação via protocolos como ramificação do GitHub e criação de páginas do Notion.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать весь цикл разработки программного обеспечения (SDLC) с помощью инструментов seperti `mcp__linear__get_issue`, `mcp__notion__notion-search` и `mcp__github__search_code`, обеспечивая бесперебойное управление проектами от начала до развертывания через протоколы, такие как ветвление GitHub и создание страниц Notion.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكيل من تautomatisation دورة حياة كاملّة لتطوير البرمجيات (SDLC) باستخدام أدوات مثل `mcp__linear__get_issue` و `mcp__notion__notion-search` و `mcp__github__search_code`، و يُسهّل إدارة المشاريع دون انقطاع من الاستهلاك إلى النشر عبر بروتوكولات مثل التفرع في GitHub وإنشاء صفحات Notion."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue tracking with `mcp__linear__get_issue`","Streamlining code exploration using `mcp__github__search_code`","Enhancing project planning with `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`"],"zh":["使用 `mcp__linear__get_issue` 自动化问题跟踪","使用 `mcp__github__search_code` 流线化代码探索","使用 `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages` 提高项目规划"],"ja":["`mcp__linear__get_issue` を使用して問題追跡を自動化する","`mcp__github__search_code` を使用してコードの探索をストリーミングする","`mcp__notion__notion-create-pages` を使用してプロジェクト計画を強化する"],"ko":["`mcp__linear__get_issue`를 사용하여 이슈 추적 자동화","`mcp__github__search_code`를 사용하여 코드 탐색 스트리밍","`mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`를 사용하여 프로젝트 계획 강화"],"es":["Automatizar el seguimiento de problemas con `mcp__linear__get_issue`","Optimizar la exploración de código utilizando `mcp__github__search_code`","Mejorar la planificación de proyectos con `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`"],"fr":["Automatiser le suivi des problèmes avec `mcp__linear__get_issue`","Optimiser l''exploration de code en utilisant `mcp__github__search_code`","Améliorer la planification de projet avec `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`"],"de":["Automatisieren der Fehlerverfolgung mit `mcp__linear__get_issue`","Optimieren der Code-Exploration mit `mcp__github__search_code`","Verbessern der Projektplanung mit `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`"],"pt":["Automatizar o rastreamento de problemas com `mcp__linear__get_issue`","Simplificar a exploração de código usando `mcp__github__search_code`","Aprimorar o planejamento de projetos com `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отслеживание проблем с помощью `mcp__linear__get_issue`","Упростить изучение кода с помощью `mcp__github__search_code`","Улучшить планирование проектов с помощью `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`"],"ar":["تautomatisation تتبع المشاكل باستخدام `mcp__linear__get_issue`","تسهيل استكشاف الكود باستخدام `mcp__github__search_code`","تحسين التخطيط للمشاريع باستخدام `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Notion and GitHub integration","Limited to tools specified in MCP Tools by Phase","Dependent on AI-native development workflow compatibility"],"zh":["需要Notion和GitHub集成","仅限于MCP Tools by Phase中指定的工具","依赖于AI原生开发工作流兼容性"],"ja":["NotionとGitHubの統合が必要","MCP Tools by Phaseに指定されたツールのみに限定される","AIネイティブ開発ワークフローの互換性に依存する"],"ko":["Notion 및 GitHub 통합이 필요","MCP Tools by Phase에서 지정한 도구로만 제한","AI 네이티브 개발 워크플로우 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración con Notion y GitHub","Limitado a herramientas especificadas en MCP Tools by Phase","Dependiente de la compatibilidad del flujo de trabajo de desarrollo nativo de IA"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Notion et GitHub","Limité aux outils spécifiés dans MCP Tools by Phase","Dépendant de la compatibilité du flux de travail de développement natif IA"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit Notion und GitHub","Begrenzt auf Tools, die in MCP-Tools by Phase angegeben sind","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität des nativen AI-Entwicklungs-Workflows"],"pt":["Exige integração com Notion e GitHub","Limitado às ferramentas especificadas em MCP Tools by Phase","Dependente da compatibilidade do fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento nativo de IA"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Notion и GitHub","Ограничен инструментами, указанными в MCP Tools by Phase","Зависит от совместимости рабочего процесса разработки на основе ИИ"],"ar":["يتطلب دمجًا مع Notion و GitHub","محدود بالأدوات المحددة في MCP Tools by Phase","يعتمد على التوافق مع تدفق عمل تطوير التعلم الآلي الأصلي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"80326c36902460a25ca2f96d39fd91f6ff39017a94294a79ab42e4ab58a066a2","qualityScore":36}');
